n-modes-25","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#compare-stronger","content":"Why Oliv AI is the stronger choice for agent tools and run modes"},"482":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-26","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#limits","content":"Limits and things to know"},"483":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-27","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#common-questions","content":"Common questions"},"484":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-28","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#faq-what-is-a-tool","content":"What is a tool in Oliv AI?"},"485":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-29","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#faq-default-mode","content":"What run mode does a new tool start on?"},"486":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-30","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#faq-approval-vs-decides","content":"What's the difference between Requires Approval and Agent Decides?"},"487":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-31","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#faq-bulk","content":"Can I set every tool on an agent at once?"},"488":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-32","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#faq-systems","content":"Which systems can tools come from?"},"489":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-33","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#faq-remove","content":"Can I remove a tool from an agent?"},"490":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-34","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#faq-ask-before-acting","content":"Is Ask before acting the same as Requires Approval?"},"491":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-35","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#faq-limit-records","content":"Can I limit a tool to certain records or fields?"},"492":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-36","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#related","content":"Related"},"493":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-37","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","content":"A tool is one action an agent is allowed to take, such as looking up a record, drafting an email or posting to a channel. Every agent in the Oliv AI agent marketplace with a detail page lists its tools on a **Tools** tab. Each tool carries a run mode that decides how much freedom the agent has with it: **Auto Run**, **Requires Approval** or **Agent Decides**."},"494":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-38","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","content":"The Tools tab puts every action an agent may take in one list. Each card carries its own run-mode dropdown, and here all five tools sit on the default, Auto Run."},"495":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-39","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#at-a-glance","content":"|                    |                                        |\n| ------------------ | -------------------------------------- |\n| **What a tool is** | One action an agent is allowed to take |","table":"table-0"},"496":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-40","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#at-a-glance","content":"|                      |                                                                 |\n| -------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Where tools live** | **Agents › [agent] › Tools**, on every agent with a detail page |","table":"table-0"},"497":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-41","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#at-a-glance","content":"|               |                                                        |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Run modes** | **Auto Run**, **Requires Approval**, **Agent Decides** |","table":"table-0"},"498":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-42","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                                                 |\n| ---------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Default mode** | **Auto Run**, for any tool that doesn't store a mode of its own |","table":"table-0"},"499":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-43","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#at-a-glance","content":"|             |                                 |\n| ----------- | ------------------------------- |\n| **Set for** | One tool on one agent at a time |","table":"table-0"},"500":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-44","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                                                          |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Tool catalog** | Salesforce, HubSpot, Gmail, Google Calendar, Outlook, LinkedIn and Slack |","table":"table-0"},"501":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-45","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#at-a-glance","content":"|                          |                                                                                        |\n| ------------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Conversation setting** | **Ask before acting** or **Act without asking**, on Oliv AI's Olivia and Oliver agents |","table":"table-0"},"502":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-46","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#what-it-is","content":"Tools are what turn an agent from something that reads into something that acts. Each tool has a name, an icon and a one-sentence summary of what it does, and agents hold between 2 and 6 tools each. The actions cover reading records, creating and updating them, logging calls, meetings and emails, sending and drafting email, managing calendar events and posting to channels."},"503":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-47","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#what-it-is","content":"The run mode is the second half. It sits on each tool card as a dropdown, and it applies to that one tool on that one agent. Changing it on one tool changes nothing else."},"504":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-48","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#what-it-is","content":"| Run mode     | Icon                  | What the agent does with the tool |\n| ------------ | --------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| **Auto Run** | A blue lightning bolt | Acts without asking               |","table":"table-1"},"505":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-49","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#what-it-is","content":"| Run mode              | Icon                                  | What the agent does with the tool   |\n| --------------------- | ------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| **Requires Approval** | A red circle with an exclamation mark | Waits for a person to confirm first |","table":"table-1"},"506":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-50","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#what-it-is","content":"| Run mode          | Icon                          | What the agent does with the tool |\n| ----------------- | ----------------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| **Agent Decides** | A circled question mark, gray | Judges whether to ask             |","table":"table-1"},"507":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-51","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#what-it-is","content":"One agent can mix all three. Each tool keeps its own mode, so a lookup can run freely while the step before it waits for a person."},"508":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-52","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#what-it-is","content":"Run modes are set one tool at a time, so a single agent can hold one step for approval, let the agent judge another and run the rest automatically."},"509":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-53","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#tool-sources","content":"The tool catalog groups actions by the system they come from. These are the same apps Oliv AI works alongside, from your CRM to your inbox."},"510":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-54","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#tool-sources","content":"| System         | Tools offered   | What they cover                                                                                                  |\n| -------------- | --------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Salesforce** | 34, in 6 groups | **Lookup / Search**, **Create / Update**, **Associations**, **Activities**, **Pipeline / Forecast**, **Utility** |","table":"table-2"},"511":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-55","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#tool-sources","content":"| System      | Tools offered   | What they cover                                                                                        |\n| ----------- | --------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **HubSpot** | 32, in 6 groups | **Lookup / Search**, **Create / Update**, **Associations**, **Activities**, **Marketing**, **Utility** |","table":"table-2"},"512":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-56","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#tool-sources","content":"| System    | Tools offered | What they cover                                                           |\n| --------- | ------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Gmail** | 9             | Send, retrieve, search, reply, draft, attach, label, read threads, delete |","table":"table-2"},"513":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-57","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#tool-sources","content":"| System              | Tools offered | What they cover                                                                |\n| ------------------- | ------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Google Calendar** | 9             | Create, list, update and cancel events, read calendar details, find free slots |","table":"table-2"},"514":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-58","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#tool-sources","content":"| System      | Tools offered | What they cover                                                                        |\n| ----------- | ------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Outlook** | 9             | Send, retrieve, search, reply, draft, attach, read calendar events, categorize, delete |","table":"table-2"},"515":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-59","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#tool-sources","content":"| System       | Tools offered | What they cover                                                          |\n| ------------ | ------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **LinkedIn** | 9             | Read public profile, company and post information, and comment on a post |","table":"table-2"},"516":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-60","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#tool-sources","content":"| System    | Tools offered | What they cover                                                              |\n| --------- | ------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Slack** | 5             | Send a message, read messages, create a channel, invite users, upload a file |","table":"table-2"},"517":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-61","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#what-its-for","content":"Tools decide what an agent may do in your systems, and run modes decide how freely it does it. Together they're where you read and set an agent's permission to act. You make that call one action at a time, not once for the whole agent."},"518":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-62","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#how-it-helps","content":"**Every action sits in one list.** Each card names the action and says in a sentence what it does, so nothing an agent can do is hidden."},"519":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-63","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#how-it-helps","content":"**Risk is set where it lives.** A record lookup and a stage update on the same agent can run under different modes."},"520":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-64","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#how-it-helps","content":"**Writes can wait for a person.** **Requires Approval** holds an action until someone confirms it."},"521":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-65","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#how-it-helps","content":"**Routine reads stay quick.** **Auto Run** lets low-risk actions happen without a prompt."},"522":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-66","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#without-it","content":"Without a per-action setting, an agent's freedom is all or nothing. Either it writes to your CRM, mailbox and channels unchecked, or it only reads and every update still falls to a person. The first puts the records your forecast depends on at risk. The second loses most of the time the agent was meant to save."},"523":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-67","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#why-buyers-care","content":"This matters most to the people who own the systems agents write to: revenue operations teams and CRM admins. It matters at rollout, when a team first lets an agent change records or send mail. It matters again each time an agent gains a new tool, because a tool that stores no mode starts on **Auto Run**."},"524":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-68","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#approach","content":"Picture a revenue operations lead getting ready to switch on an agent for a sales team of 40. The agent can look up Salesforce opportunities, log calls and change fields such as stage and close date. Lookups worry nobody. A wrong stage change, though, lands straight in Monday's forecast call."},"525":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-69","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#approach","content":"The common answer is a single switch for the whole agent. Teams often keep it read-only for weeks and paste its suggestions into the CRM by hand. That probably feels safe. It also means the agent saves little time, and the pile of suggestions grows with every rep added."},"526":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-70","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#approach","content":"The risk isn't spread evenly across the agent. It sits in the handful of actions that write to shared records or reach customers. Reading a record can't break anything, so it makes sense to hold back only the actions that can."},"527":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-71","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#approach","content":"Oliv AI puts the control on each tool instead of on the agent. Every card on an agent's **Tools** tab carries its own run mode. The RevOps lead leaves lookups on **Auto Run** and sets stage and close date updates to **Requires Approval**. Call logging goes on **Agent Decides** while the team watches how the agent behaves."},"528":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-72","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#approach","content":"You can see the setting on the tab itself. The three modes always appear in the same order, and each keeps one icon and color on the button and in the menu. How other platforms handle an agent's freedom to act is covered in How agent tools and run modes compare, below."},"529":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-73","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#open-tools","content":"There are three ways in:"},"530":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-74","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#open-tools","content":"From the agent's detail page, select the **Tools** tab."},"531":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-75","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#open-tools","content":"On the **Overview** tab, press one of the agent's tool pills."},"532":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-76","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#open-tools","content":"On the **Instructions** tab, press a tool chip inside a process step. The **Tools** tab opens with that tool scrolled into view."},"533":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-77","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#open-tools","content":"The tab has two columns. A sidebar down the left holds **Add Tool** above the list of the agent's tools. The main pane on the right shows the same tools as cards, in the same order. Press a tool's name in the sidebar and its card scrolls into view."},"534":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-78","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#set-run-mode","content":"Open the agent and select **Tools**."},"535":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-79","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#set-run-mode","content":"Find the tool. Scroll the main pane, or press the tool's name in the sidebar."},"536":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-80","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#set-run-mode","content":"Read the card: the tool's name as a heading, with a sentence beneath saying what it does."},"537":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-81","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#set-run-mode","content":"Press the dropdown at the right of the card. It shows the tool's current mode with its icon."},"538":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-82","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#set-run-mode","content":"Choose **Auto Run**, **Requires Approval** or **Agent Decides**. The menu closes and the button shows the new mode."},"539":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-83","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#set-run-mode","content":"Repeat for each tool you want to change. To close the menu without changing anything, press anywhere outside it."},"540":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-84","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#set-run-mode","content":"Step 4: the dropdown on each tool card lists the three run modes in the same fixed order, each with the icon it keeps on the button."},"541":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-85","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#set-run-mode","content":"Step 5: the button relabels at once to show the new mode. Only the tool you changed moves; the other four keep Auto Run."},"542":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-86","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#choosing-a-mode","content":"| Mode         | A good fit for                                                                         |\n| ------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Auto Run** | Actions that only read, such as searching records or reading a public LinkedIn profile |","table":"table-3"},"543":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-87","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#choosing-a-mode","content":"| Mode                  | A good fit for                                                                                             |\n| --------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Requires Approval** | Actions that change shared records or reach customers, such as updating an opportunity or sending an email |","table":"table-3"},"544":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-88","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#choosing-a-mode","content":"| Mode              | A good fit for                                                             |\n| ----------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Agent Decides** | Actions where you're happy for the agent to judge when a check is worth it |","table":"table-3"},"545":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-89","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#choosing-a-mode","content":"If you're weighing how much an AI agent should do alone, start writes on **Requires Approval** and widen them once you trust the output."},"546":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-90","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#tool-catalog","content":"Press **Add Tool** at the top of the sidebar to open the catalog, a panel headed **Add Tool**. It shows the actions an agent could be given, grouped by the system they come from. A **Search tools...** box and a **New Tool** button sit above the list of systems: HubSpot and Salesforce, then Gmail, Google Calendar, Outlook, LinkedIn and Slack."},"547":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-91","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#tool-catalog","content":"Pick a system in the list on the left. **Salesforce** is selected when the panel opens."},"548":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-92","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#tool-catalog","content":"Read the main pane. It lists that system's tools under category headings, such as **Lookup / Search** or **Create / Update** for a CRM, and **Actions** for Gmail, Google Calendar, Outlook, LinkedIn and Slack."},"549":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-93","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#tool-catalog","content":"Read each card: the tool's name, with a one-line description beneath."},"550":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-94","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#tool-catalog","content":"Close the panel with the **×** at the top right, or press the dimmed page behind it."},"551":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-95","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#tool-catalog","content":"The catalog is the same whichever agent you opened it from."},"552":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-96","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#tool-catalog","content":"Each system's tools appear as cards with a one-line description. Gmail's nine run from reading and drafting to sending and deleting, which is why writes deserve a run mode check."},"553":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-97","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#with-overview","content":"The **Overview** tab lists an agent's tools as pills. The **Tools** tab is where you set each tool's run mode."},"554":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-98","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#with-instructions","content":"The process steps on the **Instructions** tab name the tools each step uses. Pressing a tool chip there takes you to that tool's card, which is the quickest way to check the mode of a tool a step depends on."},"555":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-99","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#with-super-agents","content":"Oliv AI's Olivia agent and Oliv AI's Oliver agent carry their own autonomy setting beneath the message box: **Ask before acting** or **Act without asking**. It covers a whole conversation, opens on **Ask before acting**, and is separate from any tool's run mode. Choosing **Act without asking** for Oliver shows a **High Risk** warning above the message box."},"556":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-100","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#with-run-records","content":"An agent's run records show both outcomes of a run mode: emails sent automatically, and emails drafted and left for a person to send. That's where you see how an agent that acts differs from a copilot that suggests."},"557":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-101","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#who-uses-it","content":"These are typical patterns, shown to illustrate how the settings are used."},"558":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-102","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#revenue-operations","content":"Before a rollout, a revops team walks each agent's **Tools** tab and lists every tool that writes to Salesforce or HubSpot. Those go to **Requires Approval** first. Read-only lookups stay on **Auto Run**, so the CRM work agents take on starts with a person checking each write."},"559":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-103","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#sales-development","content":"A sales development team lets an agent read public LinkedIn profiles and company posts on **Auto Run**. Sending email from Gmail or Outlook stays on **Requires Approval**, so no first touch reaches a prospect unseen. That keeps AI outreach from burning through the target list."},"560":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-104","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#customer-success","content":"A customer success team lets an agent post account updates to an internal Slack channel on **Auto Run**. Anything addressed to the customer, such as a reply in Gmail, waits on **Requires Approval**."},"561":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-105","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#enablement","content":"An enablement lead uses the one-line summaries on each tool card to brief new reps on what each agent may do in their accounts. The colored icons make it easy to point out which actions run unattended and which wait for a person."},"562":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-106","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#compare","content":"Oliv AI sets an agent's freedom to act on each tool, with a choice of three modes. One of them lets the agent itself judge whether a check is needed. Its tools act in the systems revenue teams work in, from CRM records to email, calendars and Slack. Oliv AI is the only platform in this table that does all three."},"563":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-107","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#compare","content":"Agent permissions, from each platform's public documentation:"},"564":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-108","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#compare","content":"| Platform    | Approval choice for each agent action | Agent judges when to ask | Agent actions in connected apps |\n| ----------- | ------------------------------------- | ------------------------ | ------------------------------- |\n| **Oliv AI** | Yes                                   | Yes                      | Yes                             |","table":"table-4"},"565":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-109","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#compare","content":"| Platform | Approval choice for each agent action | Agent judges when to ask | Agent actions in connected apps |\n| -------- | ------------------------------------- | ------------------------ | ------------------------------- |\n| **Gong** | Not in docs                           | Not in docs              | Outputs stay inside Gong        |","table":"table-4"},"566":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-110","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#compare","content":"| Platform     | Approval choice for each agent action      | Agent judges when to ask | Agent actions in connected apps    |\n| ------------ | ------------------------------------------ | ------------------------ | ---------------------------------- |\n| **Outreach** | Partly (fixed check before record changes) | Not in docs              | Partly (read-only connector tools) |","table":"table-4"},"567":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-111","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#compare","content":"| Platform         | Approval choice for each agent action | Agent judges when to ask | Agent actions in connected apps |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------------------- | ------------------------ | ------------------------------- |\n| **Fireflies.ai** | Partly (allow or block per app)       | Not in docs              | Yes (custom connectors)         |","table":"table-4"},"568":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-112","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#compare","content":"| Platform  | Approval choice for each agent action | Agent judges when to ask | Agent actions in connected apps |\n| --------- | ------------------------------------- | ------------------------ | ------------------------------- |\n| **Avoma** | Not in docs                           | Not in docs              | Not in docs                     |","table":"table-4"},"569":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-113","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#compare","content":"*Yes: documented and built in. Partly: documented with a limit, shown in brackets. Not in docs: not found in the vendor's public documentation.*"},"570":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-114","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#compare-stronger","content":"**Approval set per action.** Oliv AI gives each tool its own run mode, so lookups and writes on one agent can differ. Outreach's Omni pauses for confirmation before any change to a Prospect, Account or Opportunity record."},"571":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-115","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#compare-stronger","content":"**Agents that act beyond their own app.** Oliv AI's tools update CRM records, send email and post to Slack. Gong's help center says its agents generate outputs within Gong Assistant and do not perform actions in external systems. See Oliv AI as a Gong alternative."},"572":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-116","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#compare-stronger","content":"**Writes as well as reads.** Oliv AI's catalog includes **Create / Update** tools for Salesforce and HubSpot. Outreach's help center says only read-only tools are supported over its connectors at this time."},"573":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-117","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#compare-stronger","content":"**A middle setting between asking and acting.** With **Agent Decides**, the agent judges whether to ask before it uses a tool. Fireflies.ai documents choosing which permissions AskFred has in each connected app."},"574":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-118","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#compare-stronger","content":"*Competitor details checked against each vendor's public documentation on 21 October 2026. Features and plans change, so confirm with the vendor before you decide.*"},"575":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-119","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#limits","content":"**One tool at a time.** There's no bulk control, and no agent-wide or workspace-wide default mode."},"576":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-120","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#limits","content":"**Auto Run is the default.** A tool that stores no mode shows **Auto Run**. Check new tools before an agent goes live."},"577":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-121","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#limits","content":"**Tools can't be removed or reordered.** There's no delete control on a tool card or in the sidebar."},"578":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-122","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#limits","content":"**Tools have no settings of their own.** There are no parameters, field mappings or filters, so you can't limit a tool to certain records or fields."},"579":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-123","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#limits","content":"**No connection status.** The tab doesn't show whether a tool's system is connected."},"580":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-124","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#faq-what-is-a-tool","content":"A tool is one action an agent is allowed to take, such as finding a record, drafting an email or posting to a channel. Each one is listed on the agent's **Tools** tab with a one-line summary."},"581":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-125","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#faq-default-mode","content":"**Auto Run**, unless the tool stores a different mode. That means the agent acts without asking, so set writes to **Requires Approval** if you want a person to check them."},"582":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-126","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#faq-approval-vs-decides","content":"With **Requires Approval**, a person confirms before the agent uses the tool. With **Agent Decides**, the agent judges for itself whether to ask first."},"583":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-127","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#faq-bulk","content":"No. Each tool is set on its own card, one at a time. There's no agent-wide or workspace-wide default."},"584":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-128","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#faq-systems","content":"Seven: Salesforce and HubSpot, plus Gmail, Google Calendar, Outlook, LinkedIn and Slack. Salesforce offers 34 tools and HubSpot 32; Slack offers 5 and the others 9 each."},"585":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-129","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#faq-remove","content":"No. There's no delete control on the tool card or in the sidebar."},"586":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-130","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#faq-ask-before-acting","content":"No. **Ask before acting** covers a whole conversation with Oliv AI's Olivia or Oliver agent. **Requires Approval** covers one tool on one agent, and the two are set separately."},"587":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-131","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#faq-limit-records","content":"No. Tools carry no parameters, field mappings or filters."},"588":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-132","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#related","content":"Prepare for a meeting: how agents send a brief before your calls."},"589":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-133","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#related","content":"Oliv AI product documentation: every guide, by agent and feature."},"590":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-134","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#related","content":"Browse agents in the marketplace: the agents whose tools this page describes."},"591":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-135","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#related","content":"Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent: the agent that writes field updates back to your CRM."},"592":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-136","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#related","content":"How the agents are built: the platform layer each agent's tools run on."},"593":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-137","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#related","content":"AI agents for RevOps: where agents fit in a revenue operations team."},"594":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-138","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#related","content":"Salesforce automation explained: how agent actions compare with flows and rules."},"595":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-139","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#related","content":"Agentic sales automation: what changes when software acts, not just suggests."},"596":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-140","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#related","content":"Connected apps: the systems Oliv AI connects to."},"597":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","type":"page","content":"Agent triggers","breadcrumbs":["Oliv AI docs","Agents","Agent builder"],"tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers"},"598":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-0","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","content":"What an Oliv AI agent's triggers and schedules are, where to read them on the Triggers tab, and how the trigger picker and the schedule form are laid out."},"599":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-1","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#at-a-glance","content":"At a glance"},"600":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-2","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#what-it-is","content":"What agent triggers are"},"601":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-3","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#why-it-matters","content":"Why agent triggers matter"},"602":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-4","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#what-its-for","content":"What it's for"},"603":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-5","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#how-it-helps","content":"How it helps"},"604":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-6","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#without-it","content":"What happens without it"},"605":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-7","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#why-buyers-care","content":"Why buyers care"},"606":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-8","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#approach","content":"The Oliv AI approach to agent triggers"},"607":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-9","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#read-triggers","content":"Read an agent's triggers"},"608":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-10","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#trigger-picker","content":"Browse the trigger picker"},"609":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-11","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#set-schedule","content":"Set a schedule"},"610":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-12","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#works-with","content":"How agent triggers work with other features"},"611":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-13","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#with-tools","content":"Tools and run modes"},"612":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-14","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#with-run-history","content":"Run history"},"613":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-15","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#with-overview","content":"The Overview tab"},"614":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-16","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#with-deal-work","content":"Deal work that starts from a stage"},"615":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-17","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#who-uses-it","content":"Who uses agent triggers, and how"},"616":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-18","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#revenue-operations","content":"Revenue operations"},"617":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-19","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#account-executives-and-sales-leaders","content":"Account executives and sales leaders"},"618":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-20","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#customer-success","content":"Customer success and account management"},"619":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-21","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#enablement","content":"Enablement"},"620":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-22","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#compare","content":"How agent triggers compare"},"621":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-23","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#compare-stronger","content":"Why Oliv AI is the stronger choice for agent triggers"},"622":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-24","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#limits","content":"Limits and things to know"},"623":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-25","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#common-questions","content":"Common questions"},"624":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-26","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#faq-what-is-a-trigger","content":"What is a trigger in Oliv AI?"},"625":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-27","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#faq-see-triggers","content":"How do I see what starts an agent?"},"626":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-28","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#faq-deal-stage","content":"Can an agent start when a deal changes stage?"},"627":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-29","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#faq-several-triggers","content":"Can one agent have more than one trigger?"},"628":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-30","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#faq-trigger-vs-schedule","content":"What's the difference between a trigger and a schedule?"},"629":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-31","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#faq-did-it-fire","content":"How do I tell whether a trigger fired?"},"630":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-32","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#faq-pause","content":"Can I pause or remove a trigger?"},"631":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-33","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#faq-filters","content":"Can I limit a trigger to certain deals or people?"},"632":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-34","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#faq-no-tab","content":"Why does this agent have no Triggers tab?"},"633":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-35","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#related","content":"Related"},"634":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-36","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","content":"A trigger is the event that starts an Oliv AI agent without anybody pressing anything, such as a deal reaching a stage in your CRM. Each agent in the Oliv AI agent marketplace that has a **Triggers** tab lists those events as cards. The same tab holds the agent's schedules, the fixed times it acts at."},"635":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-37","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","content":"The Triggers tab answers what starts an agent. Each card names the event in one line and explains when the agent fires; schedules sit in their own section below."},"636":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-38","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#at-a-glance","content":"|                       |                                           |\n| --------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| **What a trigger is** | The event that starts an agent on its own |","table":"table-0"},"637":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-39","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#at-a-glance","content":"|                         |                                 |\n| ----------------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| **Where triggers live** | **Agents › [agent] › Triggers** |","table":"table-0"},"638":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-40","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#at-a-glance","content":"|                       |                                                                                   |\n| --------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **What a card shows** | The source's icon, the event in one line, when the agent fires, and a menu button |","table":"table-0"},"639":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-41","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#at-a-glance","content":"|               |                                                   |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Schedules** | The **Schedule messages** section of the same tab |","table":"table-0"},"640":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-42","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#at-a-glance","content":"|                          |                                                    |\n| ------------------------ | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Schedule frequencies** | **Daily**, **Every Week**, **Monthly**, **Yearly** |","table":"table-0"},"641":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-43","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#at-a-glance","content":"|                             |                                                                                                      |\n| --------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **How automatic runs show** | **Auto-triggered** or **Auto Trigger** in the run history, apart from **Manually run** or **Manual** |","table":"table-0"},"642":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-44","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#at-a-glance","content":"|                   |                                                                                      |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Also shown on** | The **Overview** tab, as trigger pills, including on agents with no **Triggers** tab |","table":"table-0"},"643":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-45","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#what-it-is","content":"The **Triggers** tab answers one question: what makes this agent start work by itself? Its own description puts it plainly: \"Triggers allow your agent to work on auto-pilot.\" The tab has two sections, stacked in one column."},"644":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-46","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#what-it-is","content":"| Section      | What it lists                                   | Button          |\n| ------------ | ----------------------------------------------- | --------------- |\n| **Triggers** | The events the agent watches for, one card each | **Add Trigger** |","table":"table-1"},"645":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-47","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#what-it-is","content":"| Section               | What it lists                                    | Button           |\n| --------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ | ---------------- |\n| **Schedule messages** | The fixed times the agent acts at, one card each | **Set Schedule** |","table":"table-1"},"646":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-48","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#what-it-is","content":"A trigger card has three parts: a small icon for the source the event comes from, the event as a one-line title, and a longer explanation of when the agent fires. The explanation can be one sentence or a short list. A menu button (⋮) sits at the card's right."},"647":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-49","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#what-it-is","content":"Agents carry between 1 and 5 triggers each, and they start from many kinds of event:"},"648":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-50","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#what-it-is","content":"| Event that starts the agent                     | Example                       |\n| ----------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| A deal's stage is set to Proposal in Salesforce | Oliv AI's Multithreader agent |","table":"table-2"},"649":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-51","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#what-it-is","content":"| Event that starts the agent                         | Example                         |\n| --------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| A tracked lead starts a new session on your website | Oliv AI's Quick Qualifier agent |","table":"table-2"},"650":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-52","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#what-it-is","content":"| Event that starts the agent                             | Example                          |\n| ------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------- |\n| Company Insights detects a funding signal on an account | Oliv AI's Momentum Reviver agent |","table":"table-2"},"651":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-53","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#what-it-is","content":"| Event that starts the agent                                                                                                                      | Example                       |\n| ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ | ----------------------------- |\n| A new customer email in Gmail or Outlook, a message in a shared Teams or Slack Connect channel, a deadline, or a message unanswered for 24 hours | Oliv AI's Comms Manager agent |","table":"table-2"},"652":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-54","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#what-it-is","content":"| Event that starts the agent | Example                         |\n| --------------------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| A meeting is completed      | Oliv AI's Content Curator agent |","table":"table-2"},"653":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-55","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#what-it-is","content":"| Event that starts the agent               | Example                                   |\n| ----------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| A release announcement in a Slack channel | Oliv AI's Product Release Messenger agent |","table":"table-2"},"654":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-56","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#what-it-is","content":"A trigger can come from outside the CRM. This agent starts the moment a tracked lead begins a new website session."},"655":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-57","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#what-it-is","content":"A card's explanation can be a short list. Here it spells out which signals count as fresh budget before the agent wakes up."},"656":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-58","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#what-it-is","content":"Take the Multithreader agent as an example. It has one trigger: it fires on its own when a deal's stage is set to Proposal in the connected CRM. It can also be started by hand with **Run Agent**."},"657":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-59","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#what-its-for","content":"Triggers decide when an agent starts work on its own. They tie the agent to a moment in your systems, such as a stage change, instead of to someone remembering to run it. Schedules do the same for fixed times."},"658":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-60","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#how-it-helps","content":"**Work starts when the event happens.** An agent can begin the moment a deal reaches a stage."},"659":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-61","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#how-it-helps","content":"**Every start is written down.** Each card names the event and says in a sentence when the agent fires."},"660":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-62","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#how-it-helps","content":"**Automatic runs are labeled.** The run history marks them **Auto-triggered**, so they stand apart from runs a person started."},"661":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-63","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#how-it-helps","content":"**Events and times sit together.** One tab lists an agent's triggers and its schedules."},"662":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-64","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#without-it","content":"Without a trigger, every run starts with a person. Someone has to spot the stage change, open the agent and press run. In a busy week that run comes late or never. The deals that most needed the work are often the ones it misses."},"663":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-65","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#why-buyers-care","content":"This matters most to revenue operations teams, who own the stage definitions in the CRM. It matters when a team first lets agents start unattended. It matters again whenever the stage process changes, because a trigger is where an agent can begin with no person present."},"664":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-66","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#approach","content":"Picture a revenue operations manager whose team has just redrawn the opportunity stages. The new rule says every deal that reaches Proposal needs a wider buying committee before pricing goes out. Around sixty deals a quarter cross that line, spread over several teams."},"665":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-67","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#approach","content":"The usual fix is a saved CRM report and a reminder. Someone checks the report on Monday and nudges each deal owner in chat. That probably works for a while. But a deal that hits Proposal on a Tuesday can wait six days, and the check quietly stops when its owner goes on leave."},"666":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-68","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#approach","content":"The stage change is already the signal. The CRM records the moment a deal moves, so the work can start from that moment rather than from somebody's calendar. What the team needs is a way to tie the agent to the event itself."},"667":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-69","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#approach","content":"Oliv AI starts the agent from the event. Oliv AI's Multithreader agent fires on its own when a deal's stage is set to Proposal in the connected CRM. It then judges whether the buying committee is broad enough and drafts outreach for the seller to review. The RevOps manager reads that trigger on the agent's **Triggers** tab before rolling the agent out."},"668":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-70","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#approach","content":"Each trigger is written out on the tab. Every card shows the source system's icon, the event in one line and a sentence on when the agent fires. Runs it starts appear in the run history as **Auto-triggered**. How other platforms start agents on their own is covered in How agent triggers compare, below."},"669":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-71","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#read-triggers","content":"Open the agent and select the **Triggers** tab. You can also press one of the trigger pills on the **Overview** tab, which opens the same tab."},"670":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-72","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#read-triggers","content":"Read the first section, headed **Triggers**. Its description reads \"Triggers allow your agent to work on auto-pilot.\""},"671":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-73","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#read-triggers","content":"Read each card. The icon shows the system the event comes from. The title names the event, and the line beneath says when the agent fires."},"672":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-74","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#read-triggers","content":"Scroll down to **Schedule messages** to see any fixed times the agent acts at."},"673":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-75","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#read-triggers","content":"On some agents, the **Overview** tab also carries a plain-language sentence above the trigger pills. It explains what kind of event wakes the agent. It's collapsed to one line, and pressing it expands the rest."},"674":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-76","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#trigger-picker","content":"Press **Add Trigger** at the right of the **Triggers** heading to open the picker. It opens as a panel headed **Triggers**, over a dimmed page."},"675":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-77","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#trigger-picker","content":"Type in the search box, marked \"Search triggers...\". It narrows both groups as you type, matching any part of a system's name and ignoring case."},"676":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-78","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#trigger-picker","content":"Read the **Most popular** group: a fixed list of 11 systems, each shown with its logo, two to a row. They are Microsoft Outlook, Google Mail, Google Calendar, Salesforce, HubSpot, Freshdesk, ZoomInfo, Relevance Meeting Bot, LinkedIn, WhatsApp and Telegram."},"677":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-79","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#trigger-picker","content":"Read the **All triggers** group beneath it, a longer list that starts with WhatsApp Business, Airtable and Aircall. A **Show more** link sits at its foot."},"678":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-80","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#trigger-picker","content":"Close the picker with the **×** at the top right, or press the dimmed page behind it."},"679":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-81","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#trigger-picker","content":"The picker is the same whichever agent you opened it from."},"680":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-82","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#trigger-picker","content":"The picker lists the systems a trigger can come from. Search narrows both groups, and the most common sources sit at the top."},"681":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-83","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#set-schedule","content":"A schedule lets an agent act at fixed times, alongside its event triggers. The section explains itself as \"Schedule allow your agent to schedule future actions.\""},"682":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-84","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#set-schedule","content":"Open the agent's **Triggers** tab and scroll to **Schedule messages**."},"683":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-85","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#set-schedule","content":"Press **Set Schedule**. A form headed **Set Schedule** opens. A line at the top shows the timezone the schedule uses."},"684":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-86","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#set-schedule","content":"Type a name in the **Name** field, marked \"Enter text...\"."},"685":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-87","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#set-schedule","content":"Choose how often in the first **Schedule** dropdown: **Daily**, **Every Week**, **Monthly** or **Yearly**. It opens on **Every Week**."},"686":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-88","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#set-schedule","content":"Fill in the dropdowns that appear to its right, such as **Select day** and **Select time**. They change with the frequency, as the table below shows."},"687":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-89","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#set-schedule","content":"Press **Finish**."},"688":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-90","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#set-schedule","content":"Step 4: the frequency comes first. The day and time dropdowns beside it follow whichever of the four you choose."},"689":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-91","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#set-schedule","content":"| Frequency | Further dropdowns                                                        |\n| --------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Daily** | Hour, then minute, at quarter-hours (**:00**, **:15**, **:30**, **:45**) |","table":"table-3"},"690":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-92","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#set-schedule","content":"| Frequency      | Further dropdowns                               |\n| -------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| **Every Week** | Day of the week, then a time at half-hour steps |","table":"table-3"},"691":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-93","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#set-schedule","content":"| Frequency   | Further dropdowns                               |\n| ----------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| **Monthly** | Day of the month (**1** to **31**), then a time |","table":"table-3"},"692":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-94","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#set-schedule","content":"| Frequency  | Further dropdowns                         |\n| ---------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| **Yearly** | Month, then day of the month, then a time |","table":"table-3"},"693":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-95","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#set-schedule","content":"A fixed time can also show as a trigger. Oliv AI's Comms Manager agent lists \"Morning inbox sweep, weekdays 7:30 AM\" among its trigger pills."},"694":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-96","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#with-tools","content":"A trigger decides when an agent starts. How freely it then acts is set by each tool's run mode, covered in agent tools and run modes. An agent with a trigger and an **Auto Run** tool can act with no person involved at any point."},"695":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-97","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#with-run-history","content":"The run history on the agent's **Runs** tab records each run's type: **Auto-triggered** or **Auto Trigger** for runs that started on their own, **Manually run** or **Manual** for the rest. That's where you see a trigger at work, as the run history guide in this documentation explains."},"696":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-98","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#with-overview","content":"The **Overview** tab lists the agent's triggers as pills under a **Triggers** heading. Pressing a pill opens the **Triggers** tab, so it's a quick way to check what starts an agent you're about to rely on. Agents with no **Triggers** tab still list their triggers here, each pill with its own icon."},"697":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-99","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#with-overview","content":"One agent can carry several triggers. Here five pills cover new messages, deadlines, an unanswered-message backstop and a weekday morning sweep."},"698":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-100","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#with-deal-work","content":"A stage-based trigger fits the deal work agents already do between calls. It sits alongside the day-to-day deal flow for account executives and the brief an agent sends when you prepare for a meeting."},"699":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-101","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#who-uses-it","content":"These are typical patterns, shown to illustrate how the tab is used."},"700":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-102","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#revenue-operations","content":"Before a rollout, a revops team walks each agent's **Triggers** tab and lists which agents can start on their own. It then checks those agents' tools, since a trigger plus an **Auto Run** tool means unattended action. The Oliv AI guide for RevOps covers where this fits in the wider process."},"701":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-103","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#account-executives-and-sales-leaders","content":"When an agent's draft lands on a deal, an account executive can open the run history and see it marked **Auto-triggered**. The trigger card then explains which deal event started it, such as reaching Proposal. Sales managers use the same cards to explain agent activity in 1:1s."},"702":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-104","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#customer-success","content":"A customer success team reads the **Schedule messages** section to see when an agent acts at a fixed time, such as every week on a set day. That sits next to the event triggers on the same tab, so the whole picture is in one place."},"703":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-105","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#enablement","content":"An enablement lead uses the one-sentence descriptions on trigger cards to brief new reps. Reps learn which deal events will start an agent on their opportunities, before the first draft arrives."},"704":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-106","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#compare","content":"Oliv AI lets one agent carry several event triggers, such as a deal reaching a stage in the CRM, and fixed-time schedules on the same tab. Runs that start on their own are labeled in the agent's run history. Oliv AI is the only platform in this table that does all four."},"705":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-107","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#compare","content":"Agent start rules, from each platform's public documentation:"},"706":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-108","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#compare","content":"| Platform    | Starts when a CRM deal changes | Several triggers on one agent | Event triggers and schedules on one agent | Automatic runs marked in run history |\n| ----------- | ------------------------------ | ----------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| **Oliv AI** | Yes                            | Yes                           | Yes                                       | Yes                                  |","table":"table-4"},"707":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-109","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#compare","content":"| Platform | Starts when a CRM deal changes          | Several triggers on one agent | Event triggers and schedules on one agent | Automatic runs marked in run history |\n| -------- | --------------------------------------- | ----------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| **Gong** | Yes (brief when a deal reaches a stage) | One trigger per agent         | Partly (schedules are one trigger type)   | Yes (Run history per automation)     |","table":"table-4"},"708":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-110","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#compare","content":"| Platform     | Starts when a CRM deal changes  | Several triggers on one agent | Event triggers and schedules on one agent | Automatic runs marked in run history |\n| ------------ | ------------------------------- | ----------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| **Outreach** | Yes (opportunity updated event) | Not in docs                   | Partly (event or a scheduled time)        | Yes (Runs tab for each schedule)     |","table":"table-4"},"709":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-111","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#compare","content":"| Platform         | Starts when a CRM deal changes | Several triggers on one agent | Event triggers and schedules on one agent | Automatic runs marked in run history |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------------ | ----------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| **Fireflies.ai** | After each meeting             | Not in docs                   | Partly (per-meeting or scheduled skill)   | Not in docs                          |","table":"table-4"},"710":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-112","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#compare","content":"| Platform  | Starts when a CRM deal changes | Several triggers on one agent | Event triggers and schedules on one agent | Automatic runs marked in run history |\n| --------- | ------------------------------ | ----------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| **Avoma** | Not in docs                    | Not in docs                   | Partly (scheduled prompts)                | Not in docs                          |","table":"table-4"},"711":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-113","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#compare","content":"*Yes: documented and built in. Partly: documented with a limit, shown in brackets. Not in docs: not found in the vendor's public documentation.*"},"712":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-114","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#compare-stronger","content":"**Several triggers on one agent.** Oliv AI agents carry between 1 and 5 triggers each. Gong's help center says each automated agent uses one trigger. See Oliv AI as a Gong alternative."},"713":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-115","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#compare-stronger","content":"**Events and schedules in one place.** Oliv AI lists an agent's event triggers and its schedules on one **Triggers** tab. Outreach documents scheduled Research Agent runs as their own scheduled workflows. See how Gong and Outreach compare."},"714":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-116","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#compare-stronger","content":"**Started by a deal event, not only the clock.** Oliv AI's Multithreader agent fires when a deal's stage is set to Proposal. Avoma's scheduled prompts run a question on a recurring basis. See Avoma vs Oliv AI."},"715":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-117","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#compare-stronger","content":"**Automatic runs you can pick out.** Oliv AI's run history marks each run **Auto-triggered** or **Manually run**. Fireflies.ai documents skills that run after every meeting or on a schedule."},"716":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-118","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#compare-stronger","content":"*Competitor details checked against each vendor's public documentation on 21 October 2026. Features and plans change, so confirm with the vendor before you decide.*"},"717":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-119","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#limits","content":"**Not every agent has the tab.** Only some agents show a **Triggers** tab. For the others, the trigger pills on the **Overview** tab say what starts them."},"718":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-120","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#limits","content":"**No pause or off switch.** A trigger or schedule can't be paused from the tab, and there's no agent-wide off switch."},"719":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-121","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#limits","content":"**No conditions or filters.** A trigger can't be narrowed to a team, a region or a deal size."},"720":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-122","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#limits","content":"**No firing record on the card.** There's no last-fired time, firing count or failure marker on any trigger."},"721":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-123","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#limits","content":"**Runs don't name their trigger.** The run history says a run was **Auto-triggered**, not which trigger or schedule started it."},"722":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-124","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#faq-what-is-a-trigger","content":"A trigger is the event that starts an agent on its own, with nobody pressing anything. The tab puts it as \"Triggers allow your agent to work on auto-pilot.\""},"723":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-125","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#faq-see-triggers","content":"Open the agent and select **Triggers**. Each card names the event and explains when the agent fires. You can also press a trigger pill on the **Overview** tab."},"724":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-126","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#faq-deal-stage","content":"Yes. Oliv AI's Multithreader agent, for example, fires on its own when a deal's stage is set to Proposal in the connected CRM."},"725":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-127","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#faq-several-triggers","content":"Yes. Agents carry between 1 and 5 triggers each. One agent starts on new customer messages, deadlines, a 24-hour backstop and a weekday morning sweep."},"726":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-128","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#faq-trigger-vs-schedule","content":"A trigger starts the agent when an event happens. A schedule starts it at a fixed time, set as **Daily**, **Every Week**, **Monthly** or **Yearly**. Both sit on the **Triggers** tab."},"727":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-129","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#faq-did-it-fire","content":"Open the agent's run history. Runs that started on their own are marked **Auto-triggered**. The run doesn't say which trigger was responsible."},"728":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-130","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#faq-pause","content":"No. A trigger can't be paused or disabled from the tab, and there's no off switch for the whole agent."},"729":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-131","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#faq-filters","content":"No. A trigger carries a title and a description and nothing you can configure, so it can't be narrowed by team, region or deal size."},"730":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-132","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#faq-no-tab","content":"Only some agents offer one. Their triggers still show as pills on the **Overview** tab."},"731":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-133","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#related","content":"Agent tools and run modes: decide how freely a triggered agent acts."},"732":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-134","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#related","content":"Oliv AI product documentation: every guide, by agent and feature."},"733":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-135","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#related","content":"Deal Driver agent: how Oliv AI's Deal Driver agent works on open deals."},"734":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-136","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#related","content":"Olivia agent: ask Oliv AI's Olivia agent about deals and pipeline."},"735":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-137","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#related","content":"Prepare a brief before each call: the meeting workflow agents support."},"736":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-138","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#related","content":"How account executives run deals: where agent work fits in an AE's week."},"737":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-139","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#related","content":"Sales process automation by stage: what to automate at each deal stage."},"738":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-140","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#related","content":"AI sales workflow automation: how agents and workflows fit together."},"739":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-141","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#related","content":"Why deals slip without warning: the pipeline gaps stage triggers address."},"740":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-142","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#related","content":"Oliv AI implementation guide for RevOps: set-up and admin for revops teams."},"741":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers-143","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/triggers#related","content":"Connected apps: the systems Oliv AI connects to."},"742":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","type":"page","content":"Coach agent","breadcrumbs":["Oliv AI docs","Agents"],"tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/coach"},"743":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-0","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach","content":"How Oliv AI's Coach agent scores every call, recommends three goals per rep each month for the manager to set, tracks progress every week, how to set it up, and how it compares with other sales coaching tools."},"744":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-1","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#at-a-glance","content":"At a glance"},"745":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-2","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#what-it-is","content":"What the Coach agent is"},"746":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-3","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#four-dimensions","content":"Scoring across four dimensions"},"747":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-4","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#review-and-report","content":"The monthly review and the weekly report"},"748":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-5","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#why-it-matters","content":"Why the Coach agent matters"},"749":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-6","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#what-its-for","content":"What it's for"},"750":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-7","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#how-it-helps","content":"How it helps"},"751":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-8","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","type":"heading","tags