":"/product-docs/agents/coach","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#common-questions","content":"Common questions"},"773":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-30","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#faq-call-volume","content":"How many calls does Coach need before it can find patterns?"},"774":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-31","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#faq-override","content":"Can the manager choose a different goal from the one Coach recommends?"},"775":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-32","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#faq-who-sees-review","content":"Does the rep see the monthly review?"},"776":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-33","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#faq-bdrs","content":"Does Coach work for BDRs?"},"777":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-34","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#faq-rep-disagrees","content":"What if a rep disagrees with the coaching goal?"},"778":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-35","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#faq-own-framework","content":"Can I use my own scoring framework?"},"779":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-36","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#faq-where-review","content":"Where do I find a rep's monthly review?"},"780":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-37","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#faq-setup","content":"How does setup work?"},"781":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-38","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#faq-deal-driver","content":"Does Coach replace Deal Driver?"},"782":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-39","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#faq-where-reports-go","content":"Where do reps get their weekly report?"},"783":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-40","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#faq-style-coach","content":"Is Coach a communication style coach?"},"784":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-41","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#related","content":"Related"},"785":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-42","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach","content":"Oliv AI's Coach agent runs the coaching cadence for every rep on your team. It scores every recorded call, meeting and deal, then recommends the three behaviors most likely to improve each rep's results that month. The manager sets one goal, and Coach tracks the rep's progress every week until the next monthly cycle begins."},"786":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-43","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                                                            |\n| ---------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **What it does** | Finds where coaching moves revenue for each rep and tracks progress weekly |","table":"table-0"},"787":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-44","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                                                                           |\n| ---------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Who it's for** | Sales managers and BDR leads, plus VPs of Sales, enablement managers and account managers |","table":"table-0"},"788":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-45","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#at-a-glance","content":"|            |                                                    |\n| ---------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Scores** | 100% of recorded activity, against your scorecards |","table":"table-0"},"789":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-46","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#at-a-glance","content":"|             |                                                                                  |\n| ----------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Monthly** | A review report per rep with three recommended goals, one marked **Recommended** |","table":"table-0"},"790":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-47","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#at-a-glance","content":"|            |                                                   |\n| ---------- | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Weekly** | A progress report for each rep on the active goal |","table":"table-0"},"791":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-48","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#at-a-glance","content":"|                    |                                                                       |\n| ------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Before the 1:1** | A brief with goal progress, call highlights and one coaching question |","table":"table-0"},"792":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-49","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#at-a-glance","content":"|                      |                                                                                                     |\n| -------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Where you see it** | **Apps › Enable › People**, **Reports › My Reports** and the **Coaching** tab on meetings and deals |","table":"table-0"},"793":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-50","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#at-a-glance","content":"|           |                                                         |\n| --------- | ------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Needs** | About 10 recorded calls per rep, plus deal outcome data |","table":"table-0"},"794":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-51","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#what-it-is","content":"Oliv AI's Coach agent is a revenue coaching agent. Its goals are tied to close rates, stage conversion and deal size, not to communication style or compliance. The manager doesn't have to watch a single recording, and the rep doesn't wait for a quarterly review."},"795":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-52","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#what-it-is","content":"Every recorded call gets a grade like this one, with a score per skill and plain feedback, which is the raw material Coach builds each rep's monthly goals from."},"796":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-53","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#four-dimensions","content":"| Dimension             | What it covers                                                  |\n| --------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Pipeline Coverage** | Whether the rep is building enough pipeline to hit their number |","table":"table-1"},"797":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-54","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#four-dimensions","content":"| Dimension          | What it covers                                                                          |\n| ------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Deal Execution** | How well active deals are run: qualification, stakeholder mapping, next-step discipline |","table":"table-1"},"798":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-55","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#four-dimensions","content":"| Dimension              | What it covers                                                                        |\n| ---------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Meeting Management** | Discovery quality, positioning, objection handling, agenda control and follow-through |","table":"table-1"},"799":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-56","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#four-dimensions","content":"| Dimension               | What it covers                                                              |\n| ----------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Foundational Skills** | Presence, active listening, questioning, relating, positioning and checking |","table":"table-1"},"800":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-57","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#four-dimensions","content":"Each meeting's **Coaching** tab shows the call's grade, a score out of 5 for each skill and a radar of your qualification criteria. A deal's **Coaching** tab grades how the rep ran that whole deal, with **Strengths** and **Focus Areas**."},"801":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-58","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#four-dimensions","content":"Coach also grades the deal as a whole, so a manager can coach on a live opportunity without listening to every call in it."},"802":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-59","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#review-and-report","content":"Once a month, Coach analyzes each rep's full performance data and produces a review report. It surfaces three focus areas, ranked by expected impact, each grounded in evidence from that rep's calls and deals."},"803":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-60","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#review-and-report","content":"The review opens with **Goals for** the month: three goals, the first marked **Recommended**, each with a **Why?** that gives the evidence. Below sit last month's goal with its progress and metric cards against targets, then **Coaching Tasks** with due dates. **Performance Overview** scores the four dimensions, each with a **Strength**, a **Gap** and the change in points. **Drill Down Reports** compare last month with this month against a top performer."},"804":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-61","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#review-and-report","content":"The manager picks the goal that fits and sets it. Coach then breaks the goal into weekly sub-goals. At the end of each week the rep gets a progress report: progress on the goal, wins from last week, and one focus for next week."},"805":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-62","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#what-its-for","content":"Oliv AI's Coach agent is for teams that want every rep to get better each month, not each quarter. It runs a simple loop: find one gap per rep, reinforce it weekly, and track whether it moves."},"806":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-63","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#how-it-helps","content":"**Every call counts.** Coach scores all recorded activity, so no manager has to sample calls by hand."},"807":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-64","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#how-it-helps","content":"**Goals come with proof.** The three monthly recommendations cite the rep's own calls and deals."},"808":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-65","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#how-it-helps","content":"**The goal stays visible.** A weekly report keeps it in front of the rep between conversations."},"809":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-66","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#how-it-helps","content":"**1:1s open on coaching.** The brief lands before the meeting, so nobody starts with a pipeline recap."},"810":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-67","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#without-it","content":"Most calls are never reviewed at all. Feedback stays generic, and nothing tracks whether it lands. By week two, the rep drifts back to old habits. A struggling rep often surfaces only after missing quota."},"811":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-68","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#why-buyers-care","content":"Sales managers, BDR leads and VPs of Sales are the buyers. Sales managers benefit most directly, with better 1:1 prep and no manual call review. Enablement managers care because they can see which skills drive revenue and which training isn't sticking."},"812":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-69","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#approach","content":"Picture an enablement manager ramping five new account executives through their first month. They've finished onboarding and are now running real discovery calls every day. She needs to know who is struggling, and with what, before early habits harden."},"813":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-70","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#approach","content":"The common fallback is sitting in on a few calls per hire and scoring them against a rubric by hand. With five people, that might mean a couple of calls each per week. The picture stays thin, and feedback can land after the habit has already formed."},"814":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-71","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#approach","content":"But every one of those calls is already recorded. The patterns that matter, like skipped next steps or a single contact per deal, only show across many calls. What's missing is scoring at full volume and one clear goal per person drawn from it."},"815":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-72","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#approach","content":"Oliv AI handles this with its Coach agent. It scores every recorded call against the team's scorecards and looks for each new hire's real pattern. Their sales manager reviews three ranked recommendations per person and sets one goal. Every week after that, each new hire gets a progress report, and the enablement manager can see who is advancing."},"816":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-73","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#approach","content":"Coach needs about ten calls per rep to find a pattern. Most teams see their first monthly review within two weeks of connecting their call stack. How that cadence measures up against other coaching tools is covered in How the Coach agent compares, below."},"817":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-74","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#set-up","content":"**Connect your call stack.** Zoom, your existing call recorder or Oliv AI's own call recording. Coach starts scoring as soon as calls start flowing in. It also connects to your CRM and Slack, with more than 70 integrations in all."},"818":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-75","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#set-up","content":"**Set your scorecards.** Start with the pre-built scorecards for enterprise, mid-market and SMB motions, or bring your own criteria. No engineering is required. The library lives in **Settings › Coaching Scorecard**."},"819":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-76","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#set-up","content":"**Let the first monthly review land.** Coach needs about ten calls per rep to find a real pattern. Most teams see their first monthly review within two weeks."},"820":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-77","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#set-up","content":"No rep training is needed."},"821":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-78","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#scorecards","content":"Coach ships with fourteen pre-built scorecards, grouped under **Deals**, **Customers**, **Meetings** and **Phone calls**. Each one has a description and a count of **Evaluations (Last 30 days)**, so you can see which scorecards are in use."},"822":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-79","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#scorecards","content":"| Group     | Scorecards                                                     |\n| --------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Deals** | Enterprise Deal, Mid-Market Deal, SMB Deal, Upsell Opportunity |","table":"table-2"},"823":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-80","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#scorecards","content":"| Group         | Scorecards                                                 |\n| ------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Customers** | Customer Retention, Customer Onboarding, Renewal Readiness |","table":"table-2"},"824":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-81","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#scorecards","content":"| Group        | Scorecards                                                       |\n| ------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Meetings** | Discovery, Demo Meeting, POC Kickoff Meeting, POC Review Meeting |","table":"table-2"},"825":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-82","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#scorecards","content":"| Group           | Scorecards                                          |\n| --------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Phone calls** | Qualification Call, Cold-Call, Event Follow-Up Call |","table":"table-2"},"826":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-83","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#scorecards","content":"The scorecard library covers deals, customer accounts, meetings and phone calls, and the evaluation counts show which ones Coach is actually applying."},"827":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-84","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#scorecards","content":"Some scorecards are written for a role, such as the solution engineer on a POC or the SDR on an event follow-up call. Every scorecard draws on a library of more than 100 criteria in six categories: Discovery & Qualification, Solution & Value, Stakeholder Alignment, Commercial & Negotiation, Risk & Competitive, and Foundational Skills. Managers add, remove or weight criteria to match their sales methodology, such as a SPICED scorecard."},"828":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-85","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#coaching-cadence","content":"| When                   | What happens                                                                                                                 |\n| ---------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Start of the month** | The monthly review is ready before the calendar opens. The manager picks a goal per rep and sets it in about twenty minutes. |","table":"table-3"},"829":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-86","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#coaching-cadence","content":"| When           | What happens                                                                                                 |\n| -------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Every week** | The progress report lands without the manager sending it: wins, the current gap and one focus for next week. |","table":"table-3"},"830":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-87","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#coaching-cadence","content":"| When                                 | What happens                                                                                             |\n| ------------------------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Thursday, or your configured day** | The 1:1 brief arrives before the meeting, with goal progress, call highlights and one coaching question. |","table":"table-3"},"831":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-88","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#coaching-cadence","content":"| When        | What happens                                                                                     |\n| ----------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **The 1:1** | The conversation opens on what's getting in the way of the goal, not on pipeline reconstruction. |","table":"table-3"},"832":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-89","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#coaching-cadence","content":"Each rep's **Monthly Review** is listed under Coach in **Reports › My Reports**, scheduled every 30 days. The same review sits in **Apps › Enable › People**, under the rep's **Coach** section, with a list of past months."},"833":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-90","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#coaching-cadence","content":"The monthly review lands in My Reports for the manager, with the goal choice, the evidence and last month's progress in one report."},"834":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-91","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#set-the-goal","content":"Read each goal's **Why?**, then click **Set as goal** on the one that fits. It doesn't have to be the **Recommended** one. **Continue with goal** carries last month's goal forward instead. Nothing reaches the rep until the manager has reviewed it. The monthly review is for the manager only, and reps see their weekly progress reports, scoped to the goal already set."},"835":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-92","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#set-the-goal","content":"The manager chooses the month's goal from three, each with its evidence, or keeps last month's goal running, so the rep only ever works on one."},"836":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-93","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#set-the-goal","content":"Add **Coaching Tasks** with due dates to break the goal into steps, and tick them off as the rep completes them."},"837":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-94","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#team-visibility","content":"Managers see a dashboard of every rep's active goal, weekly progress and improvement trajectory. It shows who's advancing, who's stalling and who needs a direct conversation. In **Apps › Enable › People**, **My Team** cards show each rep's target pacing, open deals, active pipeline and forecast. A rep's card opens their report, where the **One on One** report carries a **Coaching** block with the goal's progress and **View Coaching**."},"838":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-95","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#team-visibility","content":"People is the manager's way into each rep's coaching: spot who is behind pace, then open that rep's one-on-one and Coach reports."},"839":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-96","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#team-visibility","content":"Sales leaders see coaching performance at team and org level, including skill gaps that repeat across reps. For a leader's view of this, read about coaching at scale for VPs of Sales."},"840":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-97","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#with-deal-driver","content":"Oliv AI's Deal Driver agent handles the pipeline context before each 1:1. Coach has already surfaced the rep's highest-impact goal, so the conversation starts there. Deal Driver removes the status check, and Coach drives the development conversation."},"841":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-98","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#with-content-curator","content":"When Coach sets a goal like handling pricing objections, Oliv AI's Content Curator agent supplies clips from the call library as coaching examples. The manager shows what good looks like from the team's own calls."},"842":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-99","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#with-oliver","content":"Oliv AI's Oliver agent updates the methodology and process definitions that feed Coach's scoring criteria. When your process changes, the scoring follows."},"843":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-100","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#with-olivia","content":"Oliv AI's Olivia agent is the front-facing master agent for reps. Coach's weekly reports reach reps through Slack, email or the Oliv AI platform."},"844":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-101","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#sales-managers","content":"Managers set one goal per rep each month in about twenty minutes and walk into every 1:1 with the brief. Many pair it with the pipeline view in the Deal Driver agent docs. More on Oliv AI for sales managers and the skill gap questions managers should ask."},"845":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-102","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#enablement","content":"Enablement sees which skills are actually winning deals and which training isn't sticking. Training can then be built from evidence, not assumptions. Read how coaching can cut new-hire ramp time and how sales enablement software differs."},"846":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-103","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#sales-leadership","content":"Leaders see which managers are consistently developing their reps and where improvement is stalling. The coaching system lives in the platform, so it doesn't leave when a strong manager does."},"847":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-104","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#reps","content":"Account executives, account managers and CSMs get a weekly progress report and a goal grounded in their own calls. They self-coach between conversations. The rest of a rep's week is in Run deals as an account executive, and customer-facing teams can read about Oliv AI for customer success."},"848":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-105","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#compare","content":"Coach scores every call against a pre-built scorecard library and turns the scores into one evidence-backed goal per rep each month. Each week, the rep gets a progress report on that goal. Oliv AI is the only platform in this table that does all four."},"849":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-106","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#compare","content":"Coaching features, from each platform's public documentation:"},"850":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-107","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#compare","content":"| Platform    | Auto-scores every recorded call | Monthly goal recommended per rep | Weekly progress report for the rep | Pre-built scorecard library |\n| ----------- | ------------------------------- | -------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| **Oliv AI** | Yes                             | Yes                              | Yes                                | Yes                         |","table":"table-4"},"851":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-108","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#compare","content":"| Platform | Auto-scores every recorded call           | Monthly goal recommended per rep          | Weekly progress report for the rep | Pre-built scorecard library    |\n| -------- | ----------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| **Gong** | Yes (AI Call Reviewer scores whole calls) | Partly (Whisper tips from best practices) | Not in docs                        | Yes (Gong scorecard templates) |","table":"table-4"},"852":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-109","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#compare","content":"| Platform  | Auto-scores every recorded call         | Monthly goal recommended per rep           | Weekly progress report for the rep | Pre-built scorecard library |\n| --------- | --------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ | ---------------------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| **Avoma** | Yes (AI Coaching Assistant auto-scores) | Partly (coaching recommendations in Slack) | Not in docs                        | Three default AI scorecards |","table":"table-4"},"853":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-110","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#compare","content":"| Platform     | Auto-scores every recorded call     | Monthly goal recommended per rep         | Weekly progress report for the rep | Pre-built scorecard library |\n| ------------ | ----------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| **Outreach** | Partly (2 Amplify credits per card) | Partly (tracks managers' coaching goals) | Not in docs                        | Not in docs                 |","table":"table-4"},"854":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-111","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#compare","content":"| Platform   | Auto-scores every recorded call           | Monthly goal recommended per rep | Weekly progress report for the rep | Pre-built scorecard library        |\n| ---------- | ----------------------------------------- | -------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| **Fathom** | Partly (AI Scorecards on Business or Pro) | Not in docs                      | Not in docs                        | Partly (example templates to copy) |","table":"table-4"},"855":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-112","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#compare","content":"| Platform      | Auto-scores every recorded call       | Monthly goal recommended per rep | Weekly progress report for the rep | Pre-built scorecard library             |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------------- | -------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| **Fireflies** | Partly (scorecards through AI Skills) | Not in docs                      | Not in docs                        | Partly (AI Skill templates, incl. BANT) |","table":"table-4"},"856":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-113","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#compare","content":"*Yes: documented and built in. Partly: documented with a limit, shown in brackets. Not in docs: not found in the vendor's public documentation.*"},"857":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-114","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#compare-stronger","content":"**Goals come from your reps' own deals.** Coach ranks three recommendations per rep by expected impact, with evidence from that rep's calls and deals. Gong's Whisper notes that its recommendations are based on industry best practices. Compare Oliv AI vs Gong."},"858":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-115","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#compare-stronger","content":"**The goal is tracked every week.** Once the manager sets a goal, Coach sends the rep a weekly report on wins, the remaining gap and one focus. Avoma sends coaching recommendations as Slack alerts, with its Revenue Intelligence add-on. Compare Oliv AI vs Avoma."},"859":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-116","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#compare-stronger","content":"**Full-volume scoring is part of the cadence.** Coach scores 100% of recorded activity before it recommends anything. In Outreach, each automatically scored coaching card uses 2 Amplify credits. Read how Gong and Outreach compare."},"860":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-117","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#compare-stronger","content":"*Competitor details checked against each vendor's public documentation on 21 October 2026. Features and plans change, so confirm with the vendor before you decide.*"},"861":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-118","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#limits","content":"**It needs call volume.** About 10 calls per rep give enough data for a meaningful pattern. More calls raise confidence."},"862":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-119","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#limits","content":"**It isn't real-time.** Coach works on recorded calls after the fact. Live, in-call guidance is a separate tool."},"863":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-120","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#limits","content":"**It isn't a QA or compliance tool.** Goals are tied to revenue outcomes, not script adherence, tone or legal review."},"864":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-121","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#limits","content":"**It doesn't queue calls to watch.** Coach surfaces conclusions, not a list of recordings to review."},"865":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-122","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#limits","content":"**It doesn't replace the 1:1.** It gives managers better material for the conversation."},"866":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-123","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#limits","content":"**One goal at a time.** Each month the manager sets one goal per rep from the three recommended, or continues the last one."},"867":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-124","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#faq-call-volume","content":"Typically 10 or more calls per rep. More calls improve the quality and confidence of the goal recommendations."},"868":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-125","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#faq-override","content":"Yes. Any of the three goals can be set, not only the one marked **Recommended**. The manager can also continue last month's goal. Nothing reaches the rep until the manager sets it."},"869":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-126","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#faq-who-sees-review","content":"No. The monthly review is for the manager only. Reps see their weekly progress reports, scoped to the goal the manager has set."},"870":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-127","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#faq-bdrs","content":"The scorecard library includes phone call scorecards written for SDR work, such as the Cold-Call Scorecard and the Event Follow-Up Call scorecard. BDR leads use the same cadence as sales managers."},"871":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-128","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#faq-rep-disagrees","content":"The goal is grounded in their own call data and deal outcomes, so the evidence is there to discuss. The aim is a data-led conversation, not a manager's opinion."},"872":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-129","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#faq-own-framework","content":"Yes. Start from the pre-built scorecards or build your own from a library of more than 100 criteria. No engineering is required."},"873":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-130","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#faq-where-review","content":"In **Reports › My Reports** under Coach, or in **Apps › Enable › People** from the rep's card. Both show the same goals, scores and drill-downs."},"874":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-131","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#faq-setup","content":"Connect your call recording stack and CRM. Most teams have their first monthly review within two weeks, with no rep training."},"875":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-132","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#faq-deal-driver","content":"No. Deal Driver gives managers pipeline visibility across active deals. Coach gives them rep development visibility. They're often bought together."},"876":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-133","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#faq-where-reports-go","content":"In their usual channel: Slack, email or the Oliv AI platform."},"877":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-134","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#faq-style-coach","content":"No. A goal like \"be more confident\" isn't a Coach goal. Goals tie a specific behavior to a measurable deal outcome."},"878":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-135","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#related","content":"Coach on oliv.ai: the agent's own page, with the coaching cadence."},"879":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-136","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#related","content":"Run 1:1s that drive progress: a webinar on coaching-first 1:1s."},"880":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-137","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#related","content":"Sales call analytics software: how recording and scoring tools differ."},"881":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-138","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#related","content":"Agent tools and run modes: how approval settings work for agent actions."},"882":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-139","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#related","content":"Prepare for a meeting: the brief reps get before each deal meeting."},"883":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-140","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#related","content":"Oliv AI pricing: plans and what each includes."},"884":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/coach-141","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/coach","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/coach#related","content":"Oliv AI product documentation: every documented agent and feature."},"885":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","type":"page","content":"CRM Manager agent","breadcrumbs":["Oliv AI docs","Agents","CRM Manager"],"tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager"},"886":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-0","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","content":"What Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent writes to your CRM after every activity, how reps review its updates, when to switch to Auto-Pilot, and how it compares."},"887":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-1","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#at-a-glance","content":"At a glance"},"888":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-2","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#what-it-is","content":"What the CRM Manager agent is"},"889":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-3","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#keeps-current","content":"What it keeps current"},"890":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-4","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#field-types","content":"Three kinds of fields"},"891":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-5","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#why-it-matters","content":"Why the CRM Manager agent matters"},"892":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-6","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#what-its-for","content":"What it's for"},"893":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-7","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#how-it-helps","content":"How it helps"},"894":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-8","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#without-it","content":"What happens without it"},"895":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-9","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#why-buyers-care","content":"Why buyers care"},"896":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-10","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#approach","content":"The Oliv AI approach to the CRM Manager agent"},"897":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-11","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#set-up","content":"Set up CRM Manager"},"898":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-12","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#review-and-auto","content":"Review updates, then switch to Auto-Pilot"},"899":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-13","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#rep-review","content":"What a rep sees"},"900":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-14","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#weekly-cadence","content":"The weekly cadence"},"901":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-15","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#batch-jobs","content":"Direct a clean-up job"},"902":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-16","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#weekly-report","content":"What RevOps gets each week"},"903":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-17","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#works-with","content":"How CRM Manager works with other agents"},"904":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-18","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#with-meeting-assistant","content":"Meeting Assistant"},"905":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-19","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#with-deal-driver-forecaster","content":"Deal Driver and Forecaster"},"906":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-20","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#with-portfolio-manager","content":"Portfolio Manager"},"907":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-21","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#with-oliver","content":"Oliver"},"908":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-22","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#with-olivia","content":"Olivia"},"909":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-23","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#who-uses-it","content":"Who uses CRM Manager, and how"},"910":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-24","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#account-executives","content":"Account executives"},"911":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-25","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#revops","content":"Revenue operations"},"912":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-26","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#sales-managers","content":"Sales managers"},"913":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-27","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#customer-success","content":"Customer success managers"},"914":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-28","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#compare","content":"How the CRM Manager agent compares"},"915":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-29","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#compare-stronger","content":"Why Oliv AI is the stronger choice for the CRM Manager agent"},"916":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-30","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#limits","content":"Limits and things to know"},"917":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-31","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#common-questions","content":"Common questions"},"918":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-32","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#faq-approve-first","content":"Does CRM Manager write directly to my CRM, or do I approve updates first?"},"919":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-33","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#faq-wrong-update","content":"What if it makes a wrong update?"},"920":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-34","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#faq-messy-data","content":"Our CRM data is already a mess. Will it still work?"},"921":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-35","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#faq-crms","content":"Which CRMs does it support?"},"922":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-36","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#faq-custom-fields","content":"Who configures the custom fields?"},"923":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-37","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#faq-hierarchy","content":"Does it understand account hierarchy?"},"924":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-38","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#faq-customer-success","content":"Does it cover customer success, or just sales?"},"925":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-39","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#faq-activity-coverage","content":"Does it only log meetings that Oliv AI joined?"},"926":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-40","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#faq-new-contacts","content":"Does it create new contacts?"},"927":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-41","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#faq-field-history","content":"Can I see what changed on a field over time?"},"928":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-42","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#related","content":"Related"},"929":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-43","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","content":"Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent keeps every record in your CRM accurate and current, without anyone updating it by hand. After every meeting, call and email, it works out what changed and writes it to Salesforce, HubSpot or Zoho. Each suggested change waits on the deal's **CRM Updates** tab beside the field's current value, so reps can accept or reject it. Once the team trusts the results, you can switch it to fully automatic updates."},"930":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-44","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                                                                     |\n| ---------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **What it does** | Updates accounts, contacts, opportunities, activities and tasks from every activity |","table":"table-0"},"931":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-45","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                                                       |\n| ---------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Who it's for** | RevOps first, plus account executives, sales managers and CS managers |","table":"table-0"},"932":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-46","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#at-a-glance","content":"|          |                                                                |\n| -------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **CRMs** | Salesforce, HubSpot and Zoho out of the box; others on request |","table":"table-0"},"933":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-47","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#at-a-glance","content":"|                     |                                                            |\n| ------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Fields it fills** | Standard fields, methodology fields and your custom fields |","table":"table-0"},"934":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-48","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#at-a-glance","content":"|                      |                                                                                            |\n| -------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Where you review** | The deal's **CRM Updates** tab: **AI Suggestions**, **AI Updates** and **Updates History** |","table":"table-0"},"935":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-49","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#at-a-glance","content":"|                   |                                 |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| **Control modes** | **Ask First** or **Auto-Pilot** |","table":"table-0"},"936":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-50","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#at-a-glance","content":"|                    |                                                                            |\n| ------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **On-demand jobs** | Duplicates, broken hierarchies, unassigned contacts, methodology backfills |","table":"table-0"},"937":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-51","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#at-a-glance","content":"|                   |                                                             |\n| ----------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Weekly output** | A governance digest for RevOps and a report of what changed |","table":"table-0"},"938":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-52","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#what-it-is","content":"Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent is an always-on agent that sits on top of your CRM. It isn't a CRM itself. It works with Salesforce, HubSpot or Zoho, and its updates flow into your existing workflows, reports and dashboards."},"939":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-53","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#what-it-is","content":"It runs as a result of every activity rather than when someone asks. Oliv AI's Deal Insights layer works out what a conversation means. CRM Manager is the operator that takes that work and applies it everywhere it needs to go. On the live page, the promise reads \"Your CRM can now run itself.\""},"940":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-54","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#what-it-is","content":"CRM Manager reports its day in the Agent Feed beside Oliver and Forecaster. One row says how many fields it changed, which applied straight away and which still need a person."},"941":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-55","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#keeps-current","content":"**Accounts and contacts.** When an activity involves a company or person not yet in the CRM, it creates the record and enriches it straight away."},"942":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-56","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#keeps-current","content":"**Account structure.** It maps activity to the right account and opportunity, keeps parent and subsidiary links current, and removes duplicates."},"943":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-57","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#keeps-current","content":"**Stakeholder roles.** It tracks each contact's role on each opportunity, such as economic buyer, champion or blocker, and updates Opportunity Contact Roles."},"944":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-58","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#keeps-current","content":"**Opportunities.** It creates the opportunity once there are enough activity signals, then moves the stage as the deal progresses."},"945":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-59","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#keeps-current","content":"**Activities and tasks.** It logs every meeting, call and email, and creates tasks from the next steps it hears."},"946":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-60","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#keeps-current","content":"After a meeting, its **CRM Updates** tab shows each write as a card: **Account Updated**, **Opportunity Updated**, **Contact Created**. A change that waits for you, such as a stage move, shows as **Pending Update** with **Update Deal**."},"947":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-61","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#keeps-current","content":"One meeting, several CRM writes: an account refresh, a scorecard update and two new contacts. The stage move is held as a Pending Update until someone confirms it."},"948":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-62","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#field-types","content":"**Standard fields.** Close date, deal amount, stage, next steps and last activity date. These are pre-mapped when you connect your CRM."},"949":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-63","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#field-types","content":"**Methodology fields.** The criteria of the framework marked **Active** in **Settings › Qualification Framework**: MEDDPICC, MEDDIC, SPICED, BANT or DRIVE. Each criterion lists how many supporting fields back it."},"950":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-64","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#field-types","content":"**Custom fields.** Anything unique to your process, such as use case, competition or integration type. Oliv AI's team configures these during onboarding."},"951":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-65","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#field-types","content":"On a deal, the **Details** tab groups these fields into sections such as **Overview**, **Next Steps** and **Opportunity and Risks**."},"952":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-66","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#field-types","content":"These are the standard fields CRM Manager keeps current, such as close date, amount, stage and next step, grouped the way a rep reads a deal."},"953":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-67","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#field-types","content":"Methodology fields follow the framework marked Active here. The supporting fields count on each criterion shows how many CRM fields CRM Manager fills to back it."},"954":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-68","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#what-its-for","content":"Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent is for teams whose CRM shows what got logged rather than what happened. It turns every conversation into current records, so nobody has to type them."},"955":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-69","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#how-it-helps","content":"**Fields fill themselves.** Stage, close date, next steps and methodology fields come from what was said."},"956":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-70","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#how-it-helps","content":"**No clean-up first.** It works with messy data and tidies it as it goes."},"957":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-71","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#how-it-helps","content":"**Every change sits beside the old value.** Each suggestion shows the field's current value, so a rep sees exactly what would change."},"958":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-72","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#how-it-helps","content":"**Other agents get better data.** Forecasts, deal alerts and coaching all read the records it keeps current."},"959":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-73","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#without-it","content":"Managers spend one-on-ones policing the CRM. Customer success managers work from stale account records. RevOps runs pipeline reports on fields that nobody has touched in weeks, and forecasts inherit those gaps."},"960":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-74","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#why-buyers-care","content":"A RevOps lead usually buys CRM Manager, with a VP of Sales or VP of CS joining in mid-market teams. It tends to come up when a forecast misses or a CRM clean-up project starts, because that is when the cost of stale data shows."},"961":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-75","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#approach","content":"Imagine an account executive on a Friday afternoon after eleven customer calls this week. Next steps, new names and revised close dates for half her deals are still in her notebook. Her manager reviews the pipeline first thing Monday."},"962":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-76","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#approach","content":"The common fix is an hour or two of copying notes into fields, deal by deal. Some fields get rushed and others get skipped. The record ends up showing whatever she had time to type, which may not match what buyers actually said."},"963":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-77","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#approach","content":"Every one of those calls already happened on a recorded line, so the facts exist. The missing step is moving them into the right fields. A rep shouldn't have to retype a conversation, only check that the record matches it."},"964":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-78","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#approach","content":"Oliv AI gives that step to its CRM Manager agent. After every meeting, call and email, it proposes values for standard, methodology and custom fields. Each one appears on the deal's **CRM Updates** tab with the suggested value above the current one. The AE accepts or rejects each field."},"965":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-79","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#approach","content":"Teams on the weekly cadence get pending suggestions on Friday morning, and anything left unreviewed is accepted automatically on Sunday night. RevOps then receives a summary that includes how often each rep accepted the suggestions. How that digest stacks up is covered in How the CRM Manager agent compares, below."},"966":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-80","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#set-up","content":"**Connect your CRM.** Use the one-click integration for Salesforce, HubSpot or Zoho. Your pipeline and fields sync straight away."},"967":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-81","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#set-up","content":"**Let Oliv AI map your custom fields.** Oliv AI's team configures them during onboarding as a service, so RevOps has nothing to build."},"968":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-82","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#set-up","content":"**Let activity start the engine.** From the first meeting, call or email, CRM Manager is already working."},"969":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-83","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#set-up","content":"**Review updates as they arrive.** Reps check suggestions while the team builds confidence in them."},"970":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-84","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#set-up","content":"**Switch to auto when you're ready.** Once accuracy thresholds are met, RevOps confirms the move to auto mode."},"971":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-85","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#set-up","content":"Adding email and phone integrations widens what it sees beyond meetings. The integrations directory lists what you can connect."},"972":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-86","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#review-and-auto","content":"CRM Manager runs in one of two control modes:"},"973":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-87","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#review-and-auto","content":"**Ask First.** You review each update before it's written. Suggestions wait under **AI Suggestions** on the deal's **CRM Updates** tab."},"974":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-88","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#review-and-auto","content":"**Auto-Pilot.** Unreviewed updates apply automatically, so the pipeline stays current without anyone acting. Applied changes are listed under **AI Updates**."},"975":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-89","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#rep-review","content":"After every activity, CRM Manager sends a message in Slack or your preferred channel: \"I found updates for X fields, review here.\" On Home, its **Agent Feed** row says how many fields it updated and how many need your review."},"976":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-90","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#rep-review","content":"Open the deal from **Records › Deals** and pick the **CRM Updates** tab. Its index has three lists, each with a count: **AI Suggestions**, **AI Updates** and **Updates History**. Each suggestion card names the field, holds the suggested value in a text box or dropdown, and shows \"Current Value\" below. Press **Accept** or **Reject**. For a rep's view of the same deals, see running deals as an account executive."},"977":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-91","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#rep-review","content":"This is the review step in Ask First. Every suggestion sits beside the value it would replace, and nothing changes until a rep presses Accept."},"978":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-92","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#rep-review","content":"The count beside **AI Suggestions** shows managers what is waiting on each deal. **Updates History** keeps the record of how each field changed."},"979":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-93","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#weekly-cadence","content":"Some teams prefer one review window a week. Reps get their pending CRM suggestions on Friday morning, and an auto-acceptance confirmation on Sunday night. If a rep doesn't complete updates within a set window, deals can be deferred automatically or flagged as closed-lost, depending on how your org configures it."},"980":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-94","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#batch-jobs","content":"CRM Manager works in the background, but RevOps can give it a job at any time in plain language:"},"981":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-95","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#batch-jobs","content":"\"Find all duplicate accounts from last quarter.\""},"982":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-96","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#batch-jobs","content":"\"Rebuild broken account hierarchies.\""},"983":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-97","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#batch-jobs","content":"\"Clean unassigned contacts.\""},"984":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-98","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#batch-jobs","content":"\"Backfill MEDDPICC fields across the pipeline.\""},"985":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-99","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#batch-jobs","content":"These batch jobs replace the rule-heavy clean-up work that older tools need, with no configuration to maintain. The guide to autonomous CRM hygiene shows how RevOps teams plan these jobs."},"986":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-100","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#weekly-report","content":"**A weekly report.** Newly created deals, accounts and contacts, fields updated and enriched, and records cleaned or de-duplicated."},"987":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-101","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#weekly-report","content":"**A governance summary.** Suggestions made, fields updated, reverts, time saved, acceptance rate by rep and flags that need review."},"988":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-102","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#weekly-report","content":"**Stale data flags.** CRM objects with missing or stale data."},"989":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-103","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#weekly-report","content":"**A usage and ROI tab.** Visible in the product, alongside an estimate of time saved on manual CRM work."},"990":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-104","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#works-with","content":"CRM Manager doesn't direct other agents. They read the data it produces."},"991":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-105","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#with-meeting-assistant","content":"Oliv AI's Meeting Assistant agent proposes field updates from every call. CRM Manager reviews the same call context and pushes approved changes into the CRM. Before the next call, briefs pull from the contact and account records it keeps current, as shown in preparing for a meeting."},"992":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-106","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#with-deal-driver-forecaster","content":"Oliv AI's Deal Driver agent uses CRM field values and stage history for pipeline review and risk flags. Oliv AI's Forecaster agent uses stage, close date and amount for its projections."},"993":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-107","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#with-portfolio-manager","content":"Oliv AI's Portfolio Manager agent works from account records that CRM Manager keeps current from QBRs and check-in calls. Its signals reflect this week, not last month."},"994":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-108","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#with-oliver","content":"Oliv AI's Oliver agent maintains the field definitions that decide what CRM Manager tracks and updates. When a process change needs a new field, Oliver works through CRM Manager. An Oliver proposal in Playbook can add a new Opportunity field that CRM Manager fills from meeting and email activity, with a 90-day backfill."},"995":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-109","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#with-olivia","content":"Oliv AI's Olivia agent answers reps' questions about deals and accounts. Her answers are only as current as the records CRM Manager maintains. When she drafts an email, her follow-up plan names CRM Manager to log the touch on the deal."},"996":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-110","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#account-executives","content":"An AE gets a message after each call and reviews proposed updates in a few clicks. The record stays current without an end-of-week typing session. More on Oliv AI for account executives."},"997":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-111","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#revops","content":"RevOps owns CRM Manager. It confirms the switch to auto mode, runs batch clean-up jobs and reads the weekly governance digest. The RevOps view of the **Agent Feed** lists CRM Manager beside Oliver and Forecaster. See how Oliv AI supports revenue operations."},"998":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-112","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#sales-managers","content":"Managers check the **AI Suggestions** count on each deal's **CRM Updates** tab, so one-on-ones start from clean data instead of CRM police work. Read about Oliv AI for sales managers."},"999":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-113","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#customer-success","content":"CRM Manager covers the full revenue lifecycle, including onboarding, QBRs and renewals. When a champion mentions a reorg in passing, the stakeholder map changes and the champion is flagged at risk. Learn more about Oliv AI for customer success."},"1000":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-114","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#compare","content":"Several tools in this table write fields from calls. CRM Manager also resolves duplicate accounts as activity touches them and sends RevOps a weekly digest with each rep's acceptance rate. Oliv AI is the only platform in this table that does all three."},"1001":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-115","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#compare","content":"CRM update features, from each platform's public documentation:"},"1002":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-116","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#compare","content":"| Platform    | CRM fields updated from calls | Duplicates resolved as it goes | Weekly digest with acceptance rate by rep |\n| ----------- | ----------------------------- | ------------------------------ | ----------------------------------------- |\n| **Oliv AI** | Yes                           | Yes                            | Yes                                       |","table":"table-1"},"1003":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-117","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#compare","content":"| Platform | CRM fields updated from calls             | Duplicates resolved as it goes             | Weekly digest with acceptance rate by rep |\n| -------- | ----------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ | ----------------------------------------- |\n| **Gong** | Yes (AI Data Extractor writes CRM fields) | Partly (filters to skip duplicate records) | Not in docs                               |","table":"table-1"},"1004":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-118","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#compare","content":"| Platform     | CRM fields updated from calls          | Duplicates resolved as it goes      | Weekly digest with acceptance rate by rep |\n| ------------ | -------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| **Outreach** | Yes (Deal Agent field recommendations) | Partly (dedupe rules set by admins) | Not in docs                               |","table":"table-1"},"1005":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-119","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#compare","content":"| Platform  | CRM fields updated from calls        | Duplicates resolved as it goes | Weekly digest with acceptance rate by rep |\n| --------- | ------------------------------------ | ------------------------------ | ----------------------------------------- |\n| **Avoma** | Yes (bi-directional Salesforce sync) | Not in docs                    | Not in docs                               |","table":"table-1"},"1006":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-120","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#compare","content":"| Platform      | CRM fields updated from calls           | Duplicates resolved as it goes | Weekly digest with acceptance rate by rep |\n| ------------- | --------------------------------------- | ------------------------------ | ----------------------------------------- |\n| **Fireflies** | Yes (Autofill CRM drafts field updates) | Not in docs                    | Not in docs                               |","table":"table-1"},"1007":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-121","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#compare","content":"| Platform   | CRM fields updated from calls              | Duplicates resolved as it goes | Weekly digest with acceptance rate by rep |\n| ---------- | ------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------ | ----------------------------------------- |\n| **Fathom** | Yes (call summaries written to Salesforce) | Not in docs                    | Not in docs                               |","table":"table-1"},"1008":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-122","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#compare","content":"*Yes: documented and built in. Partly: documented with a limit, shown in brackets. Not in docs: not found in the vendor's public documentation.*"},"1009":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-123","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#compare-stronger","content":"**One value per field, beside the old one.** CRM Manager shows each suggested value above the current value and waits for **Accept** or **Reject**. Gong notes that when several Data Extractors map to one field, they all update it and overwrite the existing value. Compare Oliv AI vs Gong."},"1010":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-124","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#compare-stronger","content":"**Duplicates handled for you.** CRM Manager resolves duplicates in real time and in batch jobs. Outreach documents deduping criteria that Outreach Admins customize per field mapping. Read how Gong and Outreach compare."},"1011":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-125","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#compare-stronger","content":"**Set-up without two admins.** You connect the CRM and Oliv AI's team maps your custom fields. Avoma's Salesforce sync says you must be both an Avoma admin and a Salesforce admin. Compare Oliv AI vs Avoma."},"1012":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-126","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#compare-stronger","content":"*Competitor details checked against each vendor's public documentation on 21 October 2026. Features and plans change, so confirm with the vendor before you decide.*"},"1013":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-127","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#limits","content":"**It isn't a CRM.** It works on top of Salesforce, HubSpot or Zoho, and your reports stay where they are."},"1014":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-128","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#limits","content":"**It writes what Deal Insights produces.** CRM Manager doesn't score deals or decide field values from scratch."},"1015":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-129","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#limits","content":"**It isn't for pipeline risk.** Pipeline risk signals belong to Deal Driver. CRM Manager surfaces data quality issues."},"1016":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-130","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#limits","content":"**It isn't a forecast.** Forecaster handles projections."},"1017":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-131","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#limits","content":"**Auto mode needs a decision.** RevOps confirms the switch once accuracy thresholds are met."},"1018":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-132","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#limits","content":"**If it can't tell where an activity belongs, it asks.** The seller confirms the right account or opportunity."},"1019":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-133","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#faq-approve-first","content":"Both. By default, every suggested update waits under **AI Suggestions** before anything reaches your CRM. Once your team trusts it, switch to auto mode for hands-free updates."},"1020":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-134","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#faq-wrong-update","content":"Each suggestion shows the current value next to the suggested one, so you can reject it before it's written. **Updates History** keeps the record of every change."},"1021":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-135","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#faq-messy-data","content":"Yes. Real-time mode fixes issues as new activity comes in, and batch mode cleans what's already there. You don't need a clean CRM to start."},"1022":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-136","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#faq-crms","content":"Salesforce, HubSpot and Zoho out of the box. Additional CRMs are available on request."},"1023":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-137","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#faq-custom-fields","content":"Oliv AI's team handles this during onboarding as a service. It isn't a RevOps task on your side."},"1024":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-138","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#faq-hierarchy","content":"Yes. It maps parent and subsidiary relationships and keeps them current. RevOps can also run a full hierarchy rebuild as a batch job."},"1025":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-139","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#faq-customer-success","content":"Both. It tracks activity across the full revenue lifecycle: pre-sale, active sales, CS onboarding, QBRs and renewals."},"1026":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-140","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#faq-activity-coverage","content":"No. It logs any activity on the platform, including calls and emails, against the right account, contact and opportunity."},"1027":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-141","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#faq-new-contacts","content":"Yes. When a new person joins a meeting, call or email thread, CRM Manager creates the contact and enriches it with title, LinkedIn and email. The meeting's **CRM Updates** tab shows it as **Contact Created**, with **View Contact**."},"1028":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-142","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#faq-field-history","content":"Yes. Each deal's **CRM Updates** tab has an **Updates History** list of the changes made."},"1029":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager-143","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager#related","content":"CRM Manager on oliv.ai: the agent's own page, with a week in the life of RevOps."},"1030":{"id":"/produ