                            |\n| -------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **First mode** | **Ask First**, with each suggestion beside the current value on the deal's **CRM Updates** tab |","table":"table-0"},"1086":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-48","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#at-a-glance","content":"|          |                                               |\n| -------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| **Then** | **Auto-Pilot**, once RevOps confirms accuracy |","table":"table-0"},"1087":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-49","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#before-you-begin","content":"**Have your CRM ready to connect.** You connect it during onboarding."},"1088":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-50","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#before-you-begin","content":"**Know which methodology you run.** **Settings › Qualification Framework** lists MEDDPICC, MEDDIC, SPICED, BANT and DRIVE, with one marked **Active**."},"1089":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-51","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#before-you-begin","content":"**List your custom opportunity fields.** Note what each one means and which reports read it."},"1090":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-52","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#before-you-begin","content":"**Plan a short review period.** Reps take part while the team checks early updates."},"1091":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-53","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#before-you-begin","content":"**For HubSpot, have access to HubSpot Settings.** You may need to create a custom property for Oliv data."},"1092":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-54","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#step-1-list-fields","content":"CRM Manager fills three kinds of field. Sort your list into them before you connect anything."},"1093":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-55","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#step-1-list-fields","content":"**Standard fields.** Close date, deal amount, stage, next steps and last activity date. These are pre-mapped and fill from day one."},"1094":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-56","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#step-1-list-fields","content":"**Methodology fields.** The fields your qualification framework uses. Values come from Oliv AI's Deal Insights layer, and CRM Manager writes them and keeps them current."},"1095":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-57","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#step-1-list-fields","content":"**Custom fields.** Anything unique to your process, such as a deck status, use case, competition or integration type."},"1096":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-58","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#step-1-list-fields","content":"To see the standard fields as reps will, open a deal's **Details** tab. Its section index runs from **Overview** and **Next Steps** to **Opportunity and Risks**, **Adoption**, **Success Plan** and **Marketing Opportunity**."},"1097":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-59","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#step-1-list-fields","content":"Use the Details tab as your checklist for Step 1. The standard fields are already here; note which custom fields belong in the later sections."},"1098":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-60","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#step-1-list-fields","content":"For methodology fields, open **Settings › Qualification Framework**. Each criterion of the previewed framework shows a **Supporting fields** count, the CRM fields that back it."},"1099":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-61","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#step-1-list-fields","content":"The supporting fields count tells you how many CRM fields each criterion needs. Add those fields to your list so framework scores have somewhere to land."},"1100":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-62","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#step-1-list-fields","content":"The sales methodology overview explains how framework fields fill from calls."},"1101":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-63","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#step-2-connect","content":"Use the one-click integration for Salesforce, HubSpot or Zoho. Your pipeline and fields sync straight away."},"1102":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-64","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#step-2-connect","content":"For HubSpot, visit the HubSpot integration in the Oliv AI web app. Share your HubSpot URL with the Oliv AI admin through Intercom in the Oliv AI interface."},"1103":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-65","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#step-2-connect","content":"To connect email and phone as well, add those integrations. They widen activity coverage beyond meetings."},"1104":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-66","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#step-2-connect","content":"Open **Settings › Revenue Process** and check your stages. Each sales motion has its own tab, and **Import Pipeline from CRM** pulls in the stages from the connected CRM. Every stage carries a **Type**, a **Probability** and a **Forecast Category**."},"1105":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-67","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#step-2-connect","content":"Stage values are the first mapping to confirm. Import them from the CRM here, then check that each stage rolls into the forecast category your reports expect."},"1106":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-68","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#step-2-connect","content":"The integrations directory lists the apps you can connect."},"1107":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-69","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#step-3-hubspot-property","content":"Use this step when you want a piece of Oliv data, such as pain points, in its own HubSpot field."},"1108":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-70","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#step-3-hubspot-property","content":"In HubSpot, click **Settings** at the top of the page."},"1109":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-71","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#step-3-hubspot-property","content":"Under **Data Management**, select **Properties**, then click **Create Property**."},"1110":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-72","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#step-3-hubspot-property","content":"Name the property, for example **Oliv: Pain Points & Needs**, and set the object type to **Deal**."},"1111":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-73","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#step-3-hubspot-property","content":"Choose **Rich Text** as the field type, since most Oliv fields work best that way. Click **Preview**, then **Create**."},"1112":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-74","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#step-3-hubspot-property","content":"Back in **Settings**, go to **Objects**, then **Record Customization**, and open the default view."},"1113":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-75","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#step-3-hubspot-property","content":"Click **Add Cards**, then **Create Card**. Name the card, select your new property and click **Save and exit**."},"1114":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-76","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#step-3-hubspot-property","content":"Open any deal to check the field shows. Once Oliv captures relevant information, it fills the field automatically."},"1115":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-77","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#step-4-mapping-service","content":"Oliv AI's team configures custom fields during onboarding, as a service. It isn't a task RevOps does alone. Share the list from Step 1, including any HubSpot properties you created in Step 3."},"1116":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-78","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#step-4-mapping-service","content":"Once a custom field is mapped, CRM Manager updates it in the same way as standard and methodology fields. The RevOps implementation guide covers the rest of onboarding."},"1117":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-79","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#step-5-review","content":"**Leave CRM Manager on Ask First.** You review each update before it's written."},"1118":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-80","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#step-5-review","content":"**Watch for the notification.** After every activity, reps get a Slack or preferred-channel message: \"I found updates for X fields, review here.\""},"1119":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-81","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#step-5-review","content":"**Open the deal's CRM Updates tab.** Under **AI Suggestions**, each card names the field, holds the suggested value and shows \"Current Value\" below it."},"1120":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-82","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#step-5-review","content":"**Accept or reject.** Reps press **Accept** or **Reject** on each field."},"1121":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-83","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#step-5-review","content":"**Check the counts.** The index shows counts for **AI Suggestions**, **AI Updates** and **Updates History**, so you can see what's waiting and what already changed."},"1122":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-84","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#step-5-review","content":"This is where you check your first mapped fields. A custom field like Use Case shows up as a suggestion beside its current value, so a wrong mapping is easy to spot."},"1123":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-85","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#step-5-review","content":"The meeting's own **CRM Updates** tab says what changed and why, for example a stage move held as **Pending Update** until someone presses **Update Deal**."},"1124":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-86","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#step-5-review","content":"If a field keeps landing in the wrong place, raise it with Oliv AI's team before you move on. Reps see these reviews as part of running their deals."},"1125":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-87","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#step-6-auto-pilot","content":"Once accuracy thresholds are met, RevOps confirms the switch to auto mode. On **Auto-Pilot**, unreviewed updates apply automatically and the pipeline stays current without anyone acting."},"1126":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-88","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#step-6-auto-pilot","content":"Teams on the weekly cadence get a middle path. Reps receive pending CRM suggestions on Friday morning, and unreviewed ones are accepted automatically on Sunday night. The same approval idea applies to other agents, as described in agent tools and run modes."},"1127":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-89","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#step-7-backfill","content":"**Backfill existing deals.** Ask CRM Manager in plain language, for example \"Backfill MEDDPICC fields across the pipeline.\""},"1128":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-90","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#step-7-backfill","content":"**Clean up as needed.** It can also find duplicate accounts, rebuild broken account hierarchies and clean unassigned contacts."},"1129":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-91","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#step-7-backfill","content":"**Read the weekly governance summary.** It lists suggestions made, fields updated, reverts, time saved, acceptance rate by rep and flags that need review."},"1130":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-92","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#what-it-is","content":"Field mapping is the link between what Oliv AI learns from a conversation and the CRM field that stores it. Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent writes to Salesforce, HubSpot or Zoho, and every update flows into your existing workflows, reports and dashboards. Oliv AI works on top of your CRM and doesn't replace it."},"1131":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-93","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#what-it-is","content":"Mapping covers more than deal fields. CRM Manager also logs every meeting, call and email against the right account, contact and opportunity."},"1132":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-94","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#what-it-is","content":"An agent's **Data** tab shows the other side of the link: the CRM objects and fields an agent can read. Under **Sources**, Salesforce lists **Deals**, **Contacts**, **Accounts** and **Leads**, and each field comes with a plain-language description."},"1133":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-95","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#what-it-is","content":"Field definitions are what agents read back from your CRM. Clear descriptions here mean every agent understands a mapped field the same way."},"1134":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-96","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#what-it-is","content":"For a recorded call, CRM Manager attaches an AI-generated summary and the full call transcript to the Opportunity record. The CRM Manager agent page shows that example in full."},"1135":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-97","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#what-its-for","content":"Field mapping is for RevOps teams whose reports depend on custom fields that reps rarely fill. It points each piece of call data at the one field where your reports expect it."},"1136":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-98","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#how-it-helps","content":"**Custom fields stay filled.** Once mapped, they update like stage and close date."},"1137":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-99","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#how-it-helps","content":"**No rules to maintain.** CRM Manager reasons from context instead of rules someone has to write and update."},"1138":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-100","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#how-it-helps","content":"**Every value can be checked.** Each suggestion sits beside the current value, and the meeting's update says why it changed."},"1139":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-101","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#how-it-helps","content":"**Methodology stays complete.** Framework fields fill from every call, and old deals can be backfilled."},"1140":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-102","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#without-it","content":"Custom fields stay blank until someone chases them. Reports that rely on use case, competition or deal status show gaps, and leaders stop trusting them. Pipeline reviews fall back on whatever reps remember to type. Methodology fields sit half empty until someone chases them before a forecast call."},"1141":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-103","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#why-buyers-care","content":"The RevOps lead owns this decision, because the reports they build depend on those fields. It matters most during onboarding, and again whenever the team adds a field for a new process or methodology. Sales leaders feel it later, when the reports they read every week finally show complete data."},"1142":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-104","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#approach","content":"Take a RevOps admin whose opportunity record carries a dozen custom fields beyond the standard set. There is a deck status, a use case, a competitor field and an integration type. Each one feeds a report the CRO opens every Monday, and two of them decide how deals are routed to solutions engineers."},"1143":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-105","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#approach","content":"Most teams fill fields like these in one of two ways. Either reps remember to type them, or an admin writes rules to fill them. Rules tend to break when the schema changes, and a field nobody fills quietly drops out of the reports."},"1144":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-106","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#approach","content":"The information behind those fields is usually spoken on calls already. A buyer names a competitor or describes the integration they need, often in the first ten minutes. What's left is pointing each piece of data at the right field once, so every later update lands there."},"1145":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-107","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#approach","content":"Oliv AI takes that job on during onboarding. Its team maps your custom fields as a service, and the CRM Manager agent then updates them from every meeting, call and email. It treats them exactly as it treats stage, close date and methodology fields."},"1146":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-108","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#approach","content":"While you're on **Ask First**, every suggestion sits next to the field's present value on the deal's **CRM Updates** tab. Nothing reaches the CRM until a rep presses **Accept**. The reason given for each update is covered in How field mapping compares, below."},"1147":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-109","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#with-oliver","content":"Oliv AI's Oliver agent creates or modifies CRM field mappings when new tracking requirements emerge. When your process adds a field, Oliver works through CRM Manager to add it. An Oliver proposal can add a new Opportunity field that CRM Manager fills from meeting and email activity, with a 90-day backfill."},"1148":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-110","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#with-meeting-assistant","content":"Oliv AI's Meeting Assistant agent proposes field updates from every call. CRM Manager reviews the same call context and pushes approved changes into the mapped fields. The brief reps read before a call draws on those records, as shown in preparing for a meeting."},"1149":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-111","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#with-deal-driver","content":"Oliv AI's Deal Driver agent reads CRM field values and stage history for pipeline review and risk flags. Well-mapped fields make its alerts more accurate."},"1150":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-112","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#with-olivia","content":"Oliv AI's Olivia agent answers reps' questions about deals and accounts from the same records. Current fields mean current answers."},"1151":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-113","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#revops-admins","content":"The RevOps admin prepares the field list, checks early updates and confirms the switch to auto mode. The weekly governance summary shows each rep's acceptance rate. More on Oliv AI for revenue operations."},"1152":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-114","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#account-executives","content":"AEs review proposed updates during the Ask First period, then mostly stop touching the fields. Their opportunity records stay current from their calls. See Oliv AI for account executives."},"1153":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-115","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#sales-managers","content":"Managers watch the **AI Suggestions** count on each deal's **CRM Updates** tab. Custom fields they use in one-on-ones fill from real activity instead of reminders. Read about Oliv AI for sales managers."},"1154":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-116","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#customer-success","content":"CS teams map renewal and account fields too, because CRM Manager covers onboarding, QBRs and renewals. Learn more about Oliv AI for customer success."},"1155":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-117","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#compare","content":"Most tools here can fill custom CRM fields from calls once an admin sets up the mapping. Oliv AI's team does the mapping for you during onboarding, and every update says why it was made. Oliv AI is the only platform in this table that does all three."},"1156":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-118","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#compare","content":"Field mapping features, from each platform's public documentation:"},"1157":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-119","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#compare","content":"| Platform    | Custom fields filled from calls | Mapping set up for you at onboarding | Reason shown for each update |\n| ----------- | ------------------------------- | ------------------------------------ | ---------------------------- |\n| **Oliv AI** | Yes                             | Yes                                  | Yes                          |","table":"table-1"},"1158":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-120","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#compare","content":"| Platform     | Custom fields filled from calls | Mapping set up for you at onboarding | Reason shown for each update           |\n| ------------ | ------------------------------- | ------------------------------------ | -------------------------------------- |\n| **Outreach** | Yes (Deal Agent field updates)  | Admin task                           | Yes (transcript excerpt and timestamp) |","table":"table-1"},"1159":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-121","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#compare","content":"| Platform | Custom fields filled from calls         | Mapping set up for you at onboarding | Reason shown for each update                 |\n| -------- | --------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------ | -------------------------------------------- |\n| **Gong** | Yes (AI data fields mapped to your CRM) | Admin task (Business admin feature)  | Partly (evidence snippets on playbook notes) |","table":"table-1"},"1160":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-122","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#compare","content":"| Platform  | Custom fields filled from calls         | Mapping set up for you at onboarding | Reason shown for each update          |\n| --------- | --------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------- |\n| **Avoma** | Yes (CRM fields mapped to Smart Topics) | Admin task (needs an Avoma admin)    | Partly (evidence in deal methodology) |","table":"table-1"},"1161":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-123","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#compare","content":"| Platform      | Custom fields filled from calls     | Mapping set up for you at onboarding  | Reason shown for each update |\n| ------------- | ----------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- | ---------------------------- |\n| **Fireflies** | Yes (custom fields in Autofill CRM) | Partly (suggested mappings to review) | Not in docs                  |","table":"table-1"},"1162":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-124","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#compare","content":"| Platform   | Custom fields filled from calls         | Mapping set up for you at onboarding | Reason shown for each update |\n| ---------- | --------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------ | ---------------------------- |\n| **Fathom** | Yes (summary sections mapped to fields) | Admin task (set by a team admin)     | Not in docs                  |","table":"table-1"},"1163":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-