ic documentation on 21 October 2026. Features and plans change, so confirm with the vendor before you decide.*"},"1168":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-130","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#limits","content":"**Custom fields need onboarding.** Oliv AI's team maps them, so a new field goes through that team or through Oliver."},"1169":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-131","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#limits","content":"**HubSpot properties come first.** To store Oliv data in its own HubSpot field, create the property before mapping."},"1170":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-132","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#limits","content":"**Auto mode needs a decision.** RevOps confirms the switch once accuracy thresholds are met."},"1171":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-133","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#limits","content":"**Values come from Deal Insights.** CRM Manager writes what that layer produces and doesn't decide values from scratch."},"1172":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-134","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#limits","content":"**Other CRMs are by request.** Salesforce, HubSpot and Zoho work out of the box."},"1173":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping-135","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/crm-manager/field-mapping#faq-pre-mapped","content":"Standard 