g Assistant separately?"},"1229":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-37","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#faq-crm-writes","content":"Does Deal Driver write to the CRM?"},"1230":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-38","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#faq-cs-managers","content":"Does it work for customer success managers?"},"1231":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-39","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#faq-setup-time","content":"How long does setup take?"},"1232":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-40","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#faq-reps","content":"Do reps need to change how they work?"},"1233":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-41","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#related","content":"Related"},"1234":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-42","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","content":"Oliv AI's Deal Driver agent keeps sales managers ahead of their team's pipeline without daily standups, manual rep check-ins or digging through CRM reports. Every weekday it sends a **Morning Brief**, fires alerts when something important happens, and closes the day with a **Sunset Summary**. It also prepares a **One-on-One Prep** report for each rep and a **Pipeline Review** every Monday."},"1235":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-43","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                                                     |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **What it does** | Watches the team's pipeline and tells managers what needs attention |","table":"table-0"},"1236":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-44","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                                                                 |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Who it's for** | Sales managers, BDR leads and regional heads of sales, plus VP Sales and RevOps |","table":"table-0"},"1237":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-45","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                                                                     |\n| ---------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Daily rhythm** | **Morning Brief** and **Sunset Summary** every weekday, plus event-triggered alerts |","table":"table-0"},"1238":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-46","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#at-a-glance","content":"|                   |                                                                                               |\n| ----------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Weekly rhythm** | **Pipeline Review** every Monday; **One-on-One Prep** for each rep on that rep's own schedule |","table":"table-0"},"1239":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-47","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#at-a-glance","content":"|                          |                                               |\n| ------------------------ | --------------------------------------------- |\n| **Where it reaches you** | **Reports › My Reports**, plus Slack or email |","table":"table-0"},"1240":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-48","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#at-a-glance","content":"|              |                                           |\n| ------------ | ----------------------------------------- |\n| **Includes** | The Meeting Assistant capability for reps |","table":"table-0"},"1241":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-49","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#what-it-is","content":"Oliv AI's Deal Driver agent is a manager intelligence agent. Managers stay informed at every level, from an individual rep to a single deal to the full team, from one agent. It doesn't write to the CRM. It surfaces signals for the manager to act on."},"1242":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-50","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#what-it-is","content":"Deal Driver is also a bundle. It includes the capabilities of Oliv AI's Meeting Assistant agent: pre-call prep, post-call follow-up and CRM sync for reps. If you're on Deal Driver, your reps already have Meeting Assistant."},"1243":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-51","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#what-it-is","content":"Deal Driver's reports sit together under one card in My Reports, each with its schedule. Pipeline Review is the Monday view of every deal, grouped by status, for leadership updates."},"1244":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-52","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#where-reports-live","content":"Open **Reports › My Reports**. The **Deal Driver** card lists its four reports, each with a schedule tag: **Pipeline Review**, **One-on-One Prep**, **Morning Brief** and **Sunset Summary**. The **Reports for** dropdowns above the list set the team and role, such as Sales and Manager."},"1245":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-53","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#where-reports-live","content":"Each open report has a **Rate this report** button and a date picker. The previous and next arrows step between editions of the same report. Olivia's daily brief also carries a Deal Driver section, such as a check-in draft for a quiet deal, with a **Review draft from Deal Driver** button."},"1246":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-54","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#daily-rhythm","content":"**Morning Brief.** Sent every weekday. An Overview covers the day's meetings, key highlights and customer engagement. **Important Meetings** come next, then a section of meetings for each rep."},"1247":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-55","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#daily-rhythm","content":"**Event-triggered alerts.** A signal during the day when a deal stalls, a stage drifts or a high-value opportunity goes quiet."},"1248":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-56","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#daily-rhythm","content":"**Sunset Summary.** Sent every weekday as an end-of-day recap of wins, risks and next-step gaps. Its Overview covers meetings, deal progress, notable updates and customer engagement."},"1249":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-57","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#daily-rhythm","content":"Each Morning Brief meeting card shows a type tag, such as **Expansion** or **New Business**, the time and a short note. An availability line compares the meeting with your own calendar. **Add me to this call** and **Leave a note** let you join or brief the rep, and **Review Deal** opens the deal."},"1250":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-58","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#daily-rhythm","content":"The Morning Brief opens with the day's meetings, flags the important ones and groups the rest by rep. It's where a manager decides which calls to join before the day starts."},"1251":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-59","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#daily-rhythm","content":"The Sunset Summary's meetings line also says whether the notetaker recorded the day's meetings. Its sections then walk through **Closed Won**, **Closed Lost**, **Closing Soon**, **Quick Wins**, **Deals at Risk**, **Existing Customers** and **Needs Follow up**."},"1252":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-60","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#daily-rhythm","content":"The Sunset Summary closes the day by status, from deals won and lost to deals that need follow-up. Its meetings line also confirms how many of the day's calls were recorded."},"1253":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-61","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#weekly-rhythm","content":"**One-on-One Prep.** A snapshot of each rep's pipeline to guide one-on-one coaching. Each rep has their own schedule tag, such as **Every Thursday** or **Every Friday**."},"1254":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-62","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#weekly-rhythm","content":"**Pipeline Review.** Every Monday, a full view of every deal in the pipeline for executive updates. It's ready before the first standup of the week."},"1255":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-63","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#weekly-rhythm","content":"A One-on-One Prep report opens with the rep's total pipeline value and deal count. A **Pipeline Summary** follows, covering **Pipeline Health**, **Deal Momentum** and **Areas for Improvement**. Each status section then carries its own value and deal count."},"1256":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-64","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#weekly-rhythm","content":"One-on-One Prep gives the manager one rep's whole pipeline, status by status, before the meeting. Each rep's report runs on its own day, so 1:1s can start at strategy."},"1257":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-65","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#weekly-rhythm","content":"Pipeline Review opens with an Overview of **Pipeline Overview**, **Key Opportunities**, **Customer Updates** and **Next Steps**. Its sections run from **Closed** through **Closing Soon**, **Deals at Risk**, **Quick Wins**, **Stalled Deals**, **On Track Deals** and **Existing Customer** to **Needs Follow Up**. Each deal card holds a **Deal Summary**, a **Next Step** and **Review Deal**."},"1258":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-66","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#what-its-for","content":"Oliv AI's Deal Driver agent is for managers who need to know what is happening in their team's pipeline without asking for it. It removes the lag between what happens in the field and what the manager hears."},"1259":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-67","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#how-it-helps","content":"**The day starts briefed.** Meetings, risks and deals that need attention first are surfaced before the day starts."},"1260":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-68","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#how-it-helps","content":"**Risk shows up early.** Alerts fire the moment deals stall or stages drift, not when a rep escalates."},"1261":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-69","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#how-it-helps","content":"**1:1s start at strategy.** Rep reviews arrive prepped, so the meeting skips twenty minutes of status updates."},"1262":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-70","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#how-it-helps","content":"**Reps get time back.** A follow-up is drafted in about five minutes for the rep to review and send."},"1263":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-71","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#without-it","content":"A deal can go quiet with no activity, no CRM flag and no alert. A week later, the rep says \"it's progressing\" at the standup. By day fourteen the deal is cold and the rep escalates, after two or more weeks of invisible risk."},"1264":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-72","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#why-buyers-care","content":"Deal Driver is bought by sales managers, VPs of Sales and regional heads. The sales manager is the main daily beneficiary, because the agent turns time spent on admin into time spent coaching."},"1265":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-73","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#approach","content":"Think of a regional sales leader with eight account executives and about forty open opportunities. Every Monday she walks the VP of Sales through the region's pipeline. On Friday she starts working out which of those forty deals are really moving."},"1266":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-74","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#approach","content":"The usual method is a CRM export, a message to each rep asking for an update, and a skim of recent call notes. It can easily take an evening. Even then, the picture is only as current as the last field each rep remembered to fill in."},"1267":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-75","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#approach","content":"The raw signals already exist as the team works. Meetings get held, next steps get set, close dates slip and fields stay blank. What's missing is something that reads those signals every day and rolls them up on a schedule."},"1268":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-76","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#approach","content":"Oliv AI handles this with its Deal Driver agent. It monitors all activity on the team's deals and alerts the leader when a deal enters a risk state. Each alert carries the signal, the context and a suggested action. Before the first Monday standup, the Pipeline Review is already prepared."},"1269":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-77","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#approach","content":"Managers choose what counts as risk. Inactivity windows, field completion requirements and deal value thresholds can all be set per manager or per team, as listed in the set-up steps. How that rhythm lines up against other pipeline tools is covered in How the Deal Driver agent compares, below."},"1270":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-78","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#set-up","content":"**Connect your CRM.** Deal Driver reads Deal Insights data: stage, amount, close date and next steps."},"1271":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-79","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#set-up","content":"**Connect your team's calendar.** Meeting and activity data from Oliv feed the Morning Brief and the alerts."},"1272":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-80","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#set-up","content":"**Confirm the team roster and manager hierarchy.** Deal Driver needs both to know whose deals roll up to whom."},"1273":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-81","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#set-up","content":"**Set your alert thresholds.** Choose inactivity windows, field completion requirements and deal value thresholds, per manager or per team."},"1274":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-82","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#set-up","content":"**Adjust the brief format if you want to.** Managers can customize alert sensitivity and brief format."},"1275":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-83","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#set-up","content":"Most managers are live within a week. Reps don't need to change anything. Deal Driver works in the background and shows up for them as follow-up prompts and next-step reminders."},"1276":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-84","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#deal-risk","content":"Deal Driver monitors all activity and triggers an alert when:"},"1277":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-85","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#deal-risk","content":"A deal enters a risk state, such as no activity for a set number of days or a close date approaching without progress."},"1278":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-86","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#deal-risk","content":"A rep hasn't updated the Core 4 Fields after a meeting."},"1279":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-87","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#deal-risk","content":"A deal stage changes unexpectedly, moving backward or stalling mid-stage."},"1280":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-88","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#deal-risk","content":"A high-value opportunity goes quiet."},"1281":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-89","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#deal-risk","content":"A rep shows a pattern that warrants attention, such as consistently missing next-step fields."},"1282":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-90","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#deal-risk","content":"Each alert includes the deal, the signal, the relevant context and a suggested action for the manager."},"1283":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-91","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#rep-nudges","content":"Deal Driver also nudges reps directly when deals stall, next steps go overdue or activity drops. That catches the gap before a manager needs to step in."},"1284":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-92","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#meeting-support","content":"The Deal Driver bundle includes meeting-level support for individual reps."},"1285":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-93","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#meeting-support","content":"**Before the meeting.** About 30 minutes before every meeting on an active opportunity, the rep gets a deal summary, qualification status against the methodology, stakeholder context and a recommended agenda. Qualification follows the framework marked **Active** in **Settings › Qualification Framework**, which lists MEDDPICC, MEDDIC, SPICED, BANT and DRIVE."},"1286":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-94","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#meeting-support","content":"**After the meeting.** Once the recording is processed, the follow-up email is drafted, CRM field updates are proposed and qualification gaps are flagged, all within five minutes of the call ending."},"1287":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-95","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#with-coach","content":"Oliv AI's Coach agent is the rep development layer. On a rep's 1:1 day, the One-on-One Prep lands first with pipeline status, and Coach follows minutes later with that rep's coaching goal. In My Reports, Coach's **Monthly Review** sits beside it, one for each rep every 30 days."},"1288":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-96","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#with-forecaster","content":"Oliv AI's Forecaster agent builds on Deal Driver's signals. Deal Driver flags the exceptions, such as close dates without activity, and Forecaster rolls those signals into the number."},"1289":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-97","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#with-crm-manager","content":"Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent refreshes deal fields overnight from calls, emails and meetings. It also supplies the Core 4 Fields completion data that triggers gap alerts."},"1290":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-98","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#with-portfolio-manager","content":"Oliv AI's Portfolio Manager agent is the customer success equivalent. It applies the same manager-visibility model to the renewal and retention book."},"1291":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-99","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#with-olivia","content":"Oliv AI's Olivia agent is the front-facing master agent for reps. Deal Driver is the manager's tool, though the Meeting Assistant capability inside the bundle serves reps directly."},"1292":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-100","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#sales-managers","content":"A sales manager reads the Morning Brief before the standup and each rep's One-on-One Prep before their 1:1. Many shorten the daily standup, and some drop it. More on Oliv AI for sales managers and a day in a sales manager's workflow."},"1293":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-101","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#bdr-leads","content":"BDR leads use Deal Driver the same way as sales managers. The Morning Brief, rep activity alerts and One-on-One Prep reports work across BDR and AE pipelines, with different cadence and field settings. See how Oliv AI supports sales development teams."},"1294":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-102","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#sales-leadership","content":"Leaders get the Pipeline Review every Monday, ready before the first standup of the week. Read how a VP of Sales can stop deals slipping unseen."},"1295":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-103","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#revops","content":"RevOps sets the alert thresholds and keeps the CRM data behind them accurate. More on how Oliv AI works for revenue operations."},"1296":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-104","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#compare","content":"Most pipeline tools give managers somewhere to look. Deal Driver tells them when to look, sends a 1:1 report for every rep each week, and wraps each weekday in a Sunset Summary. Oliv AI is the only platform in this table that does all three."},"1297":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-105","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#compare","content":"Pipeline management features, from each platform's public documentation:"},"1298":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-106","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#compare","content":"| Platform    | Deal risk alerts | Per-rep 1:1 report each week | End-of-day summary for the manager |\n| ----------- | ---------------- | ---------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| **Oliv AI** | Yes              | Yes                          | Yes                                |","table":"table-1"},"1299":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-107","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#compare","content":"| Platform | Deal risk alerts               | Per-rep 1:1 report each week             | End-of-day summary for the manager |\n| -------- | ------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| **Gong** | Yes (AI Deal Monitor warnings) | Partly (deal board to check before 1:1s) | Not in docs                        |","table":"table-1"},"1300":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-108","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#compare","content":"| Platform  | Deal risk alerts               | Per-rep 1:1 report each week | End-of-day summary for the manager |\n| --------- | ------------------------------ | ---------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| **Avoma** | Yes (AI-powered health alerts) | Not in docs                  | Not in docs                        |","table":"table-1"},"1301":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-109","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#compare","content":"| Platform      | Deal risk alerts              | Per-rep 1:1 report each week | End-of-day summary for the manager |\n| ------------- | ----------------------------- | ---------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| **Fireflies** | Yes (Deal Intelligence risks) | Not in docs                  | Not in docs                        |","table":"table-1"},"1302":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-110","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#compare","content":"| Platform     | Deal risk alerts           | Per-rep 1:1 report each week              | End-of-day summary for the manager |\n| ------------ | -------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| **Outreach** | Partly (Deal Health score) | Partly (pipeline summary for 1:1 reviews) | Not in docs                        |","table":"table-1"},"1303":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-111","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#compare","content":"| Platform   | Deal risk alerts               | Per-rep 1:1 report each week | End-of-day summary for the manager |\n| ---------- | ------------------------------ | ---------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| **Fathom** | Partly (answers on deal risks) | Not in docs                  | Not in docs                        |","table":"table-1"},"1304":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-112","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#compare","content":"*Yes: documented and built in. Partly: documented with a limit, shown in brackets. Not in docs: not found in the vendor's public documentation.*"},"1305":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-113","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#compare-stronger","content":"**The 1:1 report comes to you.** Deal Driver compiles each rep's pipeline on that rep's own schedule and files it in the manager's My Reports. Gong recommends checking a deal board weekly, particularly before 1:1s and pipeline reviews. Compare Oliv AI vs Gong."},"1306":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-114","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#compare-stronger","content":"**An alert with a next move.** Each Deal Driver alert carries the deal, the signal, the context and a suggested action. Avoma's Deal Health produces a 0 to 100 risk score with a Low, Medium or High classification. Compare Oliv AI vs Avoma."},"1307":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-115","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#compare-stronger","content":"**A daily rhythm, not a weekly check.** Deal Driver sends a Morning Brief and a Sunset Summary every weekday. Gong's pipeline generation dashboard recipe says it should be viewed weekly. See Oliv AI as a Gong alternative."},"1308":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-116","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#compare-stronger","content":"*Competitor details checked against each vendor's public documentation on 21 October 2026. Features and plans change, so confirm with the vendor before you decide.*"},"1309":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-117","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#limits","content":"**It doesn't update CRM fields.** Deal Driver surfaces data quality gaps. CRM Manager makes the updates."},"1310":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-118","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#limits","content":"**It isn't the forecast.** Forecaster handles pipeline projection and accuracy. Deal Driver handles real-time visibility and alerts."},"1311":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-119","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#limits","content":"**It isn't a coaching tool.** Coach handles rep development."},"1312":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-120","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#limits","content":"**It's built for sales teams.** Customer success managers use Portfolio Manager instead."},"1313":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-121","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#limits","content":"**Signals depend on the data.** Deal Driver's signals are only as good as the data behind them, which is why CRM Manager matters."},"1314":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-122","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#faq-standup","content":"For many managers, yes. When reps get their own activity alerts and you have a Morning Brief, the standup becomes a strategy conversation. Some managers drop it."},"1315":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-123","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#faq-alert-triggers","content":"Yes. Inactivity windows, field completion requirements and deal value thresholds are all configurable per manager or per team."},"1316":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-124","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#faq-bdr-teams","content":"Yes. Sales managers and BDR leads use it the same way. Cadence and field settings differ, but the structure is the same."},"1317":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-125","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#faq-thursday-report","content":"Each rep gets their own report on their own schedule, such as Every Thursday or Every Friday. It shows the rep's pipeline total, a Pipeline Summary and every deal by status."},"1318":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-126","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#faq-existing-tools","content":"Visibility tools show you the pipeline. Deal Driver tells you when to look, what to pay attention to and what to do. Many teams run both."},"1319":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-127","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#faq-meeting-assistant","content":"No. Meeting Assistant is included in Deal Driver, so your reps already have it."},"1320":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-128","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#faq-crm-writes","content":"No. It sends alerts, briefs and summaries to Slack, email or **Reports › My Reports** in Oliv AI. CRM Manager handles field updates."},"1321":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-129","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#faq-cs-managers","content":"It's designed for sales managers and BDR leads. Customer success managers have an equivalent agent, Portfolio Manager."},"1322":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-130","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#faq-setup-time","content":"Connect your CRM and your team's calendar, then set your alert thresholds. Most managers are live within a week."},"1323":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-131","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#faq-reps","content":"No. Deal Driver works in the background and shows up for reps as follow-up prompts and next-step reminders."},"1324":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-132","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#related","content":"Deal Driver on oliv.ai: the agent's own page, with its weekly cadence."},"1325":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-133","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#related","content":"The Olivia agent docs: the front-facing agent reps work with."},"1326":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-134","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":