---------------------------------------------- |\n| **Cadence** | Weekly, monthly or quarterly, with separate rep and manager submission days, and several cadences in parallel |","table":"table-0"},"1385":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-52","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#at-a-glance","content":"|                         |                                                         |\n| ----------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Forecast categories** | Commit, Most Likely, Best Case, Pipeline and Closed Won |","table":"table-0"},"1386":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-53","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#at-a-glance","content":"|                    |                                                                                 |\n| ------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Where you work** | The **Submissions** tab, the **Boards** tab and each person's submission drawer |","table":"table-0"},"1387":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-54","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#at-a-glance","content":"|               |                                                              |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Snapshots** | Weekly snapshots and end-of-quarter snapshots you can reopen |","table":"table-0"},"1388":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-55","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#at-a-glance","content":"|                 |                                                                    |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Learns from** | Closed deals, pushed deals and your team's feedback on its signals |","table":"table-0"},"1389":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-56","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#at-a-glance","content":"|                 |                                       |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| **You connect** | Your CRM: Salesforce, HubSpot or Zoho |","table":"table-0"},"1390":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-57","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#what-it-is","content":"Oliv AI's Forecaster agent is a forecasting agent for revenue teams. It analyzes every deal in the pipeline against historical performance, company patterns and deal progression signals. It doesn't move deals or change stages itself. It recommends and nudges, and people make the call."},"1391":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-58","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#what-it-is","content":"The board is where Forecaster's work rolls up: each manager and rep, their attainment and coverage, and the commit and most likely numbers against the roll-up."},"1392":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-59","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#three-views","content":"**Submissions.** Each person's number per measurement and period, with **Deals Sum**, **Last Week** and **Roll-Up** beside it. **My Team** shows how many rows each person has submitted, and the header shows the **Due Date**."},"1393":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-60","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#three-views","content":"**Boards.** The rolled-up forecast by **Rep/Team**: **Target Attainment**, **Pipeline Coverage**, **Commit Forecast**, **Most Likely Forecast** and **Best Case**. Pick the board, the granularity (**Quarterly**, **Monthly** or **Weekly**), the fiscal year, the period and the snapshot."},"1394":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-61","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#three-views","content":"**The submission drawer.** One person's commit, built as **Commit** plus **Adjustment**, with comments and what moved since the last snapshot. Its deal tabs are **Committed Deals**, **Closed Won Deals**, **Most Likely Deals**, **Best Case Deals** and **Pipeline Deals**."},"1395":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-62","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#three-views","content":"A company can keep several boards, such as **Sales Forecast**, **Renewals Forecast** and a regional new business board."},"1396":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-63","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#signals","content":"| Signal            | What it tells you                                                                                 |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Deal movement** | A deal can move between categories, such as from Best Case to Commit, based on recent progression |","table":"table-1"},"1397":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-64","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#signals","content":"| Signal               | What it tells you                                                                                |\n| -------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Value adjustment** | The likely value differs from the entered amount, based on historical close rates and trajectory |","table":"table-1"},"1398":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-65","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#signals","content":"| Signal   | What it tells you                                                      |\n| -------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Risk** | A deal has stalled and may not close in the period, flagged for review |","table":"table-1"},"1399":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-66","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#signals","content":"| Signal              | What it tells you                                             |\n| ------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Pipeline health** | Coverage for a period is below target, with a recommended fix |","table":"table-1"},"1400":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-67","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#signals","content":"Suggested category moves appear in the drawer's deal tabs, grouped by direction, such as **Move down to Most Likely**. Each group shows a deal count and a total, and each deal carries a red flag with its risk reason. One click on the target button moves the deal, and **X** dismisses the suggestion. That feedback trains the agent."},"1401":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-68","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#signals","content":"Forecaster's category suggestions are decisions, not changes: every risky commit shows its reason, and the manager moves it in one click or dismisses it."},"1402":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-69","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#what-its-for","content":"Oliv AI's Forecaster agent is for teams that want a number they can stand behind on Monday. It takes over the building of the forecast, so people spend their time judging it."},"1403":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-70","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#how-it-helps","content":"**Reps stop typing updates.** They open a forecast that is already filled in, check it and submit."},"1404":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-71","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#how-it-helps","content":"**Managers review changes, not everything.** Risky commits, sandbagged upside and dead deals are flagged before the call."},"1405":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-72","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#how-it-helps","content":"**Leaders see decisions.** The rollup shows what slipped, what moved and why."},"1406":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-73","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#how-it-helps","content":"**Accuracy compounds.** Every closed deal makes the next forecast better."},"1407":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-74","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#without-it","content":"Without it, the forecast is only as good as each rep's mood that week. Leadership sees a number with no trail behind it: no signals, no reason for the change since last week. A slipping deal shows up when the quarter is already lost, not while there is still time to act."},"1408":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-75","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#why-buyers-care","content":"VPs of Sales, CROs and RevOps leads buy it. The VP of Sales champions it because the weekly rollup burden goes away. RevOps backs it because clean data feeds the model. It pays off most for teams with five or more reps and at least one manager layer."},"1409":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-76","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#approach","content":"It's the last week of the quarter, and a VP of Sales has her commit call with the CRO on Friday. Five managers report to her, each carrying a team number. The CRO wants one figure she can defend, plus the short list of deals it depends on."},"1410":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-77","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#approach","content":"The usual run-up is a round of rep updates, manager check-ins and a rollup sheet that comes together late on Thursday. Across a team, that routine can swallow a dozen hours in a week. Even then, the number tends to lean on how hopeful each rep felt."},"1411":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-78","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#approach","content":"Yet most of what the commit needs already sits in the pipeline and the calls. Close dates slip, stages stall and deals go quiet, and each of those leaves a trail. The hard part is reading that trail across every deal, every week, without waiting on people."},"1412":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-79","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#approach","content":"Oliv AI does that reading with its Forecaster agent. It drafts each rep's forecast before anyone logs in and checks it before the call starts. It flags risky commits, surfaces sandbagged upside and removes dead deals. Managers review only what changed, and the VP gets one rolled-up view with the risk already called out."},"1413":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-80","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#approach","content":"Each board keeps weekly snapshots and an end-of-quarter snapshot, so any commit can be reopened as it stood and checked against what actually closed. How that learning loop lines up against other forecasting tools is covered in How the Forecaster agent compares, below."},"1414":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-81","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#set-up","content":"**Connect your CRM.** Salesforce, HubSpot or Zoho. Forecaster reads stage, amount, close date and owner for every deal. See the supported integrations."},"1415":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-82","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#set-up","content":"**Load your roster.** Add reps and managers with the team hierarchy, so forecasts roll up to the right person at every level."},"1416":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-83","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#set-up","content":"**Set targets.** In **Settings › Targets**, **Create Target** adds a target with its type, such as Revenue, and its users. **Active Targets** and **Completed Targets** show each target's overall progress."},"1417":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-84","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#set-up","content":"**Check your measurements.** **Settings › Measurements** holds the numbers the forecast is built from, such as Commit, Most Likely, Best Case and Pipeline Coverage. Each is **Basic** (a sum or count) or **Formula**."},"1418":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-85","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#set-up","content":"**Organize your boards.** Under **Settings › Organisational Settings › Monitoring › Boards**, boards sit in collections such as Forecasting and Regional. Each board has a description, a target and its users."},"1419":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-86","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#set-up","content":"**Add a cadence.** **Organisational Settings › Agents › Forecaster** lists your cadences by **Name**, **Board** and **Interval**. **Add** opens the **New Cadence** wizard, described below."},"1420":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-87","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#set-up","content":"**Plan the weeks.** **Monitoring › Cadence** shows a grid of weeks against measurements, on a **Quarterly** or **Monthly** period, so you can tick which numbers are due in which week."},"1421":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-88","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#set-up","content":"Each cadence ties a board to a rhythm, such as reps every Friday and managers every Monday, which is the schedule Forecaster collects and drafts against."},"1422":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-89","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#new-cadence","content":"The **New Cadence** wizard has three steps: **Overview**, **Boards & Measurements** and **People**. On **Overview**, give the cadence a **Title** and a **Description**, then choose its **Period**: **Weekly**, **Monthly** or **Quarterly**. With a monthly period, set the **Rep Submission Day** and the **Manager Submission Day** by week and day."},"1423":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-90","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#new-cadence","content":"Reps and managers get their own submission day, so the manager's review always lands after the reps have submitted."},"1424":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-91","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#new-cadence","content":"Most teams are live within two weeks. Reps need no training: they see a pre-drafted view where they'd normally submit by hand."},"1425":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-92","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#rep-workflow","content":"Open **Apps › Forecast › Submissions**. See your target for the period, then review the forecast computed from your pipeline in the **Submission** column, next to **Deals Sum** and **Last Week**. Check Forecaster's recommended signals, adjust anything you disagree with, and submit with a comment explaining any changes. It takes about 5 to 10 minutes."},"1426":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-93","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#manager-workflow","content":"In **Submissions**, **My Team** shows each person's progress, such as 9/9 when every row is in, with the due date at the top. Open a person's submission drawer to review their commit: **Commit** plus **Adjustment** equals **Commit Forecast**. Add your own adjustment and a comment, then work through the suggested moves in the deal tabs. For a team of 5 to 10, that's about 15 to 30 minutes in total."},"1427":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-94","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#manager-workflow","content":"Submissions shows a manager who has submitted and who hasn't, and puts each pre-drafted number next to the deals behind it and last week's figure."},"1428":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-95","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#manager-workflow","content":"The drawer's comments include Forecaster's own note on how it built the number, so you can see what it changed before you add yours. **Deals in this Snapshot** then reconciles the start and end commit: **Total Decrease** (deals that left the category or pushed out) and **Total Increase** (new deals and deals moved in)."},"1429":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-96","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#manager-workflow","content":"The commit is never a bare number: Forecaster explains how it rolled up the reps and where it cut risk, and the snapshot cards show what moved."},"1430":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-97","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#manager-workflow","content":"On the **Boards** tab, expand a manager's row to see each rep, or click the manager's name to drill into that team. Teams that run evidence-based forecast commits every Monday start from this rolled-up view. The full meeting routine is in Run a pipeline review."},"1431":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-98","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#cadences","content":"Monthly, quarterly and pipeline forecasts can run in parallel, each with its own targets and rollup views. One **Submissions** table can hold a quarter, the next quarter, two months and the current week at once. If you forecast quarterly but want monthly visibility, Forecaster can show a monthly equivalent of the quarterly number. Weekly manager calls, monthly reviews and quarterly board forecasts all run from the same signals, targets, rollups and snapshots in Oliv Forecast."},"1432":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-99","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#snapshots-and-learning","content":"Every submission creates a timestamped record. Each board keeps the **Current** snapshot, weekly snapshots with the week they cover, and end-of-quarter snapshots such as **End of Q3**. Pick one from **Snapshot** to see the board as it stood that day."},"1433":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-100","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#snapshots-and-learning","content":"In the drawer, a **Timeline** lists each weekly submission, marked as scheduled, submitted by Oliv or submitted by the manager. **View as of** reopens a past week, and a **Commit Forecast** chart plots the submission against the actual."},"1434":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-101","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#snapshots-and-learning","content":"When deals close or push, Forecaster compares the forecast value to the actual outcome. That reconciliation trains the agent. Over time it learns company-specific patterns, such as a deal type that always needs an RFP or a rep who runs two weeks optimistic on timelines. Feedback on its signals trains it too. More on improving forecast accuracy with AI."},"1435":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-102","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#operating-modes","content":"Forecaster's operating modes (Beta) let it take over more of the process as it learns your patterns."},"1436":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-103","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#operating-modes","content":"**AI-Assisted (Beta).** Forecaster recommends and your team decides. Managers see where the agent and the rep disagree."},"1437":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-104","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#operating-modes","content":"**AI-Managed (Beta).** Forecaster generates the full forecast, and your team reviews and adjusts. Reps are largely hands-free."},"1438":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-105","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#operating-modes","content":"**AI-Owned (Beta).** Forecaster produces the forecast, and managers review only flagged areas of uncertainty. No rep involvement is needed."},"1439":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-106","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#operating-modes","content":"Teams typically move through all three operating modes (Beta) within 6 to 18 months. Managers stay in the loop in every mode."},"1440":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-107","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#where-results-go","content":"Every Monday, Forecaster's **Weekly Forecast** report lands in **Reports › My Reports**. Its **Current Standing** compares your team's forecast with the AI forecast and shows the gap. Then come **Deals likely to slip**, **Deals to pull in** and **Deals closed last week**, each deal with a **Review Deal** button. **Present** shows the report in the meeting."},"1441":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-108","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#where-results-go","content":"The Weekly Forecast puts the team's call and Forecaster's own number side by side, then lists the deals behind the gap, ready for the Monday review."},"1442":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-109","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#where-results-go","content":"Forecaster also posts to the Agent Feed on **Home**, for example when deals shifted forecast categories overnight. Forecast submissions, snapshots, signals and adjustments are kept in Oliv AI. If configured, Forecaster syncs the forecast category and adjusted values back to your CRM. Managers get a weekly team forecast summary with flagged deals in Slack or email."},"1443":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-110","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#where-results-go","content":"A manager doesn't have to open the board to learn that the forecast moved: Forecaster reports overnight category shifts in the Agent Feed."},"1444":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-111","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#with-crm-manager","content":"Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent is the data foundation. It pulls from call transcripts and meeting notes to keep stage, close date and amount current, so Forecaster builds from today's deal state. Read why clean CRM data drives predictability."},"1445":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-112","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#with-deal-driver","content":"Forecaster surfaces deals that don't add up, such as closing-date conflicts. Oliv AI's Deal Driver agent fills in the context: last touchpoint, open next steps and days since last activity. A manager can review the flagged items in minutes instead of reading the whole pipeline."},"1446":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-113","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#with-oliver","content":"When leadership needs a cross-deal breakdown, such as why one segment is lagging, Oliv AI's Oliver agent runs it. Oliver uses the structured data layer that Forecaster and CRM Manager maintain."},"1447":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-114","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#with-olivia","content":"Oliv AI's Olivia agent is the front-facing master agent for reps. Forecaster stays in the background, drafting the forecast each rep reviews. The **Ask** button on the Forecast header opens Olivia beside the board, so you can ask a question without leaving it."},"1448":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-115","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#sales-leaders","content":"VPs of Sales and CROs get one forecast view, split by motion, with risk already called out. Leadership sees what moved, what slipped and where the gap is before the commit call. More in Oliv AI for sales leaders and a CRO's guide to forecast accuracy."},"1449":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-116","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#sales-managers","content":"Managers review submissions, add their own adjustments and sign off. They spend time on the deals Forecaster flagged, not the whole board. Pair it with the manager visibility in the Deal Driver agent docs. See Oliv AI for sales managers."},"1450":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-117","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#revops","content":"RevOps configures cadences, targets and metrics during onboarding and watches forecast against actual to spot systematic bias. Learn how Oliv AI works for revenue operations teams."},"1451":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-118","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#account-executives","content":"Reps open a pre-filled forecast, adjust a deal or two and submit in minutes. The rest of their week is in Run deals as an account executive."},"1452":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-119","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#compare","content":"Most forecasting tools give reps a board to fill in. Forecaster drafts the rep's forecast, suggests category moves with a reason on each deal, and learns from every closed deal, across monthly and quarterly forecasts at once. Oliv AI is the only platform in this table that does all four."},"1453":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-120","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#compare","content":"Forecasting features, from each platform's public documentation:"},"1454":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-121","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#compare","content":"| Platform    | Rep's forecast pre-drafted | Suggested category moves, with reasons | Learns from your closed deals | Monthly and quarterly in parallel |\n| ----------- | -------------------------- | -------------------------------------- | ----------------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| **Oliv AI** | Yes                        | Yes                                    | Yes                           | Yes                               |","table":"table-2"},"1455":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-122","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#compare","content":"| Platform | Rep's forecast pre-drafted | Suggested category moves, with reasons   | Learns from your closed deals             | Monthly and quarterly in parallel |\n| -------- | -------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| **Gong** | Rep submits each number    | Partly (suggested updates in one column) | Yes (trained on historical deal outcomes) | Yes (monthly, quarterly or both)  |","table":"table-2"},"1456":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-123","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#compare","content":"| Platform     | Rep's forecast pre-drafted         | Suggested category moves, with reasons | Learns from your closed deals | Monthly and quarterly in parallel |\n| ------------ | ---------------------------------- | -------------------------------------- | ----------------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| **Outreach** | Manager edits and submits the call | Partly (risk signals in rollup, Beta)  | Not in docs                   | Yes (parallel forecasts)          |","table":"table-2"},"1457":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-124","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#compare","content":"| Platform  | Rep's forecast pre-drafted  | Suggested category moves, with reasons | Learns from your closed deals | Monthly and quarterly in parallel     |\n| --------- | --------------------------- | -------------------------------------- | ----------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| **Avoma** | Reps enter their submission | Partly (forecast risk alerts in Slack) | Not in docs                   | Partly (one period for the whole org) |","table":"table-2"},"1458":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-125","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#compare","content":"| Platform      | Rep's forecast pre-drafted | Suggested category moves, with reasons | Learns from your closed deals | Monthly and quarterly in parallel |\n| ------------- | -------------------------- | -------------------------------------- | ----------------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| **Fireflies** | Not in docs                | Partly (deal risks flagged early)      | Not in docs                   | Not in docs                       |","table":"table-2"},"1459":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-126","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#compare","content":"*Yes: documented and built in. Partly: documented with a limit, shown in brackets. Not in docs: not found in the vendor's public documentation.*"},"1460":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-127","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#compare-stronger","content":"**The forecast is built before anyone logs in.** Forecaster pre-drafts each rep's forecast, so reps review and submit in minutes. In Gong, a panel opens where you submit your number for the selected category. Compare Oliv AI vs Gong."},"1461":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-128","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#compare-stronger","content":"**Every suggested move is a decision you control.** Each suggested category move names the risk behind it, and the manager accepts it in one click or dismisses it. Avoma sends forecast risk alerts to Slack with its Revenue Intelligence add-on. Compare Oliv AI vs Avoma."},"1462":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-129","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#compare-stronger","content":"**Learning comes from your own outcomes.** Forecaster compares each forecast with what closed and learns your company's patterns. Outreach's Scenario Planner simulates forecast projections from inputs you review and adjust. Read how Gong and Outreach compare."},"1463":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-130","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#compare-stronger","content":"*Competitor details checked against each vendor's public documentation on 21 October 2026. Features and plans change, so confirm with the vendor before you decide.*"},"1464":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-131","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#limits","content":"**It recommends, it doesn't move deals on its own.** Forecaster doesn't change deal stages or categories itself. It suggests a move, and a person accepts it."},"1465":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-132","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#limits","content":"**It isn't deal scoring.** Oliv AI's Deal Insights layer evaluates deal health, and Forecaster consumes those insights."},"1466":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-133","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#limits","content":"**It isn't a real-time alert tool.** Deal Driver handles alerts on deals as they happen."},"1467":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-134","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#limits","content":"**It isn't a coaching tool.** Coach handles rep development."},"1468":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-135","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#limits","content":"**It's only as good as the data.** CRM Manager should be active so deal fields are current before Forecaster analyzes them."},"1469":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-136","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#limits","content":"**Operating modes are Beta.** AI-Assisted, AI-Managed and AI-Owned are all labeled Beta."},"1470":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-137","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#faq-time-to-autonomy","content":"It depends on your sales cycle. For 3 to 6 month cycles it's usually 6 to 9 months, and for 12 month enterprise cycles, 12 to 18 months. Time savings show up from week one."},"1471":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-138","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#faq-bad-recommendation","content":"You dismiss it with **X**. Forecaster learns from that, and every decision you make helps it recognize your company's patterns."},"1472":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-139","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#faq-disagree","content":"They override it, with their own value or adjustment. The system learns from that feedback and adjusts future recommendations."},"1473":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-140","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#faq-cadences","content":"Yes. Forecaster supports several cadences in parallel, each with separate targets and rollup views. Boards switch between quarterly, monthly and weekly views."},"1474":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-141","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#faq-rollups","content":"Yes. On a board, reps sit under their manager and managers sit under their leader, each row with its own roll-up. Expand a row to see the level below."},"1475":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-142","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#faq-snapshots","content":"Yes. Pick a past weekly or end-of-quarter snapshot from **Snapshot**, and the board shows the numbers as they stood that day."},"1476":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-143","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#faq-crm-field","content":"No. Forecaster can sync values back to the CRM if you configure it, but it's primarily Oliv-based. The CRM stays current without anyone updating it by hand."},"1477":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-144","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#faq-crm-forecasting","content":"CRM forecasting relies on reps keeping fields updated by hand. Forecaster removes that dependency by analyzing the pipeline itself and getting smarter every week."},"1478":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-145","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#faq-existing-tools","content":"Visibility tools show you the pipeline. Forecaster removes the manual work of building the forecast, which is a different problem. Many teams run it alongside their existing tools."},"1479":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-146","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#faq-setup","content":"Connect your CRM, set targets and define your cadence. Most teams are live within two weeks, with no rep training."},"1480":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-147","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#faq-messy-crm","content":"Forecaster works with CRM Manager to keep the pipeline current. If data is incomplete, CRM Manager improves it as it goes, so you don't need a clean CRM to start."},"1481":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-148","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#faq-team-size","content":"It delivers the most for teams with five or more reps and at least one manager layer. Smaller teams get the time savings straight away."},"1482":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-149","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#faq-notifications","content":"Yes. The Weekly Forecast report arrives in My Reports every Monday. Managers also get a weekly summary of the team forecast with flagged deals, in Slack or email."},"1483":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-150","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#related","content":"Forecaster on oliv.ai: the agent's own page, with its operating modes."},"1484":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-151","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#related","content":"The Oliv Forecast app: forecast boards, deal inspection and scenario modelling."},"1485":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-152","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#related","content":"The Monday rollup, retired: how agentic forecasting replaces the weekly scramble."},"1486":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-153","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#related","content":"AI sales forecasting software compared: what to weigh across tools."},"1487":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-154","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#related","content":"Agentic forecasting webinar: moving to agent-led forecasting."},"1488":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-155","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#related","content":"Agent tools and run modes: how approval settings work for agent actions."},"1489":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-156","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#related","content":"Oliv AI pricing: plans and what each includes."},"1490":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster-157","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/forecaster#related","content":"Oliv AI product documentation: every documented agent and feature."},"1491":{"id":"/product-docs/agents","page_id":"/product-docs/agents","type":"page","content":"Agents overview","breadcrumbs":["Oliv AI docs","Agents"],"tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents"},"1492":{"id":"/product-docs/agents-0","page_id":"/product-docs/agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents","content":"How Oliv AI's agents fit together, from Olivia and Oliver, the two agents you talk to, to the specialist agents they hand work to and the parts every agent is built from."},"1493":{"id":"/product-docs/agents-1","page_id":"/product-docs/agents","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents#how-agents-fit","content":"How the agents fit together"},"1494":{"id":"/product-docs/agents-2","page_id":"/product-docs/agents","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents#olivia-and-oliver","content":"The two agents you talk to"},"1495":{"id":"/product-docs/agents-3","page_id":"/product-docs/agents","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents#olivia","content":"Olivia runs the work"},"1496":{"id":"/product-docs/agents-4","page_id":"/product-docs/agents","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents#oliver","content":"Oliver keeps the rules"},"1497":{"id":"/product-docs/agents-5","page_id":"/product-docs/agents","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents#specialist-agents","content":"The specialist agents"},"1498":{"id":"/product-docs/agents-6","page_id":"/product-docs/agents","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents#marketplace","content":"Browse agents in the app"},"1499":{"id":"/product-docs/agents-7","page_id":"/product-docs/agents","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents#where-context-comes-from","content":"Where agents get their context"},"1500":{"id":"/product-docs/agents-8","page_id":"/product-docs/agents","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents#inside-an-agent","content":"Inside every agent"},"1501":{"id":"/product-docs/agents-9","page_id":"/product-docs/agents","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents#next-steps","content":"Where to start"},"1502":{"id":"/product-docs/agents-10","page_id":"/product-docs/agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents","content":"Agents are the product at Oliv AI. You talk to two of them, Oliv AI's Olivia agent and Oliv AI's Oliver agent. They pass focused work to specialist agents for deals, the CRM, meetings, forecasts and coaching. Every agent works as a layer on top of the CRM you already use, and keeps it updated."},"1503":{"id":"/product-docs/agents-11","page_id":"/product-docs/agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents#how-agents-fit","content":"Oliv AI's agents work in three layers. At the front, Oliv AI's Olivia agent runs the work and Oliv AI's Oliver agent sets the rules. Oliver configures how the agents work, and Olivia coordinates their tasks across your team."},"1504":{"id":"/product-docs/agents-12","page_id":"/product-docs/agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents#how-agents-fit","content":"| Layer                      | Agents            | What the layer does                                        |\n| -------------------------- | ----------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **The agents you talk to** | Olivia and Oliver | Answer questions, hand off work and keep the process rules |","table":"table-0"},"1505":{"id":"/product-docs/agents-13","page_id":"/product-docs/agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents#how-agents-fit","content":"| Layer                 | Agents                                                         | What the layer does                |\n| --------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| **Specialist agents** | Deal Driver, CRM Manager, Meeting Assistant, Forecaster, Coach | Each owns one job and reports back |","table":"table-0"},"1506":{"id":"/product-docs/agents-14","page_id":"/product-docs/agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents#how-agents-fit","content":"| Layer           | Agents                                                | What the layer does                                           |\n| --------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Agent parts** | Instructions, tools, triggers, knowledge, run history | What every agent is built from, and the record of what it did |","table":"table-0"},"1507":{"id":"/product-docs/agents-15","page_id":"/product-docs/agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents#how-agents-fit","content":"All of them read from one shared record. Oliv AI wires your CRM, calls, email, tickets and product usage into one context graph. Every agent and every rep works from that same graph."},"1508":{"id":"/product-docs/agents-16","page_id":"/product-docs/agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents#olivia-and-oliver","content":"Which one you work with depends on whether you run deals or run the process. Both sit in the agent picker on the **Ask** tab of **Home**."},"1509":{"id":"/product-docs/agents-17","page_id":"/product-docs/agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents#olivia-and-oliver","content":"The two agents you talk to share one picker. Choose Oliv AI's Olivia agent for deals and meetings, or Oliv AI's Oliver agent for the process rules."},"1510":{"id":"/product-docs/agents-18","page_id":"/product-docs/agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents#olivia","content":"Oliv AI's Olivia agent is the one reps, SDRs, CSMs and account managers talk to. You ask in plain language about a deal, a meeting or your pipeline. She answers, or hands the task to a specialist agent and reports back. Each conversation is set to **Ask before acting**, the default, or **Act without asking**. Her role across the revenue team is set out on oliv.ai."},"1511":{"id":"/product-docs/agents-19","page_id":"/product-docs/agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents#oliver","content":"Oliv AI's Oliver agent is for RevOps managers and revenue leaders. It keeps the process handbook, from your ICP and personas to your methodology and approval rules, and every other agent works inside it. You describe a change in plain language. Oliver proposes the update as **Pending Review**, waits for a person to approve it, then passes it to every agent that depends on it. Its approach to your sales process is on oliv.ai, and its chat also sits beside the **Agents** marketplace."},"1512":{"id":"/product-docs/agents-20","page_id":"/product-docs/agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents#specialist-agents","content":"Each specialist agent owns one job. It does that job in the background and delivers the result where you already work, such as Slack, email or the Oliv AI app."},"1513":{"id":"/product-docs/agents-21","page_id":"/product-docs/agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents#specialist-agents","content":"Oliv AI's Deal Driver agent watches the team's pipeline for sales managers. It sends a morning brief, alerts during the day when a deal needs attention, and a summary at the end of the day. Each week it also prepares a 1:1 report for every rep."},"1514":{"id":"/product-docs/agents-22","page_id":"/product-docs/agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents#specialist-agents","content":"Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent writes what changed after each meeting, call and email to Salesforce, HubSpot or Zoho. Reps accept or reject each suggested field beside its current value, until RevOps switches the agent to **Auto-Pilot**. First, map your custom CRM fields so each update lands in the right place."},"1515":{"id":"/product-docs/agents-23","page_id":"/product-docs/agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents#specialist-agents","content":"Oliv AI's Meeting Assistant agent sends a one-screen brief 30 minutes before each deal meeting. After the call, it drafts the follow-up email, proposes CRM updates and flags qualification gaps."},"1516":{"id":"/product-docs/agents-24","page_id":"/product-docs/agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents#specialist-agents","content":"Oliv AI's Forecaster agent drafts each rep's forecast from the pipeline before anyone logs in. It flags the deals that don't add up and learns from how your deals actually close."},"1517":{"id":"/product-docs/agents-25","page_id":"/product-docs/agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents#specialist-agents","content":"Oliv AI's Coach agent scores every recorded call against your scorecards. Each month it recommends three behaviors per rep, the manager picks one goal, and Coach tracks it weekly."},"1518":{"id":"/product-docs/agents-26","page_id":"/product-docs/agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents#specialist-agents","content":"The Oliv AI agent marketplace groups agents by the roles they serve, from SDRs to RevOps."},"1519":{"id":"/product-docs/agents-27","page_id":"/product-docs/agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents#marketplace","content":"**Agents** in the sidebar opens the marketplace. Filter pills narrow it to **All**, **Our Agents**, **Sales**, **Revenue Operations** or **Customer Success**, and **Search...** matches an agent's name or description. Each card carries **View Agent** or **Clone Agent**, and some carry a **Custom** or **Pre-built** badge. Oliver's chat sits on the right."},"1520":{"id":"/product-docs/agents-28","page_id":"/product-docs/agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents#marketplace","content":"The marketplace is where you find a specialist agent by team. Oliv AI's Oliver agent stays beside it, so you can ask a process question while you browse."},"1521":{"id":"/product-docs/agents-29","page_id":"/product-docs/agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents#marketplace","content":"Search by the job you need done. A word that appears only in a card's description still finds that agent."},"1522":{"id":"/product-docs/agents-30","page_id":"/product-docs/agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents#where-context-comes-from","content":"An agent can only act on what it can read. Three sources feed it."},"1523":{"id":"/product-docs/agents-31","page_id":"/product-docs/agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents#where-context-comes-from","content":"**Conversations.** The Converse app captures online meetings, phone calls, email and Slack. Bot and botless recording decides how each meeting is recorded."},"1524":{"id":"/product-docs/agents-32","page_id":"/product-docs/agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents#where-context-comes-from","content":"**Your CRM.** Deals, contacts and fields come from Salesforce or HubSpot, and agents write updates back."},"1525":{"id":"/product-docs/agents-33","page_id":"/product-docs/agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents#where-context-comes-from","content":"**Your tools.** Meetings come in through the Zoom integration, and Slack is where many agents deliver their work."},"1526":{"id":"/product-docs/agents-34","page_id":"/product-docs/agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents#where-context-comes-from","content":"You don't need a clean CRM to start. Oliv AI's Olivia agent reads what's already there, messy data included."},"1527":{"id":"/product-docs/agents-35","page_id":"/product-docs/agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents#inside-an-agent","content":"Every agent with a detail page is built from the same five parts. On the page they sit on tabs: **Overview**, **Instructions**, **Tools**, **Triggers**, **Knowledge**, **Data** and **Runs**, with **Back to Marketplace** above. The agent builder overview explains how they fit together."},"1528":{"id":"/product-docs/agents-36","page_id":"/product-docs/agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents#inside-an-agent","content":"Agent instructions state the agent's objective, the steps it follows and what it produces."},"1529":{"id":"/product-docs/agents-37","page_id":"/product-docs/agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents#inside-an-agent","content":"Tools and run modes list the actions an agent may take, each set to **Auto Run**, **Requires Approval** or **Agent Decides**."},"1530":{"id":"/product-docs/agents-38","page_id":"/product-docs/agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents#inside-an-agent","content":"Triggers and schedules are the events and fixed times that start an agent without anyone pressing anything."},"1531":{"id":"/product-docs/agents-39","page_id":"/product-docs/agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents#inside-an-agent","content":"Knowledge files are the documents an agent works against, such as an ICP document or a solution deck."},"1532":{"id":"/product-docs/agents-40","page_id":"/product-docs/agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents#inside-an-agent","content":"Run history records every run, with each email the agent wrote and each change it made."},"1533":{"id":"/product-docs/agents-41","page_id":"/product-docs/agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents#inside-an-agent","content":"Every agent page uses the same tabs, so once you know one agent you can find the instructions, tools or run history of any other."},"1534":{"id":"/product-docs/agents-42","page_id":"/product-docs/agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents#next-steps","content":"Prepare for a meeting: get the deal brief before each call."},"1535":{"id":"/product-docs/agents-43","page_id":"/product-docs/agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents#next-steps","content":"Record a meeting and follow up: turn a finished call into a follow-up and CRM updates."},"1536":{"id":"/product-docs/agents-44","page_id":"/product-docs/agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents#next-steps","content":"Keep the CRM updated: move from reviewed updates to automatic ones."},"1537":{"id":"/product-docs/agents-45","page_id":"/product-docs/agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents#next-steps","content":"Run a pipeline review: walk into each 1:1 with a per-rep report."},"1538":{"id":"/product-docs/agents-46","page_id":"/product-docs/agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents#next-steps","content":"Run deals as an account executive: see how the agents share one AE's week."},"1539":{"id":"/product-docs/agents-47","page_id":"/product-docs/agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents#next-steps","content":"Plans and seat roles: match each person on your team to a seat role."},"1540":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","type":"page","content":"Meeting Assistant agent","breadcrumbs":["Oliv AI docs","Agents"],"tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant"},"1541":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-0","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","content":"What Oliv AI's Meeting Assistant agent sends before each deal meeting, what it drafts and flags after the call, how to set it up, and how it compares with other meeting tools."},"1542":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-1","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#at-a-glance","content":"At a glance"},"1543":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-2","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#what-it-is","content":"What the Meeting Assistant agent is"},"1544":{"id":"/pro