t agent compares"},"1570":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-29","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#compare-stronger","content":"Why Oliv AI is the stronger choice for the Meeting Assistant agent"},"1571":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-30","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#limits","content":"Limits and things to know"},"1572":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-31","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#common-questions","content":"Common questions"},"1573":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-32","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#faq-brief-length","content":"How long is the pre-meeting brief?"},"1574":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-33","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#faq-methodologies","content":"What sales methodologies does it support?"},"1575":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-34","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#faq-which-meetings","content":"Does it work for every meeting, or only some?"},"1576":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-35","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#faq-template","content":"Is the follow-up email a template?"},"1577":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-36","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#faq-timing","content":"How soon after the call is the follow-up ready?"},"1578":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-37","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#faq-crm-changes","content":"Does it change CRM fields on its own?"},"1579":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-38","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#faq-deal-driver","content":"I'm already on Deal Driver. Do I need this separately?"},"1580":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-39","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#faq-integrations","content":"What does it need connected?"},"1581":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-40","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#faq-messy-crm","content":"What if our CRM data is incomplete?"},"1582":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-41","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#faq-team-size","content":"Is there a minimum team size?"},"1583":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-42","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#faq-customer-success","content":"Can customer success teams use it?"},"1584":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-43","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#related","content":"Related"},"1585":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-44","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","content":"Oliv AI's Meeting Assistant agent prepares you for every meeting on an active deal and drives the follow-through after it. Thirty minutes before the call, it sends a one-screen brief with the deal status, qualification gaps and a recommended agenda. After the call, it drafts the follow-up email, proposes CRM field updates and flags new qualification gaps."},"1586":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-45","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                                                              |\n| ---------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **What it does** | Prepares you before each deal meeting and drafts the follow-through after it |","table":"table-0"},"1587":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-46","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                                                                               |\n| ---------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Who it's for** | Account executives, BDRs and account managers, plus sales managers and customer success leads |","table":"table-0"},"1588":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-47","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#at-a-glance","content":"|                        |                                                |\n| ---------------------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| **Before the meeting** | A one-screen brief, 30 minutes before the call |","table":"table-0"},"1589":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-48","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#at-a-glance","content":"|                       |                                                                           |\n| --------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **After the meeting** | A follow-up email draft, proposed CRM updates and qualification gap flags |","table":"table-0"},"1590":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-49","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#at-a-glance","content":"|             |                                                           |\n| ----------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Runs on** | Every meeting linked to an active opportunity in your CRM |","table":"table-0"},"1591":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-50","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#at-a-glance","content":"|                |                                           |\n| -------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| **Built from** | Oliv Notetaker recordings and transcripts |","table":"table-0"},"1592":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-51","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#at-a-glance","content":"|                      |                                                                                                 |\n| -------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Where you see it** | Home's **Agent Feed** before the call; the meeting's page in **Activities › Meetings** after it |","table":"table-0"},"1593":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-52","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                        |\n| ---------------- | ---------------------- |\n| **Also part of** | The Deal Driver bundle |","table":"table-0"},"1594":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-53","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#what-it-is","content":"Oliv AI's Meeting Assistant agent is an action agent for the people who run meetings on open deals. It works only on active opportunities. If the deal exists and the meeting is on your calendar, it runs automatically. First meetings with new contacts get a research brief instead, covered in Prepare for a meeting. In the **Agents** marketplace it's listed as a **Pre-built** agent under **Customer Success**."},"1595":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-54","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#before-the-meeting","content":"The brief arrives 30 minutes before the call. It's built to fit one screen and take about 60 seconds to read."},"1596":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-55","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#before-the-meeting","content":"**Deal summary.** Stage, amount, close date, last activity and next steps."},"1597":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-56","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#before-the-meeting","content":"**Qualification status.** Where the deal stands against your methodology, with gaps and open questions highlighted."},"1598":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-57","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#before-the-meeting","content":"**Stakeholders.** Who's in the meeting, the role each plays, and what they care about based on earlier conversations."},"1599":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-58","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#before-the-meeting","content":"**Recommended agenda.** Tailored to the deal stage and the qualification gaps."},"1600":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-59","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#before-the-meeting","content":"The prep also reaches you on Home. When something about an upcoming meeting changes, Meeting Assistant posts a row in the **Agent Feed**. Olivia's daily brief carries a Meeting Assistant section with **Detours**, plans for objections that might come up, and a **Review meeting plan** button."},"1601":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-60","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#before-the-meeting","content":"Before the call, Meeting Assistant's update sits in the same Agent Feed as your other agents. Its row says what changed about the meeting, so you walk in with the latest picture."},"1602":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-61","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#after-the-meeting","content":"Once the recording is processed, three things are ready for you."},"1603":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-62","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#after-the-meeting","content":"**A follow-up email draft.** Written from the transcript: what was discussed, what was agreed, and next steps with dates where possible. It isn't a template."},"1604":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-63","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#after-the-meeting","content":"**Proposed deal field updates.** Stage, amount, close date, qualification fields and next steps, based on what was said."},"1605":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-64","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#after-the-meeting","content":"**Qualification gap flags.** New information, or notable absences, that change the deal's qualification status."},"1606":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-65","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#meeting-page","content":"Open the meeting from **Activities › Meetings**. Its **Overview** tab shows **Key takeaways** and an **AI Summary**, with blue timestamps that link into the recording. A deal card under the takeaways shows stage, amount and close date, with **Review Deal**."},"1607":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-66","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#meeting-page","content":"After the call, the meeting's Overview gives you the takeaways and summary with timestamps back to the moment. The deal card beside them is one click from the deal itself."},"1608":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-67","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#meeting-page","content":"The **Action Items** tab turns commitments into work. **Next meeting**, **Next action** and **Next follow-up** cards sit above a **Tasks** table with **Assignee** and **Due Date**. Each task links to the moment it was agreed, and **Add task** adds your own."},"1609":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-68","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#meeting-page","content":"Every commitment from the call becomes a task with an owner, a due date and a timestamp to the source. That's the follow-through the recap email promises, already tracked."},"1610":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-69","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#meeting-page","content":"The full tour of every tab is in meeting details."},"1611":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-70","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#across-meetings","content":"As meetings stack up on a deal, Meeting Assistant keeps an updated picture of the opportunity. That picture doesn't depend on a rep typing notes after every call. It's what makes better sales follow-ups possible without extra admin."},"1612":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-71","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#what-its-for","content":"Oliv AI's Meeting Assistant agent is for anyone who runs meetings on live deals. It handles the prep before each call and the paperwork after it. That leaves the time in between for thinking about the customer."},"1613":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-72","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#how-it-helps","content":"**You walk in ready.** The brief lands half an hour early and reads in about a minute."},"1614":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-73","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#how-it-helps","content":"**The email is already written.** The draft comes from the real conversation, so you edit rather than start from a blank page."},"1615":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-74","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#how-it-helps","content":"**The CRM keeps pace.** Changes heard on the call come back as CRM updates you can check on the meeting."},"1616":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-75","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#how-it-helps","content":"**Gaps show up early.** Missing qualification details are flagged after every call, while there's time to fix them."},"1617":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-76","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#without-it","content":"Reps lose 15 to 20 minutes rebuilding context before each call. Each follow-up email takes another 15 minutes. CRM updates rely on memory, so fields drift out of date. Qualification gaps surface at the forecast review, when it's too late to act on them."},"1618":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-77","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#why-buyers-care","content":"VPs of Sales and sales managers are the usual buyers. Account executives champion it, because they get time back before and after every call. The value grows with deal volume, since there's more for the gap tracking to catch."},"1619":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-78","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#approach","content":"Say a customer success manager has just wrapped a quarterly business review with three people from one account. The operations director wants a rollout plan. The finance lead asked for usage numbers before the renewal talk. The admin raised two open support issues, and the renewal opportunity is sitting in the CRM."},"1620":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-79","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#approach","content":"Most CSMs write that recap later in the day, from memory and a page of scribbles. Pleasing three readers in one email can eat close to half an hour. Small promises tend to slip, and the renewal record often stays exactly as it was before the call."},"1621":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-80","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#approach","content":"Yet nothing in that recap is new information. Every ask, owner and date was said out loud on a recorded call. The real job is turning the transcript into an email and a few field changes while the meeting is still fresh."},"1622":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-81","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#approach","content":"Oliv AI does that with its Meeting Assistant agent. When the recording is processed, it drafts the follow-up from the transcript with the recap, commitments, owners and next steps. It also proposes field updates for the renewal and flags any qualification gaps the call exposed. The CSM reads it, adjusts a line or two and sends it."},"1623":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-82","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#approach","content":"The draft lands within minutes of the call ending. Each CRM change shows on the meeting's **CRM Updates** tab, with a stage move held for the CSM to confirm. How that set of outputs lines up against other meeting tools is covered in How the Meeting Assistant agent compares, below."},"1624":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-83","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#set-up","content":"**Connect your calendar.** Meeting Assistant looks for meetings linked to an active opportunity."},"1625":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-84","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#set-up","content":"**Connect your call recorder.** Use your existing recording tool or Oliv AI's own recorder. The follow-up and gap flags are built from recordings and transcripts, which Oliv AI's Converse app captures with call recording and transcription."},"1626":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-85","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#set-up","content":"**Connect your CRM.** Salesforce, HubSpot or Zoho. This is where the deal context comes from and where approved updates go. See the full list of supported integrations."},"1627":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-86","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#set-up","content":"**Confirm your methodology.** Open **Settings › Qualification Framework**. It lists MEDDPICC, MEDDIC, SPICED, BANT and DRIVE, and the one marked **Active** is what Meeting Assistant maps every call against. Preview another tab, then press **Activate** to switch."},"1628":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-87","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#set-up","content":"The Active framework decides which criteria every call is checked against. Set it here before the first meetings, so gap flags match the way your team qualifies."},"1629":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-88","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#set-up","content":"Most teams are connected within a week. You don't need a clean CRM to start: Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent fills in missing or stale fields from call history as it goes."},"1630":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-89","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#review-the-follow-up","content":"The follow-up is a draft, not an automatic send. Read it, adjust anything that needs changing, and send it yourself. The pre-meeting brief for any active deal or customer works the same way: it informs you, and you decide what happens next."},"1631":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-90","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#approve-updates","content":"The agent reads the call, finds what changed, and proposes updates. That keeps stage, close date and next steps current without chasing anyone."},"1632":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-91","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#approve-updates","content":"The meeting's **CRM Updates** tab lists what changed after the call. Applied changes, such as an account summary, a scorecard or a new contact, carry a green check and a link to the record. A change waiting for you, such as a stage move, shows as **Pending Update** with **Update Deal**."},"1633":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-92","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#approve-updates","content":"This is where the call's field changes land. Done items link to the record, and a pending stage move waits for you to press Update Deal."},"1634":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-93","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#approve-updates","content":"Approval settings for agent actions in general are explained in agent tools and run modes."},"1635":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-94","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#act-on-gaps","content":"Gap flags appear after every call, so reps and managers can act before missing details hurt the deal. The meeting's **Meeting insights** tab has a chip for each criterion of the active framework, from **Metrics** to **Champion**, plus **Additional Fields**. Each section holds evidence cards with timestamps. Where nothing was said, the card says so, as in \"No ROI\"."},"1636":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-95","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#act-on-gaps","content":"Gaps show up as plainly as evidence. A \"not discussed\" card, like the missing ROI here, is the question to raise on the next call."},"1637":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-96","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#act-on-gaps","content":"Your team's framework decides what counts as a gap, so it helps to agree on your sales methodology first."},"1638":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-97","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#with-crm-manager","content":"Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent writes the field updates that Meeting Assistant surfaces. Meeting Assistant proposes, and CRM Manager keeps the pipeline current without manual cleanup."},"1639":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-98","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#with-deal-driver","content":"Oliv AI's Deal Driver agent adds pipeline context before every manager 1:1: what changed, what's stuck and which deals need attention. Meeting Assistant summarizes what happened on each call, so managers coach from the same context their reps have. Deal Driver's **Sunset Summary** also says whether the notetaker recorded the day's meetings."},"1640":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-99","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#with-forecaster","content":"Oliv AI's Forecaster agent uses the deal qualification data that Meeting Assistant helps keep current. Better data after each call feeds a more grounded pipeline projection."},"1641":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-100","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#with-coach","content":"Oliv AI's Coach agent is developmental and works on recordings after the fact. Meeting Assistant is operational and works before and right after the call."},"1642":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-101","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#with-olivia","content":"Oliv AI's Olivia agent is the front-facing master agent for reps. Meeting Assistant works in the background around each call, so the brief and follow-up arrive without anyone asking."},"1643":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-102","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#account-executives","content":"Account executives are the main users. They get the brief before each deal meeting and the drafted follow-up after it, so prep and recap stop eating the gaps between calls. The full rep workflow is in Run deals as an account executive."},"1644":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-103","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#account-managers-cs","content":"Account managers and CSMs use it on meetings tied to a renewal or expansion opportunity. A check-in with several stakeholders ends with the recap already drafted. See how Oliv AI supports customer success teams and account management."},"1645":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-104","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#bdrs","content":"BDRs use it on meetings tied to an active opportunity. They get the same brief before the call and the same drafted follow-up after it. More on Oliv AI for sales development teams."},"1646":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-105","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#sales-managers","content":"Sales managers see the same call summaries their reps do before each 1:1. Combined with Deal Driver, the meeting opens on the deal, not on a retelling of it. Read how Oliv AI works for sales managers."},"1647":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-106","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#compare","content":"Most meeting tools draft a follow-up email. Meeting Assistant also proposes CRM updates for approval, flags qualification gaps and summarizes each call for the manager's 1:1, all from the same recording. Oliv AI is the only platform in this table that does all four."},"1648":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-107","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#compare","content":"After-the-call features, from each platform's public documentation:"},"1649":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-108","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#compare","content":"| Platform    | Follow-up drafted from the call | CRM updates proposed for approval | Qualification gaps flagged after each call | Call summary for the manager's 1:1 |\n| ----------- | ------------------------------- | --------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ | ---------------------------------- |\n| **Oliv AI** | Yes                             | Yes                               | Yes                                        | Yes                                |","table":"table-1"},"1650":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-109","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#compare","content":"| Platform | Follow-up drafted from the call          | CRM updates proposed for approval      | Qualification gaps flagged after each call | Call summary for the manager's 1:1       |\n| -------- | ---------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------- |\n| **Gong** | Yes (follow-up email from the call page) | Partly (one text field on deal boards) | Partly (separate MEDDICC agent)            | Partly (deal board to check before 1:1s) |","table":"table-1"},"1651":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-110","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#compare","content":"| Platform     | Follow-up drafted from the call    | CRM updates proposed for approval      | Qualification gaps flagged after each call | Call summary for the manager's 1:1       |\n| ------------ | ---------------------------------- | -------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------- |\n| **Outreach** | Yes (Smart Email Assist follow-up) | Yes (Deal Agent field recommendations) | Partly (methodology in the Deal Agent)     | Partly (deal questions to cut 1:1 admin) |","table":"table-1"},"1652":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-111","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#compare","content":"| Platform      | Follow-up drafted from the call        | CRM updates proposed for approval | Qualification gaps flagged after each call | Call summary for the manager's 1:1 |\n| ------------- | -------------------------------------- | --------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ | ---------------------------------- |\n| **Fireflies** | Yes (follow-up after every sales call) | Yes (Autofill CRM review)         | Partly (BANT and MEDDIC scorecards)        | Not in docs                        |","table":"table-1"},"1653":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-112","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#compare","content":"| Platform  | Follow-up drafted from the call      | CRM updates proposed for approval | Qualification gaps flagged after each call | Call summary for the manager's 1:1 |\n| --------- | ------------------------------------ | --------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ | ---------------------------------- |\n| **Avoma** | Yes (auto-generated follow-up email) | Automated field updates           | Yes (gaps in the deal dashboard)           | Not in docs                        |","table":"table-1"},"1654":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-113","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#compare","content":"| Platform   | Follow-up drafted from the call             | CRM updates proposed for approval | Qualification gaps flagged after each call | Call summary for the manager's 1:1 |\n| ---------- | ------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ | ---------------------------------- |\n| **Fathom** | Partly (drafted when you prompt Ask Fathom) | Writes summaries and tasks to CRM | Partly (MEDDPICC deal summary template)    | Not in docs                        |","table":"table-1"},"1655":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-114","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#compare","content":"*Yes: documented and built in. Partly: documented with a limit, shown in brackets. Not in docs: not found in the vendor's public documentation.*"},"1656":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-115","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#compare-stronger","content":"**One recording, every output.** Meeting Assistant turns each call into a follow-up, CRM proposals and gap flags at once. Gong puts generating a follow-up email among the call page actions, while a MEDDICC agent shows where the gaps are. Compare Oliv AI vs Gong."},"1657":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-116","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#compare-stronger","content":"**Gaps flagged on every call.** Meeting Assistant maps each call against the methodology your team runs. Avoma's Deal Methodology surfaces compliance and gaps in the deal dashboard once an admin configures it. Compare Oliv AI vs Avoma."},"1658":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-117","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#compare-stronger","content":"**The manager gets the call context without asking.** Before every 1:1, Meeting Assistant summarizes what happened on each call. Outreach's manager workflows suggest you use pipeline summary to review a rep's opportunities and pull that context together yourself. Read how Gong and Outreach compare."},"1659":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-118","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#compare-stronger","content":"*Competitor details checked against each vendor's public documentation on 21 October 2026. Features and plans change, so confirm with the vendor before you decide.*"},"1660":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-119","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#limits","content":"**It works on active opportunities.** Meetings with no linked opportunity don't get a deal brief. First meetings with new contacts are handled by research before the first call."},"1661":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-120","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#limits","content":"**It proposes, it doesn't send.** You review, adjust and send the follow-up yourself. Field updates go through CRM Manager, which holds changes like a stage move for you to confirm."},"1662":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-121","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#limits","content":"**It isn't a forecasting agent.** Meeting Assistant surfaces field updates. Forecaster uses them for pipeline projection."},"1663":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-122","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#limits","content":"**It isn't a coaching tool.** Meeting Assistant is operational. Coach handles rep development."},"1664":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-123","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#limits","content":"**It needs recordings.** The follow-up, field updates and gap flags come from Oliv Notetaker recordings and transcripts."},"1665":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-124","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#faq-brief-length","content":"One screen, about 60 seconds to read. It covers the deal summary, qualification status, stakeholder context and a recommended agenda."},"1666":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-125","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#faq-methodologies","content":"MEDDPICC, MEDDIC, SPICED, BANT and DRIVE, listed in **Settings › Qualification Framework**. Meeting Assistant maps every call against the one marked **Active**."},"1667":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-126","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#faq-which-meetings","content":"Every meeting linked to an active opportunity in your CRM. If the deal exists and the meeting is on your calendar, it runs automatically."},"1668":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-127","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#faq-template","content":"No. Meeting Assistant reads the recording transcript and drafts from the actual conversation: what was discussed, what was agreed and what happens next. You review it, adjust it and send it."},"1669":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-128","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#faq-timing","content":"The follow-up is drafted within minutes of the call ending, once the recording is processed."},"1670":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-129","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#faq-crm-changes","content":"Meeting Assistant proposes the updates, and CRM Manager writes them. Check the meeting's **CRM Updates** tab: a stage move waits as a **Pending Update** until you press **Update Deal**."},"1671":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-130","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#faq-deal-driver","content":"No. Meeting Assistant is included in Deal Driver, so if you're on Deal Driver, your reps already have it."},"1672":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-131","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#faq-integrations","content":"Your calendar, your call recording tool or Oliv AI's own recorder, and your CRM: Salesforce, HubSpot or Zoho. Most teams are connected within a week."},"1673":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-132","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#faq-messy-crm","content":"Meeting Assistant works with CRM Manager to keep deal fields current. If data is missing or stale, CRM Manager fills it in from call history, so you don't need a clean CRM to start."},"1674":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-133","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#faq-team-size","content":"No. It delivers value for individual reps straight away. Qualification gap tracking gets more useful as deal volume grows."},"1675":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-134","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#faq-customer-success","content":"Yes, on meetings linked to an active opportunity, such as a renewal or expansion. Customer success and account management are among the teams it's built for."},"1676":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-135","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#related","content":"Meeting Assistant on oliv.ai: the agent's own page, with the brief and follow-up examples."},"1677":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-136","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#related","content":"Prepare for a meeting: the step-by-step guide to the brief and first-meeting research."},"1678":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-137","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#related","content":"The Deal Driver agent docs: the manager bundle that includes Meeting Assistant."},"1679":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-138","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#related","content":"The AE deal workflow: how a rep's week runs across agents."},"1680":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-139","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#related","content":"AI meeting assistants for sales: how meeting tools differ on prep and follow-up."},"1681":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-140","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#related","content":"Sales call notes software: transcription and structured notes compared."},"1682":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant-141","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/meeting-assistant#related","content":"Oliv AI pricing: plans a