r#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                                                                                  |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **What it does** | Keeps the process handbook every Oliv AI agent follows, and updates it when your process changes |","table":"table-0"},"1730":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-45","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                              |\n| ---------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| **Who it's for** | RevOps managers, VPs of Sales, CROs and CEOs |","table":"table-0"},"1731":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-46","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#at-a-glance","content":"|                     |                                                                     |\n| ------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Who can open it** | Anyone, from the agent picker on **Home**; RevOps owns the handbook |","table":"table-0"},"1732":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-47","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#at-a-glance","content":"|                          |                                                                   |\n| ------------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **How you work with it** | A chat on **Home**, or a panel beside **Agents** and **Playbook** |","table":"table-0"},"1733":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-48","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#at-a-glance","content":"|                              |                                                                 |\n| ---------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Where the handbook lives** | **Playbook** in the sidebar, with **Edit** and **History** tabs |","table":"table-0"},"1734":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-49","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#at-a-glance","content":"|                       |                                                                                     |\n| --------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **How changes apply** | **Pending Review**, then **Approve & merge** in **Review changes**, then **Merged** |","table":"table-0"},"1735":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-50","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#at-a-glance","content":"|                 |                                              |\n| --------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| **Methodology** | MEDDPICC, BANT, SPICED or your own framework |","table":"table-0"},"1736":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-51","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                                                     |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Set-up paths** | **You Run It** (2 to 4 sessions) or **We Run It** (live in 2 weeks) |","table":"table-0"},"1737":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-52","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#what-it-is","content":"Oliv AI's Oliver agent is one of two super agents in Oliv AI. The other is Oliv AI's Olivia agent, who works with reps on deals. Oliver works on the business rather than within it. Every other agent works on deals, contacts and activities, and Oliver owns the rules they all run by."},"1738":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-53","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#what-it-is","content":"Oliv AI's Oliver agent on Home, in its amber theme. Its prompts point at process questions, such as stage accuracy and forecast integrity, rather than single deals."},"1739":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-54","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#what-it-is","content":"On **Home**, Oliver's pill reads **Your Chief GTM Engineer**. In the agent picker it describes itself in one line: \"I learn how your team operates and turn it into the rules every other agent follows.\""},"1740":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-55","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#handbook","content":"The handbook is a set of structured, interlinked documents. Update the ICP, and the qualifying criteria across agents update with it."},"1741":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-56","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#handbook","content":"**ICP definition.** Who you sell to, and the qualifying signals."},"1742":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-57","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#handbook","content":"**Persona library.** The roles you target and what they care about."},"1743":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-58","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#handbook","content":"**Sales methodology.** MEDDPICC, BANT, SPICED or a custom framework, and the fields each stage requires."},"1744":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-59","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#handbook","content":"**Approval workflows.** When the pricing desk gets involved, and the deal size where manager sign-off starts."},"1745":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-60","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#handbook","content":"**POC process.** What makes a POC eligible, what success looks like and how long it should run."},"1746":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-61","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#handbook","content":"**Proposal standards.** What goes into a proposal, who reviews it and the approval steps."},"1747":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-62","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#handbook","content":"**Territory and segmentation rules.** How pipeline is divided, and who owns what."},"1748":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-63","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#handbook","content":"The handbook lives in **Playbook**, pinned at the bottom of the sidebar. A file tree groups markdown files into folders such as **Market**, **Prospecting** and **Sales**, with **Search playbook** above them. Each file opens on the **Edit** tab with a rich-text toolbar. A status row shows **Synced**, the last editor and a word count, and Oliver sits in a panel on the right."},"1749":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-64","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#handbook","content":"The handbook Oliv AI's Oliver agent keeps is a set of files you can open and edit. Oliver works beside them, so you can ask for a change while reading the rule."},"1750":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-65","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#handbook","content":"A sample handbook page such as `Target Market.md` opens with a **Winning Zone** table and runs through Winning Zone, Priority Segments, Disqualification Signals, Owner Notes, Trigger Events, Agent Behavior, How This Page Gets Used In Practice and Change Log Guidance. `Sales Process.md` holds a **Sales Stages** table with win percentages, activities and exit criteria. Sections such as **Stage Rules**, **Deal Risk Flags**, **Forecast Category Guidance** and **Deal Driver Alerts** follow. The Process Graph shows this playbook as agents read it."},"1751":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-66","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#writes-to","content":"The company process handbook."},"1752":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-67","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#writes-to","content":"Platform configuration: agent settings, schema definitions and field mappings."},"1753":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-68","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#writes-to","content":"Every Olivia conversation, which inherits the handbook context."},"1754":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-69","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#writes-to","content":"The CRM schema, through the CRM Manager agent, when a process change needs new fields or new mappings."},"1755":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-70","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#what-its-for","content":"Oliv AI's Oliver agent is for the people who decide how the company sells. It makes your process something every agent reads and follows, instead of a document people forget."},"1756":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-71","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#how-it-helps","content":"**One change, everywhere.** A new rule reaches scorecards, tracking fields and agent context together."},"1757":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-72","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#how-it-helps","content":"**Same rules for every rep.** Two reps can't track different data points on the same type of opportunity."},"1758":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-73","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#how-it-helps","content":"**Drift gets flagged.** Deals or activity outside your norms go to a person for review."},"1759":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-74","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#how-it-helps","content":"**The playbook learns.** Oliver spots patterns across deals and drafts the next update for you."},"1760":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-75","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#how-it-helps","content":"**You stay in charge.** Oliver's proposals wait as **Pending Review** until a person approves them."},"1761":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-76","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#without-it","content":"The real process lives in training decks and in managers' memories. A new rep needs three to six months to learn it. A new methodology or ICP has to be pushed into six tools by hand, and until that happens every rep runs a different version."},"1762":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-77","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#why-buyers-care","content":"RevOps leads, VPs of Sales and CROs buy Oliver. RevOps configures and owns the handbook. Sales leaders care most when they change methodology, shift the ICP or reset approval thresholds, because that is when consistency breaks first."},"1763":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-78","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#approach","content":"Picture a head of revenue operations leaving a meeting with a new rule. From Monday, an SDR passes a meeting to an AE only when the account fits the target segment and discovery notes are complete. Twelve SDRs and twenty AEs need to follow it."},"1764":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-79","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#approach","content":"Teams often handle this with a slide, a Slack post and a few CRM field changes, then a short training session. That work tends to stretch over weeks. Until every tool and scorecard catches up, SDRs and AEs may each be running a slightly different version of the rule."},"1765":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-80","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#approach","content":"A handoff rule looks like one decision, but it touches qualification fields, coaching standards, routing and the context a rep reads before a call. Once agents do much of that work, the rule only has to be changed in the place every agent reads from."},"1766":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-81","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#approach","content":"Oliv AI puts that place in its Oliver agent. The RevOps head describes the new rule in plain language. Oliver updates the handbook, reconfigures the related fields and passes the change to every agent that depends on it, from the next day forward. The proposal waits for a person to approve it."},"1767":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-82","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#approach","content":"Each proposal opens in **Review changes** as a line-by-line diff of every file it touches, with its knock-on effects listed below. It waits as **Pending Review** until someone presses **Approve & merge**. That review step is covered in How the Oliver agent compares, below."},"1768":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-83","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#set-up","content":"**Connect your CRM.** Salesforce, HubSpot or Zoho, so Oliver can align with your schema."},"1769":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-84","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#set-up","content":"**Gather your process documents.** Playbooks, methodology decks and the handbook you have, even if they are messy or incomplete."},"1770":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-85","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#set-up","content":"**Name a RevOps or leadership owner.** That person checks the handbook is accurate during onboarding."},"1771":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-86","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#set-up","content":"**Populate the first handbook.** Oliv AI's onboarding team works with your RevOps lead to translate your playbooks, CRM configuration and methodology into Oliver's structured format. This takes 1 to 2 weeks."},"1772":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-87","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#set-up","content":"**Keep it current in one conversation.** From then on, tell Oliver what changed and it passes the update to every connected agent."},"1773":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-88","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#run-paths","content":"**You Run It.** Your RevOps team works with Oliver directly, with full control over every update. Onboarding takes 2 to 4 sessions, with no engineering and no long prompts."},"1774":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-89","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#run-paths","content":"**We Run It.** Oliv AI's operators keep your playbooks, scorecards and agent context current for you. You're live in 2 weeks, with no prompts to write."},"1775":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-90","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#run-paths","content":"The RevOps implementation guide walks through the first weeks in more detail."},"1776":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-91","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#change-process","content":"**Open Oliver.** Choose **Oliver** in the agent picker on **Home**, or use its panel beside the **Agents** marketplace or **Playbook**. Its saved chats sit in the history panel."},"1777":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-92","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#change-process","content":"**Check the autonomy setting.** The dropdown under the message box opens on **Ask before acting**, where Oliver aligns on its approach before taking actions. **Act without asking** lets it act without asking for permission, and shows a **High Risk** banner: \"Oliver can take action on your settings right now.\""},"1778":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-93","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#change-process","content":"**Ask or tell.** The box reads \"Ask Oliver anything\", followed by data quality, stage accuracy, forecast integrity and pipeline structure. In **Playbook**, suggestions offer changes such as updating qualification scoring from win/loss patterns."},"1779":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-94","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#change-process","content":"**Read the answer.** A why question returns a **Pipeline Snapshot**, then ranked causes. Each cause carries **Deals impacted** and **Value impacted** badges and chips for the accounts affected."},"1780":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-95","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#change-process","content":"**Find the proposal.** A change Oliver proposes appears on the Playbook **History** tab as **Pending Review**."},"1781":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-96","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#change-process","content":"**Review it.** **Review changes** shows each file as a diff, with removed lines in red and added lines in green. Cards below list the knock-on effects, such as a new CRM field, an agent retrained or deals re-scored."},"1782":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-97","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#change-process","content":"**Decide.** Press **Approve & merge**, **Request edit** or **Cancel**. Approved changes show as **Merged** in **History**."},"1783":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-98","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#change-process","content":"Step 2: set how freely Oliv AI's Oliver agent may act in this conversation before you ask for a process change."},"1784":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-99","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#change-process","content":"Step 4: Oliv AI's Oliver agent answers a why question with a snapshot, then each cause and its impact. The figures are sample values."},"1785":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-100","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#change-process","content":"Steps 6 and 7: read exactly what Oliv AI's Oliver agent would change in each file, then approve and merge, ask for an edit or cancel."},"1786":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-101","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#change-process","content":"Specialist agents carry a separate control on each of their tools, covered in agent tools and run modes."},"1787":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-102","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#history","content":"The **History** tab lists every change to the playbook, by your company, by Oliver and by Oliv GTM Engineers. Filters narrow it to **All**, **By Oliver**, **By Your Company** or **By Oliv GTM Engineer**. Each card shows the date, the author, a status, a summary and the number of files changed."},"1788":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-103","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#history","content":"A status reads **Pending Review**, **Merged** or **Autonomous**. Autonomous marks a minor update Oliver applied on its own, such as syncing an agent prompt to a scorecard, noted as \"No human review needed\"."},"1789":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-104","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#history","content":"History shows who changed the playbook and whether each change is pending, merged or applied on its own by Oliv AI's Oliver agent."},"1790":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-105","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#drafted-changes","content":"Oliver watches what's winning in the field and drafts the next process update for your review. Its own example: \"We've seen 14 POCs extend beyond 30 days without a clear qualification gate. Should we add one?\" In the **Agent Feed**, Oliver posts reviews such as a quarterly revenue review, with playbook and agent changes ready for you to review. It also reports when it has updated process files."},"1791":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-106","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#drafted-changes","content":"In the RevOps view of the feed, Oliv AI's Oliver agent flags proposed playbook and agent changes waiting for you. The figures are sample values."},"1792":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-107","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#works-with","content":"Oliver doesn't work deals itself. It is the layer every execution agent reads from."},"1793":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-108","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#with-olivia","content":"Oliv AI's Olivia agent runs the front line inside Oliver's boundaries. Oliver sets the stages, ownership and handoffs, and Olivia operates inside them from day one. The Olivia agent page describes her side of the pair."},"1794":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-109","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#with-coach","content":"Oliv AI's Coach agent takes its methodology and process standards from Oliver. Every rep is coached against the same current rules."},"1795":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-110","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#with-deal-driver","content":"Oliv AI's Deal Driver agent grounds its deal alerts in the qualification framework Oliver defines. Managers catch deal problems early enough to change course."},"1796":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-111","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#with-crm-forecaster","content":"The field definitions Oliver keeps decide what Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent tracks and updates. The methodology Oliver defines feeds Oliv AI's Forecaster agent, so the forecast rests on one qualification standard."},"1797":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-112","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#with-cs-outbound","content":"Health signals and escalation thresholds for Oliv AI's Portfolio Manager agent come from the same handbook. Territory and segmentation rules keep Oliv AI's Prospector agent on strategy when the ICP shifts."},"1798":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-113","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#revops","content":"RevOps managers own Oliver. They define the handbook and approve the changes Oliver proposes, and one conversation replaces edits across many tools. More on Oliv AI for revenue operations teams."},"1799":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-114","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#sales-leadership","content":"When the market focus shifts, Oliver realigns every agent to the updated ICP. It runs your methodology across every rep interaction without a training cycle, and flags drift before it shows in pipeline quality. See how sales teams work with Oliv AI."},"1800":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-115","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#customer-success","content":"Oliver enforces your health standards across every account and carries each renewal criteria change to your CS agents. It also surfaces retention patterns across your book and drafts policy updates for review. Read more on Oliv AI for customer success."},"1801":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-116","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#enablement","content":"Enablement sees the effect through coaching. Coach coaches every rep against the methodology Oliver keeps current, so the standard reps are trained on matches the one agents enforce. The guide to sales methodology automation covers scoring calls against a framework."},"1802":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-117","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#compare","content":"Many platforms let an admin set up a sales methodology in settings. Oliver takes a process change in a chat, applies one change to every agent that depends on it, and drafts the next update from patterns across your deals. Oliv AI is the only platform in this table that does all three."},"1803":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-118","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#compare","content":"Process and playbook features, from each platform's public documentation:"},"1804":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-119","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#compare","content":"| Platform    | Methodology rules applied by AI | Process changed through a chat | Process updates drafted from deal patterns |\n| ----------- | ------------------------------- | ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------ |\n| **Oliv AI** | Yes                             | Yes                            | Yes                                        |","table":"table-1"},"1805":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-120","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#compare","content":"| Platform | Methodology rules applied by AI  | Process changed through a chat | Process updates drafted from deal patterns |\n| -------- | -------------------------------- | ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------ |\n| **Gong** | Yes (AI Deal Reviewer playbooks) | Admin settings                 | Not in docs                                |","table":"table-1"},"1806":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-121","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#compare","content":"| Platform  | Methodology rules applied by AI          | Process changed through a chat | Process updates drafted from deal patterns |\n| --------- | ---------------------------------------- | ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------ |\n| **Avoma** | Yes (Deal Methodology from Smart Topics) | Admin settings                 | Not in docs                                |","table":"table-1"},"1807":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-122","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#compare","content":"| Platform     | Methodology rules applied by AI        | Process changed through a chat | Process updates drafted from deal patterns |\n| ------------ | -------------------------------------- | ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------ |\n| **Outreach** | Yes (Sales Methodology for Deal Agent) | Admin settings                 | Not in docs                                |","table":"table-1"},"1808":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-123","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#compare","content":"| Platform      | Methodology rules applied by AI  | Process changed through a chat | Process updates drafted from deal patterns |\n| ------------- | -------------------------------- | ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------ |\n| **Fireflies** | Partly (BANT and MEDDIC reports) | Not in docs                    | Not in docs                                |","table":"table-1"},"1809":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-124","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#compare","content":"| Platform   | Methodology rules applied by AI               | Process changed through a chat | Process updates drafted from deal patterns |\n| ---------- | --------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------ |\n| **Fathom** | Partly (scorecards against a defined process) | Not in docs                    | Not in docs                                |","table":"table-1"},"1810":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-125","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#compare","content":"*Yes: documented and built in. Partly: documented with a limit, shown in brackets. Not in docs: not found in the vendor's public documentation.*"},"1811":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-126","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#compare-stronger","content":"**Tell it, don't configure it.** RevOps describes a process change to Oliver in plain language. Gong's playbooks are built in AI Deal Reviewer settings, with up to 20 elements per playbook. Compare Oliv AI vs Gong."},"1812":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-127","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#compare-stronger","content":"**Your methodology, not a preset.** Oliver captures MEDDPICC, BANT, SPICED or a proprietary framework. Avoma provides three default, non-editable methodologies to start from. Compare Oliv AI vs Avoma."},"1813":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-128","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#compare-stronger","content":"**One change reaches every agent.** Oliver carries an update to scorecards, tracking fields and agent context together. Outreach's methodology page supports the MEDDPICC framework by default for its Deal Agent. Read how Gong and Outreach compare."},"1814":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-129","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#compare-stronger","content":"*Competitor details checked against each vendor's public documentation on 21 October 2026. Features and plans change, so confirm with the vendor before you decide.*"},"1815":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-130","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#limits","content":"**It doesn't work deals.** Oliver doesn't act on individual opportunities. That is Olivia and the specialist agents."},"1816":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-131","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#limits","content":"**It doesn't track the CRM itself.** Oliver defines what should be tracked, and CRM Manager does the tracking."},"1817":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-132","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#limits","content":"**It isn't a reporting tool.** Cross-deal insight reaches you through Olivia, Forecaster and Coach, which read Oliver's structured layer."},"1818":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-133","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#limits","content":"**Change management is still yours.** Oliver handles the configuration, but telling the team about a change remains a RevOps job."},"1819":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-134","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#limits","content":"**Act without asking carries a warning.** Only Oliver shows the **High Risk** banner, because it can change your settings."},"1820":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-135","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#limits","content":"**Minor updates can apply on their own.** **History** marks them **Autonomous**, so read it to see what changed without a review."},"1821":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-136","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#limits","content":"**It isn't a one-time setup.** Oliver is maintained continuously, not configured once."},"1822":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-137","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#faq-who-talks","content":"Anyone can choose Oliver in the agent picker on **Home**. RevOps managers and senior revenue leaders own the handbook and approve its changes, while reps mostly work with Olivia."},"1823":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-138","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#faq-get-started","content":"During onboarding, Oliv AI's team works with your RevOps lead to populate the first handbook. It typically takes 1 to 2 weeks."},"1824":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-139","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#faq-process-change","content":"You tell Oliver. It updates the handbook and passes the change to every connected agent, including scorecards, tracking fields and agent context, at the same time."},"1825":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-140","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#faq-on-its-own","content":"Process proposals wait as **Pending Review** until a person approves them. Minor updates, such as syncing an agent prompt to a scorecard, can apply as **Autonomous** and appear in **History**."},"1826":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-141","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#faq-history","content":"Yes. The **History** tab lists every change with its author, status and files. Filter it by Oliver, by your company or by Oliv GTM Engineer."},"1827":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-142","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#faq-custom-methodology","content":"Yes. Oliver is methodology-agnostic. Whether you run MEDDPICC, BANT, SPICED or something proprietary, Oliver captures it and enforces it."},"1828":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-143","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#faq-messy-docs","content":"That's expected. Oliver starts from your existing handbook, playbooks and methodology decks, even when they are messy or incomplete."},"1829":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-144","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#faq-vs-olivia","content":"Oliver keeps the GTM playbook current. Olivia runs the front line and routes work to the right agents, inside the rules Oliver sets."},"1830":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-145","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#faq-exceptions","content":"When a deal or activity falls outside your established norms, Oliver surfaces it for human review rather than letting it drift silently."},"1831":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-146","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#faq-who-runs-it","content":"No. With **We Run It**, Oliv AI's operators maintain your playbooks on your behalf. With **You Run It**, your RevOps team works with Oliver directly."},"1832":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-147","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#faq-high-risk","content":"Setting Oliver to **Act without asking** lets it change your settings without confirming first. The banner sits above the message box while that setting is on."},"1833":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-148","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#related","content":"Oliver on oliv.ai: the agent's own page, with the two set-up paths."},"1834":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-149","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#related","content":"The Olivia agent docs: the front-line super agent that works inside Oliver's rules."},"1835":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-150","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#related","content":"Deal Driver agent docs: deal alerts built on Oliver's qualification framework."},"1836":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-151","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#related","content":"Agent tools and run modes: how approval works for each agent action."},"1837":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-152","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#related","content":"Prepare for a meeting: the brief that carries your methodology into each call."},"1838":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-153","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#related","content":"Run deals as an account executive: the rep's day inside the rules Oliver keeps."},"1839":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-154","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#related","content":"Sales process automation guide: automating each stage of the sales process."},"1840":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-155","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#related","content":"Scaling revenue operations: keeping process consistent from 25 to 200 reps."},"1841":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver-156","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/oliver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/oliver#related","content":"Oliv AI product documentation: every documented agent and feature."},"1842":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","type":"page","content":"Olivia agent","breadcrumbs":["Oliv AI docs","Agents"],"tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia"},"1843":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-0","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","content":"What Oliv AI's Olivia agent does, how to ask her questions and hand her work, what she needs connected, and how she compares with other revenue assistants."},"1844":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-1","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#at-a-glance","content":"At a glance"},"1845":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-2","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#what-it-is","content":"What the Olivia agent is"},"1846":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-3","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#a-conversation","content":"Olivia is a conversation, not a marketplace agent"},"1847":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-4","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#why-it-matters","content":"Why the Olivia agent matters"},"1848":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-5","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#what-its-for","content":"What it's for"},"1849":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-6","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#how-it-helps","content":"How it helps"},"1850":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-7","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#without-it","content":"What happens without it"},"1851":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-8","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#why-buyers-care","content":"Why buyers care"},"1852":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-9","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#approach","content":"The Oliv AI approach to the Olivia agent"},"1853":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-10","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#ask-olivia","content":"Ask Olivia a question"},"1854":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-11","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#suggestions","content":"The suggestion cards"},"1855":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-12","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#call-prep-answer","content":"What a call-prep answer holds"},"1856":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-13","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#drafts","content":"Drafts that wait for your choice"},"1857":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-14","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#history","content":"Pick up an earlier conversation"},"1858":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-15","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#from-the-feed","content":"Ask about a row in the Agent Feed"},"1859":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-16","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#things-to-ask","content":"Things you can hand her"},"1860":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-17","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#set-up","content":"Set up what Olivia reads"},"1861":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-18","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#works-with","content":"How Olivia works with other agents"},"1862":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-19","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#with-oliver","content":"Oliver"},"1863":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-20","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#with-meeting-agents","content":"Meeting Assistant and Researcher"},"1864":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-21","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#with-crm-manager","content":"CRM Manager"},"1865":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-22","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#with-cs-agents","content":"Gold Digger and Portfolio Manager"},"1866":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-23","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#with-deal-driver","content":"Deal Driver"},"1867":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-24","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#with-context","content":"Context underneath"},"1868":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-25","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#who-uses-it","content":"Who uses Olivia, and how"},"1869":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-26","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#account-executives","content":"Account executives"},"1870":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-27","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#sales-development","content":"Sales development"},"1871":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-28","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#account-managers","content":"Account managers"},"1872":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-29","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#cs-managers","content":"Customer success managers"},"1873":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-30","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#compare","content":"How the Olivia agent compares"},"1874":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-31","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#compare-stronger","content":"Why Oliv AI is the stronger choice for the Olivia agent"},"1875":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-32","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#limits","content":"Limits and things to know"},"1876":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-33","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#common-questions","content":"Common questions"},"1877":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-34","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#faq-who","content":"Who is Olivia?"},"1878":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-35","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#faq-same-for-everyone","content":"Is Olivia the same for everyone on the team?"},"1879":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-36","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#faq-vs-oliver","content":"How is Olivia different from Oliver?"},"1880":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-37","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#faq-vs-individual-agents","content":"Why use Olivia instead of the individual agents?"},"1881":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-38","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#faq-slack","content":"Does Olivia work in Slack?"},"1882":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-39","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#faq-autonomy","content":"Can I stop her acting on her own?"},"1883":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-40","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#faq-monitoring","content":"Does she really watch my conversations?"},"1884":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-41","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#faq-see-work","content":"How do I see what she has done?"},"1885":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-42","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#faq-saved","content":"Are my conversations with her saved?"},"1886":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-43","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#faq-other-screens","content":"Can I ask Olivia from other screens?"},"1887":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-44","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#faq-needs","content":"What does Olivia need connected?"},"1888":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-45","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#faq-sold-separately","content":"Is Olivia sold separately?"},"1889":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-46","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#related","content":"Related"},"1890":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-47","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","content":"Oliv AI's Olivia agent is the agent you talk to rather than configure. You ask in plain language about deals, meeting prep, pipeline or next steps, and she either answers or hands the work to a specialist agent and reports back. She also monitors your conversations in the background and takes care of things before you ask."},"1891":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-48","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                                                |\n| ---------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **What it does** | Answers questions and gets work done through specialist agents |","table":"table-0"},"1892":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-49","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                                      |\n| ---------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Who it's for** | AEs, BDRs, SDRs, CSMs and AMs across the revenue org |","table":"table-0"},"1893":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-50","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#at-a-glance","content":"|                        |                                                                                     |\n| ---------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Where you find her** | The **Ask** tab on **Home**, or a side panel opened with **Ask** from other screens |","table":"table-0"},"1894":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-51","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#at-a-glance","content":"|                         |                                                                                     |\n| ----------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **How freely she acts** | **Ask before acting** (the default) or **Act without asking**, set per conversation |","table":"table-0"},"1895":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-52","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#at-a-glance","content":"|                        |                                                        |\n| ---------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Past conversations** | Saved in a history panel, with search and **New Chat** |","table":"table-0"},"1896":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-53","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#at-a-glance","content":"|                            |                                          |\n| -------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| **Where alerts reach you** | Slack, Teams, or within the Oliv product |","table":"table-0"},"1897":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-54","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#at-a-glance","content":"|                    |                                                                  |\n| ------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **What she needs** | A recording or transcript input, a CRM connection and a calendar |","table":"table-0"},"1898":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-55","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#what-it-is","content":"Oliv AI's Olivia agent is one of two super agents in Oliv AI. The other is Oliv AI's Oliver agent. Oliver owns the back end: the process handbook, the configuration and the rules the org runs on. Olivia owns the front end: the relationship, the context and the execution."},"1899":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-56","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#what-it-is","content":"Oliv AI's Olivia agent opens on Home's Ask tab, ready for a question. The dropdown under the box shows how freely she may act in this conversation."},"1900":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-57","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#what-it-is","content":"On **Home**, the **Ask** tab opens with Olivia chosen. Her pill reads **Your Chief of AI Staff**, and the **Agent Feed** tab beside it shows what your agents have done."},"1901":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-58","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#what-it-is","content":"She is the same agent for the whole revenue org, not a separate instance per person. She adapts to each rep's accounts and deals, while Oliver keeps her inside consistent company process. In the agent picker she describes herself in one line: \"I see everything across your team and dispatch the right sub-agent for each task.\""},"1902":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-59","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#a-conversation","content":"Olivia doesn't appear in the agent marketplace. She has no card, no detail page, no tools tab and no run history. You reach her on the **Ask** tab or in a side panel, and her background work shows up as rows in the **Agent Feed**."},"1903":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-60","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#what-its-for","content":"Oliv AI's Olivia agent is for revenue people who need the full picture of a deal or account at the moment they act. That picture is split across the CRM, call recordings and email, and someone has to stitch it together."},"1904":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-61","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#how-it-helps","content":"**Prep that's already done.** She surfaces deal context about 30 minutes before a meeting, so you don't rebuild it yourself."},"1905":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-62","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#how-it-helps","content":"**Follow-up drafted for you.** After a call, the follow-up email is drafted and ready within minutes."},"1906":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-63","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#how-it-helps","content":"**Risk raised early.** She flags deals with no activity, close dates nearing without progress, or qualification gaps."},"1907":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-64","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#how-it-helps","content":"**One place to ask.** You tell Olivia what you need, and she routes it to the right agent."},"1908":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-65","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#without-it","content":"Each piece of busywork is small: prep a meeting, follow up a call, update a field, brief a colleague on a handoff. Added up, it slows the whole team. A quiet deal often gets noticed only when a rep escalates it."},"1909":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-66","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#why-buyers-care","content":"Olivia is usually bought by a VP of Sales or a RevOps lead. AE and BDR team leads feel the daily value first. Sales managers care about the team consistency that comes from every rep working inside the same process."},"1910":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-67","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#approach","content":"Picture a customer success manager who looks after a book of mid-market accounts. One customer has a renewal call at 4pm, and the CSM last spoke to them six weeks ago. Since then the account has had a support escalation, two calls with an account executive and a run of emails."},"1911":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-68","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#approach","content":"A common fix is to open the CRM record, skim old call notes, search the inbox and message the AE for anything missed. That likely takes half an hour per call. Even then, a hint of expansion buried in one of those calls may never reach the CSM."},"1912":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-69","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#approach","content":"None of this information is new. It already sits in the calls, the CRM and the inbox. What the CSM lacks is someone who holds that history and assembles it at the right moment, without being asked twice."},"1913":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-70","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#approach","content":"Oliv AI puts that assembly in a chat beside the work. The CSM presses the suggestion for a renewal call at 4pm. Oliv AI's Olivia agent returns the deal at a glance, who is joining, the risks to watch and talking points. She can call on Oliv AI's Portfolio Manager agent for account health and its Gold Digger agent for expansion signals."},"1914":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-71","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#approach","content":"The autonomy dropdown under the message box opens on **Ask before acting**, so Olivia aligns on her approach before she takes any action. That setting is one of the points covered in How the Olivia agent compares, below."},"1915":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-72","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#ask-olivia","content":"Open **Home** and stay on the **Ask** tab. On another screen, press **Ask** in the header to open her in a side panel beside your work."},"1916":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-73","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#ask-olivia","content":"Check the agent picker at the top reads **Olivia**. Her surface is blue to violet with a dotted background. Oliver's is amber to orange with a grid."},"1917":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-74","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#ask-olivia","content":"Choose how freely she acts with the dropdown beneath the message box: **Ask before acting** or **Act without asking**."},"1918":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-75","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#ask-olivia","content":"Ask your question. Type into the box that reads *Ask olivia anything - deals, meeting prep, pipeline, next steps...*, or use the microphone. The **+** button attaches a file."},"1919":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-76","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#ask-olivia","content":"Check her working. A **Reasoning Trace** row sits above each answer. It stays collapsed until you open it to read the steps she took."},"1920":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-77","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#ask-olivia","content":"Read the answer. It can be plain text or a structured result, such as a renewal brief with the deal at a glance, attendees, risks and talking points."},"1921":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-78","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#ask-olivia","content":"Choose what goes out. Drafted work waits for you to pick a send option, edit it or open a review button."},"1922":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-79","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#ask-olivia","content":"Step 2: the picker lists both super agents with their own one-line descriptions. Choose Olivia for deals, meetings and next steps, and Oliv AI's Oliver agent for process questions."},"1923":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-80","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#suggestions","content":"In the side panel, Olivia offers three suggestions about your own day and deals:"},"1924":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-81","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#suggestions","content":"**What does my day look like?**"},"1925":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-82","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#suggestions","content":"**Get me ready for my [account] renewal call at 4pm today.**"},"1926":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-83","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#suggestions","content":"**Where are my deals getting stuck the most?**"},"1927":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-84","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#suggestions","content":"Press Ask on any screen and Oliv AI's Olivia agent opens beside it with three suggestion cards. You keep your place on the board while you ask."},"1928":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-85","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#call-prep-answer","content":"Ask Olivia to get you ready for a call, and she starts with **Deal at a glance**: four cards for **Deal Stage**, **ARR**, **Since Economic Buyer Touch** and **Deal Health**. Below them sit **Who's Joining?**, **Three risks to watch**, numbered **Talking points** and a **Researcher brief** on a new attendee. A suggestion chip at the end offers the next step, such as drafting the pre-meeting email."},"1929":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-86","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#call-prep-answer","content":"A call-prep answer opens with the deal at a glance, so the state of the deal is the first thing you read. The figures are sample values."},"1930":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-87","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#drafts","content":"When Olivia drafts an email, she writes two versions. **Draft 1** carries a **Recommended** badge and a **Why this version?** box, and the second draft says when to use it instead. You choose **Send Draft 1 now**, send it at a set time, **Edit before sending** or **Send Draft 2 instead**."},"1931":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-88","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#drafts","content":"Under **After this goes out, I'll**, she lists what follows. Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent logs the touch on the deal, and she watches for a reply."},"1932":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-89","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#drafts","content":"Nothing goes out until you press one of the four buttons. Oliv AI's Olivia agent also says what she and Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent will do after it sends."},"1933":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-90","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#drafts","content":"A daily brief works the same way. It groups the work under the agent that did it, with a review button for each, such as **Review meeting plan** and **Review draft from Deal Driver**."},"1934":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-91","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#history","content":"Press the menu icon beside the picker to open the history panel. It lists your saved chats with Olivia, with a search icon and **New Chat** at the top. Oliver keeps a separate list. The pencil icon starts a new chat at any time."},"1935":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-92","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#history","content":"Saved chats let you reopen a brief or a renewal prep later. Oliv AI's Olivia agent keeps her own history, separate from Oliver's."},"1936":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-93","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#from-the-feed","content":"Hover a row in the **Agent Feed** to show two buttons: a comment button and **Clear**. Press the comment button and Olivia opens in a side panel beside the feed, with that row outlined. The panel has its own new chat, history and close buttons."},"1937":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-94","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#from-the-feed","content":"Ask Oliv AI's Olivia agent about a feed update without leaving the feed. The outlined row shows which update the conversation is about."},"1938":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-95","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#things-to-ask","content":"You can describe the work in your own words. For example:"},"1939":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-96","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#things-to-ask","content":"\"Draft the follow-up from my call this afternoon.\" Olivia pulls from the meeting transcript and drafts it."},"1940":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-97","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#things-to-ask","content":"\"This deal has been stuck for three weeks.\" She engages Oliv AI's Re-Activator agent and surfaces a re-engagement strategy."},"1941":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-98","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#things-to-ask","content":"\"Can you prep a mutual action plan for this deal?\" She engages Oliv AI's MAP Manager agent."},"1942":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-99","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#things-to-ask","content":"\"I just met six people at an event, line up outreach for each of them.\" She engages Oliv AI's Prospector agent."},"1943":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-100","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#set-up","content":"Oliv AI's Olivia agent works from the data you connect, and each source adds context she can use."},"1944":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-101","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#set-up","content":"**Connect a recording or transcript input.** Oliv Notetaker, or an equivalent, is the primary source of her live context."},"1945":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-102","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#set-up","content":"**Connect your CRM.** It gives her pipeline and deal history. Oliv AI works as a layer on top of the CRM, alongside your other connected tools."},"1946":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-103","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#set-up","content":"**Connect your calendar.** It's how she knows which meetings are coming up."},"1947":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-104","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#set-up","content":"**Add email, if you can.** Email is optional, but it adds a lot of context between meetings. LinkedIn or Sales Navigator is optional too, for contact enrichment."},"1948":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-105","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#set-up","content":"**Let Oliver set the playbook.** RevOps and leadership configure Oliver with your stages, ownership and handoffs, and Olivia operates inside those rules from day one."},"1949":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-106","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#with-oliver","content":"Oliv AI's Oliver agent sets the process and Olivia runs within it. When Oliver updates the company's methodology or approval process, her behavior updates to match. The Process Graph is the living playbook every Oliv agent reads before it acts."},"1950":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-107","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#with-meeting-agents","content":"Before a meeting, Olivia coordinates with Oliv AI's Meeting Assistant agent for active opportunities and with Oliv AI's Researcher agent for new contacts."},"1951":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-108","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#with-crm-manager","content":"After every call, she surfaces proposed CRM updates, such as field values, stage changes and next steps, for the rep to review and approve. Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent handles the execution of those writes."},"1952":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-109","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#with-cs-agents","content":"Olivia alerts the team when Oliv AI's Gold Digger agent detects an expansion signal. For CS managers she works with Gold Digger and Oliv AI's Portfolio Manager agent."},"1953":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-110","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#with-deal-driver","content":"She also alerts reps when Oliv AI's Deal Driver agent flags a manager-level concern on one of their deals."},"1954":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-111","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#with-context","content":"Every agent draws on the same foundation. Context Capture maps raw activity into account, deal, people and process context, so Olivia knows what changed and what needs attention."},"1955":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-112","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#account-executives","content":"An AE walks into every call prepared, because Oliv AI's Olivia agent handles the brief. When the call ends, she updates the CRM and drafts the follow-up, and at-risk deals surface before they become a problem. More on AI agents for sales teams."},"1956":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-113","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#sales-development","content":"A BDR back from an event gets every contact enriched, matched and sequenced before the signal cools. High-intent inbound is qualified and routed in under 30 minutes. See how Oliv AI supports sales development teams."},"1957":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-114","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#account-managers","content":"An account manager gets the full account history before every call. Olivia surfaces the revival window before an account goes dark, and expansion signals from calls nobody would review by hand."},"1958":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-115","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#cs-managers","content":"Expansion signals from customer calls reach sales the same day, without anyone asking. At-risk accounts surface before the renewal window closes, and every call updates portfolio health. More on Oliv AI for customer success teams."},"1959":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-116","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#compare","content":"Many revenue tools now answer plain-language questions about deals. Oliv AI's Olivia agent also hands the work to specialist agents, raises deal risk on her own, and lets you choose per conversation whether she asks before she acts. Oliv AI is the only platform in this table that does all four."},"1960":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-117","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#compare","content":"Revenue assistant features, from each platform's public documentation:"},"1961":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-118","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#compare","content":"| Platform    | Plain-language questions on deals and pipeline | Hands tasks to specialist agents | Deal risk raised automatically | Ask-before-acting setting per conversation |\n| ----------- | ---------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------- | ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------ |\n| **Oliv AI** | Yes                                            | Yes                              | Yes                            | Yes                                        |","table":"table-1"},"1962":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-119","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#compare","content":"| Platform | Plain-language questions on deals and pipeline | Hands tasks to specialist agents         | Deal risk raised automatically | Ask-before-acting setting per conversation |\n| -------- | ---------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- | ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------ |\n| **Gong** | Yes (Gong Assistant)                           | Partly (runs your saved personal agents) | Yes (AI Deal Monitor warnings) | Not in docs                                |","table":"table-1"},"1963":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-120","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#compare","content":"| Platform  | Plain-language questions on deals and pipeline | Hands tasks to specialist agents | Deal risk raised automatically | Ask-before-acting setting per conversation |\n| --------- | ---------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------- | ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------ |\n| **Avoma** | Yes (Global Ask Avoma)                         | Not in docs                      | Yes (Deal Health Score)        | Not in docs                                |","table":"table-1"},"1964":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-121","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#compare","content":"| Platform      | Plain-language questions on deals and pipeline | Hands tasks to specialist agents | Deal risk raised automatically | Ask-before-acting setting per conversation |\n| ------------- | ---------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------- | ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------ |\n| **Fireflies** | Yes (Global AskFred)                           | Not in docs                      | Yes (Deal Intelligence)        | Not in docs                                |","table":"table-1"},"1965":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-122","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#compare","content":"| Platform   | Plain-language questions on deals and pipeline | Hands tasks to specialist agents | Deal risk raised automatically | Ask-before-acting setting per conversation |\n| ---------- | ---------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------- | ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------ |\n| **Fathom** | Yes (Account-Wide Ask Fathom)                  | Not in docs                      | Partly (answers on deal risks) | Not in docs                                |","table":"table-1"},"1966":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-123","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#compare","content":"| Platform     | Plain-language questions on deals and pipeline | Hands tasks to specialist agents | Deal risk raised automatically | Ask-before-acting setting per conversation |\n| ------------ | ---------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------- | ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------ |\n| **Outreach** | Yes (Omni)                                     | Not in docs                      | Yes (Deal Health)              | Not in docs                                |","table":"table-1"},"1967":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-124","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#compare","content":"*Yes: documented and built in. Partly: documented with a limit, shown in brackets. Not in docs: not found in the vendor's public documentation.*"},"1968":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-125","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#compare-stronger","content":"**Work handed off, not just answered.** Olivia dispatches the right specialist agent for each task and reports back. Gong's help centre describes agents as personal assets that each team member creates for their own use. Compare Oliv AI vs Gong."},"1969":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-126","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#compare-stronger","content":"**Answers that lead to action.** Olivia drafts the follow-up and surfaces CRM updates for review after a call. Avoma describes Global Ask Avoma as an assistant for asking questions about your organization's data. Compare Oliv AI vs Avoma."},"1970":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-127","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#compare-stronger","content":"**You set how far she goes.** Olivia opens each conversation on **Ask before acting**, and you can switch to **Act without asking**. Gong documents that its agents don't perform actions in external systems. See Oliv AI as a Gong alternative."},"1971":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-128","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#compare-stronger","content":"*Competitor details checked against each vendor's public documentation on 21 October 2026. Features and plans change, so confirm with the vendor before you decide.*"},"1972":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-129","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#limits","content":"**Not in the marketplace.** Browsing agents won't find Olivia. Reach her on the **Ask** tab, through **Ask** on another screen or from an **Agent Feed** row."},"1973":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-130","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#limits","content":"**One history per super agent.** Saved chats with Olivia and with Oliver sit in separate lists, so switch the picker to find a conversation."},"1974":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-131","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#limits","content":"**English only.** Olivia works in English."},"1975":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-132","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#limits","content":"**No warning on Act without asking.** Oliver shows a **High Risk** banner for this setting and Olivia doesn't, so check the dropdown before you leave a conversation."},"1976":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-133","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#limits","content":"**Hand-offs show in the work, not in a log.** A brief groups each piece under the agent that did it, and delegated work carries a \"Drafted by\" line."},"1977":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-134","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#limits","content":"**She doesn't own process.** Stages, ownership and handoffs are set through Oliver."},"1978":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-135","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#faq-who","content":"Oliv AI's Olivia agent is the agent you talk to rather than configure. She introduces herself as your chief of AI staff and works through Oliv AI's specialist agents."},"1979":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-136","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#faq-same-for-everyone","content":"Yes. She's one agent for the whole revenue org. She adapts to each rep's accounts and deals, and Oliver keeps her within company process."},"1980":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-137","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#faq-vs-oliver","content":"Oliver is the back-end super agent that RevOps and leadership configure. Olivia is the front-facing one the revenue team works with. Oliver sets the rules and Olivia runs the plays."},"1981":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-138","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#faq-vs-individual-agents","content":"Individual agents are specialists, but they don't know your full situation. Olivia does, so she picks the right agent, gives it the context and brings back the result."},"1982":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-139","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#faq-slack","content":"Yes. She surfaces alerts and drives execution through Slack, Teams, or within the Oliv product."},"1983":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-140","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#faq-autonomy","content":"Yes. The dropdown beneath the message box offers **Ask before acting** and **Act without asking**. It opens on **Ask before acting** in each conversation."},"1984":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-141","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#faq-monitoring","content":"Her introduction says she monitors your conversations in the background and proactively takes care of things for you."},"1985":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-142","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#faq-see-work","content":"Her work shows up as rows in the **Agent Feed**. In a chat, her answers group each piece of work under the agent that produced it."},"1986":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-143","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#faq-saved","content":"Yes. The history panel lists your saved chats with Olivia, with search and **New Chat**. Oliver keeps a separate list of his own."},"1987":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-144","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#faq-other-screens","content":"Yes. Press **Ask** in the header of a screen such as the Forecast board, and she opens in a side panel beside it."},"1988":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-145","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#faq-needs","content":"A recording or transcript input such as Oliv Notetaker, a CRM connection and a calendar. Email and LinkedIn or Sales Navigator are optional."},"1989":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-146","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#faq-sold-separately","content":"No. She's the front-facing interface through which the Oliv platform is experienced. For plans, see Oliv AI pricing."},"1990":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-147","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#related","content":"Olivia, Chief of AI Staff: the Olivia agent's page on oliv.ai."},"1991":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-148","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#related","content":"The Oliver agent: the super agent that sets the rules Olivia works within."},"1992":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-149","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#related","content":"AI agents vs AI copilots: why an agent that acts differs from one that only answers."},"1993":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-150","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#related","content":"How agentic sales automation works: the multi-agent model Olivia orchestrates."},"1994":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-151","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#related","content":"RevOps and Oliv AI: how revenue operations sets up the process Olivia follows."},"1995":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-152","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#related","content":"The Deal Driver agent docs: the manager's view of the same pipeline."},"1996":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-153","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#related","content":"Run deals as an account executive: how an AE uses Olivia alongside the other agents."},"1997":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-154","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#related","content":"Oliv AI product documentation: every documented agent and feature."},"1998":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse","type":"page","content":"Converse app","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps/converse"},"1999":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse-0","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse","content":"What Oliv AI's Converse app captures, from online meetings and phone calls to email and Slack, what you get after each conversation, and how it compares with other conversation intelligence tools."},"2000":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse-1","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps/converse#at-a-glance","content":"At a glance"},"2001":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse-2","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps/converse#what-it-is","content":"What the Converse app is"},"2002":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse-3","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps/converse#where-it-lives","content":"Where Converse lives in the product"},"2003":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse-4","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps/converse#app-and-plan","content":"Converse the app and Converse the plan"},"2004":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse-5","