/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#tabs","content":"**Overview.** Key takeaways, the AI summary and the linked deal."},"2340":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-66","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#tabs","content":"**Action Items.** The next meeting, next action and next follow-up, then a task table."},"2341":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-67","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#tabs","content":"**Meeting insights.** What was said against each qualification criterion."},"2342":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-68","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#tabs","content":"**Recording.** The player, chapters, transcript and comments."},"2343":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-69","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#tabs","content":"**Coaching.** A grade for the call and scores per skill."},"2344":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-70","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#tabs","content":"**Attendees.** Who was in the room and where each person stands."},"2345":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-71","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#tabs","content":"**CRM Updates.** What was written back to the CRM after the call."},"2346":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-72","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#shared-view","content":"Each meeting also has a shared view, opened by link at an address of the form `/meeting/view/<id>`. It's for someone who needs to see the meeting from outside your Oliv AI workspace."},"2347":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-73","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#what-its-for","content":"Meeting details is for anyone who needs to know what happened on a call they didn't join. It puts the summary, the transcript and the key moments of one meeting in a single drawer."},"2348":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-74","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#how-it-helps","content":"**The gist in a minute.** Key takeaways and the AI summary are ready as soon as the call ends."},"2349":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-75","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#how-it-helps","content":"**The words, not a paraphrase.** Timestamps link each point back to the moment in the recording."},"2350":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-76","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#how-it-helps","content":"**Qualification without replaying.** Meeting insights files what was said under each criterion."},"2351":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-77","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#how-it-helps","content":"**Easy to pass on.** You clip a moment or share a transcript segment that plays from the right minute."},"2352":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-78","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#without-it","content":"Without a record of the meeting, what was said lives in one person's memory. Commitments made on the call get lost when the account moves to a new owner. The customer then repeats themselves to a team that should already know."},"2353":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-79","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#why-buyers-care","content":"Customer success leaders care at handover, when onboarding has to start from what sales promised. Sales managers care when they coach from calls they didn't attend. Product teams care when they want feature requests in the customer's own words."},"2354":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-80","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#approach","content":"Consider a customer success manager picking up an account that closed on Friday. The kickoff with the customer is on Tuesday. Last week the account executive ran a handover call with the champion to agree what goes live first and who signs off. The CSM wasn't on it."},"2355":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-81","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#approach","content":"The usual route is a short recap message from the AE and a skim of the CRM notes. Some CSMs block an hour to watch the full recording. Each path likely costs time, and a recap written from memory can drop the one integration the champion called a must-have."},"2356":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-82","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#approach","content":"The details already exist on the recording. What the CSM needs is the champion's priorities and open concerns, in their own words, before Tuesday. Reading a whole transcript to find two or three moments is the slow part."},"2357":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-83","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#approach","content":"Oliv AI turns the handover call into a record the CSM can scan. The takeaways sit on the first tab, each with a timestamp into the recording. The **Attendees** tab shows where the champion stands. Then the CSM shares the right transcript segment with the onboarding lead, starting at the right minute."},"2358":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-84","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#approach","content":"The same summary and full call transcript also land on the opportunity record in the CRM. The CSM can find them there without opening Oliv AI. That CRM record is one of the points covered in How meeting details compares, below."},"2359":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-85","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#read-a-meeting","content":"Open **Activities › Meetings** and click the meeting, or press **Open Meeting** in the Slack message about it."},"2360":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-86","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#read-a-meeting","content":"Read **Key takeaways** and the **AI Summary** on **Overview**. Click a blue timestamp to hear that moment."},"2361":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-87","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#read-a-meeting","content":"Open **Action Items** to see what was agreed, who owns it and when it's due."},"2362":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-88","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#read-a-meeting","content":"Open **Meeting insights** to check qualification, or **Recording** to replay and read along."},"2363":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-89","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#read-a-meeting","content":"Click **Review Deal** on the deal card to go to the linked deal."},"2364":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-90","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#read-a-meeting","content":"If you'd rather get the summary without opening the drawer, the Slack meeting summary arrives as soon as the meeting ends. It carries the meeting details, key takeaways and next steps. For ways to structure what you capture, see meeting summary templates."},"2365":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-91","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#summary","content":"**Key takeaways** lists the main points of the call, each with blue timestamps that link back to the recording. The **AI Summary** card holds longer headed entries, also timestamped. Below them, a deal updates card shows the linked deal's stage, amount and close date, with a **Review Deal** button."},"2366":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-92","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#summary","content":"After a call on an active opportunity, Oliv AI's Meeting Assistant agent also drafts the follow-up email from the transcript. More on AI meeting summaries."},"2367":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-93","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#action-items","content":"Three cards sit across the top: **Next meeting**, **Next action** and **Next follow-up**. The next meeting carries its RSVP status, such as **Accepted**, and a late follow-up shows **Overdue**. Below them, a **Tasks** table lists each commitment with an **Assignee** and a **Due Date**."},"2368":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-94","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#action-items","content":"Action Items turns what was agreed on the call into owned, dated tasks, and each timestamp takes you back to the moment the commitment was made."},"2369":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-95","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#action-items","content":"Each task links to the moment in the recording where it was agreed. Tick a task off, change the **Pending** status filter, or press **Add task** to add one by hand."},"2370":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-96","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#meeting-insights","content":"Meeting insights files what was said under each criterion of your qualification framework. A row of chips jumps to each section: **Metrics**, **Economic Buyer**, **Decision Criteria**, **Decision Process**, **Paper Process**, **Identify Pain**, **Champion** and **Additional Fields**."},"2371":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-97","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#meeting-insights","content":"Meeting insights lets a manager check qualification without listening to the call, and a card that says nothing was discussed marks the gap to close on the next one."},"2372":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-98","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#meeting-insights","content":"Each section holds evidence cards with timestamps. Where nothing was said, the card states it rather than guessing. The criteria follow the methodology active in **Settings › Qualification Framework**, so a team on another framework sees its own criteria."},"2373":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-99","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#recording","content":"The **Recording** tab holds the player, with **Add Comment**, **Clip** and **Share** beneath it. A **Timeline** groups speakers by company and shows each person's **Talk time** and **Engagement**. On the right, **Chapters**, **Transcripts** and **Comments** let you jump to a section, read along or see your team's notes."},"2374":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-100","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#recording","content":"The Recording tab is where you find a moment by chapter or transcript, then clip it, comment on it or share the meeting, without scrubbing through the whole call."},"2375":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-101","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#coaching","content":"The **Coaching** tab grades the call and scores the rep's skills out of 5. Skill groups such as **Solution Presentation**, **Value Storytelling**, **Prospect Engagement**, **Objection Handling** and **Driving Action** each break into sub-skills. A **Summary** card names one **Improvement Required** and one **Strength**."},"2376":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-102","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#coaching","content":"Coaching shows a manager where a rep needs help on this call, skill by skill, with the framework scorecard beside it, so a 1:1 can start from evidence."},"2377":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-103","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#coaching","content":"A scorecard radar shows coverage of each qualification criterion, with a badge counting how many improved. Click any skill in the left list to see the evidence behind its score. Oliv AI's Coach agent does the scoring, using the scorecards set in **Settings › Coaching Scorecard**."},"2378":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-104","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#attendees","content":"The **Attendees** tab sorts the people on the call into **Buying Committee** and **Other Contacts**, with a search box. Each person gets a card with their sentiment, such as **Ally** or **Neutral**, whether they are a **Decision Maker**, and an access level such as **In-Depth Access** or **Limited Access**."},"2379":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-105","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#attendees","content":"Attendees maps the buying committee from one call, so you can see who decides, who is on your side and who barely spoke before the next meeting."},"2380":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-106","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#attendees","content":"Each card also shows talk time, engagement and **Key Attendee Insights** with timestamps. **View Contact** opens the person's full contact record."},"2381":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-107","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#crm-updates","content":"The **CRM Updates** tab is a timeline of the changes made after the meeting. A green check marks a completed change, such as an account summary refresh, a scorecard update or a new contact. A grey clock marks a **Pending Update** that waits for you, such as a stage move."},"2382":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-108","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#crm-updates","content":"CRM Updates shows RevOps exactly what this meeting changed in the CRM, and which change, like a stage move, is still waiting for a person to confirm."},"2383":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-109","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#crm-updates","content":"Press **Update Deal** to act on a pending change. **View Account**, **View Deal** and **View Contact** open the record that changed. The keep the CRM updated guide covers the wider flow."},"2384":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-110","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#objections","content":"Oliv AI's Content Curator agent watches for **Objections**, one of its three moment types. Its **Detect Moments** tool tags moments by type, such as product requests, competitor mentions and objections. You can also search a meeting for the exact objection or pricing concern yourself."},"2385":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-111","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#competitor-mentions","content":"**Competitor Mentions** is another of Content Curator's moment types. It looks for mentions of competitors, or feature by feature comparisons, so you see how a competitor came up."},"2386":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-112","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#product-requests","content":"**Product Requests** is the third moment type. Its public page lists product feedback among the moments a team can ask it to watch for. Clips can go into a clip library for the product team."},"2387":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-113","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#sentiment","content":"Sentiment shows per person on the **Attendees** tab, as **Ally** or **Neutral** for example. When Content Curator maps a conversation, it also reads the meeting's sentiment and how it flowed. Converse reads sentiment and intent instead of matching words."},"2388":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-114","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#voice-of-the-customer","content":"**Ask AI · Voice of the customer** is listed among the customer context features on every plan, as a credit-based feature. Details are on Oliv AI pricing."},"2389":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-115","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#ask-questions","content":"The **Ask** button sits at the right of the meeting drawer. You can also ask Oliv AI's Olivia agent about a call in plain language. Ask her to draft the follow-up from your call this afternoon, and she pulls from the meeting transcript and drafts it."},"2390":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-116","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#ask-questions","content":"Every plan includes asking questions and reviewing conversations, opportunities and accounts. **Ask AI** is credit-based on every plan. AI agent actions are paid through credits, for tasks such as researching an account or updating CRM records."},"2391":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-117","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#share","content":"On the **Recording** tab, **Clip** cuts a moment, **Add Comment** notes a point in the call and **Share** shares the meeting. To share part of the transcript instead:"},"2392":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-118","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#share","content":"In the transcript, find the minute marker where the moment starts."},"2393":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-119","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#share","content":"Check the box beside the segment you want to share."},"2394":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-120","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#share","content":"Copy the selected portion."},"2395":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-121","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#share","content":"Open it in a new tab. Playback begins from that minute."},"2396":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-122","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#share","content":"To share the whole meeting with someone outside your workspace, use its shared view, which opens by link. To keep a moment for your own team, clip it into a clip library instead. The guide to taking notes during sales calls covers what to capture by hand."},"2397":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-123","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#with-meeting-assistant","content":"Oliv AI's Meeting Assistant agent runs on Oliv Notetaker recordings and transcripts. After the meeting it drafts the follow-up and flags what needs updating in the CRM. The prepare for a meeting guide covers its brief before the next call."},"2398":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-124","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#with-crm-manager","content":"Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent attaches the AI-generated summary and the full call transcript to the opportunity record. It writes the field updates Meeting Assistant proposes, as a layer on top of your CRM. Its changes for this meeting show on the **CRM Updates** tab."},"2399":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-125","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#with-coach","content":"Oliv AI's Coach agent fills the **Coaching** tab. It grades the call against the scorecard for meetings and scores each skill, so a manager can coach from the call without joining it."},"2400":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-126","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#with-content-curator","content":"Oliv AI's Content Curator agent runs when a meeting is completed. Each clip carries a short explanation of why it was captured, plus the participants, timestamp, call date and a link to the recording."},"2401":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-127","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#with-cs-agents","content":"Oliv AI's Gold Digger agent quotes the transcript, with a timestamp link to the exact moment, when it spots an expansion signal. Oliv AI's Portfolio Manager agent flags account risk signals, including a sentiment shift."},"2402":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-128","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#customer-success","content":"A CSM reads the handover call before kickoff, so onboarding starts from what the customer was promised. More on Oliv AI for customer success teams."},"2403":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-129","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#account-managers","content":"An account manager checks the last QBR before a renewal conversation, including any competitor the customer mentioned. See Oliv AI for account management."},"2404":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-130","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#account-executives","content":"An AE works the **Action Items** tab before sending the follow-up, so every agreed task has an owner and a date. See how AEs run deals with Oliv AI."},"2405":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-131","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#enablement-and-product","content":"A manager reads **Meeting insights** and **Coaching** before a 1:1. An enablement lead clips a strong objection handle for onboarding. Read about sales enablement software."},"2406":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-132","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#compare","content":"Most meeting tools write an AI summary and send notes to the CRM. Oliv AI also turns a plain-language description of a moment into clips that are cut, filed and shared for you. Oliv AI is the only platform in this table that does all three."},"2407":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-133","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#compare","content":"Meeting record features, from each platform's public documentation:"},"2408":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-134","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#compare","content":"| Platform    | AI summary with next steps | Clips cut from a description you write | Meeting notes written to the CRM record |\n| ----------- | -------------------------- | -------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| **Oliv AI** | Yes                        | Yes                                    | Yes                                     |","table":"table-1"},"2409":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-135","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#compare","content":"| Platform | AI summary with next steps            | Clips cut from a description you write     | Meeting notes written to the CRM record            |\n| -------- | ------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Gong** | Yes (Highlights recap and next steps) | Partly (AI trackers mark matching moments) | Yes (Highlights and Transcript tabs in Salesforce) |","table":"table-1"},"2410":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-136","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#compare","content":"| Platform  | AI summary with next steps          | Clips cut from a description you write | Meeting notes written to the CRM record    |\n| --------- | ----------------------------------- | -------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| **Avoma** | Yes (Key Takeaways with next steps) | Partly (custom categories for notes)   | Yes (notes and action items pushed to CRM) |","table":"table-1"},"2411":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-137","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#compare","content":"| Platform      | AI summary with next steps     | Clips cut from a description you write | Meeting notes written to the CRM record    |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------ | -------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| **Fireflies** | Yes (summary and action items) | Partly (AI picks the key moments)      | Yes (notes and transcript link in HubSpot) |","table":"table-1"},"2412":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-138","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#compare","content":"| Platform   | AI summary with next steps       | Clips cut from a description you write        | Meeting notes written to the CRM record |\n| ---------- | -------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| **Fathom** | Yes (summaries and action items) | Partly (highlight button pressed on the call) | Yes (summaries written to Salesforce)   |","table":"table-1"},"2413":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-139","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#compare","content":"*Yes: documented and built in. Partly: documented with a limit, shown in brackets. Not in docs: not found in the vendor's public documentation.*"},"2414":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-140","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#compare-stronger","content":"**Moments become clips, filed and posted.** Content Curator cuts each match into a clip, files it in a library and posts it to a chat channel. Gong's tracker results appear as timestamps in the Points of interest tab. Compare Oliv AI vs Gong."},"2415":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-141","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#compare-stronger","content":"**You describe the moment, not the category.** You tell Content Curator what belongs in plain language, with no keyword lists. Avoma lets you create custom categories to organize meeting notes. Compare Oliv AI vs Avoma."},"2416":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-142","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#compare-stronger","content":"**The full transcript travels with the summary.** Oliv AI attaches the AI summary and the full call transcript to the opportunity record. Avoma documents pushing meeting notes, action items, and insights to the CRM. See Gong vs Avoma for where Oliv AI fits."},"2417":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-143","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#compare-stronger","content":"*Competitor details checked against each vendor's public documentation on 21 October 2026. Features and plans change, so confirm with the vendor before you decide.*"},"2418":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-144","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#limits","content":"**Ask AI uses credits.** **Ask AI · Voice of the customer** is credit-based on every plan. See plan details on oliv.ai."},"2419":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-145","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#limits","content":"**Insights follow one framework.** Meeting insights and the scorecard radar use the methodology active in **Settings › Qualification Framework**."},"2420":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-146","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#limits","content":"**Some CRM changes wait for you.** A **Pending Update**, such as a stage move, stays pending until someone confirms it with **Update Deal**."},"2421":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-147","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#limits","content":"**Clips live in Enable.** The clips route opens the **Library** tab of the Enable app."},"2422":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-148","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#limits","content":"**Transcript sharing starts at a minute marker.** A shared segment plays from the minute marker you picked."},"2423":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-149","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#limits","content":"**Meeting Assistant needs an active opportunity.** Its follow-up and field updates cover meetings linked to an active opportunity in your CRM."},"2424":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-150","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#faq-open","content":"Open **Activities › Meetings** and click the meeting. Or press **Open Meeting** in the Slack message Oliv AI sent about it."},"2425":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-151","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#faq-tabs","content":"Seven: **Overview**, **Action Items**, **Meeting insights**, **Recording**, **Coaching**, **Attendees** and **CRM Updates**."},"2426":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-152","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#faq-summary-ready","content":"The AI summary and next steps are ready as soon as the call ends. The Slack meeting summary is sent immediately after the meeting ends."},"2427":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-153","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#faq-speakers","content":"Yes. Oliv AI transcribes the conversation and labels every speaker. The **Recording** tab also shows each speaker's talk time."},"2428":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-154","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#faq-qualification","content":"Yes. **Meeting insights** files what was said under each criterion, with timestamps, and says so when a criterion wasn't discussed."},"2429":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-155","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#faq-objection","content":"Yes. Search for the exact objection, competitor mention or pricing concern, then clip it into a clip library."},"2430":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-156","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#faq-competitors","content":"Oliv AI's Content Curator agent has a **Competitor Mentions** moment type for mentions of competitors or feature by feature comparisons."},"2431":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-157","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#faq-product","content":"Yes. Content Curator's moment types include **Product Requests**, and clips can go into a library for product."},"2432":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-158","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#faq-share-part","content":"Find the minute marker, check the box for the segment and copy it. Opened in a new tab, it plays from that minute."},"2433":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-159","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#faq-outside","content":"Yes. Each meeting has a shared, link-accessible view for someone opening it outside the workspace."},"2434":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-160","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#faq-crm","content":"Yes. The AI-generated summary and the full call transcript are attached to the opportunity record. The **CRM Updates** tab lists every change made."},"2435":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-161","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#faq-ask","content":"Yes. Use **Ask** in the drawer, or ask Olivia, for example to draft the follow-up from a call, and she works from the transcript."},"2436":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-162","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#related","content":"Converse app: the conversation capture app behind every meeting record."},"2437":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-163","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#related","content":"Meeting transcription software compared: how transcripts differ across tools."},"2438":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-164","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#related","content":"Meaning extraction vs dumping transcripts into LLMs: why Oliv AI reads context rather than keywords."},"2439":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details-165","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details#related","content":"The Deal Driver agent docs: how meeting signals feed deal risk for managers."},"2440":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeting-details