:"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#account-executives","content":"Account executives"},"2466":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-23","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#sales-development","content":"Sales development"},"2467":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-24","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#sales-managers","content":"Sales managers"},"2468":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-25","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#customer-success","content":"Customer success"},"2469":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-26","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#compare","content":"How the Meetings list compares"},"2470":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-27","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#compare-stronger","content":"Why Oliv AI is the stronger choice for finding past meetings"},"2471":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-28","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#limits","content":"Limits and things to know"},"2472":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-29","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#common-questions","content":"Common questions"},"2473":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-30","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#faq-where","content":"Where is the Meetings list?"},"2474":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-31","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#faq-by-date","content":"How do I find a meeting from a specific day?"},"2475":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-32","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#faq-phrase","content":"Can I search for something that was said?"},"2476":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-33","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#faq-team","content":"Can I see my team's meetings?"},"2477":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-34","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#faq-columns","content":"What does each row show?"},"2478":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-35","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#faq-calls","content":"Are phone calls in the Meetings list?"},"2479":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-36","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#faq-slack","content":"How do I open a meeting from Slack?"},"2480":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-37","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#faq-tomorrow","content":"When does the list of tomorrow's meetings arrive?"},"2481":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-38","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#faq-prep","content":"When does the prep summary arrive?"},"2482":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-39","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#faq-stop","content":"Can I stop the Slack messages?"},"2483":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-40","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#faq-setup","content":"Do I need to set up these messages?"},"2484":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-41","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#faq-not-recorded","content":"Why did a meeting not record?"},"2485":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-42","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#related","content":"Related"},"2486":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-43","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","content":"The Meetings list is where every customer meeting Oliv AI has captured is kept. It sits under **Activities › Meetings** and shows each meeting with its length, who it was with, the next step and an AI summary. You can search it, switch to your team's meetings, or skip it and open a meeting from the Slack message Oliv AI sends after the call."},"2487":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-44","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                                              |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **What it does** | Lists your captured meetings and opens each meeting's record |","table":"table-0"},"2488":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-45","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#at-a-glance","content":"|                 |                                                  |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Where it is** | **Activities › Meetings** in the main navigation |","table":"table-0"},"2489":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-46","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#at-a-glance","content":"|          |                                                                    |\n| -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Tabs** | **My meetings** and **Team meetings**, plus a **Favorites** toggle |","table":"table-0"},"2490":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-47","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#at-a-glance","content":"|             |                                                                               |\n| ----------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Columns** | **Meeting**, **Duration**, **Meeting with**, **Next Step** and **AI Summary** |","table":"table-0"},"2491":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-48","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#at-a-glance","content":"|                            |                                                                                                    |\n| -------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **How you find a meeting** | **Search**, **Group**, **Fields**, **Sort** and **Filter**, or **Open Meeting** in a Slack message |","table":"table-0"},"2492":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-49","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#at-a-glance","content":"|                 |                                                      |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Phone calls** | Kept in their own list, under **Activities › Calls** |","table":"table-0"},"2493":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-50","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                                               |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Who it's for** | Account executives, SDRs, sales managers and customer success |","table":"table-0"},"2494":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-51","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#what-it-is","content":"The Meetings list shows the meetings captured in your workspace in a grid. Each row is the way into one meeting record, with its recording, transcript and notes. Clicking a row opens that meeting's details in a drawer over the list."},"2495":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-52","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#what-it-is","content":"The Meetings list puts each captured meeting's type, next step and AI summary in one row, so you can see where a conversation landed before you open it."},"2496":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-53","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#what-it-is","content":"The list belongs to Converse, Oliv AI's conversation capture app. Online meetings are recorded one of two ways: botlessly through the meeting platform when your company hosts, or by a visible note taker when someone else does."},"2497":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-54","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#row-columns","content":"**Meeting.** A video icon, the meeting title, and the date and time it was held."},"2498":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-55","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#row-columns","content":"**Duration.** How long the meeting ran, in minutes."},"2499":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-56","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#row-columns","content":"**Meeting with.** A dropdown that classifies the meeting as **Prospect**, **Customer**, **Candidate** or **Colleague**."},"2500":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-57","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#row-columns","content":"**Next Step.** The next step Oliv AI picked out of the call, with a colour-coded status icon."},"2501":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-58","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#row-columns","content":"**AI Summary.** The opening of the meeting's AI summary."},"2502":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-59","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#tabs-and-views","content":"**My meetings** shows the meetings you were in, with a count badge. **Team meetings** widens the list beyond your own calls, which is how a manager reviews the team's week. **Favorites** keeps the meetings you return to most within reach."},"2503":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-60","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#meetings-and-calls","content":"Phone calls don't appear in the Meetings list. **Activities** opens a menu with two entries, **Meetings** and **Calls**. The **Calls** list works the same way, with its own columns for direction, disposition, owner, company and deal."},"2504":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-61","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#meetings-and-calls","content":"Phone calls live in their own Calls list, with direction, disposition, owner and linked deal, so look there when the conversation you need was a call rather than a meeting."},"2505":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-62","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#what-its-for","content":"The Meetings list is for getting back to a conversation you've already had. It gives every rep one place to find a customer meeting, without asking who was on the call."},"2506":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-63","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#how-it-helps","content":"**One place to look.** Every captured meeting in the workspace is in the same grid."},"2507":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-64","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#how-it-helps","content":"**The outcome at a glance.** Each row shows the next step and the start of the AI summary."},"2508":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-65","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#how-it-helps","content":"**Found by date or phrase.** You search for the day it happened or the words that were said."},"2509":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-66","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#how-it-helps","content":"**One press from Slack.** The message after a meeting links straight to it."},"2510":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-67","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#without-it","content":"A recording nobody can find is close to a recording nobody made. Reps rebuild what a buyer said from memory, or walk into the next meeting without it. Small details, like who raised a concern, get lost between calls."},"2511":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-68","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#why-buyers-care","content":"Account executives feel it before a late-stage meeting, when the last conversation matters most. Sales managers feel it when a deal changes hands. Customer success feels it at handover, when sales' promises need to be on record."},"2512":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-69","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#approach","content":"Take an account executive with a pricing-stage meeting on Thursday. The buyer's finance lead joined a call about four weeks ago and raised concerns about budget timing. The AE wants to hear exactly how that was put before walking back in."},"2513":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-70","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#approach","content":"Often the AE scrolls back through the calendar to find the date, then scrubs through an hour of recording. Or they message the sales engineer who was there and wait for a reply. That can easily eat half an hour, and the exact words may still be missed. Under time pressure, the AE may simply go in from memory instead."},"2514":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-71","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#approach","content":"The call itself was recorded. What's missing is a fast way back to it at the moment the AE needs it. A recording only helps if it surfaces before the meeting, not after it."},"2515":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-72","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#approach","content":"Oliv AI puts that way back in two places. The afternoon before, a Slack message lists tomorrow's meetings, so Thursday's call is on the AE's radar early. In **Activities › Meetings**, the AE searches for the last call, reads its next step in the row and opens it. From there they can find the exact concern and clip it for the sales engineer."},"2516":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-73","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#approach","content":"Oliv AI's own help article shows the date search with a worked example: a meeting held on June 12th, found by searching for that date. Searching by date is one of the points covered in How the Meetings list compares, below."},"2517":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-74","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#find-a-meeting","content":"Open **Activities** from the main navigation and choose **Meetings**."},"2518":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-75","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#find-a-meeting","content":"Stay on **My meetings**, or switch to **Team meetings** to see your team's calls too."},"2519":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-76","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#find-a-meeting","content":"Use **Search** to locate the meeting. To find a meeting from a particular day, search for its date."},"2520":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-77","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#find-a-meeting","content":"Reshape the grid with **Group**, **Fields**, **Sort** and **Filter**, or open the **Quick Filters** panel from the filter icon beside the search."},"2521":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-78","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#find-a-meeting","content":"Click the row to open the meeting's details, with its recording and notes."},"2522":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-79","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#find-a-meeting","content":"Step 1: the Activities menu holds Meetings and Calls, so this is where you start whenever you need to get back to a past customer conversation."},"2523":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-80","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#find-a-meeting","content":"Clicking a row opens a drawer with seven tabs: **Overview**, **Action Items**, **Meeting insights**, **Recording**, **Coaching**, **Attendees** and **CRM Updates**. A round arrow on its left edge collapses it back to the list."},"2524":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-81","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#find-a-meeting","content":"Step 5: a row opens the meeting's drawer on its Overview tab, so the takeaways and deal context are one click away from the list."},"2525":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-82","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#find-a-meeting","content":"If you're after one moment, search for the exact objection, competitor mention or pricing concern. Then clip the moment into a clip library, so you can share it with a colleague before the meeting. For more on getting ready, read how to prepare for a sales meeting."},"2526":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-83","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#meeting-with","content":"Change the **Meeting with** dropdown in the row to **Prospect**, **Customer**, **Candidate** or **Colleague**. The same dropdown sits in the header of the meeting drawer, so you can correct it from either place."},"2527":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-84","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#from-slack","content":"You don't have to start in the list. When you get a Slack message about a meeting, press **Open Meeting** in the message. It takes you to Oliv AI, where you open the green tab the help center points to."},"2528":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-85","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#from-slack","content":"Once Oliv AI is connected to Slack, three messages start arriving with no setup:"},"2529":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-86","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#from-slack","content":"**Summary of tomorrow's meetings.** Sent at 4 PM local time, it lists the meetings Oliv AI will summarize the next day."},"2530":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-87","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#from-slack","content":"**Prep summary.** Sent 10 minutes before a meeting, with its title, date, time, participants and account, plus research on the account and contact."},"2531":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-88","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#from-slack","content":"**Meeting summary.** Sent as soon as the meeting ends, with the key takeaways and next steps."},"2532":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-89","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#from-slack","content":"The same messages go to your email by default. To stop them, turn them off on your **Profile Settings** page. Setup steps are on the Oliv AI integrations page."},"2533":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-90","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#which-meetings","content":"Which way a meeting is recorded depends on who organized it, when botless recording is enabled for your organization:"},"2534":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-91","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#which-meetings","content":"**Your company organized it.** Oliv AI records through the meeting platform, such as Zoom or Microsoft Teams. Attendees see the platform's own recording indicator, not an extra participant."},"2535":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-92","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#which-meetings","content":"**Someone outside organized it.** A note taker joins as a visible participant, shown with your company's name. If the meeting has a waiting room or lobby, admit it so recording can begin."},"2536":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-93","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#which-meetings","content":"If botless recording isn't set up, Oliv Support can help enable it with your video conferencing admin."},"2537":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-94","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#with-meeting-assistant","content":"For meetings linked to an active opportunity, Oliv AI's Meeting Assistant agent sends a brief 30 minutes before the call. It covers the deal summary, qualification status, stakeholders and a recommended agenda. The prepare for a meeting guide walks through it."},"2538":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-95","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#with-olivia","content":"You can ask Oliv AI's Olivia agent to draft the follow-up from a call, and she pulls from the meeting transcript. It saves opening the meeting yourself when you only need the email."},"2539":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-96","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#with-deal-driver","content":"Every captured meeting feeds the same record that Oliv AI's Deal Driver agent reads to flag deals at risk. A manager reviewing a flagged deal can open the meetings behind it from the **Team meetings** tab."},"2540":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-97","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#with-content-curator","content":"Oliv AI's Content Curator agent watches every new recording and clips the moments your team has described. Its clips keep a link back to the full source recording."},"2541":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-98","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#account-executives","content":"An AE goes back to the last call before a late-stage meeting, to hear what the buyer actually said. More on how AEs run deals with Oliv AI, and Oliv AI for account executives."},"2542":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-99","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#sales-development","content":"An SDR checks the discovery call before handing a qualified meeting to an AE, so nothing said on it is lost. See Oliv AI for sales development teams."},"2543":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-100","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#sales-managers","content":"A manager opens **Team meetings** before a 1:1 and reads each rep's next steps down the column. Then they open one meeting to coach from what happened. See Oliv AI for sales managers."},"2544":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-101","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#customer-success","content":"A CSM finds the sales calls for a new account, so onboarding starts from what the customer was promised. More on Oliv AI for customer success teams."},"2545":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-102","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#compare","content":"Most meeting tools let you search past calls and clip moments. Oliv AI also links each Slack message straight to its meeting and lists tomorrow's meetings in Slack the afternoon before. Oliv AI is the only platform in this table that does all four."},"2546":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-103","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#compare","content":"Finding past meetings, from each platform's public documentation:"},"2547":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-104","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meeti