gs":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#compare-stronger","content":"**Tomorrow's meetings, in Slack, the day before.** Oliv AI sends the list at 4 PM local time. Gong's daily digest is an email for team members with calls that day. Compare Oliv AI vs Gong."},"2554":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-111","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#compare-stronger","content":"**The link arrives without anyone sharing it.** Each Oliv AI meeting message carries **Open Meeting** automatically. Avoma documents a way to share the meeting link directly to a Slack channel or DM. Compare Oliv AI vs Avoma."},"2555":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-112","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#compare-stronger","content":"**Clips made for the team, not a private shelf.** Oliv AI clips found moments into a library for coaching, enablement or product. Gong describes the call library as a private workspace unless you share. See Oliv AI as a Gong alternative."},"2556":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-113","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#compare-stronger","content":"*Competitor details checked against each vendor's public documentation on 21 October 2026. Features and plans change, so confirm with the vendor before you decide.*"},"2557":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-114","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#limits","content":"**Phone calls are in a separate list.** Look under **Activities › Calls** for them."},"2558":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings-115","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/converse/meetings#limits","content":"**A 