s"},"2758":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-31","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#compare","content":"How the Engage app compares"},"2759":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-32","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#compare-stronger","content":"Why Oliv AI is the stronger choice for sales engagement"},"2760":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-33","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#limits","content":"Limits and things to know"},"2761":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-34","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#common-questions","content":"Common questions"},"2762":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-35","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#faq-what","content":"What is the Engage app?"},"2763":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-36","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#faq-add-on","content":"Is Engage a plan or an add-on?"},"2764":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-37","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#faq-included","content":"What does an Engage seat include?"},"2765":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-38","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#faq-inbox-channels","content":"Which channels does the Inbox show?"},"2766":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-39","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#faq-ranking","content":"How does Engage rank accounts?"},"2767":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-40","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#faq-reranking","content":"Does the list update on its own?"},"2768":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-41","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#faq-play-type","content":"What's the difference between an Outbound and an Inbound play?"},"2769":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-42","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#faq-approve-steps","content":"Do I approve outreach before it goes out?"},"2770":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-43","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#faq-dialer","content":"Does Engage include a dialer?"},"2771":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-44","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#faq-prospector-send","content":"Does Prospector send emails without the rep?"},"2772":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-45","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#faq-find","content":"Where do I find Engage?"},"2773":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-46","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#faq-crm","content":"Does Engage replace my CRM?"},"2774":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-47","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#faq-manager","content":"Can managers see whether reps work the right accounts?"},"2775":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-48","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#related","content":"Related"},"2776":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-49","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage","content":"Engage is Oliv AI's sales engagement app. It gathers prospect replies from email, LinkedIn and WhatsApp in one Inbox, runs plays that enrol contacts on a signal or around the clock, and adds a power dialer with a call plan for every contact. Every account in a play carries its ICP fit and the signal behind it, so reps know who to work and why."},"2777":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-50","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                                                          |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **What it does** | Triages replies, runs plays and flows, ranks accounts and dials contacts |","table":"table-0"},"2778":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-51","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                                                                     |\n| ---------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Who it's for** | SDRs and BDRs, their managers, and anyone who connects with prospects and customers |","table":"table-0"},"2779":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-52","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#at-a-glance","content":"|          |                                                                           |\n| -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Tabs** | **Inbox**, **Dialer**, **Plays**, **Flows**, **Signals**, **Experiments** |","table":"table-0"},"2780":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-53","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#at-a-glance","content":"|                       |                                                       |\n| --------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Included channels** | One connected primary mailbox and LinkedIn automation |","table":"table-0"},"2781":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-54","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#at-a-glance","content":"|                    |                                                           |\n| ------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Added channels** | Dialer, WhatsApp, Telegram, Instagram and extra mailboxes |","table":"table-0"},"2782":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-55","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#at-a-glance","content":"|                       |                                          |\n| --------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| **Where you find it** | **Apps › Engage** in the main navigation |","table":"table-0"},"2783":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-56","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#at-a-glance","content":"|                    |                                              |\n| ------------------ | -------------------------------------------- |\n| **How you get it** | An add-on to the Converse, Sell or Grow plan |","table":"table-0"},"2784":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-57","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#what-it-is","content":"Engage is where your reps prioritize, sequence, multi-thread, call and follow up, with the full account context attached. The product page puts its job plainly: it turns the context your team already creates into a ranked, executable workflow."},"2785":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-58","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#what-it-is","content":"Engage opens on the Inbox. Its six tabs split outbound work into replies, dialing, plays, flows, signals and experiments, and the left panel filters replies by disposition and channel."},"2786":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-59","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#what-it-is","content":"That context comes from the same record the rest of Oliv AI uses. Calls, emails, CRM data, Slack and meetings form one account context that Engage and every agent can read. So a rank in Engage can reflect what a buyer said on a call last week, not only what sits in a sequence tool."},"2787":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-60","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#where-it-lives","content":"**Apps › Engage** opens the Engage home on the **Inbox** tab."},"2788":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-61","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#where-it-lives","content":"Six tabs run along the top: **Inbox**, **Dialer**, **Plays**, **Flows**, **Signals** and **Experiments**."},"2789":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-62","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#where-it-lives","content":"Each **play** opens on its own detail page, with its own tabs and an **Edit Play** button."},"2790":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-63","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#where-it-lives","content":"**Dialer sessions** start from a **Power Dialer** setup page and run in an active-session view."},"2791":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-64","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#add-on","content":"Engage is an add-on, not a plan. You add it to Converse, Sell or Grow for the team members who connect with prospects and customers. Each Engage seat includes one connected primary mailbox and LinkedIn automation. For current prices, see Oliv AI pricing."},"2792":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-65","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#what-its-for","content":"Engage is for outbound teams that need to work the right accounts each day, with a reason to reach out. It gives SDRs, BDRs and their managers one workspace for ranking, outreach and calls."},"2793":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-66","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#how-it-helps","content":"**A ranked list with reasons.** Every account carries its rank and the reason for it."},"2794":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-67","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#how-it-helps","content":"**A next move, not only a task.** Each account comes with a recommended next step for the rep."},"2795":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-68","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#how-it-helps","content":"**Context from the whole account.** Ranks draw on CRM, calls and Slack, not only activity inside one tool."},"2796":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-69","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#how-it-helps","content":"**A list that keeps up.** The list re-ranks the moment a signal changes."},"2797":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-70","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#without-it","content":"Signals sit scattered across calls, email, the CRM and meetings. The next step still comes down to rep judgment, and personalization starts with a rep researching and guessing. Activity gets logged, but nothing learns what moves deals forward."},"2798":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-71","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#why-buyers-care","content":"Sales development leaders care when a rep's book of named accounts grows past what one person can research. Oliv AI's sales development page puts it as 500 named accounts, of which a rep reaches maybe 50. Managers care when they can't tell whether reps are working the right accounts."},"2799":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-72","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#approach","content":"Picture an SDR manager who runs a call block every morning for a team of eight. Each rep carries a few hundred named accounts and two or three outbound plays at once. Before the block starts, the manager wants every rep dialing the accounts that matter this week, with a reason to call each one."},"2800":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-73","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#approach","content":"The usual answer is a sequence tool, a dialer and a spreadsheet. Reps spend the first part of the morning researching, and the list they work from may have been sorted days ago. A good part of the call block can go to preparation rather than conversation."},"2801":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-74","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#approach","content":"Buyers now leave signals in many places. They show up on calls, in email threads, in CRM updates and in Slack. A list that ranks accounts only from activity inside one tool will miss most of them, and it goes stale as soon as something changes."},"2802":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-75","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#approach","content":"Oliv AI ranks every account by ICP fit, engagement and call activity, and shows the reason for each rank. The list re-ranks the moment a signal changes, so the manager sees whether reps are on the right accounts. Oliv AI's Prospector agent writes the outreach, and the dialer puts a tailored call plan beside each contact."},"2803":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-76","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#approach","content":"The Engage add-on names its channels on the pricing page: email, LinkedIn, the dialer, and WhatsApp, Telegram or Instagram. Those channels, with the ranked list, are the columns in How the Engage app compares, below."},"2804":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-77","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#inbox","content":"The **Inbox** collects prospect replies from email, LinkedIn and WhatsApp in one list. Each row shows a channel badge, the sender, a one-line preview and when it arrived."},"2805":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-78","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#inbox","content":"**Filter the list.** Choose **All** or **No Dispositions**, one of five dispositions, **Out of office**, or a channel: **Email**, **LinkedIn** or **Whatsapp**."},"2806":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-79","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#inbox","content":"**Switch views.** **Active** shows open conversations with a count, and **Completed** holds finished ones. **Search** and **Filters** narrow either view."},"2807":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-80","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#inbox","content":"**Open a conversation.** The thread opens in a drawer, with earlier messages collapsed and the latest reply expanded."},"2808":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-81","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#inbox","content":"**Label the reply.** **Select Disposition** offers **Wrong contact**, **Positive**, **Negative**, **Meeting booked** and **Left job**, the same five the Inbox filters by."},"2809":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-82","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#inbox","content":"**Act on it.** Icon buttons flag, assign, forward or delete the conversation."},"2810":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-83","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#inbox","content":"**Reply.** **Reply** opens a composer with the recipient and a \"Re:\" subject filled in from the thread, an attachments row and **Send**."},"2811":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-84","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#prioritization","content":"Engage ranks the accounts in each play by what matters now. A play's **Companies** tab lists every account with its **ICP Fit** grade and score, its **Engagement** (High, Medium or Low) and its **Point of View**: **Validated**, **Contextual**, **Hypotheses** or **Generic**."},"2812":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-85","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#prioritization","content":"The Companies tab is where account ranking shows up in Engage. Each account carries its fit score, how engaged it is and the signal that put it in the play, so reps see which account to push next."},"2813":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-86","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#prioritization","content":"**Ranked by ICP fit, engagement and call activity.** The rank uses the whole account, CRM, calls and Slack included."},"2814":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-87","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#prioritization","content":"**The reason, shown.** Every account shows why it sits where it does. The **Signal** column names the trigger and how many days ago it happened."},"2815":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-88","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#prioritization","content":"**Coverage and stage.** Each row counts the people reached and booked, and shows a **Stage** such as **Meeting Booked** or **Connected**."},"2816":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-89","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#prioritization","content":"**A recommended next move.** Reps get a next step that's ready to act on, not just an assignment."},"2817":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-90","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#prioritization","content":"**A manager view.** It flags whether reps are working the right accounts."},"2818":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-91","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#prioritization","content":"**Live re-ranking.** The list updates the moment a signal changes."},"2819":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-92","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#plays-and-sprints","content":"A play finds the right people and enrols them in outreach. The **Plays** tab lists every play with its **Priority**, **Status** (**Active** or **Inactive**), **Outreach Type** (**Agentic** or **Step-based**), a description and a contact count. You change a play's priority inline: **ASAP**, **High**, **Medium** or **Low**."},"2820":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-93","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#plays-and-sprints","content":"The Plays tab is the team's list of outbound plays. Priority changes inline, and Outreach Type shows whether a play runs agentic outreach or a step-based flow."},"2821":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-94","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#plays-and-sprints","content":"Click a play to open its detail page. Four stage cards track its contacts: **Identified**, **Contacted**, **Replied** and **Meetings Booked**. The header holds the play's owners, a **Pause** button, **Ask** and **Archive**."},"2822":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-95","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#plays-and-sprints","content":"**Details** shows the whole set-up in six read-only sections: Details, Play Type, Target Level, Signal, ICP and Flow, including which persona maps to which flow."},"2823":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-96","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#plays-and-sprints","content":"**Contacts** lists everyone enrolled, with a status from **Booked** to **Not Contacted** and a **Next Step** for each. Chips filter by **All**, **Engaged**, **Hot** and **Stalled**."},"2824":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-97","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#plays-and-sprints","content":"**Companies** ranks the play's accounts, as described in Account prioritization, above."},"2825":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-98","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#plays-and-sprints","content":"**Agentic Outreach** holds the written directives an agentic play follows, from **Overview** and **Week 1** through **Post-Call Protocol** and **Voice & Rules**."},"2826":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-99","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#plays-and-sprints","content":"A play's detail page shows how far its contacts have moved, from identified to meetings booked. The Details tab mirrors the six steps of the Edit Play wizard."},"2827":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-100","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#edit-play","content":"**Edit Play** opens a six-step wizard with a progress bar across the top."},"2828":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-101","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#edit-play","content":"**Details.** Name the play and describe it."},"2829":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-102","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#edit-play","content":"**Play Type.** Choose **Outbound**, which runs continuously against anyone matching your ICP, or **Inbound**, which only fires when a signal triggers."},"2830":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-103","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#edit-play","content":"**Target Level.** Choose **Company**, where messaging varies by persona and a play can use several flows, or **Contact**, which targets one person with a single flow."},"2831":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-104","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#edit-play","content":"**Signal.** Search the signal library and tick one or more signals."},"2832":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-105","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#edit-play","content":"**ICP.** Write the **Target ICP** in plain language, not structured fields, then add or remove personas."},"2833":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-106","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#edit-play","content":"**Flow.** Choose **Structured Flow**, where you pick a flow, map it to personas and approve each step, or **Assign Outreach Agent**, where one agent handles every persona from a written **Prompt**."},"2834":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-107","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#edit-play","content":"Play Type is the first real choice in the wizard. An Inbound play waits for a signal, which is why step 4 then asks you to pick the signals that trigger it."},"2835":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-108","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#flows-signals-experiments","content":"Three tabs hold the building blocks that plays draw on."},"2836":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-109","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#flows-signals-experiments","content":"**Flows** lists each outreach flow with its **Status** (**Active** or **Draft**), senders, progress, contact counts, **Reply Rate** and **Positive Replies**. **Add Flow** creates a new one."},"2837":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-110","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#flows-signals-experiments","content":"**Signals** is the library of buying signals. Each has a topic, a description, a category and a **Source** of **First Party** or **Third Party**. **Add Signal** creates a custom one."},"2838":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-111","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#flows-signals-experiments","content":"**Experiments** tracks small outreach tests with a status of **Running**, **Promoted** or **Stopped**, a start date, a sample size and early replies and meetings."},"2839":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-112","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#flows-signals-experiments","content":"The Signals tab is the library a play picks from at step 4. Each signal carries a category and shows whether it comes from first-party or third-party data."},"2840":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-113","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#email-and-linkedin","content":"Each Engage seat includes one connected primary mailbox and LinkedIn automation. You manage your sending setup from the same workspace as your sequences and follow-ups. When a team needs more volume, you add more warm email mailboxes. For outreach strategy, see the guide to outbound sales software."},"2841":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-114","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#dialer","content":"The dialer is an add-on to Engage. It gives a rep one US phone number, with calling minutes to the US and Canada. The **Dialer** tab lists every session with its type, status, creator, contact list, numbers dialed and connects."},"2842":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-115","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#dialer","content":"The Dialer tab is the home for every calling session. Sessions run as Power or Parallel, and Oliv AI's Prospector agent can create them alongside your reps."},"2843":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-116","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#dialer","content":"**Start a session.** Click **New Session**. On the **Power Dialer** page, pick a **List**, which shows its prospect count, and a **Call using** number, then click **Start a Session**."},"2844":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-117","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#dialer","content":"**Prep each call.** Each contact comes with a **Tailored Call Plan**: an **Attention Grabber**, **Discovery Questions**, **Social Proof** and an **Offer Ladder**."},"2845":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-118","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#dialer","content":"**Dial.** A prep countdown runs on the **Up next** card, and the dial starts automatically when it ends. **Dial now** skips the wait."},"2846":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-119","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#dialer","content":"**Check the context.** The **Contact** tab ranks the person's intent signals with a score. The **Company** tab shows the account's ICP grade with a one-line reason."},"2847":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-120","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#dialer","content":"**Run the call.** Once connected, the card switches to **Record call**, a **Recording method** of **One-way** or **Two-way**, pause, mute and **End Call**."},"2848":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-121","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#dialer","content":"**Close the session.** **End Session** opens **Session Complete**, with tiles for dialled, connects, connect rate, average talk, voicemails dropped, DNC hits and bad numbers."},"2849":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-122","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#dialer","content":"During a call the plan stays on screen, so the rep can follow it while recording, pausing or muting. The figures in the plan shown are sample data, not results."},"2850":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-123","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#dialer","content":"Oliv AI's sales development page describes reps starting a volume session at the parallel dialer, talking rather than waiting between dials."},"2851":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-124","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#more-channels","content":"You choose WhatsApp, Telegram or Instagram one at a time, and each is added per person. Teams pay only for the channels they use. The Oliv AI pricing page lists each channel."},"2852":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-125","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#with-prospector","content":"Oliv AI's Prospector agent gives reps prioritized briefs, a point of view for each account and tailored outreach ready to send. It also builds morning and afternoon dial lists for a rep and creates dial sessions from them. The first email is always reviewed and sent by the rep. Follow-ups after no response are handled automatically by Prospector."},"2853":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-126","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#with-researcher","content":"Oliv AI's Researcher agent does the digging before every dial. Your BDR opens the contact list with briefs already in place. Before a first meeting, Researcher sends a three-bullet summary of the company, the person and an icebreaker. The prepare for a meeting guide covers research on new contacts."},"2854":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-127","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#with-quick-qualifier","content":"Oliv AI's Quick Qualifier agent watches for inbound leads from your website. It checks each one against territory and company-size criteria. It then routes qualified leads to the right rep, with a call script written before they pick up the phone."},"2855":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-128","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#with-olivia","content":"Oliv AI's Olivia agent coordinates tasks across your team. On the Engage page, Olivia builds the day's outreach queue by pulling in Prospector. Each play's detail page also has an **Ask** button, and the agents' work lands back in the same queue your reps already use."},"2856":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-129","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#with-crm-manager-and-forecaster","content":"Engage reads the same account context as Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent and Oliv AI's Forecaster agent. Outreach and the deals it creates sit on one record. Keeping the CRM updated covers how activity reaches your CRM."},"2857":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-130","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#sdrs-and-bdrs","content":"An SDR starts the day in the Inbox, labels each reply with a disposition, then runs a power-dial session with a call plan for every contact. Research and outreach drafts are already done, so the morning goes to calls. More on Oliv AI for sales development teams."},"2858":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-131","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#sdr-managers","content":"A manager sets each play's priority, watches its stage cards and checks which experiments to promote. Each account shows its signal and fit, so a coaching conversation starts from the account, not from activity counts. For the call side of coaching, see Oliv AI's Coach agent."},"2859":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-132","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#account-executives","content":"An AE uses the same workspace to multi-thread and follow up on deals. For expansion, Prospector watches existing customer conversations and alerts the right rep when a signal surfaces. See how AEs run deals with Oliv AI."},"2860":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-133","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#revenue-operations","content":"RevOps defines the ICP and the territory structure, and Prospector runs the build from there. In Engage, that means a plain-language Target ICP and personas in each play, and a shared signal library. The account data comes from your CRM, such as Salesforce or HubSpot."},"2861":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-134","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#compare","content":"Most sales engagement tools sort accounts from data inside their own product. Engage ranks from the whole account and shows the reason for every rank, with LinkedIn automation, a dialer and messaging channels in one workspace. Oliv AI is the only platform in this table that does all four."},"2862":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-135","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#compare","content":"Sales engagement features, from each platform's public documentation:"},"2863":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-136","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#compare","content":"| Platform    | Accounts ranked, reason shown | Built-in dialer | LinkedIn automation | WhatsApp, Telegram or Instagram |\n| ----------- | ----------------------------- | --------------- | ------------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| **Oliv AI** | Yes                           | Yes             | Yes                 | Yes                             |","table":"table-1"},"2864":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-137","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#compare","content":"| Platform | Accounts ranked, reason shown                 | Built-in dialer                       | LinkedIn automation                   | WhatsApp, Telegram or Instagram |\n| -------- | --------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| **Gong** | Partly (sort by CRM values such as fit score) | Yes (Gong Dialer for calls from Gong) | Partly (LinkedIn steps become to-dos) | Not in docs                     |","table":"table-1"},"2865":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-138","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#compare","content":"| Platform     | Accounts ranked, reason shown           | Built-in dialer                | LinkedIn automation                   | WhatsApp, Telegram or Instagram |\n| ------------ | --------------------------------------- | ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| **Outreach** | Partly (third-party Buyer Intent Score) | Yes (dialer in the mobile app) | Partly (AI message pasted in by hand) | Not in docs                     |","table":"table-1"},"2866":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-139","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#compare","content":"| Platform  | Accounts ranked, reason shown           | Built-in dialer                          | LinkedIn automation | WhatsApp, Telegram or Instagram |\n| --------- | --------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- | ------------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| **Avoma** | Partly (filters to prioritize accounts) | Partly (works with your existing dialer) | Not in docs         | Not in docs                     |","table":"table-1"},"2867":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-140","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#compare","content":"| Platform      | Accounts ranked, reason shown | Built-in dialer              | LinkedIn automation | WhatsApp, Telegram or Instagram |\n| ------------- | ----------------------------- | ---------------------------- | ------------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| **Fireflies** | Not in docs                   | Partly (dialer integrations) | Not in docs         | Not in docs                     |","table":"table-1"},"2868":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-141","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#compare","content":"*Yes: documented and built in. Partly: documented with a limit, shown in brackets. Not in docs: not found in the vendor's public documentation.*"},"2869":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-142","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#compare-stronger","content":"**A reason with every rank.** Engage shows why each account sits where it does, using CRM, calls and Slack. Gong's help center describes how to sort by CRM values such as fit score to decide where to focus. Compare Oliv AI vs Gong."},"2870":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-143","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#compare-stronger","content":"**LinkedIn automation in every seat.** Each Engage seat includes LinkedIn automation next to the primary mailbox. Outreach's help center says reps must manually copy and paste the AI-generated message into LinkedIn. Read Gong vs Outreach for how Oliv AI fits that choice."},"2871":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-144","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#compare-stronger","content":"**A dialer in the same workspace.** The Engage dialer gives each rep a US number inside the app, beside the ranked list. Avoma's dialer setup is built to work with your existing dialer. Compare Oliv AI vs Avoma."},"2872":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-145","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#compare-stronger","content":"*Competitor details checked against each vendor's public documentation on 22 October 2026. Features and plans change, so confirm with the vendor before you decide.*"},"2873":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-146","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#limits","content":"**Engage is an add-on.** It sits on top of the Converse, Sell or Grow plan and is priced separately."},"2874":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-147","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#limits","content":"**Calling is its own add-on.** The dialer comes with one US phone number and calling minutes to the US and Canada."},"2875":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-148","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#limits","content":"**Channels are chosen one by one.** WhatsApp, Telegram and Instagram are each added per person."},"2876":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-149","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#limits","content":"**One mailbox is included.** Extra warm email mailboxes are added separately."},"2877":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-150","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#limits","content":"**Reps send the first email.** Prospector's first email is always reviewed and sent by the rep."},"2878":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-151","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#limits","content":"**A play works at one level.** Each play targets either a company or a single contact, and a contact-level play uses a single flow."},"2879":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-152","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#limits","content":"**Inbound plays wait for a signal.** An Inbound play only fires when one of its signals triggers; an Outbound play runs all the time."},"2880":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-153","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#faq-what","content":"Engage is Oliv AI's sales engagement app. It brings replies into one Inbox, runs plays and flows, ranks accounts with a reason for each rank, and adds a power dialer."},"2881":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-154","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#faq-add-on","content":"An add-on. You add it to Converse, Sell or Grow for each team member who connects with prospects and customers."},"2882":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-155","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#faq-included","content":"One connected primary mailbox and LinkedIn automation. The dialer, WhatsApp, Telegram, Instagram and extra mailboxes are added separately."},"2883":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-156","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#faq-inbox-channels","content":"Email, LinkedIn and WhatsApp, each marked with a badge on the conversation. You can filter the Inbox by any one channel."},"2884":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-157","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#faq-ranking","content":"By ICP fit, engagement and call activity, using the whole account, CRM, calls and Slack included. Each account in a play shows its fit grade, engagement and the signal behind it."},"2885":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-158","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#faq-reranking","content":"Yes. The list re-ranks the moment a signal changes."},"2886":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-159","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#faq-play-type","content":"An Outbound play runs continuously against anyone matching your ICP. An Inbound play only fires when a signal triggers, such as a role change or a funding round."},"2887":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-160","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#faq-approve-steps","content":"With a Structured Flow, yes: you review and approve each step. With Assign Outreach Agent, one agent works every persona from the prompt you write."},"2888":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-161","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#faq-dialer","content":"The dialer is an add-on to Engage. It comes with one US phone number and calling minutes to the US and Canada, and runs Power and Parallel sessions."},"2889":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-162","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#faq-prospector-send","content":"Not the first one. The rep always reviews and sends the first email. Prospector handles follow-ups automatically when there's no response."},"2890":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-163","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#faq-find","content":"Open **Apps › Engage** in the main navigation. It opens on the Inbox, with tabs for Dialer, Plays, Flows, Signals and Experiments."},"2891":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-164","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#faq-crm","content":"No. Oliv AI works with your existing CRM. It brings the context together and keeps your systems updated."},"2892":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-165","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#faq-manager","content":"Yes. A manager view flags whether reps are working the right accounts, and each play's stage cards show how far its contacts have moved."},"2893":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-166","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#related","content":"Sales engagement platforms compared: a wider look at sequencing and outreach tools."},"2894":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-167","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#related","content":"AI sales automation explained: use cases for automating sales work with AI."},"2895":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-168","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#related","content":"Process Graph: how Oliv AI writes your playbook down for agents."},"2896":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-169","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#related","content":"Plans overview: the plans Engage is added to."},"2897":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-170","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#related","content":"Converse app: the conversation capture that feeds Engage's account context."},"2898":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-171","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#related","content":"Agents overview: every documented Oliv AI agent."},"2899":{"id":"/product-docs/apps/engage-172","page_id":"/product-docs/apps/engage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps/engage#related","content":"Apps overview: the other Oliv AI apps."},"2900":{"id":"/product-docs/apps","page_id":"/product-docs/apps","type":"page","content":"Apps overview","breadcrumbs":["Oliv AI docs","Apps"],"tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps"},"2901":{"id":"/product-docs/apps-0","page_id":"/product-docs/apps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps","content":"The Oliv AI apps your team works in, from Converse for conversation capture to Engage for outreach, Forecast for the number and Enable for coaching, and how the apps share one record with Oliv AI's agents."},"2902":{"id":"/product-docs/apps-1","page_id":"/product-docs/apps","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps#apps-at-a-glance","content":"The apps at a glance"},"2903":{"id":"/product-docs/apps-2","page_id":"/product-docs/apps","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps#converse","content":"Converse: every customer conversation in one record"},"2904":{"id":"/product-docs/apps-3","page_id":"/product-docs/apps","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps#converse-pages","content":"The Converse pages"},"2905":{"id":"/product-docs/apps-4","page_id":"/product-docs/apps","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps#other-apps","content":"Engage, Forecast and Enable"},"2906":{"id":"/product-docs/apps-5","page_id":"/product-docs/apps","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps#apps-and-agents","content":"How the apps and agents share one record"},"2907":{"id":"/product-docs/apps-6","page_id":"/product-docs/apps","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps#seats-and-apps","content":"Which seat brings which app"},"2908":{"id":"/product-docs/apps-7","page_id":"/product-docs/apps","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/apps#next-steps","content":"Next steps"},"2909":{"id":"/product-docs/apps-8","page_id":"/product-docs/apps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps","content":"Oliv AI's apps are where your team reviews customer context: conversations, opportunities and accounts. Converse captures every customer conversation and makes it searchable. Engage runs outreach, Forecast handles the number, Enable supports coaching, and each person gets the apps their role needs."},"2910":{"id":"/product-docs/apps-9","page_id":"/product-docs/apps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps#apps-at-a-glance","content":"| App          | What it covers                                                              | Where you find it                                    | Where it comes from           |\n| ------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| **Converse** | Capturing online meetings, phone calls, in-person meetings, email and Slack | **Activities › Meetings** and **Activities › Calls** | Converse, Sell and Grow plans |","table":"table-0"},"2911":{"id":"/product-docs/apps-10","page_id":"/product-docs/apps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps#apps-at-a-glance","content":"| App          | What it covers                                          | Where you find it                                             | Where it comes from |\n| ------------ | ------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------- |\n| **Forecast** | Opportunity management: forecast boards and submissions | **Apps › Forecast**, with **Submissions** and **Boards** tabs | Sell and Grow plans |","table":"table-0"},"2912":{"id":"/product-docs/apps-11","page_id":"/product-docs/apps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps#apps-at-a-glance","content":"| App        | What it covers                                                                            | Where you find it                     | Where it comes from |\n| ---------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- | ------------------- |\n| **Retain** | Account management: customer health scorecards, churn risks and retention forecast boards | Renewal views in Forecast and Reports | Grow plan           |","table":"table-0"},"2913":{"id":"/product-docs/apps-12","page_id":"/product-docs/apps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps#apps-at-a-glance","content":"| App        | What it covers                                            | Where you find it                                       | Where it comes from |\n| ---------- | --------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------- |\n| **Enable** | Coaching: team pacing, per-rep reports and clip libraries | **Apps › Enable**, with **Library** and **People** tabs | Add-on              |","table":"table-0"},"2914":{"id":"/product-docs/apps-13","page_id":"/product-docs/apps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps#apps-at-a-glance","content":"| App        | What it covers                                            | Where you find it | Where it comes from |\n| ---------- | --------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------- | ------------------- |\n| **Engage** | Outreach: the Inbox, plays, flows, signals and the dialer | **Apps › Engage** | Add-on              |","table":"table-0"},"2915":{"id":"/product-docs/apps-14","page_id":"/product-docs/apps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps#apps-at-a-glance","content":"The **Apps** menu in the main navigation opens Engage, Forecast and Enable. Converse has no entry of its own there: its meetings and calls sit under **Activities**. The Forecast app page on oliv.ai shows its opportunity views, and sales methodology tracking covers the frameworks it tracks."},"2916":{"id":"/product-docs/apps-15","page_id":"/product-docs/apps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps#converse","content":"The Converse app records and transcribes your team's online meetings, phone calls and in-person conversations. It captures email and Slack the same way. A summary and next steps are ready as soon as a call ends, and every conversation lands in one searchable record."},"2917":{"id":"/product-docs/apps-16","page_id":"/product-docs/apps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps#converse","content":"Converse's captured conversations live under Activities, not Apps. Meetings and Calls each open a list where every conversation already carries its next step and AI summary."},"2918":{"id":"/product-docs/apps-17","page_id":"/product-docs/apps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps#converse","content":"You find it under **Activities › Meetings** and **Activities › Calls** in the main navigation. Converse joins Zoom, Google Meet and Microsoft Teams calls automatically, and the Zoom integration covers the Zoom setup. The Converse page on oliv.ai shows the capture channels side by side."},"2919":{"id":"/product-docs/apps-18","page_id":"/product-docs/apps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps#converse-pages","content":"Each page in this section covers one part of working with captured conversations."},"2920":{"id":"/product-docs/apps-19","page_id":"/product-docs/apps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps#converse-pages","content":"**Find a meeting.** The Meetings list keeps every captured meeting, on **My meetings** and **Team meetings** tabs. Search it by date or keyword, or open a meeting straight from the Slack message sent after the call."},"2921":{"id":"/product-docs/apps-20","page_id":"/product-docs/apps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps#converse-pages","content":"**Read one meeting.** Meeting details shows the recording, transcript and notes, with the AI summary and next steps. It also picks out objections, pricing concerns, competitor mentions and product requests."},"2922":{"id":"/product-docs/apps-21","page_id":"/product-docs/apps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps#converse-pages","content":"**Reuse the best moments.** The clip library is built from your recorded calls. You describe the moments you want, and Oliv AI's Content Curator agent clips them from every new recording. In the app, clip libraries sit on Enable's **Library** tab."},"2923":{"id":"/product-docs/apps-22","page_id":"/product-docs/apps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps#converse-pages","content":"**Choose how meetings are recorded.** Bot and botless recording explains how Oliv AI picks a mode from who organized the meeting. When your company organizes, recording is botless; otherwise a note taker named after your company joins."},"2924":{"id":"/product-docs/apps-23","page_id":"/product-docs/apps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps#converse-pages","content":"The Converse overview ties these together, from capture to search."},"2925":{"id":"/product-docs/apps-24","page_id":"/product-docs/apps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps#other-apps","content":"The other three apps open from **Apps** in the main navigation."},"2926":{"id":"/product-docs/apps-25","page_id":"/product-docs/apps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps#other-apps","content":"**Engage** is the outreach workspace. Its tabs are **Inbox**, **Dialer**, **Plays**, **Flows**, **Signals** and **Experiments**, and the Engage app page covers each one."},"2927":{"id":"/product-docs/apps-26","page_id":"/product-docs/apps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps#other-apps","content":"**Forecast** has two tabs. **Submissions** shows who on the team has submitted and each person's inputs per period. **Boards** rolls the team up by target attainment, pipeline coverage, commit and most likely."},"2928":{"id":"/product-docs/apps-27","page_id":"/product-docs/apps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps#other-apps","content":"**Enable** also has two tabs. **People** gives a manager the team's progress against target and a pacing card for each rep. **Library** lists every clip library, each set to Public or Private."},"2929":{"id":"/product-docs/apps-28","page_id":"/product-docs/apps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps#other-apps","content":"Engage opens on its Inbox, where replies from every outreach channel arrive in one list. The tab bar shows the rest of the outreach workspace, from the dialer to experiments."},"2930":{"id":"/product-docs/apps-29","page_id":"/product-docs/apps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps#other-apps","content":"Forecast's Boards tab is where a manager reads the rolled-up number for a period. The figures shown are sample data, there to illustrate the layout."},"2931":{"id":"/product-docs/apps-30","page_id":"/product-docs/apps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps#other-apps","content":"Enable's People tab gives a manager the team's pacing at a glance. Each rep card opens that rep's report, which is where coaching conversations start."},"2932":{"id":"/product-docs/apps-31","page_id":"/product-docs/apps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps#apps-and-agents","content":"Converse feeds the same context graph the rest of Oliv AI runs on. Your CRM, your forecast and every agent read from the same record, so one captured call can shape several pieces of work."},"2933":{"id":"/product-docs/apps-32","page_id":"/product-docs/apps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps#apps-and-agents","content":"Oliv AI's Meeting Assistant agent drafts the follow-up email and proposes CRM updates from what was said."},"2934":{"id":"/product-docs/apps-33","page_id":"/product-docs/apps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps#apps-and-agents","content":"Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent attaches the summary and transcript to the opportunity in Salesforce or HubSpot."},"2935":{"id":"/product-docs/apps-34","page_id":"/product-docs/apps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps#apps-and-agents","content":"Oliv AI's Coach agent scores recorded calls against your scorecards to help reps improve."},"2936":{"id":"/product-docs/apps-35","page_id":"/product-docs/apps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps#apps-and-agents","content":"Oliv AI's Content Curator agent builds the clip libraries that enablement teams share."},"2937":{"id":"/product-docs/apps-36","page_id":"/product-docs/apps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps#apps-and-agents","content":"Meeting summaries and prep notes also reach your team in Slack. The agents overview explains how the rest of the agents fit around this record."},"2938":{"id":"/product-docs/apps-37","page_id":"/product-docs/apps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps#seats-and-apps","content":"Oliv AI sells seats by role, and the plans stack. Converse includes Amplify, Sell includes Converse, and Grow includes Sell. So an SDR who only needs conversation capture takes Converse. An account executive who forecasts takes Sell, which adds the Forecast app. A customer success manager takes Grow, which adds the Retain app."},"2939":{"id":"/product-docs/apps-38","page_id":"/product-docs/apps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps#seats-and-apps","content":"Plans and seat roles maps each person on your team to a seat. Prices are on Oliv AI's pricing page."},"2940":{"id":"/product-docs/apps-39","page_id":"/product-docs/apps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps#next-steps","content":"Record a meeting and follow up: turn a captured call into a follow-up and CRM updates."},"2941":{"id":"/product-docs/apps-40","page_id":"/product-docs/apps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps#next-steps","content":"Prepare for a meeting: use past conversations to brief yourself before the next one."},"2942":{"id":"/product-docs/apps-41","page_id":"/product-docs/apps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/apps#next-steps","content":"Choose a seat role for each person: decide who needs Converse, Sell or Grow."},"2943":{"id":"/product-docs/capabilities","page_id":"/product-docs/capabilities","type":"page","content":"Capabilities","breadcrumbs":["Oliv AI docs"],"tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/capabilities"},"2944":{"id":"/product-docs/capabilities-0","page_id":"/product-docs/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/capabilities","content":"Every Oliv AI capability in one catalog, grouped by agents, agent building, autonomy, conversation capture, opportunity and account management, add-ons, context and integrations."},"2945":{"id":"/product-docs/capabilities-1","page_id":"/product-docs/capabilities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/capabilities#at-a-glance","content":"At a glance"},"2946":{"id":"/product-docs/capabilities-2","page_id":"/product-docs/capabilities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/capabilities#agents","content":"Agents"},"2947":{"id":"/product-docs/capabilities-3","page_id":"/product-docs/capabilities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/capabilities#agents-you-talk-to","content":"The agents you talk to"},"2948":{"id":"/product-docs/capabilities-4","page_id":"/product-docs/capabilities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/capabilities#specialist-agent