   | What it does                                                                                                                     |\n| ------------------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Sales methodology tracking** | Pick the active framework in **Settings › Qualification Framework**: **MEDDPICC**, **MEDDIC**, **SPICED**, **BANT** or **DRIVE** |","table":"table-6"},"3032":{"id":"/product-docs/capabilities-88","page_id":"/product-docs/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/capabilities#opportunity-management","content":"Methodology tracking starts from one setting: you preview each framework's criteria and scoring, then activate the one every deal and meeting is measured against."},"3033":{"id":"/product-docs/capabilities-89","page_id":"/product-docs/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/capabilities#opportunity-management","content":"| **Buying committee tracking** | Tracks the buying committee on each deal |\n| **Deal health and risks** | Flags at-risk deals before the review call |\n| **Revenue forecast boards** | The **Boards** tab rolls a team up by period and snapshot, with target attainment, pipeline coverage, commit and most likely per manager and rep |\n| **Forecast submissions** | Reps submit their forecast. Oliv AI's Forecaster agent pre-drafts it, and the rep reviews, adjusts and submits. The **Submissions** tab compares each number with the deals sum, last week and the roll-up |\n| **Targets, measurements and cadences** | **Settings** holds revenue targets, the **Basic** or **Formula** measurements a forecast is built from, and the rep and manager submission cadence |"},"3034":{"id":"/product-docs/capabilities-90","page_id":"/product-docs/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/capabilities#opportunity-management","content":"A forecast submission checked three ways at once: against the deals behind it, last week's number and what the team below rolls up to."},"3035":{"id":"/product-docs/capabilities-91","page_id":"/product-docs/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/capabilities#opportunity-management","content":"| **Weekly pipeline snapshots** | A snapshot of the pipeline taken each week |\n| **Deal change history** | Stage movement and deal velocity tracked over time |"},"3036":{"id":"/product-docs/capabilities-92","page_id":"/product-docs/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/capabilities#account-management","content":"The Retain app covers account management. It comes with the Grow plan."},"3037":{"id":"/product-docs/capabilities-93","page_id":"/product-docs/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/capabilities#account-management","content":"| Capability         | What it does                       |\n| ------------------ | ---------------------------------- |\n| **Customer grids** | Every customer account in one grid |","table":"table-7"},"3038":{"id":"/product-docs/capabilities-94","page_id":"/product-docs/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/capabilities#account-management","content":"| Capability                     | What it does                                |\n| ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------- |\n| **Customer health scorecards** | Health scorecards for each customer account |","table":"table-7"},"3039":{"id":"/product-docs/capabilities-95","page_id":"/product-docs/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/capabilities#account-management","content":"| Capability      | What it does                            |\n| --------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| **Churn risks** | Churn risks raised on customer accounts |","table":"table-7"},"3040":{"id":"/product-docs/capabilities-96","page_id":"/product-docs/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/capab