xt sync** | Brings account and opportunity context back into Salesforce, Snowflake, Databricks or Redshift |","table":"table-9"},"3064":{"id":"/product-docs/capabilities-120","page_id":"/product-docs/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/capabilities#integrations","content":"| Capability | What it does                                                                                            |\n| ---------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **CRM**    | Salesforce, HubSpot or Zoho syncs pipeline, fields, owners, close dates, stages and forecast categories |","table":"table-10"},"3065":{"id":"/product-docs/capabilities-121","page_id":"/product-docs/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/capabilities#integrations","content":"| Capability            | What it does                                                                                           |\n| --------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Meeting platforms** | Oliv AI joins Zoom, Google Meet and Microsoft Teams automatically, and Webex through the Webex App Hub |","table":"table-10"},"3066":{"id":"/product-docs/capabilities-122","page_id":"/product-docs/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/capabilities#integrations","content":"| Capability   | What it does                                                                               |\n| ------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Calendly** | A Calendly event setting helps Oliv AI recognize meeting participants and detect prospects |","table":"table-10"},"3067":{"id":"/product-docs/capabilities-123","page_id":"/product-docs/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/capabilities#integrations","content":"| Capability | What it does                 