:"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#compare-stronger","content":"Why Oliv AI is the stronger choice for the HubSpot integration"},"3458":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-26","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#limits","content":"Limits and things to know"},"3459":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-27","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#common-questions","content":"Common questions"},"3460":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-28","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#faq-replace","content":"Do we have to move off HubSpot to use Oliv AI?"},"3461":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-29","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#faq-connect","content":"How do we connect HubSpot?"},"3462":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-30","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#faq-where-insights","content":"Where do Oliv AI's insights show up on a deal?"},"3463":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-31","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#faq-field-type","content":"Which field type should an Oliv AI property use?"},"3464":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-32","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#faq-approval","content":"Do reps have to approve every change?"},"3465":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-33","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#faq-ignored-updates","content":"What if a rep ignores pending updates?"},"3466":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-34","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#faq-new-contacts","content":"Will Oliv AI create contacts we don't have yet?"},"3467":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-35","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#faq-messy-data","content":"Our HubSpot data is messy. Is that a problem?"},"3468":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-36","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#faq-wrong-update","content":"Can a wrong update be undone?"},"3469":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-37","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#faq-after-sale","content":"Does it work for customer calls after the sale?"},"3470":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-38","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#faq-other-crms","content":"Which other CRMs does Oliv AI support?"},"3471":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-39","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#faq-pricing","content":"How is Oliv AI priced for a team on HubSpot?"},"3472":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-40","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#related","content":"Related"},"3473":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-41","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","content":"Oliv AI connects to HubSpot so your deals, contacts and companies stay current without reps typing updates after every call. HubSpot remains your CRM, and Oliv AI works on top of it. Here you'll find the connection steps, how to show Oliv AI fields on a deal, and how approvals work."},"3474":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-42","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                                                            |\n| ---------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **What it does** | Pulls HubSpot data into Oliv AI and fills it back with what customers said |","table":"table-0"},"3475":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-43","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#at-a-glance","content":"|                     |                                                                                  |\n| ------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **How you connect** | From the HubSpot integration in the Oliv AI web app, then share your HubSpot URL |","table":"table-0"},"3476":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-44","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#at-a-glance","content":"|                           |                                                                          |\n| ------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **What it keeps current** | Deals, contacts, companies, activities, tasks and buying committee roles |","table":"table-0"},"3477":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-45","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#at-a-glance","content":"|               |                                                                        |\n| ------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Approvals** | **Ask First** by default, or **Auto-Pilot** once you trust the updates |","table":"table-0"},"3478":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-46","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#at-a-glance","content":"|               |                                                            |\n| ------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Deal view** | Oliv AI fields appear in a card you add to the deal record |","table":"table-0"},"3479":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-47","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#at-a-glance","content":"|                   |                                           |\n| ----------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| **What it needs** | A connected calendar, plus HubSpot itself |","table":"table-0"},"3480":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-48","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#what-it-is","content":"The HubSpot integration links your portal to Oliv AI in both directions. Oliv AI pulls in information from HubSpot, and it fills auto-generated insights back in, so nobody on the team does manual updates. You don't need to replace HubSpot, because Oliv AI works with the CRM you already have."},"3481":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-49","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#what-it-is","content":"The sync covers pipeline, fields, owners, close dates, stages and forecast categories. Writing back to HubSpot is the job of Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent."},"3482":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-50","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#what-changes","content":"**Logged activity.** Meetings, calls and emails land on the right deal, contact and company."},"3483":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-51","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#what-changes","content":"**New contacts and companies.** A person or company that shows up in a conversation, and isn't in HubSpot yet, gets a record."},"3484":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-52","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#what-changes","content":"**New deals.** A deal is created when there are enough activity signals, with name, estimated close date, stage and amount where available."},"3485":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-53","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#what-changes","content":"**Deal properties.** Close date, amount, stage and next steps are pre-mapped when you connect. Qualification fields such as MEDDPICC or BANT follow every call."},"3486":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-54","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#what-changes","content":"**Tasks.** Next steps from meetings, calls and emails become tasks assigned to the right owner."},"3487":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-55","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#what-changes","content":"**Buying committee.** Each contact's role on a deal, such as economic buyer, champion or blocker, is tracked as the deal moves."},"3488":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-56","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#what-its-for","content":"The HubSpot integration is for sales teams whose deal records fall behind their calls. It takes what buyers said and puts it on the deal, so the pipeline view matches the conversations."},"3489":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-57","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#how-it-helps","content":"**Deals you can trust on Monday.** Stage, amount and next steps update after each activity."},"3490":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-58","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#how-it-helps","content":"**Stakeholders on the record.** Every new person from a call becomes a contact with a role on the deal."},"3491":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-59","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#how-it-helps","content":"**Next steps that don't get lost.** Commitments from calls turn into HubSpot tasks with an owner."},"3492":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-60","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#how-it-helps","content":"**Approval you control.** Reps see each proposed change beside the current CRM value, then accept or reject it."},"3493":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-61","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#without-it","content":"HubSpot only knows what a rep remembered to type. Deal properties go stale between calls, new stakeholders never become contacts, and next steps live in someone's notebook. The weekly pipeline meeting turns into an audit of missing fields instead of a talk about deals."},"3494":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-62","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#why-buyers-care","content":"On a smaller team, the head of sales often owns HubSpot as well as the number. They care most at forecast time and in 1:1s, when deal records need to be right. Reps care because the follow-up admin after each call shrinks."},"3495":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-63","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#approach","content":"Imagine the head of sales at a twelve-person team: eight account executives and three SDRs. There is no RevOps hire yet, so she is also the HubSpot admin. Every Sunday night she opens the deals board and fixes amounts, stages and close dates before Monday's pipeline call."},"3496":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-64","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#approach","content":"A common fix is to make key deal properties required before a deal can change stage. Reps then paste a line or two from memory just to move the deal on. The board looks complete, but the values are often guesses, and she likely still rechecks the deals that matter most."},"3497":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-65","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#approach","content":"The information she needs already exists. It was said out loud on calls and written in emails during the week. What is missing is a step that turns those conversations into property values, with a person checking them before they count."},"3498":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-66","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#approach","content":"Oliv AI adds that step on top of HubSpot. Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent reads each meeting, call and email, then proposes updates to the deal, its contacts and its tasks. She starts every rep on **Ask First**, so reps **Accept** or **Reject** each proposal on the deal's **CRM Updates** tab."},"3499":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-67","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#approach","content":"Nothing reaches HubSpot until a rep approves it, and every proposal shows the current CRM value beside the suggested one. Approval before writing is one of the points covered in How the HubSpot integration compares, below."},"3500":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-68","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#connect-hubspot","content":"Sign in to the Oliv AI web app and visit the HubSpot integration, at `web.oliv.ai/hubspot/connect`."},"3501":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-69","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#connect-hubspot","content":"Share your HubSpot URL with the Oliv AI admin through Intercom in the Oliv AI app."},"3502":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-70","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#connect-hubspot","content":"Connect your Gmail or Outlook calendar. Oliv AI needs a calendar integration to take notes in meetings."},"3503":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-71","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#connect-hubspot","content":"Once you're connected, **Settings** › **Revenue Process** has an **Import Pipeline from CRM** button that pulls your existing stages into Oliv AI, one tab per sales motion."},"3504":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-72","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#connect-hubspot","content":"After HubSpot is connected, Import Pipeline from CRM brings your deal stages into Oliv AI, so agents and the forecast use the same pipeline as your portal."},"3505":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-73","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#connect-hubspot","content":"Your core deal properties are mapped on connection and start filling from day one. If you track properties unique to your process, Oliv AI's team maps them for you during onboarding."},"3506":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-74","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#show-fields-on-deals","content":"Oliv AI's help center walks through adding a custom property and a card, so Oliv AI's data sits on the deal record."},"3507":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-75","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#show-fields-on-deals","content":"In HubSpot, click **Settings** at the top of the page."},"3508":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-76","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#show-fields-on-deals","content":"Under **Data Management**, select **Properties**, then click **Create Property**."},"3509":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-77","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#show-fields-on-deals","content":"Name the property, for example \"Oliv: Pain Points & Needs\", and set the object type to **Deal**."},"3510":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-78","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#show-fields-on-deals","content":"Choose **Rich Text** as the field type, which suits most Oliv AI fields. Click **Preview**, then **Create**."},"3511":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-79","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#show-fields-on-deals","content":"Back in **Settings**, under **Data Management**, open **Objects** and go to **Record Customization**."},"3512":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-80","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#show-fields-on-deals","content":"Click the default view, click **Add Cards**, then **Create Card**."},"3513":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-81","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#show-fields-on-deals","content":"Name the card, select the property you created, and click **Save and exit**."},"3514":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-82","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#show-fields-on-deals","content":"Open any deal to check the field. Once Oliv AI captures relevant information, it fills the field automatically."},"3515":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-83","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#approve-updates","content":"Out of the box, Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent holds every suggestion for review before it touches HubSpot. There are two control modes:"},"3516":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-84","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#approve-updates","content":"**Ask First.** Each update waits for a rep before anything is written to HubSpot."},"3517":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-85","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#approve-updates","content":"**Auto-Pilot.** Updates nobody reviewed are applied on their own, so deals stay current with no one acting."},"3518":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-86","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#approve-updates","content":"After a call, the rep gets a Slack message, or a note in their preferred channel, saying updates were found. On the deal, the **CRM Updates** tab lists each proposed change under **AI Suggestions**. The suggested value sits in its own field above the **Current Value**, and the choices are **Accept** or **Reject**. **AI Updates** holds changes already applied, and **Updates History** keeps the record."},"3519":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-87","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#approve-updates","content":"This is where a rep approves HubSpot updates on Ask First: each suggestion sits beside the value HubSpot holds now, and nothing is written until the rep accepts it."},"3520":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-88","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#approve-updates","content":"Each meeting has a **CRM Updates** tab of its own. It lists what was written after the call, such as **Account Updated** or **Contact Created**, and holds a stage move as a **Pending Update** until you press **Update Deal**."},"3521":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-89","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#approve-updates","content":"After a call, the meeting's CRM Updates timeline shows what reached HubSpot and what is still pending, with a link to each record that changed."},"3522":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-90","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#approve-updates","content":"Reps with open tasks or unverified deal updates get an end-of-day reminder. If updates stay undone past a set window, deals can be deferred or flagged as closed-lost, and your org chooses whether that happens. When accuracy is good enough, the person who owns HubSpot confirms the move to auto mode."},"3523":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-91","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#with-crm-manager","content":"Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent does every write, so updates show up in the HubSpot workflows, reports and dashboards you already use. The CRM Manager overview covers its full job."},"3524":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-92","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#with-meeting-assistant","content":"Oliv AI's Meeting Assistant agent suggests field updates after each call. CRM Manager then reviews that call context and pushes approved changes into HubSpot. Briefs before a call draw on the contacts and companies kept current here, as in preparing for a meeting."},"3525":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-93","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#with-deal-driver","content":"Oliv AI's Deal Driver agent reads deal stage history and field values for pipeline reviews. Task reminders and end-of-day nudges belong to Deal Driver, while creating and logging tasks stays with CRM Manager."},"3526":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-94","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#with-olivia","content":"Oliv AI's Olivia agent reads what is already in HubSpot, messy data included. Ask her about a deal and she works from the same records."},"3527":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-95","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#with-custom-agents","content":"HubSpot appears in the **Add Tool** catalogue with 32 tools in six groups: **Lookup / Search**, **Create / Update**, **Associations**, **Activities**, **Marketing** and **Utility**. They run from **Find Deal** and **Update Deal Stage & Dates** to **Enroll Contact in Sequence** and **Submit Form**."},"3528":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-96","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#with-custom-agents","content":"Every action an agent you build can take in HubSpot, including the Marketing group for lists and forms. Each tool you add gets its own run mode."},"3529":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-97","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#with-custom-agents","content":"HubSpot is also listed under **Most popular** when you add a trigger, so a change in your portal can start an agent."},"3530":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-98","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#with-custom-agents","content":"HubSpot is one of the most popular trigger sources, which lets an event in your portal start an agent without anyone pressing Run Agent."},"3531":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-99","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#with-custom-agents","content":"How each tool asks for approval is explained in agent tools and run modes."},"3532":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-100","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#sales-leaders","content":"A head of sales opens the deals board on Monday and finds stages, amounts and next steps already updated from last week's calls. The **AI Suggestions** count on each deal's **CRM Updates** tab shows what still needs review. More on Oliv AI for sales managers."},"3533":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-101","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#account-executives","content":"An AE finishes a demo where a new economic buyer joined late. By the next call, that person is a contact with a role on the deal and the next step is logged. See how an AE runs deals day to day."},"3534":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-102","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#sales-development","content":"An SDR books a first meeting with three people from a target company. Each attendee who isn't in HubSpot becomes a contact, and the meeting is logged against the company. More on Oliv AI for sales development teams."},"3535":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-103","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#account-management","content":"An account manager's renewal and check-in calls update the company record the same way sales calls do. Changes to the stakeholder map show up on the record before the next renewal talk. More on Oliv AI for account management."},"3536":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-104","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#compare","content":"Several meeting tools can push notes or properties into HubSpot. Oliv AI also holds each update for approval, tracks each contact's role on the deal, and reminds reps about updates they haven't reviewed. Oliv AI is the only platform in this table that does all four."},"3537":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-105","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#compare","content":"HubSpot sync features, from each platform's public documentation:"},"3538":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-106","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#compare","content":"| Platform    | Deal properties filled from calls | Approval before anything reaches HubSpot | Buying committee roles on each deal | Reminders for pending updates |\n| ----------- | --------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| **Oliv AI** | Yes                               | Yes                                      | Yes                                 | Yes                           |","table":"table-1"},"3539":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-107","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#compare","content":"| Platform | Deal properties filled from calls       | Approval before anything reaches HubSpot     | Buying committee roles on each deal | Reminders for pending updates |\n| -------- | --------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| **Gong** | Yes (AI data fields mapped to your CRM) | Automatic (fields update without rep action) | Not in docs                         | Not in docs                   |","table":"table-1"},"3540":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-108","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#compare","content":"| Platform  | Deal properties filled from calls             | Approval before anything reaches HubSpot | Buying committee roles on each deal | Reminders for pending updates |\n| --------- | --------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| **Avoma** | Partly (field mapping needs Business license) | Not in docs                              | Not in docs                         | Not in docs                   |","table":"table-1"},"3541":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-109","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#compare","content":"| Platform      | Deal properties filled from calls | Approval before anything reaches HubSpot | Buying committee roles on each deal | Reminders for pending updates |\n| ------------- | --------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| **Fireflies** | Yes (Autofill CRM for HubSpot)    | Yes (nothing sent until you approve)     | Not in docs                         | Not in docs                   |","table":"table-1"},"3542":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-110","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#compare","content":"| Platform   | Deal properties filled from calls           | Approval before anything reaches HubSpot | Buying committee roles on each deal | Reminders for pending updates |\n| ---------- | ------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| **Fathom** | Partly (Business and Enterprise plans only) | Not in docs                              | Not in docs                         | Not in docs                   |","table":"table-1"},"3543":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-111","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#compare","content":"*Yes: documented and built in. Partly: documented with a limit, shown in brackets. Not in docs: not found in the vendor's public documentation.*"},"3544":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-112","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#compare-stronger","content":"**Updates follow each activity.** Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent proposes changes after every meeting, call and email and notifies the rep. Gong's help center notes that exporting Gong data to HubSpot can take up to six hours. Compare Oliv AI vs Gong."},"3545":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-113","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#compare-stronger","content":"**Your own fields, mapped for you.** Oliv AI's team maps the properties unique to your process during onboarding. Gong documents that its AI Data Extractor can only export to an existing CRM field. See Oliv AI as a Gong alternative."},"3546":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-114","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#compare-stronger","content":"**Standard fields from day one.** Core deal properties are pre-mapped on connection and fill from day one. Avoma lists a HubSpot Business license for users of field mapping. Compare Oliv AI vs Avoma."},"3547":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-115","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#compare-stronger","content":"*Competitor details checked against each vendor's public documentation on 21 October 2026. Features and plans change, so confirm with the vendor before you decide.*"},"3548":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-116","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#limits","content":"**Setup goes through Oliv AI's team.** After visiting the integration, you share your HubSpot URL with the Oliv AI admin through Intercom."},"3549":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-117","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#limits","content":"**A calendar is required.** Without a calendar integration, Oliv AI can't take notes during meetings."},"3550":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-118","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#limits","content":"**The deal card is yours to add.** Oliv AI fields show on the deal view once you create the property and card in HubSpot."},"3551":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-119","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#limits","content":"**Custom properties are mapped at onboarding.** There's no self-serve mapping screen for them."},"3552":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-120","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#limits","content":"**Auto mode waits for you.** Updates stay on review until the HubSpot owner confirms the switch."},"3553":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-121","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#limits","content":"**Removing the integration is a message.** Send Oliv AI a message through Intercom in the Oliv AI app."},"3554":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-122","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#faq-replace","content":"No. Oliv AI works with your existing CRM, brings the context together and keeps HubSpot updated. HubSpot stays your system of record."},"3555":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-123","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#faq-connect","content":"Visit the HubSpot integration in the Oliv AI web app, then share your HubSpot URL with the Oliv AI admin through Intercom in the Oliv AI app."},"3556":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-124","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#faq-where-insights","content":"In a custom property you create, shown in a card on the deal view. The help center suggests a name like \"Oliv: Pain Points & Needs\"."},"3557":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-125","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#faq-field-type","content":"Rich Text. Oliv AI's guide says most Oliv fields work best as Rich Text, with **Deal** as the object type."},"3558":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-126","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#faq-approval","content":"At first, yes. Every suggestion surfaces for review by default. Once the team trusts the updates, you can switch to **Auto-Pilot** for hands-free changes."},"3559":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-127","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#faq-ignored-updates","content":"They get end-of-day reminders. If updates aren't completed within a set window, deals can be deferred or flagged as closed-lost, depending on how your org configures it."},"3560":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-128","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#faq-new-contacts","content":"Yes. When a person or company in a meeting, call or email isn't in HubSpot, Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent creates the record and enriches it."},"3561":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-129","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#faq-messy-data","content":"No. CRM Manager works with unclean data and normalizes it as it goes, resolving duplicates and filling gaps in real time and in batch."},"3562":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-130","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#faq-wrong-update","content":"Every suggestion shows the current value next to the proposed one, and you can reject it before it's written. Changes already applied are listed under **AI Updates**, and **Updates History** keeps the record."},"3563":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-131","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#faq-after-sale","content":"Yes. Activity tracking covers renewals, QBRs and customer success check-ins as well as sales calls."},"3564":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-132","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#faq-other-crms","content":"Salesforce and Zoho, alongside HubSpot, out of the box. Other CRMs are available on request."},"3565":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-133","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#faq-pricing","content":"Plans are assigned by role, so each person gets the apps they need. For current plans, see Oliv AI pricing."},"3566":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-134","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#related","content":"How the Context Graph enriches your CRM: why Oliv AI adds to HubSpot records instead of replacing them."},"3567":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-135","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#related","content":"Oliv AI for sales managers, day to day: how a manager uses agents to keep the CRM current."},"3568":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-136","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#related","content":"The RevOps integration blueprint: connecting calls, email and Slack to the CRM."},"3569":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-137","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#related","content":"Sales call notes software: what good call notes in a CRM look like."},"3570":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-138","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#related","content":"Oliv AI for sales teams: how agents support account executives and their managers."},"3571":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-139","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#related","content":"Oliv AI integrations: every tool Oliv AI connects to besides HubSpot."},"3572":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-140","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#related","content":"The Context Graph: how Oliv AI maps activity to the right deal and company."},"3573":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot-141","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/hubspot#related","content":"Oliv AI product documentation: every documented agent and feature."},"3574":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations","type":"page","content":"Integrations overview","breadcrumbs":["Oliv AI docs","Integrations"],"tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations"},"3575":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations-0","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations","content":"The tools Oliv AI connects to, from your CRM and calendar to Zoom and Slack, what each connection is for, and which ones have their own setup guide."},"3576":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations-1","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations#categories","content":"What connects to what"},"3577":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations-2","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations#crm","content":"Your CRM"},"3578":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations-3","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations#calendar-and-recording","content":"Calendar and meeting recording"},"3579":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations-4","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations#slack-and-channels","content":"Slack and other channels"},"3580":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations-5","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations#other-sources","content":"Other sources of context"},"3581":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations-6","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations#agents-and-connections","content":"How agents use the connections"},"3582":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations-7","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations","content":"Oliv AI connects to the tools your revenue team already uses and works as a layer on top of them. Your CRM stays the system of record. Your calendar tells Oliv AI which meetings to capture, your video tool carries the recording, and Slack brings summaries and alerts to where your team works. This page shows how the connections fit together and which ones have a full guide."},"3583":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations-8","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations#categories","content":"| Category | Tools                     | What Oliv AI does with it                              | Guide               |\n| -------- | ------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ | ------------------- |\n| **CRM**  | Salesforce, HubSpot, Zoho | Pulls records in and writes conversation insights back | Salesforce, HubSpot |","table":"table-0"},"3584":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations-9","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations#categories","content":"| Category     | Tools                       | What Oliv AI does with it                      | Guide |\n| ------------ | --------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------- | ----- |\n| **Calendar** | Gmail and Outlook calendars | Tells Oliv AI which meetings to join; required | Gmail |","table":"table-0"},"3585":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations-10","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations#categories","content":"| Category               | Tools                                     | What Oliv AI does with it                     | Guide       |\n| ---------------------- | ----------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------- | ----------- |\n| **Video conferencing** | Zoom, Webex, Microsoft Teams, Google Meet | Records meetings for summaries and follow-ups | Zoom, Webex |","table":"table-0"},"3586":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations-11","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations#categories","content":"| Category          | Tools                               | What Oliv AI does with it                           | Guide |\n| ----------------- | ----------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------- | ----- |\n| **Collaboration** | Slack, Microsoft Teams, Google Chat | Sends meeting reminders, summaries and agent alerts | Slack |","table":"table-0"},"3587":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations-12","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations#categories","content":"Six have their own guide today: Salesforce, HubSpot, Gmail, Zoom, Webex and Slack. The rest are described here as far as setup goes."},"3588":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations-13","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations#categories","content":"On each deal, the **Momentum** tab plots what these connections bring in on one timeline. Its **Activity Map** has a row each for meetings, emails, internal Slack, external Slack and agent actions."},"3589":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations-14","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations#categories","content":"One deal's activity from every connected channel: meetings from your recorder, emails from your inbox, internal and external Slack, and the actions agents took."},"3590":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations-15","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations#crm","content":"Oliv AI pulls in your accounts, contacts and opportunities, then fills them back with what customers said. Salesforce, HubSpot and Zoho work out of the box. Additional CRMs are available on request, so contact Oliv AI's sales team if yours isn't listed."},"3591":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations-16","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations#crm","content":"**Salesforce.** A Salesforce admin installs the package for all users. The Salesforce setup guide covers the install, review settings and cleaning up existing data."},"3592":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations-17","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations#crm","content":"**HubSpot.** You connect from the HubSpot integration in the Oliv AI web app, then share your HubSpot URL. The HubSpot setup guide also shows Oliv AI fields on deal records."},"3593":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations-18","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations#crm","content":"Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent does the writing. By default every update waits for review before it reaches the CRM. On a deal, the **CRM Updates** tab lists each change under **AI Suggestions** next to the current CRM value, with **Accept** and **Reject**. The deal header also has a **Sync to Salesforce** button that pushes the deal to the CRM. CRM field mapping decides which field each update lands in, and the CRM Manager agent page covers approvals and auto mode. For how two-way sync enriches your records without replacing them, read about the context graph and CRM sync."},"3594":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations-19","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations#calendar-and-recording","content":"Calendar integration is required. Without it, Oliv AI can't take notes during your meetings. You connect a Gmail or Outlook calendar by logging in to the Oliv AI web app."},"3595":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations-20","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations#calendar-and-recording","content":"Once the calendar is connected, Oliv AI joins Microsoft Teams and Google Meet calls with no further setup. Zoom uses the Oliv AI Zoom app. When someone from your company organizes the meeting, Oliv AI can record botlessly through the meeting platform. When an external organizer owns it, a note taker joins under your company's name. Bot and botless recording explains the choice. The Zoom guide covers both Zoom apps, including CRM fields inside the meeting window."},"3596":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations-21","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations#calendar-and-recording","content":"Oliv AI joins external calls automatically. You can manage that from the Oliv AI web app or from your Google or Outlook calendar, using the Chrome extension or the Outlook add-in. Everything recorded lands in the Converse app, and you can find a past call in the meetings list. It sits under **Activities** › **Meetings**, with **My meetings** and **Team meetings** tabs."},"3597":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations-22","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations#calendar-and-recording","content":"Once your calendar and recorder are connected, each captured meeting lands in this list with its duration, meeting type, next step and AI summary."},"3598":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations-23","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations#slack-and-channels","content":"Once Slack is connected, three meeting messages start on their own: a summary of tomorrow's meetings, a prep summary before each call and a meeting summary straight after it. They also go to your email by default. The Slack guide covers setup and how to turn them off."},"3599":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations-24","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations#slack-and-channels","content":"Agents post to the same channels. Oliv AI's Deal Driver agent sends managers its alerts, briefs and summaries through Slack, email or the Oliv platform. Oliv AI's Olivia agent works through Slack, Teams or the Oliv AI product itself, as the Olivia agent page shows. For Microsoft Teams, Oliv AI sends an invitation to a shared channel."},"3600":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations-25","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations#other-sources","content":"Meetings are one source among several. Oliv AI also captures email from Gmail and Outlook, phone calls, and in-person meetings recorded with Plaud, a wearable recorder. For account data beyond conversations, Oliv AI connects to Snowflake, Databricks, Redshift and BigQuery. That adds product usage, support tickets, billing history and onboarding completion to each account."},"3601":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations-26","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations#other-sources","content":"These sources don't have a setup guide in these docs. Oliv AI's integrations page lists the categories it works with and has a way to request an integration. Context capture shows every channel Oliv AI captures."},"3602":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations-27","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations#agents-and-connections","content":"Every agent reads and writes through the tools above. Oliv AI's Meeting Assistant agent needs your calendar, a call recorder and your CRM before it sends its first brief, as the meeting preparation guide explains. The CRM upkeep guide shows CRM Manager writing back after each call."},"3603":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations-28","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations#agents-and-connections","content":"Agents you build use the same connections. Each tool an agent holds is one action in a connected system, and its run mode decides whether the agent asks first. The **Add Tool** catalogue lists seven systems: HubSpot, Salesforce, Gmail, Google Calendar, Outlook, LinkedIn and Slack. An agent's **Data** tab shows the sources it reads, such as Salesforce **Deals**, **Contacts**, **Accounts** and **Leads**."},"3604":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations-29","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations#agents-and-connections","content":"The Data tab shows which connected systems an agent reads and which fields it can see, so you can check what an agent knows before it runs."},"3605":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations-30","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations#agents-and-connections","content":"Agent tools and run modes covers those settings, and agent triggers can start an agent when a CRM deal changes. **Add Trigger** opens a picker whose **Most popular** group lists 11 systems, among them Microsoft Outlook, Google Mail, Google Calendar, Salesforce and HubSpot, with a longer **All triggers** list below."},"3606":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations-31","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations#agents-and-connections","content":"Connected systems can also start an agent. The trigger picker lists the most popular sources first, so the tools covered on this page are one click away."},"3607":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations-32","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations#agents-and-connections","content":"Seat roles decide which apps each person uses, so check plans and seat roles before you connect a whole team. For a wider plan, the RevOps integration blueprint covers calls, email, Slack and the CRM together."},"3608":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","type":"page","content":"Salesforce","breadcrumbs":["Oliv AI docs","Integrations"],"tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce"},"3609":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-0","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","content":"How to connect Oliv AI to Salesforce, choose how CRM updates are reviewed, clean up existing data, and see what Oliv AI writes to your org."},"3610":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-1","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#at-a-glance","content":"At a glance"},"3611":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-2","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#what-it-is","content":"What the Salesforce integration is"},"3612":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-3","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#what-it-writes","content":"What Oliv AI writes to Salesforce"},"3613":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-4","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#why-it-matters","content":"Why the Salesforce integration matters"},"3614":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-5","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#what-its-for","content":"What it's for"},"3615":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-6","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#how-it-helps","content":"How it helps"},"3616":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-7","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#without-it","content":"What happens without it"},"3617":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-8","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#why-buyers-care","content":"Why buyers care"},"3618":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-9","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#approach","content":"The Oliv AI approach to the Salesforce integration"},"3619":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-10","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#connect-salesforce","content":"Connect Salesforce"},"3620":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-11","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#review-updates","content":"Choose how updates reach Salesforce"},"3621":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-12","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#clean-up","content":"Clean up existing Salesforce data"},"3622":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-13","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#works-with","content":"How the Salesforce integration works with agents"},"3623":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-14","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#with-crm-manager","content":"CRM Manager"},"3624":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-15","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#with-meeting-assistant","content":"Meeting Assistant"},"3625":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-16","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#with-deal-and-forecast","content":"Deal Driver and Forecaster"},"3626":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-17","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#with-super-agents","content":"Olivia and Oliver"},"3627":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-18","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#with-custom-agents","content":"Agents you build"},"3628":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-19","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#who-uses-it","content":"Who uses the Salesforce integration, and how"},"3629":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-20","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#revenue-operations","content":"Revenue operations"},"3630":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-21","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#sales-managers","content":"Sales managers"},"3631":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-22","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#account-executives","content":"Account executives"},"3632":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-23","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#customer-success","content":"Customer success"},"3633":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-24","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#compare","content":"How the Salesforce integration compares"},"3634":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-25","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#compare-stronger","content":"Why Oliv AI is the stronger choice for the Salesforce integration"},"3635":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-26","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#limits","content":"Limits and things to know"},"3636":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-27","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#common-questions","content":"Common questions"},"3637":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-28","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#faq-replace","content":"Does Oliv AI replace Salesforce?"},"3638":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-29","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#faq-who-installs","content":"Who has to install it?"},"3639":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-30","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#faq-objects","content":"Which Salesforce objects does Oliv AI keep current?"},"3640":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-31","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#faq-approval","content":"Will it write to Salesforce without anyone approving?"},"3641":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-32","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#faq-messy-data","content":"Our Salesforce data is a mess. Can we still connect?"},"3642":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-33","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#faq-custom-fields","content":"Who maps our custom fields?"},"3643":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-34","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#faq-multiple-opportunities","content":"How does it pick the right opportunity when an account has several?"},"3644":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-35","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#faq-other-activity","content":"Does it log activity from meetings Oliv AI didn't record?"},"3645":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-36","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#faq-field-history","content":"Can I see how a field changed over time?"},"3646":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-37","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#faq-usage","content":"How do I watch the load on our Salesforce org?"},"3647":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-38","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#faq-other-crms","content":"Does Oliv AI work with other CRMs?"},"3648":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-39","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#faq-disconnect","content":"How do I disconnect Salesforce?"},"3649":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-40","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#related","content":"Related"},"3650":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-41","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","content":"Oliv AI connects to Salesforce as a layer on top of your org, and Salesforce stays your system of record. Oliv AI pulls in your accounts, contacts and opportunities, then writes insights from meetings, calls and emails back to them. This page covers the install, the review settings and what changes in Salesforce once the connection is live."},"3651":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-42","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                                                        |\n| ---------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **What it does** | Reads Salesforce records and writes conversation insights back to them |","table":"table-0"},"3652":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-43","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#at-a-glance","content":"|                     |                                                              |\n| ------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Who installs it** | A Salesforce admin, with the package installed for all users |","table":"table-0"},"3653":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-44","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#at-a-glance","content":"|                    |                                                                             |\n| ------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **What it writes** | Activities, new accounts and contacts, opportunity fields and contact roles |","table":"table-0"},"3654":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-45","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#at-a-glance","content":"|                      |                                                                            |\n| -------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **How updates land** | **Ask First** (review each one) or **Auto-Pilot** (applied without review) |","table":"table-0"},"3655":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-46","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#at-a-glance","content":"|                |                                                    |\n| -------------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Other CRMs** | HubSpot and Zoho out of the box, others on request |","table":"table-0"},"3656":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-47","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#at-a-glance","content":"|                   |                                                              |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **What it needs** | A calendar connection, so Oliv AI can take notes in meetings |","table":"table-0"},"3657":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-48","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#what-it-is","content":"The Salesforce integration lets Oliv AI pull information from your org and populate auto-generated insights back into it, so reps don't update records by hand. Oliv AI works with your existing CRM rather than replacing it. It brings the context together and keeps Salesforce updated, so your existing reports and dashboards run on current data."},"3658":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-49","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#what-it-is","content":"Once connected, the sync covers pipeline, fields, owners, close dates, stages and forecast categories. Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent does the writing."},"3659":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-50","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#what-it-writes","content":"**Activities.** Every meeting, call and email is logged against the right account, contact and opportunity, including activity from meetings Oliv AI didn't join."},"3660":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-51","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#what-it-writes","content":"**New records.** When an activity involves a company or person not yet in Salesforce, the record is created and enriched."},"3661":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-52","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#what-it-writes","content":"**Standard fields.** Close date, deal amount, stage, next steps and last activity date are pre-mapped when you connect, and populate from day one."},"3662":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-53","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#what-it-writes","content":"**Methodology fields.** MEDDPICC, MEDDIC, BANT or your own qualification fields stay current from every call."},"3663":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-54","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#what-it-writes","content":"**Custom fields.** Any field unique to your process, mapped by Oliv AI's team during onboarding."},"3664":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-55","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#what-it-writes","content":"**Contact roles.** Opportunity Contact Roles update from signals across meetings, emails and calls."},"3665":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-56","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#what-its-for","content":"The Salesforce integration is for teams whose records lag behind what customers said. It writes what happened in each call into the records your reports already read."},"3666":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-57","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#how-it-helps","content":"**Fields filled from conversations.** Standard, methodology and custom fields update after each activity, without a rep typing them."},"3667":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-58","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#how-it-helps","content":"**Records that exist when needed.** A new company or person from a call becomes an account or contact as soon as the activity happens."},"3668":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-59","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#how-it-helps","content":"**Cleaner data over time.** Duplicate accounts and contacts are resolved as new activity touches them."},"3669":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-60","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#how-it-helps","content":"**A clear before and after.** Each proposed update shows the suggested value beside the current Salesforce value."},"3670":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-61","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#without-it","content":"Salesforce reflects what got logged, not what happened. Reps fill fields from memory when they find time, so pipeline reports run on values nobody has touched in weeks. Sales managers then spend 1:1s chasing updates instead of coaching, and customer success managers work from stale account records."},"3671":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-62","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#why-buyers-care","content":"A RevOps lead usually buys it, because RevOps owns data quality and runs the reports. In mid-market teams a VP of Sales or VP of Customer Success often signs off too. Account executives and CSMs benefit without extra work, since their records stay accurate after every call."},"3672":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-63","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#approach","content":"Picture a Salesforce admin at a company with three sales pods and a customer success group. Leadership wants Oliv AI connected before the next quarter opens. The org is eight years old, carries duplicate accounts from two old imports, and most qualification fields on open opportunities are blank."},"3673":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-64","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#approach","content":"The usual move is a clean-up project before any new tool goes live. Someone exports accounts, merges duplicates by hand and writes validation rules that force reps to fill fields. That probably takes weeks, and the rules tend to need rework each time a field or a sales stage changes."},"3674":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-65","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#approach","content":"The blank fields and the duplicates come from the same place. Fields stay empty because nobody types them after a call, and duplicates appear because people create records by hand. A tool that needs a clean org before it starts will be waiting for a long time."},"3675":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-66","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#approach","content":"Oliv AI starts from the org as it is. Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent writes to Salesforce after every meeting, call and email, and it resolves duplicates as activity touches them. For the backlog, the admin gives it a direct job. It can find all duplicate accounts from last quarter, or backfill MEDDPICC fields across the pipeline."},"3676":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-67","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#approach","content":"Before anything is written, the admin picks how updates land. **Ask First** shows each proposed update beside the current Salesforce value, while **Auto-Pilot** applies updates without review. That review step is one of the points covered in How the Salesforce integration compares, below."},"3677":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-68","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#connect-salesforce","content":"You need admin access in Salesforce to install the package. Connect a calendar as well, because Oliv AI can't take meeting notes without one."},"3678":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-69","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#connect-salesforce","content":"Open the admin install link, `web.oliv.ai/salesforce/connect`."},"3679":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-70","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#connect-salesforce","content":"Follow the package install link and select **Install for All Users**."},"3680":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-71","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#connect-salesforce","content":"Share your Salesforce URL with Oliv AI's team."},"3681":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-72","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#connect-salesforce","content":"In Salesforce, enable the **Assign tasks to multiple objects** feature."},"3682":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-73","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#connect-salesforce","content":"Enable the **Advanced notes** functionality, which Oliv AI's guide points to as Salesforce's enhanced notes."},"3683":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-74","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#connect-salesforce","content":"Connect your calendar by logging in to `web.oliv.ai` with Gmail or Outlook."},"3684":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-75","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#connect-salesforce","content":"In Oliv AI, open **Settings** › **Revenue Process** and press **Import Pipeline from CRM** to pull your existing stages in."},"3685":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-76","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#connect-salesforce","content":"Step 7: Import Pipeline from CRM brings your Salesforce stages into Oliv AI, so each sales motion's stages, probabilities and forecast categories match your org."},"3686":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-77","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#connect-salesforce","content":"Standard fields are mapped as soon as the connection is made. Oliv AI's team configures your custom fields during onboarding as a service, so there's no mapping task for your RevOps team."},"3687":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-78","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#review-updates","content":"Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent has two control modes. By default, every suggested update surfaces for review before anything is written to Salesforce."},"3688":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-79","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#review-updates","content":"**Ask First.** Review each update before it's written to Salesforce."},"3689":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-80","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#review-updates","content":"**Auto-Pilot.** Unreviewed updates apply automatically, so the pipeline stays current without anyone acting."},"3690":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-81","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#review-updates","content":"After each activity, the rep gets a notification in Slack or their preferred channel saying updates were found. On the deal, the **CRM Updates** tab lists each change under **AI Suggestions**: the field, the suggested value and the **Current Value**. They can **Accept** or **Reject** each one. **AI Updates** holds changes already applied, and **Updates History** keeps the record."},"3691":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-82","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#review-updates","content":"Under Ask First, this is the review step: each suggested Salesforce field change sits beside its current value, and the deal header's Sync to Salesforce button pushes the deal to the CRM."},"3692":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-83","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#review-updates","content":"Once accuracy thresholds are met, RevOps confirms the switch to auto mode. Until then, reps get end-of-day reminders for unverified deal updates, and managers can see what is waiting from the **AI Suggestions** count on each deal."},"3693":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-84","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#review-updates","content":"Each meeting also has a **CRM Updates** tab. It shows what was written after the call, such as **Account Updated**, **Opportunity Updated** or **Contact Created**, and holds a stage move as a **Pending Update** until someone presses **Update Deal**."},"3694":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-85","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#review-updates","content":"After each call you can check what reached Salesforce: completed writes carry a green check, and a stage move waits as a Pending Update for a person to confirm."},"3695":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-86","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#clean-up","content":"Real-time mode cleans new data as it arrives. For history, RevOps can give Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent a direct job in plain language:"},"3696":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-87","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#clean-up","content":"\"Find all duplicate accounts from last quarter.\""},"3697":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-88","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#clean-up","content":"\"Rebuild broken account hierarchies.\""},"3698":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-89","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#clean-up","content":"\"Clean unassigned contacts.\""},"3699":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-90","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#clean-up","content":"\"Backfill MEDDPICC fields across the pipeline.\""},"3700":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-91","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#clean-up","content":"Parent and subsidiary account relationships are also maintained as org structures change. Each week the RevOps owner gets a digest by Slack or email listing new deals, accounts and contacts, the fields updated and enriched, and the records cleaned or de-duplicated. The RevOps playbook on autonomous CRM hygiene covers the thinking behind this."},"3701":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-92","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#with-crm-manager","content":"Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent writes every update to Salesforce, so all changes flow into your existing workflows, reports and dashboards. More on what it does on the CRM Manager page."},"3702":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-93","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#with-meeting-assistant","content":"Oliv AI's Meeting Assistant agent proposes field updates from every call. The CRM Manager agent reviews the same call context and pushes the approved changes to Salesforce."},"3703":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-94","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#with-deal-and-forecast","content":"Oliv AI's Deal Driver agent reads Salesforce field values and stage history for pipeline review and risk flags. Oliv AI's Forecaster agent uses stage, close date and amount, and can sync forecast category and adjusted values back to Salesforce if you configure it."},"3704":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-95","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#with-super-agents","content":"Oliv AI's Olivia agent reads what's already in Salesforce, messy data included, when she answers questions or preps a meeting. Oliv AI's Oliver agent connects to Salesforce for schema alignment, so agents follow your stages and fields."},"3705":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-96","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#with-custom-agents","content":"When you add tools to an agent, Salesforce is selected first in the **Add Tool** catalogue. It offers 34 tools in six groups: **Lookup / Search**, **Create / Update**, **Associations**, **Activities**, **Pipeline / Forecast** and **Utility**. They range from **Find Opportunity** and **Log Call** to **Get Forecast Snapshot** and **Merge Duplicates**. The approval choice for each action is covered in agent tools and run modes."},"3706":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-97","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#with-custom-agents","content":"Every Salesforce action an agent you build can take. Write tools such as Bulk Upsert and Merge Duplicates sit beside read tools, so set each one's run mode."},"3707":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-98","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#with-custom-agents","content":"An agent's **Data** tab lists the Salesforce field sets it reads, **Deals**, **Contacts**, **Accounts** and **Leads**, with a description of each field."},"3708":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-99","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#with-custom-agents","content":"The Data tab shows exactly which Salesforce fields an agent can see, which helps an admin check its access before turning it on."},"3709":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-100","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#with-custom-agents","content":"A Salesforce event can also start an agent. Oliv AI's Multithreader agent carries the trigger **Deal enters Proposal Stage in Salesforce**, and Salesforce is in the **Most popular** group when you press **Add Trigger**."},"3710":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-101","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#with-custom-agents","content":"A Salesforce stage change is the event that starts Oliv AI's Multithreader agent, so its outreach begins the moment a deal reaches Proposal."},"3711":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-102","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#revenue-operations","content":"RevOps installs the package, picks the control mode and runs clean-up jobs on old data. The weekly governance digest shows suggestions, acceptance rate by rep and records cleaned. See how Oliv AI supports revenue operations teams."},"3712":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-103","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#sales-managers","content":"A sales manager opens a deal's **CRM Updates** tab before a 1:1 to see which **AI Suggestions** are still waiting. The 1:1 can then cover the deal itself instead of missing fields. More on Oliv AI for sales managers."},"3713":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-104","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#account-executives","content":"An AE reviews the proposed updates after a call, accepts most of them and edits one. New stakeholders from the call are already contacts with roles on the opportunity. The workflow for running deals as an account executive shows where this fits in the day."},"3714":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-105","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#customer-success","content":"Renewals, QBRs and check-in calls are logged against the account like any sales call. A CSM opening the account sees this week's activity, not last month's. More on Oliv AI for customer success teams."},"3715":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-106","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#compare","content":"Many conversation tools write call notes or fields into Salesforce. Oliv AI also lets you review each update before it's written, creates missing accounts and contacts, and resolves duplicate accounts as activity arrives. Oliv AI is the only platform in this table that does all four."},"3716":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-107","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#compare","content":"Salesforce sync features, from each platform's public documentation:"},"3717":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-108","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#compare","content":"| Platform    | Fields filled from conversations | Review before each write | New accounts and contacts created | Duplicate accounts resolved |\n| ----------- | -------------------------------- | ------------------------ | --------------------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| **Oliv AI** | Yes                              | Yes                      | Yes                               | Yes                         |","table":"table-1"},"3718":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-109","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#compare","content":"| Platform | Fields filled from conversations        | Review before each write                     | New accounts and contacts created           | Duplicate accounts resolved |\n| -------- | --------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| **Gong** | Yes (AI data fields mapped to your CRM) | Automatic (fields update without rep action) | Partly (contact flows, inactive by default) | Not in docs                 |","table":"table-1"},"3719":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-110","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#compare","content":"| Platform  | Fields filled from conversations                | Review before each write | New accounts and contacts created           | Duplicate accounts resolved |\n| --------- | ----------------------------------------------- | ------------------------ | ------------------------------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| **Avoma** | Yes (CRM properties mapped to Smart categories) | Not in docs              | Partly (contacts for external participants) | Not in docs                 |","table":"table-1"},"3720":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-111","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#compare","content":"| Platform      | Fields filled from conversations  | Review before each write             | New accounts and contacts created | Duplicate accounts resolved |\n| ------------- | --------------------------------- | ------------------------------------ | --------------------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| **Fireflies** | Yes (Autofill CRM for Salesforce) | Yes (nothing sent until you approve) | Yes (leads for new participants)  | Not in docs                 |","table":"table-1"},"3721":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-112","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#compare","content":"| Platform   | Fields filled from conversations     | Review before each write | New accounts and contacts created                        | Duplicate accounts resolved |\n| ---------- | ------------------------------------ | ------------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| **Fathom** | Yes (summaries and selected content) | Not in docs              | Matches existing Contacts (writes nothing if none found) | Not in docs                 |","table":"table-1"},"3722":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-113","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#compare","content":"| Platform     | Fields filled from conversations    | Review before each write       | New accounts and contacts created | Duplicate accounts resolved |\n| ------------ | ----------------------------------- | ------------------------------ | --------------------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| **Outreach** | Yes (Deal Agent opportunity fields) | Yes (auto-applied or reviewed) | Partly (created inside Outreach)  | Not in docs                 |","table":"table-1"},"3723":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-114","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#compare","content":"*Yes: documented and built in. Partly: documented with a limit, shown in brackets. Not in docs: not found in the vendor's public documentation.*"},"3724":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-115","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#compare-stronger","content":"**It starts from the org you have.** Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent creates missing accounts and contacts and resolves duplicates as activity arrives. Gong describes Salesforce flows for new contacts that ship inactive. Compare Oliv AI vs Gong."},"3725":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-116","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#compare-stronger","content":"**Review first, automate later.** Ask First shows each update beside the current value, and RevOps decides when to switch to Auto-Pilot. Gong documents that AI Data Extractor runs automatically, with no action from reps. See Oliv AI as a Gong alternative."},"3726":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-117","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#compare-stronger","content":"**Accounts as well as contacts.** Oliv AI creates and enriches both accounts and contacts from any activity. Avoma documents that it creates Salesforce Contacts for external meeting participants. Compare Oliv AI vs Avoma."},"3727":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-118","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#compare-stronger","content":"*Competitor details checked against each vendor's public documentation on 21 October 2026. Features and plans change, so confirm with the vendor before you decide.*"},"3728":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-119","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#limits","content":"**Admin install.** The package needs a Salesforce admin and the **Install for All Users** option."},"3729":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-120","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#limits","content":"**Calendar first.** Without a calendar connection, Oliv AI can't take notes during meetings."},"3730":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-121","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#limits","content":"**Custom fields go through Oliv AI's team.** They're mapped during onboarding, not from a settings screen."},"3731":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-122","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#limits","content":"**Review is the default.** Auto-Pilot starts only after RevOps confirms the switch."},"3732":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-123","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#limits","content":"**Unclear matches go back to people.** If an activity can't be matched to the right account or opportunity, the rep is asked."},"3733":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-124","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#limits","content":"**Disconnecting is a request.** To remove the integration, send Oliv AI a message through Intercom in the Oliv AI app."},"3734":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-125","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#faq-replace","content":"No. Oliv AI works with your existing CRM. It brings the context together and keeps Salesforce updated, and Salesforce stays the system of record."},"3735":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-126","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#faq-who-installs","content":"A Salesforce admin. They run the admin install link, install the package with **Install for All Users**, and share the org's Salesforce URL with Oliv AI's team."},"3736":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-127","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#faq-objects","content":"Accounts, contacts, opportunities, activities and tasks. It also updates Opportunity Contact Roles and maintains parent and subsidiary account relationships."},"3737":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-128","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#faq-approval","content":"Not by default. Every suggested update surfaces for review first. Once your team has built confidence, RevOps can switch to **Auto-Pilot** for hands-free updates."},"3738":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-129","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#faq-messy-data","content":"Yes. Real-time mode resolves issues as new activity comes in, and batch jobs clean what's already there. You don't need a clean org to start."},"3739":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-130","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#faq-custom-fields","content":"Oliv AI's team configures custom fields during onboarding as a service. Once mapped, they update the same way as standard and methodology fields."},"3740":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-131","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#faq-multiple-opportunities","content":"Oliv AI uses AI to connect meeting, phone, email and Slack activity to the right accounts, contacts and opportunities, including when one account has multiple opportunities."},"3741":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-132","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#faq-other-activity","content":"Yes. Activity logging applies to any activity that reaches the platform, not only meetings Oliv AI joined."},"3742":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-133","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#faq-field-history","content":"Yes. A full history of how each field has been updated is kept and visible. On a deal, **Updates History** sits on the **CRM Updates** tab next to **AI Updates**, the changes already applied."},"3743":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-134","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#faq-usage","content":"Oliv AI's install guide shows how to view Salesforce's own API usage for the last 24 hours and 7 days, and usage by app with Salesforce Workbench. The 7-day report is only visible in Salesforce Classic."},"3744":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-135","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#faq-other-crms","content":"Yes. Salesforce, HubSpot and Zoho are supported out of the box, and additional CRMs are available on request."},"3745":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-136","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#faq-disconnect","content":"Send Oliv AI a message through Intercom in the Oliv AI app, and the team removes the integration."},"3746":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-137","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#related","content":"How the Context Graph enriches your CRM: why Oliv AI adds to Salesforce records and never replaces them."},"3747":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-138","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#related","content":"Salesforce automation explained: how agent-led updates differ from Flow and rule-based automation."},"3748":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-139","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#related","content":"Agentforce and specialized revenue AI: where Salesforce's own AI fits next to Oliv AI."},"3749":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-140","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#related","content":"Context Capture: how raw activity becomes account, deal and people context before it reaches Salesforce."},"3750":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-141","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#related","content":"Oliv AI integrations: every tool Oliv AI connects to alongside Salesforce."},"3751":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-142","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#related","content":"Prepare for a meeting: the brief that draws on the Salesforce records this sync keeps current."},"3752":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-143","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#related","content":"Sales methodology tracking: the qualification frameworks whose fields Oliv AI fills."},"3753":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce-144","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/salesforce#related","content":"Oliv AI product documentation: every documented agent and feature."},"3754":{"id":"/product-docs/int