ntegrations/webex#common-questions","content":"Common questions"},"3928":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-29","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#faq-where","content":"Where do I find the Oliv app for Webex?"},"3929":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-30","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#faq-account","content":"Do I need an Oliv account first?"},"3930":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-31","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#faq-after-install","content":"What happens after I install it?"},"3931":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-32","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#faq-prep","content":"What does the meeting prep include?"},"3932":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-33","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#faq-summary","content":"What is in the summary after a Webex call?"},"3933":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-34","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#faq-reminders","content":"Does Oliv send reminders for Webex meetings?"},"3934":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-35","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#faq-stop-one","content":"How do I stop Oliv joining one Webex call?"},"3935":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-36","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#faq-collaborate","content":"Can my team work on the action items together?"},"3936":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-37","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#faq-find","content":"Where do I find a Webex call later?"},"3937":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-38","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#faq-other-platforms","content":"Does it work for Zoom, Teams and Google Meet as well?"},"3938":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-39","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#faq-remove","content":"How do I remove the Webex integration?"},"3939":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-40","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#related","content":"Related"},"3940":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-41","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","content":"Oliv AI's Webex integration brings Oliv into the meetings you run on Webex. You install the Oliv.ai app from the Webex App Hub and connect your Oliv account. From then on, Oliv joins your Webex calls, sends you prep before each one and shares a summary when it ends."},"3941":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-42","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                                                 |\n| ---------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **What it does** | Joins your Webex calls and summarizes them for Oliv AI's agents |","table":"table-0"},"3942":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-43","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                                                           |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Who it's for** | Account managers, CSMs and account executives whose meetings run on Webex |","table":"table-0"},"3943":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-44","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#at-a-glance","content":"|                          |                                                 |\n| ------------------------ | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| **Where you install it** | The Webex App Hub, by searching for **Oliv.ai** |","table":"table-0"},"3944":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-45","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#at-a-glance","content":"|                     |                                                                               |\n| ------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Before the call** | AI meeting prep on participants, agenda and related documents, plus reminders |","table":"table-0"},"3945":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-46","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#at-a-glance","content":"|                    |                                                                   |\n| ------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **After the call** | A summary with key discussion points, action items and next steps |","table":"table-0"},"3946":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-47","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#at-a-glance","content":"|           |                                                         |\n| --------- | ------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Needs** | A connected calendar and an Oliv account at web.oliv.ai |","table":"table-0"},"3947":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-48","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#what-it-is","content":"The Webex integration is an app called **Oliv.ai** in the Webex App Hub. The App Hub is Webex's own place to find and install apps. Once the app is installed and your Oliv account is connected, Oliv starts joining your Webex calls and summarizing them. Each captured call then appears under **Activities** › **Meetings**, next to calls from every other platform."},"3948":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-49","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#what-it-is","content":"A recorded Webex call lands in the same Meetings list as calls from any other platform, with its duration, meeting type, next step and AI summary."},"3949":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-50","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#what-it-is","content":"The integration covers the whole meeting. Before it, Oliv gives you AI-powered meeting prep. After it, Oliv writes and shares a summary of the call, so nobody has to take notes by hand."},"3950":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-51","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#what-you-get","content":"**Meeting prep.** Concise information about the participants, the agenda and related documents, ready before you join."},"3951":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-52","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#what-you-get","content":"**Reminders.** Timely meeting reminders, so the next call doesn't slip."},"3952":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-53","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#what-you-get","content":"**A summary.** Key discussion points, action items and next steps, generated and shared once the meeting ends."},"3953":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-54","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#what-you-get","content":"**Follow-through.** A place to discuss outcomes, assign action items and work on them with your team."},"3954":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-55","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#what-you-get","content":"**A record over time.** Past summaries and action items you can look back on, to track how next steps are moving."},"3955":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-56","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#what-you-get","content":"In Oliv AI, each meeting opens to an **Overview** tab with **Key takeaways** and an **AI Summary**. Each takeaway carries timestamps that jump back into the recording."},"3956":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-57","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#what-you-get","content":"This is the summary a Webex call produces: the key takeaways and AI summary, each point linked to its moment in the recording, plus the deal it belongs to."},"3957":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-58","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#what-you-get","content":"The **Action Items** tab is where the team works on what was agreed. It shows the **Next meeting**, **Next action** and **Next follow-up**, then a task table with an **Assignee** and **Due Date** for each item, and **Add task** for anything missed."},"3958":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-59","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#what-you-get","content":"After a Webex call, the action items wait here with an owner and a due date, and each one links back to the minute it was agreed."},"3959":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-60","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#what-its-for","content":"The Webex integration is for revenue teams whose meetings happen on Webex, often because a customer or their own IT team has standardized on it. It puts those calls in front of Oliv AI's agents, the same way calls on other platforms are."},"3960":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-61","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#how-it-helps","content":"**No separate tool to approve.** Oliv installs from the Webex App Hub, where Webex users already find their apps."},"3961":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-62","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#how-it-helps","content":"**Prep arrives before the call.** You get the participants, agenda and documents without opening five tabs."},"3962":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-63","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#how-it-helps","content":"**Notes write themselves.** The summary covers discussion points, action items and next steps."},"3963":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-64","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#how-it-helps","content":"**Next steps stay visible.** Past summaries and action items sit in one place for the whole team."},"3964":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-65","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#without-it","content":"Webex calls stay outside what Oliv AI knows about the account. The prep for the next meeting misses what was said in the last one. Action items live in one person's notebook, and the rest of the team learns about them late or not at all."},"3965":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-66","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#why-buyers-care","content":"Account managers and customer success leaders care most, because their large accounts often set the meeting platform. They need every check-in and review captured, whatever tool the customer insists on. Revenue leaders care when a book of enterprise accounts would otherwise fall out of their reporting."},"3966":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-67","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#approach","content":"Imagine an account manager who looks after one large enterprise customer. The customer's IT team has made Webex the standard, and staff can only join meetings on approved tools. So every weekly check-in, steering call and quarterly review with that account runs on Webex."},"3967":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-68","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#approach","content":"The common fallback is to keep notes by hand on those calls, or to record them and promise to review the recording later. Both tend to slip when the week fills up. The account's history then lives in scattered notes, and the next meeting starts with recalling what was agreed."},"3968":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-69","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#approach","content":"The meeting tool is the only thing that is different here. The calls still sit on a calendar, with the same people and the same need for prep and follow-up. So the fix is to meet Webex where it already is, rather than asking the customer to change platforms."},"3969":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-70","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#approach","content":"Oliv AI does this with its app in the Webex App Hub. Oliv AI joins the account manager's Webex calls, sends meeting prep before each one and shares a summary with action items and next steps afterward. Those summaries then sit alongside the calls from every other platform the team uses."},"3970":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-71","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#approach","content":"The setup is short enough to follow in one sitting: five steps, all listed under Set up the Webex integration. What the app offers next to other Webex options is covered in How the Webex integration compares, below."},"3971":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-72","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#set-up","content":"**Open the Webex App Hub.** Go to the App Hub from your Webex account."},"3972":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-73","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#set-up","content":"**Search for Oliv.ai.** Type \"Oliv.ai\" in the App Hub search bar and open the app from the results."},"3973":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-74","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#set-up","content":"**Install the app.** Click **Install** to start the installation."},"3974":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-75","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#set-up","content":"**Connect your Oliv account.** Visit web.oliv.ai and follow the on-screen instructions. If you don't have an Oliv account yet, you can create one through onboarding."},"3975":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-76","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#set-up","content":"**Finish setup.** Oliv starts joining your Webex calls and summarizing your meetings."},"3976":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-77","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#calendar","content":"Calendar integration is required for Oliv to work. Without it, Oliv can't take notes during your meetings. Connect your calendar by logging in at web.oliv.ai."},"3977":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-78","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#manage-note-taker","content":"Oliv joins external calls automatically. You can manage that from your calendar or from Oliv itself. To keep the note taker out of a particular call, use one of these:"},"3978":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-79","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#manage-note-taker","content":"The Oliv AI Chrome extension or the Oliv AI Outlook add-in."},"3979":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-80","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#manage-note-taker","content":"The **Meetings** page in Oliv AI, under **Activities**."},"3980":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-81","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#manage-note-taker","content":"The link to remove it in your meeting preparation summary, by email or in Slack."},"3981":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-82","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#manage-note-taker","content":"To remove the Webex integration, send Oliv a message through Intercom in the Oliv app."},"3982":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-83","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#find-meetings","content":"If Oliv sends you a Slack message about a meeting, click **Open Meeting** to go straight to it. You can also open **Activities** › **Meetings** and search the list for the call. **My meetings** holds your own calls, and **Team meetings** widens it to your team."},"3983":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-84","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#find-meetings","content":"To share part of a call, open the meeting's **Recording** tab. Find the moment in **Chapters** or **Transcripts**, then use **Clip** to cut it or **Share** to send the meeting."},"3984":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-85","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#find-meetings","content":"The Recording tab of a captured call. Chapters and the transcript help you find a moment fast, and Clip or Share sends it on without rewatching the whole meeting."},"3985":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-86","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#find-meetings","content":"For ideas on how to lay out what you send, look through these meeting summary templates."},"3986":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-87","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#with-meeting-assistant","content":"Oliv AI's Meeting Assistant agent runs on recordings and transcripts from the Oliv Notetaker. When a Webex meeting is on your calendar and linked to an active deal, it runs automatically. It sends a brief thirty minutes before the call, then drafts the follow-up email and flags CRM field updates after it."},"3987":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-88","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#with-olivia","content":"Oliv AI's Olivia agent holds the context of every deal, account and conversation. Your Webex calls become part of what she reads when you ask her about an account. She can also pull from a meeting transcript to draft a follow-up."},"3988":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-89","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#with-portfolio-manager","content":"Oliv AI's Portfolio Manager agent works from customer-facing interactions such as QBRs, check-ins and onboarding calls. Webex reviews with an enterprise account feed that picture, so renewal risk and expansion potential reflect what customers said."},"3989":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-90","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#with-crm-manager","content":"Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent handles the field updates that come out of a call. Olivia surfaces proposed updates after each meeting, and CRM Manager carries them out once you approve. The full flow is in keeping the CRM updated."},"3990":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-91","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#with-other-agents","content":"Oliv AI's Deal Driver agent includes Meeting Assistant for reps, so each summarized call feeds the manager's view. Oliv AI's Coach agent can score recorded calls for coaching. Oliv AI's Content Curator agent needs the Oliv Notetaker recording, because it clips moments from those calls."},"3991":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-92","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#account-management","content":"Account managers on enterprise accounts install the app once and stop worrying about the platform. Every check-in on Webex ends with a summary and a clear list of next steps. More on Oliv AI for account management."},"3992":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-93","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#customer-success","content":"CSMs run onboarding and review calls on whatever the customer uses. The prep before each call pulls in participants and documents, so a handover or a renewal call starts informed. See Oliv AI for customer success."},"3993":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-94","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#account-executives","content":"Account executives selling into Webex-standard companies get the same prep and follow-up as on any other platform. The full selling day is described in running deals as an account executive."},"3994":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-95","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#webex-admins","content":"Webex admins see a familiar install path, because the app comes from the App Hub. RevOps can check which Oliv seats each team needs in plans and seat roles."},"3995":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-96","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#compare","content":"Oliv AI installs from the Webex App Hub, joins your Webex calls and sends meeting prep before each one without a click. Oliv AI is the only platform in this table that does all three."},"3996":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-97","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#compare","content":"Webex meeting features, from each platform's public documentation:"},"3997":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-98","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#compare","content":"| Platform    | Joins and summarizes Webex calls | Prep sent before each meeting | Installed from the Webex App Hub |\n| ----------- | -------------------------------- | ----------------------------- | -------------------------------- |\n| **Oliv AI** | Yes                              | Yes                           | Yes                              |","table":"table-1"},"3998":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-99","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#compare","content":"| Platform  | Joins and summarizes Webex calls    | Prep sent before each meeting         | Installed from the Webex App Hub |\n| --------- | ----------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- | -------------------------------- |\n| **Avoma** | Yes (records and transcribes Webex) | Partly (prep view opened per meeting) | Connected in Avoma settings      |","table":"table-1"},"3999":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-100","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#compare","content":"| Platform      | Joins and summarizes Webex calls       | Prep sent before each meeting         | Installed from the Webex App Hub |\n| ------------- | -------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- | -------------------------------- |\n| **Fireflies** | Yes (joins when it finds a Webex link) | Yes (Meeting Prep from your calendar) | Invited from your calendar       |","table":"table-1"},"4000":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-101","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#compare","content":"| Platform | Joins and summarizes Webex calls      | Prep sent before each meeting               | Installed from the Webex App Hub |\n| -------- | ------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------- |\n| **Gong** | Yes (connects to Webex as a provider) | Partly (prep page opened from the calendar) | Turned on by a Gong admin        |","table":"table-1"},"4001":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-102","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#compare","content":"| Platform     | Joins and summarizes Webex calls | Prep sent before each meeting            | Installed from the Webex App Hub |\n| ------------ | -------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- | -------------------------------- |\n| **Outreach** | Yes (Kaia set up for Webex)      | Yes (briefs ahead of scheduled meetings) | Admin connects the Webex tile    |","table":"table-1"},"4002":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-103","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#compare","content":"| Platform   | Joins and summarizes Webex calls | Prep sent before each meeting | Installed from the Webex App Hub |\n| ---------- | -------------------------------- | ----------------------------- | -------------------------------- |\n| **Fathom** | Not in docs                      | Not in docs                   | Not in docs                      |","table":"table-1"},"4003":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-104","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#compare","content":"*Yes: documented and built in. Partly: documented with a limit, shown in brackets. Not in docs: not found in the vendor's public documentation.*"},"4004":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-105","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#compare-stronger","content":"**Prep that arrives on its own.** Oliv AI provides meeting prep before your Webex meetings without being asked. In Avoma, you click the Prepare for Meeting button on each upcoming meeting. Compare Oliv AI vs Avoma."},"4005":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-106","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#compare-stronger","content":"**Installed where Webex users look.** You add Oliv from the Webex App Hub in your own Webex account. Gong's Webex recording is switched on in the Gong admin center, under Web conferencing. Compare Oliv AI vs Gong."},"4006":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-107","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#compare-stronger","content":"**Set up by the person who runs the meetings.** Oliv starts joining your Webex calls once you install the app and connect your account. Outreach requires that the administrator first connect Webex before users set up Kaia. See how Gong and Outreach compare."},"4007":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-108","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#compare-stronger","content":"*Competitor details checked against each vendor's public documentation on 22 October 2026. Features and plans change, so confirm with the vendor before you decide.*"},"4008":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-109","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#limits","content":"**Your calendar must be connected.** Without calendar integration, Oliv can't take notes in your meetings."},"4009":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-110","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#limits","content":"**You need an Oliv account.** The App Hub install connects to an account at web.oliv.ai, which you can create through onboarding."},"4010":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-111","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#limits","content":"**The note taker joins external calls automatically.** If a call shouldn't be captured, remove the note taker for that call ahead of time."},"4011":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-112","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#limits","content":"**Removal goes through Oliv.** To remove the integration, message Oliv through Intercom in the Oliv app."},"4012":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-113","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#faq-where","content":"In the Webex App Hub. Open it from your Webex account, search for \"Oliv.ai\" and open the app from the results."},"4013":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-114","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#faq-account","content":"You connect one during setup. Visit web.oliv.ai and follow the on-screen steps. If you don't have an account, you can create one through onboarding."},"4014":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-115","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#faq-after-install","content":"Once your account is connected, Oliv starts joining your Webex calls and summarizing them. Prep arrives before each meeting and a summary follows each one."},"4015":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-116","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#faq-prep","content":"Concise information about the participants, the agenda and related documents. For calls on active deals, Meeting Assistant also sends a brief thirty minutes before."},"4016":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-117","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#faq-summary","content":"Key discussion points, action items and next steps. Oliv generates and shares it automatically once the meeting ends."},"4017":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-118","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#faq-reminders","content":"Yes. Oliv sends timely meeting reminders, so you stay on schedule across your day."},"4018":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-119","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#faq-stop-one","content":"Use the **Meetings** page under **Activities**, or the removal link in your meeting preparation summary. The Chrome extension and Outlook add-in work too."},"4019":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-120","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#faq-collaborate","content":"Yes. You can discuss meeting outcomes, assign action items and work on them with your team. Past summaries stay available to track progress."},"4020":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-121","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#faq-find","content":"Click **Open Meeting** in the Slack message about the call, or search the list under **Activities** › **Meetings**."},"4021":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-122","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#faq-other-platforms","content":"Yes. Zoom has its own Zoom integration. For Teams and Google Meet, no separate integration is needed once your calendar is connected."},"4022":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-123","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#faq-remove","content":"Send Oliv a message through Intercom in the Oliv app, and the team removes it for you."},"4023":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-124","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#related","content":"Prepare for a meeting: what the brief before a call contains."},"4024":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-125","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#related","content":"Record a meeting and follow up: what happens once a call ends."},"4025":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-126","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#related","content":"Recording modes: bot and botless: how Oliv records on other platforms."},"4026":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-127","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#related","content":"Converse, Oliv AI's capture app: how calls, phone and email are captured."},"4027":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-128","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#related","content":"Salesforce and HubSpot: where call insights are written."},"4028":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-129","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#related","content":"Oliv AI integrations: every tool Oliv AI connects to."},"4029":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-130","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#related","content":"Integrations on oliv.ai: the full list by category."},"4030":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-131","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#related","content":"Meeting preparation for sales: how to walk into a call ready."},"4031":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-132","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#related","content":"Oliv AI pricing: plans and what each includes."},"4032":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex-133","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/webex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/webex#related","content":"Oliv AI product documentation: every documented agent and feature."},"4033":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","type":"page","content":"Zoom","breadcrumbs":["Oliv AI docs","Integrations"],"tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom"},"4034":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-0","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","content":"How Oliv AI records Zoom calls, picks between botless recording and a visible note taker, keeps recording when the host is absent, and puts CRM fields inside Zoom."},"4035":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-1","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#at-a-glance","content":"At a glance"},"4036":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-2","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#what-it-is","content":"What the Zoom integration is"},"4037":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-3","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#two-apps","content":"The two Zoom apps"},"4038":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-4","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#recording-modes","content":"How Oliv AI picks a recording mode"},"4039":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-5","page_id":"/product-