/integrations/zoom-24","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#who-uses-it","content":"Who uses the Zoom integration, and how"},"4059":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-25","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#sales-development","content":"Sales development"},"4060":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-26","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#account-executives","content":"Account executives"},"4061":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-27","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#customer-success","content":"Customer success and account management"},"4062":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-28","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#zoom-admins","content":"Zoom admins and revenue operations"},"4063":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-29","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#compare","content":"How the Zoom integration compares"},"4064":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-30","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#compare-stronger","content":"Why Oliv AI is the stronger choice for the Zoom integration"},"4065":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-31","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#limits","content":"Limits and things to know"},"4066":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-32","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#common-questions","content":"Common questions"},"4067":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-33","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#faq-both-apps","content":"Do I need both Zoom apps?"},"4068":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-34","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#faq-visible-bot","content":"Will the prospect see an Oliv participant on the call?"},"4069":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-35","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#faq-host-absent","content":"Can Oliv record if the host never joins?"},"4070":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-36","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#faq-consent","content":"Does Oliv record without asking?"},"4071":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-37","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#faq-not-recorded","content":"Why didn't my call get recorded?"},"4072":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-38","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#faq-stop-one-call","content":"How do I stop the note taker joining one call?"},"4073":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-39","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#faq-in-meeting","content":"What can I do inside Zoom during a call?"},"4074":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-40","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#faq-find-recording","content":"Where do I find a recording after the call?"},"4075":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-41","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#faq-permissions","content":"Which Zoom permissions does Oliv ask for?"},"4076":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-42","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#faq-other-platforms","content":"Does it work for Microsoft Teams and Google Meet too?"},"4077":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-43","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#faq-remove","content":"How do I remove the Zoom integration?"},"4078":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-44","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#related","content":"Related"},"4079":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-45","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","content":"Oliv AI's Zoom integration records your Zoom calls and turns them into summaries, follow-ups and deal updates. When your company hosts the call, Oliv can record botlessly through Zoom itself. When someone else hosts, a note taker joins under your company's name. A separate Zoom app puts Oliv inside the meeting window, so you can update CRM fields while you talk."},"4080":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-46","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                                       |\n| ---------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| **What it does** | Records Zoom calls and feeds them to Oliv AI's agents |","table":"table-0"},"4081":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-47","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                                                     |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Who it's for** | SDRs, account executives, customer success managers and Zoom admins |","table":"table-0"},"4082":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-48","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#at-a-glance","content":"|                   |                                                                           |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Two Zoom apps** | **Oliv - Meeting bot** for recording, **Oliv.ai** for use during the call |","table":"table-0"},"4083":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-49","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#at-a-glance","content":"|                     |                                                                                |\n| ------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Recording modes** | Botless on calls your company hosts, a visible note taker on calls others host |","table":"table-0"},"4084":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-50","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#at-a-glance","content":"|           |                                                                 |\n| --------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Needs** | A connected calendar, plus a Zoom admin for host-free recording |","table":"table-0"},"4085":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-51","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#at-a-glance","content":"|                    |                                                                     |\n| ------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **After the call** | Summary and next steps, a follow-up draft and a shareable recording |","table":"table-0"},"4086":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-52","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#what-it-is","content":"The Zoom integration connects your Zoom account to Oliv AI. It is how Oliv AI's Converse app captures Zoom calls: it joins Zoom, Meet and Teams automatically and labels every speaker. Once a call ends, the summary and next steps are ready, and a follow-up draft follows within minutes. Every recorded Zoom call then sits under **Activities** › **Meetings**."},"4087":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-53","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#what-it-is","content":"Where your recorded Zoom calls end up: one list of captured meetings, each with its duration, who it was with, the agreed next step and a short AI summary."},"4088":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-54","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#two-apps","content":"Oliv offers two apps on the Zoom marketplace."},"4089":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-55","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#two-apps","content":"**Oliv - Meeting bot.** Adds a meeting bot that records your meetings with your consent. After the meeting, it analyzes the call and surfaces the meeting details for you."},"4090":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-56","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#two-apps","content":"**Oliv.ai.** The richer in-meeting app. It has the bot join the call, cuts the steps needed for recording consent, and shows Oliv inside Zoom so you can edit CRM fields directly."},"4091":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-57","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#recording-modes","content":"When botless recording is turned on for your organization, Oliv chooses the method by who organized the meeting."},"4092":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-58","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#recording-modes","content":"**Your company organized it.** Oliv records directly through Zoom. No Oliv participant joins, though everyone still sees Zoom's own recording indicator."},"4093":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-59","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#recording-modes","content":"**Someone outside your company organized it.** The note taker joins as a visible participant, shown with your company's name. If the meeting has a waiting room, someone may need to admit it."},"4094":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-60","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#what-its-for","content":"The Zoom integration is for teams that run their customer calls on Zoom. It makes sure each call is recorded and handed to Oliv AI's agents. The agents then prepare the next call and handle the follow-up."},"4095":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-61","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#how-it-helps","content":"**Calls get recorded without a reminder.** Once you log in, Oliv starts joining and summarizing your Zoom calls."},"4096":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-62","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#how-it-helps","content":"**Hosted calls stay clean.** On calls your company organizes, no extra participant appears in the room."},"4097":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-63","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#how-it-helps","content":"**The host can be late.** With a Zoom admin's permission, recording goes ahead even if the host never joins."},"4098":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-64","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#how-it-helps","content":"**Deal updates happen in the meeting.** The in-meeting app lets you edit deal data during the call."},"4099":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-65","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#without-it","content":"Calls that are never recorded leave no transcript behind. The follow-up rests on what the rep wrote down, and the CRM gets whatever the rep remembers to type. Agents that prepare the next meeting have nothing to read from the last one."},"4100":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-66","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#why-buyers-care","content":"Sales development leaders care first, because first calls are where qualification starts and handoffs begin. Account executives care on every active deal. Zoom admins care at rollout, since they grant the permissions that decide how calls get recorded."},"4101":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-67","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#approach","content":"Picture a sales development team of ten that books every first call on Zoom. Some calls sit on an SDR's own Zoom account. Others run on the prospect's link. Often an account executive joins halfway, and now and then the SDR who booked the call is out sick."},"4102":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-68","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#approach","content":"The usual habit is to have each SDR press record, or invite a recorder, at the start of every call. That tends to break on busy days. A call hosted by the prospect may never get recorded, and a call whose host is missing can go unrecorded too. The handoff to the account executive then runs on a few typed notes."},"4103":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-69","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#approach","content":"Nothing about the call itself has changed. It is still a Zoom meeting on a calendar, with a known organizer. So the recording can follow the calendar and the organizer, instead of depending on someone remembering a button."},"4104":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-70","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#approach","content":"Oliv AI does this through Zoom. It records calls your company organizes botlessly through Zoom, and joins calls others organize as a visible note taker under your company's name. Once a Zoom admin grants shared access, Oliv records even when the host isn't present. The recording then feeds the agents that brief the account executive."},"4105":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-71","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#approach","content":"You can see what each Zoom app is allowed to do. Every permission it asks Zoom for is listed in plain words in Permissions Zoom asks for. The features they enable are covered in How the Zoom integration compares, below."},"4106":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-72","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#set-up","content":"**Connect your calendar.** Calendar integration is required for Oliv to work. Without it, Oliv can't take notes during your meetings."},"4107":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-73","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#set-up","content":"**Log in to Oliv.** Sign in at web.oliv.ai and set up your account. Oliv starts joining and summarizing your Zoom calls."},"4108":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-74","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#set-up","content":"**Install the Oliv.ai Zoom app.** Open web.oliv.ai/apps/zoom-meeting-bot. That's all the in-meeting app needs."},"4109":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-75","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#set-up","content":"**Choose auto-record if you host.** By default, Oliv asks the host for permission to record. To auto-record meetings you host, use the same page."},"4110":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-76","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#admin-recording","content":"A Zoom admin has to complete these steps, because they grant the needed permissions."},"4111":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-77","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#admin-recording","content":"**Open the meeting bot settings.** Go to web.oliv.ai/apps/zoom-meeting-bot."},"4112":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-78","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#admin-recording","content":"**Grant admin permissions.** Check the **Permissions** box on the page."},"4113":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-79","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#admin-recording","content":"**Enable shared access.** Click **Allow** to turn on the Shared Access Permission."},"4114":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-80","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#admin-recording","content":"**Tell the Oliv team.** They finish the remaining setup on the backend."},"4115":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-81","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#botless-setup","content":"Botless recording is set up per organization. If it isn't on for your team yet, contact Oliv Support and connect your Zoom admin with them. They'll help enable it."},"4116":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-82","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#in-meeting","content":"With the **Oliv.ai** app installed, you can open Oliv directly in the Zoom window. From there, you can update the deal data for the account while you talk. You can also see the important moments you highlighted through Oliv during the meeting."},"4117":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-83","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#in-meeting","content":"Once the call is done, the recording shows up in the Oliv app, where you can share it. The meeting's **Recording** tab has the player, a speaker **Timeline** with talk time and engagement, and **Chapters**, **Transcripts** and **Comments**, with **Clip** and **Share** under the player."},"4118":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-84","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#in-meeting","content":"What a recorded Zoom call becomes in Oliv AI: the recording split into chapters and a transcript, with speaker stats and controls to clip or share a moment."},"4119":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-85","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#in-meeting","content":"CRM changes that come out of the call are listed on the meeting's **CRM Updates** tab. Completed writes carry a check, and a stage move waits as a **Pending Update** until you press **Update Deal**."},"4120":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-86","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#in-meeting","content":"Alongside the fields you edit inside Zoom, this tab records every CRM change made from the call and holds a stage move until someone confirms it."},"4121":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-87","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#in-meeting","content":"The app also matches the Zoom meeting you're in to its calendar event, so the call lands on the right meeting."},"4122":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-88","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#manage-note-taker","content":"Oliv joins external calls automatically. You can stop it from joining a call in five ways:"},"4123":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-89","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#manage-note-taker","content":"The Oliv AI Chrome extension or the Oliv AI Outlook add-in."},"4124":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-90","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#manage-note-taker","content":"The **Meetings** page in Oliv AI, under **Activities**."},"4125":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-91","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#manage-note-taker","content":"The link to remove it in the meeting preparation summary, by email or in Slack."},"4126":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-92","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#manage-note-taker","content":"The link to remove it in the Zoom chat."},"4127":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-93","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#manage-note-taker","content":"Removing it directly from Zoom."},"4128":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-94","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#manage-note-taker","content":"To remove the whole Zoom integration, send Oliv a message through Intercom in the Oliv app."},"4129":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-95","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#permissions","content":"| App                    | Zoom permission | What it allows                              |\n| ---------------------- | --------------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| **Oliv - Meeting bot** | user_zak:read   | The Oliv bot joins the calls you want it to |","table":"table-1"},"4130":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-96","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#permissions","content":"| App         | Zoom permission | What it allows                                                   |\n| ----------- | --------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Oliv.ai** | meeting:read    | Reads the meeting you're in and matches it to its calendar event |","table":"table-1"},"4131":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-97","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#permissions","content":"| App         | Zoom permission | What it allows                                |\n| ----------- | --------------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| **Oliv.ai** | user:read       | Keeps track of the meeting recordings you own |","table":"table-1"},"4132":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-98","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#permissions","content":"| App         | Zoom permission                    | What it allows                                                 |\n| ----------- | ---------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Oliv.ai** | meeting_token:read:local_recording | Shows you the recording in Oliv after the call, ready to share |","table":"table-1"},"4133":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-99","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#permissions","content":"| App         | Zoom permission   | What it allows                                 |\n| ----------- | ----------------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| **Oliv.ai** | zoomapp:inmeeting | Opens the Oliv app directly in the Zoom window |","table":"table-1"},"4134":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-100","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#find-recordings","content":"If Oliv sends you a Slack message about a meeting, click **Open Meeting** in it to jump to the call in Oliv. You can also go to **Activities** › **Meetings** and search for it, on **My meetings** or **Team meetings**."},"4135":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-101","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#find-recordings","content":"To share part of a call, open its **Recording** tab, find the moment in **Chapters** or **Transcripts**, and press **Clip**. If you need ideas for what to capture, read about taking notes during sales calls."},"4136":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-102","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#with-meeting-assistant","content":"Oliv AI's Meeting Assistant agent runs on recordings and transcripts from the Oliv Notetaker. Thirty minutes before each call on an active deal, it sends a brief. After the call, it drafts the follow-up email and flags CRM field updates. See how that plays out when you prepare for a meeting."},"4137":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-103","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#with-researcher","content":"Oliv AI's Researcher agent handles first calls with people you haven't met. Thirty minutes before the meeting, it sends three bullets on the company and the person, plus an icebreaker. Researcher is packaged within the Prospector bundle."},"4138":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-104","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#with-olivia","content":"Oliv AI's Olivia agent answers questions about deals and accounts. Recorded Zoom calls are part of the context she reads from."},"4139":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-105","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#with-deal-driver-coach","content":"Oliv AI's Deal Driver agent bundles Meeting Assistant for reps, so each recorded call feeds the manager's view. Oliv AI's Coach agent lists Zoom as one of the call sources it can score for coaching. Each scored call gets a **Coaching** tab with a grade, skill scores out of 5 and a **MEDDPICC Scorecard**."},"4140":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-106","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#with-deal-driver-coach","content":"A recorded Zoom call scored by Oliv AI's Coach agent: an overall grade, a score per skill and qualification coverage on one radar, ready for the next one-to-one."},"4141":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-107","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#with-content-curator","content":"Oliv AI's Content Curator agent needs the Oliv Notetaker to be recording, because it clips moments from those calls for enablement."},"4142":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-108","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#sales-development","content":"SDRs book first calls on Zoom and leave the recording to Oliv. The account executive who takes the deal next gets the call, not a summary typed from memory. See how Oliv AI supports sales development teams."},"4143":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-109","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#account-executives","content":"Account executives use the in-meeting app to update deal fields while the customer is still talking. After the call, they review the drafted follow-up. The full day is laid out in running deals as an account executive."},"4144":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-110","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#customer-success","content":"CSMs record renewal and check-in calls the same way. Those recordings feed the agents that watch account health. More on Oliv AI for customer success and account management."},"4145":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-111","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#zoom-admins","content":"A Zoom admin grants the shared access that lets Oliv record when the host is absent. RevOps can review what each app may do in the permissions table above. See Oliv AI for revenue operations."},"4146":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-112","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#compare","content":"Oliv AI records Zoom calls your company hosts without a bot, and keeps recording when the host is absent once a Zoom admin grants access. Its in-meeting app also lets you edit CRM fields without leaving Zoom. Oliv AI is the only platform in this table that does all three."},"4147":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-113","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#compare","content":"Zoom recording features, from each platform's public documentation:"},"4148":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-114","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#compare","content":"| Platform    | Botless recording on Zoom | Records with the host absent | CRM fields edited inside Zoom |\n| ----------- | ------------------------- | ---------------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| **Oliv AI** | Yes                       | Yes                          | Yes                           |","table":"table-2"},"4149":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-115","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#compare","content":"| Platform | Botless recording on Zoom   | Records with the host absent       | CRM fields edited inside Zoom         |\n| -------- | --------------------------- | ---------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| **Gong** | Yes (native Zoom recording) | Yes (bot records without the host) | Partly (notes and moments in the app) |","table":"table-2"},"4150":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-116","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#compare","content":"| Platform  | Botless recording on Zoom         | Records with the host absent            | CRM fields edited inside Zoom  |\n| --------- | --------------------------------- | --------------------------------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| **Avoma** | Yes (Zoom Cloud Recording option) | Partly (joins on behalf of an attendee) | Partly (notes app inside Zoom) |","table":"table-2"},"4151":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-117","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#compare","content":"| Platform   | Botless recording on Zoom    | Records with the host absent | CRM fields edited inside Zoom |\n| ---------- | ---------------------------- | ---------------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| **Fathom** | Yes (botless Zoom recording) | Not in docs                  | Not in docs                   |","table":"table-2"},"4152":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-118","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#compare","content":"| Platform      | Botless recording on Zoom   | Records with the host absent | CRM fields edited inside Zoom |\n| ------------- | --------------------------- | ---------------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| **Fireflies** | Yes (capture without a bot) | Not in docs                  | Not in docs                   |","table":"table-2"},"4153":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-119","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#compare","content":"*Yes: documented and built in. Partly: documented with a limit, shown in brackets. Not in docs: not found in the vendor's public documentation.*"},"4154":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-120","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#compare-stronger","content":"**CRM fields, not just notes, inside Zoom.** The Oliv.ai Zoom app shows Oliv in the meeting so you can edit CRM fields directly. Gong's app for Zoom is for taking notes, marking important moments and following the conversation. Compare Oliv AI vs Gong."},"4155":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-121","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#compare-stronger","content":"**Recording that doesn't wait for a person.** After a Zoom admin grants shared access, Oliv records even when the host is not present. Avoma Assistant joins on behalf of someone from your organization who is in the meeting. Compare Oliv AI vs Avoma."},"4156":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-122","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#compare-stronger","content":"**Calls hosted by others still get recorded.** When someone outside your company organizes the call, Oliv joins as a visible note taker under your company's name. Gong notes that under its organizer-only rule, a call organized by someone outside your team may not record automatically. See Oliv AI as a Gong alternative."},"4157":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-123","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#compare-stronger","content":"*Competitor details checked against each vendor's public documentation on 21 October 2026. Features and plans change, so confirm with the vendor before you decide.*"},"4158":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-124","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#limits","content":"**Consent comes first.** By default, Oliv asks the host for permission to record. Without it, Oliv can't summarize the meeting."},"4159":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-125","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#limits","content":"**Waiting rooms need a click.** On calls hosted by someone else, the note taker may need to be admitted from the waiting room."},"4160":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-126","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#limits","content":"**Botless recording needs setup.** Oliv Support enables it with your Zoom admin. Until then, the note taker joins as a visible participant."},"4161":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-127","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#limits","content":"**Host-free recording needs a Zoom admin.** Only a Zoom admin can grant shared access, and the Oliv team then finishes the setup."},"4162":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-128","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#limits","content":"**Your calendar must be connected.** Without calendar integration, Oliv can't take notes in your meetings."},"4163":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-129","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#limits","content":"**Removal goes through Oliv.** To remove the integration, message Oliv through Intercom in the Oliv app."},"4164":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-130","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#faq-both-apps","content":"No. **Oliv - Meeting bot** covers recording and summaries. Add the **Oliv.ai** app if you want Oliv inside the Zoom window during calls, where you can edit CRM fields."},"4165":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-131","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#faq-visible-bot","content":"It depends on who organized the call. On calls your company organizes, with botless recording on, no Oliv participant appears. On calls others organize, the note taker joins under your company's name."},"4166":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-132","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#faq-host-absent","content":"Yes, once a Zoom admin grants shared access at web.oliv.ai/apps/zoom-meeting-bot and tells the Oliv team. Recording then goes ahead regardless of whether the host is there."},"4167":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-133","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#faq-consent","content":"By default, Oliv asks the host for permission to record. If you're the host, you can switch to auto-record from the meeting bot page."},"4168":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-134","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#faq-not-recorded","content":"Check that your calendar is connected and that the host gave permission to record. If someone else hosted, the note taker may have been waiting in the lobby for someone to admit it."},"4169":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-135","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#faq-stop-one-call","content":"Use the link in the Zoom chat, the link in your meeting preparation summary, or the **Meetings** page under **Activities**. You can also remove it directly in Zoom."},"4170":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-136","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#faq-in-meeting","content":"With the **Oliv.ai** app, you can open Oliv in the Zoom window, update deal data and see the moments you highlighted through Oliv."},"4171":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-137","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#faq-find-recording","content":"Click **Open Meeting** in the Slack message about the call, or search **Activities** › **Meetings**. On the call's **Recording** tab, **Clip** cuts a moment and **Share** sends the meeting."},"4172":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-138","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#faq-permissions","content":"The meeting bot asks for user_zak:read to join calls. The **Oliv.ai** app asks for meeting:read, user:read, meeting_token:read:local_recording and zoomapp:inmeeting. Each one is explained in the permissions table."},"4173":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-139","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#faq-other-platforms","content":"Yes. For Teams and Google Meet, no separate integration is needed. Oliv joins those meetings automatically once your calendar is connected."},"4174":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-140","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#faq-remove","content":"Send Oliv a message through Intercom in the Oliv app, and the team removes it for you."},"4175":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-141","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#related","content":"Prepare for a meeting: what the brief before a recorded call contains."},"4176":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-142","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#related","content":"Run deals as an account executive: recorded calls in a full selling day."},"4177":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-143","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#related","content":"Deal Driver agent docs: the manager's view built on each call."},"4178":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-144","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#related","content":"Olivia agent docs: ask questions across your recorded calls."},"4179":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-145","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#related","content":"Agent tools and run modes: what a custom agent can do with your apps."},"4180":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-146","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#related","content":"Meeting Assistant agent docs: the agent that preps and follows up each deal call."},"4181":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-147","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#related","content":"Converse, Oliv AI's capture app: how calls, phone and in-person meetings are captured."},"4182":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-148","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#related","content":"Oliv AI integrations: every tool Oliv AI connects to."},"4183":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-149","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#related","content":"Meeting transcription software compared: how transcription accuracy differs."},"4184":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-150","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#related","content":"Meeting recorders for productivity: choosing a recorder for your team."},"4185":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-151","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#related","content":"Oliv AI pricing: plans and what each includes."},"4186":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom-152","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/zoom#related","content":"Oliv AI product documentation: every documented agent and feature."},"4187":{"id":"/product-docs/plans","page_id":"/product-docs/plans","type":"page","content":"Plans overview","breadcrumbs":["Oliv AI docs","Plans"],"tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/plans"},"4188":{"id":"/product-docs/plans-0","page_id":"/product-docs/plans","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans","content":"How Oliv AI's role-based plans, add-ons and agent actions fit together, which apps each seat role brings, and where to find current prices."},"4189":{"id":"/product-docs/plans-1","page_id":"/product-docs/plans","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/plans#billing-parts","content":"The three parts of a bill"},"4190":{"id":"/product-docs/plans-2","page_id":"/product-docs/plans","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/plans#seat-roles","content":"Seat roles and the apps they bring"},"4191":{"id":"/product-docs/plans-3","page_id":"/product-docs/plans","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/plans#add-ons","content":"Add-ons"},"4192":{"id":"/product-docs/plans-4","page_id":"/product-docs/plans","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/plans#agent-actions","content":"Agent actions"},"4193":{"id":"/product-docs/plans-5","page_id":"/product-docs/plans","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/plans#choosing-seats","content":"Choosing seats for your team"},"4194":{"id":"/product-docs/plans-6","page_id":"/product-docs/plans","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/plans#where-prices-live","content":"Where prices live"},"4195":{"id":"/product-docs/plans-7","page_id":"/product-docs/plans","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans","content":"Oliv AI is billed in three parts: a seat role for each person, add-ons for the people who need them, and agent actions based on usage. Seats come in four role-based plans, Amplify, Converse, Sell and Grow, and each plan includes the one below it. This section explains how the parts fit together. Current prices are on Oliv AI's pricing page."},"4196":{"id":"/product-docs/plans-8","page_id":"/product-docs/plans","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans#billing-parts","content":"| Part          | What it covers             | How it's counted                           |\n| ------------- | -------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| **Seat role** | The apps a person works in | One plan per person, matched to their work |","table":"table-0"},"4197":{"id":"/product-docs/plans-9","page_id":"/product-docs/plans","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans#billing-parts","content":"| Part        | What it covers                                | How it's counted                         |\n| ----------- | --------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| **Add-ons** | Coaching, outreach and extra capture channels | Per person, only for those who need them |","table":"table-0"},"4198":{"id":"/product-docs/plans-10","page_id":"/product-docs/plans","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans#billing-parts","content":"| Part              | What it covers             | How it's counted                            |\n| ----------------- | -------------------------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| **Agent actions** | Tasks your agents complete | By usage, separately from app subscriptions |","table":"table-0"},"4199":{"id":"/product-docs/plans-11","page_id":"/product-docs/plans","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans#billing-parts","content":"The plans and seat roles page covers all three in detail. It also has a worked example that sorts a whole revenue org into seat roles."},"4200":{"id":"/product-docs/plans-12","page_id":"/product-docs/plans","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans#seat-roles","content":"Plans are cumulative. Converse includes Amplify, Sell includes Converse, and Grow includes Sell. You can use all four in one company and give each person the plan that matches the apps they need."},"4201":{"id":"/product-docs/plans-13","page_id":"/product-docs/plans","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans#seat-roles","content":"**Amplify** gives every role the super agents, Oliv AI's Oliver agent and Olivia agent, on the **Ask** tab of **Home**. People can ask questions of customer context, review conversations, opportunities and accounts, and build custom agents. The agent builder pages, starting with agent instructions, show what a custom agent is made of."},"4202":{"id":"/product-docs/plans-14","page_id":"/product-docs/plans","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans#seat-roles","content":"**Converse** adds conversation capture: online meetings, email, in-person meetings and phone calls. It is the conversation intelligence plan, and you can buy it on its own. The Converse app docs cover what it captures, and bot and botless recording explains how meetings are recorded."},"4203":{"id":"/product-docs/plans-15","page_id":"/product-docs/plans","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans#seat-roles","content":"**Sell** adds the Forecast app, with sales methodologies and deal risks, for account executives, sales engineering and partnerships. The Forecast app page shows its views, and sales methodology tracking lists the frameworks."},"4204":{"id":"/product-docs/plans-16","page_id":"/product-docs/plans","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans#seat-roles","content":"**Grow** adds the Retain app, with customer health scorecards and churn risks, for customer success, account management, solution engineering and onboarding. More on Oliv AI for customer success and account management teams."},"4205":{"id":"/product-docs/plans-17","page_id":"/product-docs/plans","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans#seat-roles","content":"What every seat role starts with: the super agents on Home, where anyone from the C-suite to a new SDR can ask Olivia or Oliver for work."},"4206":{"id":"/product-docs/plans-18","page_id":"/product-docs/plans","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans#add-ons","content":"Add-ons are priced separately from the four plans and added per person. Enable evaluates customer conversations against coaching scorecards to find where a rep needs help. Engage runs email and LinkedIn outreach from Oliv AI, with a dialer, messaging channels and extra mailboxes available on top. In the app, Engage has **Inbox**, **Dialer**, **Plays**, **Flows**, **Signals** and **Experiments** tabs, and Enable has **Library** (clip libraries) and **People** tabs."},"4207":{"id":"/product-docs/plans-19","page_id":"/product-docs/plans","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans#add-ons","content":"Capture add-ons extend Converse, Sell and Grow. Bot-based meeting capture sends a meeting assistant into the call, including externally hosted meetings when permitted. Slack, WhatsApp and LinkedIn capture are listed as add-ons too. Plaud hardware for in-person recording is purchased separately. The add-ons section lists what each one includes."},"4208":{"id":"/product-docs/plans-20","page_id":"/product-docs/plans","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans#agent-actions","content":"An agent action is a task an agent completes, such as researching an account or updating a CRM record. Agent actions are billed separately from app subscriptions, on every plan, and your total depends on agent usage. During a proof of concept, Oliv AI estimates agent spend at your expected volume and measures the value before rollout."},"4209":{"id":"/product-docs/plans-21","page_id":"/product-docs/plans","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans#agent-actions","content":"The pricing page gives example actions for several agents. Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent creates records, updates fields and syncs next steps. Oliv AI's Deal Driver agent reviews pipeline, drafts follow-ups and flags risks. Oliv AI's Forecaster agent prepares the forecast and updates forecast categories. To see what an agent did on each run, open its run history. Each tool's run mode decides whether an action needs a person's approval first, as agent tools and run modes explains."},"4210":{"id":"/product-docs/plans-22","page_id":"/product-docs/plans","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans#choosing-seats","content":"Assign seat roles by the apps a person needs, not by job title alone. Ask four questions for each person. Do they run customer conversations that should be captured? Do they own or forecast opportunities? Do they own renewals, health or expansion for live customers? Or do they only read context, ask questions and build agents?"},"4211":{"id":"/product-docs/plans-23","page_id":"/product-docs/plans","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans#choosing-seats","content":"Inside the product, the **Agent Feed** on Home can be filtered by **Team** (**Sales**, **Sales Development**, **Customer Success** or **RevOps**) and **Role** (**Contributor** or **Manager**). Each view shows the agents that team and role use. Those filters are views, not seat roles, but they show which agents each group works with."},"4212":{"id":"/product-docs/plans-24","page_id":"/product-docs/plans","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans#choosing-seats","content":"The same product, seen by a customer success manager: the feed shows the agents that work for that team and role, which is a useful check when you decide who needs a Grow seat."},"4213":{"id":"/product-docs/plans-25","page_id":"/product-docs/plans","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans#choosing-seats","content":"For an account executive's day on the Sell plan's agents, read running deals as an account executive. A sales manager's week is in the pipeline review guide. Oliv AI works with your existing CRM, so you keep Salesforce or HubSpot as your system of record."},"4214":{"id":"/product-docs/plans-26","page_id":"/product-docs/plans","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans#where-prices-live","content":"These docs describe plans, roles and how billing works, and leave every figure to the pricing page. To see current prices for each plan and add-on, go to Oliv AI pricing. The same page has a calculator that compares Oliv AI's apps with the tools your team uses now, using your own seat counts. For the thinking behind replacing per-seat tools with agents, read build versus buy for revenue AI. To browse every pre-built agent, open the agent marketplace."},"4215":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","type":"page","content":"Plans and seat roles","breadcrumbs":["Oliv AI docs","Plans"],"tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles"},"4216":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-0","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","content":"The four role-based Oliv AI plans, what each one adds, the add-ons that sit on top, and how to decide which person on your team needs which seat role."},"4217":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-1","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#at-a-glance","content":"At a glance"},"4218":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-2","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#how-plans-stack","content":"How the plans stack"},"4219":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-3","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#seat-roles","content":"The four seat roles"},"4220":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-4","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#amplify","content":"Amplify"},"4221":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-5","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#converse","content":"Converse"},"4222":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-6","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#sell","content":"Sell"},"4223":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-7","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#grow","content":"Grow"},"4224":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-8","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#assign-roles","content":"Assign seat roles across your team"},"4225":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-9","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#in-product-views","content":"What people see in the product"},"4226":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-10","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#questions-per-person","content":"Questions to ask for each person"},"4227":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-11","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#add-ons","content":"Add-ons"},"4228":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-12","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#enable","content":"Enable"},"4229":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-13","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#engage","content":"Engage"},"4230":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-14","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#capture-add-ons","content":"Capture add-ons"},"4231":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-15","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#plaud","content":"Plaud recordings"},"4232":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-16","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#agent-actions","content":"Agent actions"},"4233":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-17","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#cost-calculator","content":"Compare against your current tools"},"4234":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-18","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#limits","content":"Limits and things to know"},"4235":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-19","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#common-questions","content":"Common questions"},"4236":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-20","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#faq-viewers","content":"Do viewers and admins need a Sell or Grow seat?"},"4237":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-21","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#faq-ci-only","content":"Can I buy only conversation intelligence?"},"4238":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-22","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#faq-mixed-plans","content":"Can different people in one company be on different plans?"},"4239":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-23","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#faq-cumulative","content":"Does a higher plan include the lower ones?"},"4240":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-24","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#faq-sales-engineer","content":"Which plan does a sales engineer need?"},"4241":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-25","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#faq-forecasting","content":"Which plan adds forecasting?"},"4242":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-26","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#faq-health","content":"Which plan adds customer health and churn risk?"},"4243":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-27","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#faq-engage","content":"What does Engage include?"},"4244":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-28","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#faq-agent-actions","content":"How are agent actions charged?"},"4245":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-29","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#faq-crm","content":"Do we need to replace Salesforce or HubSpot?"},"4246":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-30","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#faq-in-person","content":"Is in-person meeting capture included?"},"4247":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-31","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#related","content":"Related"},"4248":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-32","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","content":"Oliv AI sells seats by role. There are four plans, Amplify, Converse, Sell and Grow, and each person gets the one that matches the apps their work needs. This page explains what each plan includes, how the plans stack, and how to assign seat roles across a revenue team. Prices aren't listed here; they're on Oliv AI's pricing page."},"4249":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-33","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#at-a-glance","content":"| Plan        | Built around                     | Typical roles                             |\n| ----------- | -------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| **Amplify** | Putting customer context to work | C-suite, Product, Operations, Engineering |","table":"table-0"},"4250":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-34","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#at-a-glance","content":"| Plan         | Built around                     | Typical roles                                      |\n| ------------ | -------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Converse** | Capturing customer conversations | BDRs and SDRs, Product Marketing, Customer Support |","table":"table-0"},"4251":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-35","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#at-a-glance","content":"| Plan     | Built around           | Typical roles                                       |\n| -------- | ---------------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Sell** | Managing opportunities | Account Executives, Sales Engineering, Partnerships |","table":"table-0"},"4252":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-36","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#at-a-glance","content":"| Plan     | Built around                   | Typical roles                                                          |\n| -------- | ------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Grow** | Retaining and growing accounts | Customer Success, Account Management, Solution Engineering, Onboarding |","table":"table-0"},"4253":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-37","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#at-a-glance","content":"Plans are cumulative. Converse includes Amplify, Sell includes Converse, and Grow includes Sell."},"4254":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-38","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#how-plans-stack","content":"Each plan carries everything in the plan below it, then adds one layer:"},"4255":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-39","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#how-plans-stack","content":"**Amplify** gives every role the super agents, Oliver and Olivia, plus questions and reviews across customer context, and building custom agents."},"4256":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-40","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#how-plans-stack","content":"**Converse** adds conversation capture: online meetings, email, in-person meetings and phone calls."},"4257":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-41","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#how-plans-stack","content":"**Sell** adds the Forecast app, with sales methodologies and deal risks."},"4258":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-42","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#how-plans-stack","content":"**Grow** adds the Retain app, with customer health scorecards and churn risks."},"4259":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-43","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#how-plans-stack","content":"You can use all four plans together in one company. Assign each team member by the apps they need, rather than buying one plan for everyone."},"4260":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-44","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#amplify","content":"Amplify is for people who use customer context but don't run calls or own deals. C-suite, Product, Engineering, Operations and Product Marketing can use Oliv AI's Oliver and Olivia agents. They can ask questions of customer context, review conversations, opportunities and accounts, and build custom agents."},"4261":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-45","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#amplify","content":"Oliv AI's Oliver agent configures how agents work. Oliv AI's Olivia agent coordinates their tasks across your team."},"4262":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-46","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#converse","content":"Converse is the conversation intelligence plan, and you can buy it on its own. It can be deployed across your customer-facing organization. It includes:"},"4263":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-47","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#converse","content":"Online meeting capture, botless or bot-based (bot-based capture is an add-on)"},"4264":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-48","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#converse","content":"Email capture and optional Slack capture"},"4265":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-49","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#converse","content":"In-person meeting capture through the mobile app"},"4266":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-50","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#converse","content":"Phone call capture, meeting transcription, and AI summaries and action items"},"4267":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-51","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#converse","content":"A conversation library with search, and meeting notes in the CRM"},"4268":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-52","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#converse","content":"More on the app itself on the Converse page. In the web app, captured conversations sit under **Activities**, as **Meetings** and **Calls**, and the meetings list has **My meetings** and **Team meetings** views."},"4269":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-53","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#converse","content":"Where a Converse seat's captured conversations land: meetings and calls under Activities, each meeting with an AI-written next step and summary."},"4270":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-54","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#sell","content":"Sell adds opportunity management through the Forecast app. It's built for account executives, sales engineering and partnerships. On top of everything in Converse, it includes:"},"4271":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-55","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#sell","content":"Opportunity grids and deal health and risks"},"4272":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-56","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#sell","content":"Sales methodology tracking against the framework you activate: **MEDDPICC**, **MEDDIC**, **SPICED**, **BANT** or **DRIVE**"},"4273":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-57","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#sell","content":"Buying committee tracking"},"4274":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-58","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#sell","content":"Revenue forecast boards, forecast submissions and weekly pipeline snapshots, on the Forecast app's **Boards** and **Submissions** tabs"},"4275":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-59","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#sell","content":"Deal change history"},"4276":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-60","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#sell","content":"The Forecast app page shows these views, and sales methodology tracking covers the frameworks."},"4277":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-61","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#grow","content":"Grow adds account management through the Retain app. It's built for customer success, account management, solution engineering and onboarding. On top of everything in Sell, it includes:"},"4278":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-62","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#grow","content":"Customer grids and customer health scorecards"},"4279":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-63","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#grow","content":"Churn risks and retention forecast boards"},"4280":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-64","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#grow","content":"Product usage tracking and support ticket tracking"},"4281":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-65","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#grow","content":"White space tracking and customer stakeholder tracking"},"4282":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-66","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#grow","content":"More on Oliv AI for customer success teams and for account management."},"4283":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-67","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#assign-roles","content":"Picture a revenue operations lead planning a rollout for a 34-person revenue org. Sales development has five SDRs, and support has two agents who answer customer calls. Sales has nine AEs, two sales engineers and a partnerships manager. Post-sale has five CSMs and two onboarding specialists. Around them sit a CRO, two product managers, two RevOps analysts, two engineers and a product marketer who sits in on customer calls."},"4284":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-68","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#assign-roles","content":"Count each person once, in the group that fits their work. A sorting like this one follows the role examples on the pricing page:"},"4285":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-69","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#assign-roles","content":"| Group                         | People in this example   | Seat role    |\n| ----------------------------- | ------------------------ | ------------ |\n| Sales development and support | 5 SDRs, 2 support agents | **Converse** |","table":"table-1"},"4286":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-70","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#assign-roles","content":"| Group     | People in this example                           | Seat role |\n| --------- | ------------------------------------------------ | --------- |\n| Pre-sales | 9 AEs, 2 sales engineers, 1 partnerships manager | **Sell**  |","table":"table-1"},"4287":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-71","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#assign-roles","content":"| Group      | People in this example           | Seat role |\n| ---------- | -------------------------------- | --------- |\n| Post-sales | 5 CSMs, 2 onboarding specialists | **Grow**  |","table":"table-1"},"4288":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-72","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#assign-roles","content":"| Group                                        | People in this example                                  | Seat role   |\n| -------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------- | ----------- |\n| Leadership, product, operations, engineering | CRO, 2 product managers, 2 RevOps analysts, 2 engineers | **Amplify** |","table":"table-1"},"4289":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-73","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#assign-roles","content":"| Group                              | People in this example | Seat role    |\n| ---------------------------------- | ---------------------- | ------------ |\n| Product marketer on customer calls | 1 product marketer     | **Converse** |","table":"table-1"},"4290":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-74","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#assign-roles","content":"The product marketer is the judgment call. The role examples are a guide, and a customer-facing product marketer can use Converse when they need conversation capture. The same logic works in reverse: give someone Sell or Grow only when they'll work in the Forecast or Retain app."},"4291":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-75","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#in-product-views","content":"Inside Oliv AI, the **Agent Feed** on Home filters by **Team** (**Sales**, **Sales Development**, **Customer Success**, **RevOps**) and **Role** (**Contributor** or **Manager**). Each combination shows the agents that group uses. These are views, not seat roles: use them to check that the seat you pick fits the work each person does."},"4292":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-76","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#in-product-views","content":"The team and role filters show which agents each group relies on, a quick way to sanity-check the seat role you give each person."},"4293":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-77","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#questions-per-person","content":"**Do they run customer conversations that should be captured?** If yes, they need at least Converse."},"4294":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-78","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#questions-per-person","content":"**Do they own or forecast opportunities?** If yes, they need Sell, which brings the Forecast app."},"4295":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-79","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#questions-per-person","content":"**Do they own renewals, health or expansion for live customers?** If yes, they need Grow, which brings the Retain app."},"4296":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-80","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#questions-per-person","content":"**Do they only read context, ask questions or build agents?** Amplify covers that work."},"4297":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-81","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#questions-per-person","content":"For how an AE spends a day with the Sell plan's agents, see running deals as an account executive."},"4298":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-82","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#add-ons","content":"Add-ons are priced separately from the four plans. Each one is added per person, so only the people who need it carry it."},"4299":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-83","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#enable","content":"Enable evaluates customer conversations against coaching scorecards to identify where a rep needs help. It's an add-on, priced separately from the plans. In the app, its **Library** tab holds clip libraries, each **Public** or **Private**, and its **People** tab shows each rep's pacing for managers."},"4300":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-84","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#engage","content":"Engage runs email and LinkedIn outreach from Oliv AI. Add it to Converse, Sell or Grow for team members who connect with prospects and customers. It includes one connected primary mailbox and LinkedIn automation. In the app, Engage has **Inbox**, **Dialer**, **Plays**, **Flows**, **Signals** and **Experiments** tabs. You can add more on top:"},"4301":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-85","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#engage","content":"**Dialer.** One US phone number, with calling minutes to the US and Canada. The **Dialer** tab runs **Power** and **Parallel** sessions."},"4302":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-86","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#engage","content":"**WhatsApp, Telegram or Instagram.** Choose the channels you need, priced per channel."},"4303":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-87","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#engage","content":"**Extra mailboxes.** Additional warm email mailboxes to scale outreach."},"4304":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-88","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#capture-add-ons","content":"Bot-based meeting capture is an add-on on Converse, Sell and Grow. A meeting assistant joins the call, including externally hosted meetings when permitted. Slack, WhatsApp and LinkedIn capture are also listed as add-ons."},"4305":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-89","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#plaud","content":"In-person meeting capture works through the mobile app on Converse. Sell and Grow also support Plaud recordings. Plaud hardware is purchased separately."},"4306":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-90","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#agent-actions","content":"Agent actions are billed separately from app subscriptions, on every plan. An agent action is a task an agent completes, such as researching an account or updating a CRM record. Your total depends on agent usage."},"4307":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-91","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#agent-actions","content":"| Agent                      | Example actions                            |\n| -------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| Oliv AI's Forecaster agent | Prepare forecast, update forecast category |","table":"table-2"},"4308":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-92","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#agent-actions","content":"| Agent                             | Example actions                                           |\n| --------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Oliv AI's Portfolio Manager agent | Flag renewal risk, prioritize customers, draft next steps |","table":"table-2"},"4309":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-93","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#agent-actions","content":"| Agent                      | Example actions                                           |\n| -------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Oliv AI's Prospector agent | Rank target accounts, identify contacts, prepare outreach |","table":"table-2"},"4310":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-94","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#agent-actions","content":"| Agent                       | Example actions                               |\n| --------------------------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| Oliv AI's Deal Driver agent | Review pipeline, draft follow-ups, flag risks |","table":"table-2"},"4311":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-95","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#agent-actions","content":"| Agent                       | Example actions                                |\n| --------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent | Create records, update fields, sync next steps |","table":"table-2"},"4312":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-96","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#agent-actions","content":"During a proof of concept, Oliv AI estimates agent spend at your expected volume. It then assesses return on investment against time saved and business value before rollout. Custom agents you build follow the same model; agent tools and run modes covers what an agent can do in connected apps."},"4313":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-97","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#cost-calculator","content":"The pricing page includes a calculator for your own team. Enter the number of people in each group, Converse, Sell, Grow and Amplify. It compares the Oliv AI apps in their plan with named tools, using the same seat counts."},"4314":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-98","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#cost-calculator","content":"The calculator states its assumptions. Its figures are comparison assumptions, not vendor quotes, because coverage and contracts differ. Platform fees are excluded. For the thinking behind replacing per-seat tools with agents, see build versus buy for revenue AI."},"4315":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-99","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#limits","content":"**Prices live on the pricing page.** This page describes plans and roles only; current prices are on the pricing page."},"4316":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-100","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#limits","content":"**Role examples are a guide.** Assign by the apps a person needs, not by job title alone."},"4317":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-101","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#limits","content":"**Add-ons aren't in the plans.** Enable, Engage, bot-based capture and the extra capture channels are priced separately."},"4318":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-102","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#limits","content":"**Agent usage is separate.** Agent actions are billed apart from seats, and the total depends on what your agents do."},"4319":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-103","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#limits","content":"**Hardware is separate.** Plaud hardware is purchased separately from any plan."},"4320":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-104","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#limits","content":"**Calculator figures are assumptions.** They aren't vendor quotes, and platform fees are excluded."},"4321":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-105","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#faq-viewers","content":"No. Amplify covers C-suite, Product, Engineering, Operations and Product Marketing. They can use Oliver and Olivia, ask questions of customer context, review conversations, opportunities and accounts, and build custom agents."},"4322":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-106","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#faq-ci-only","content":"Yes. Converse is the conversation intelligence plan, and it can be deployed across your customer-facing organization."},"4323":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-107","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#faq-mixed-plans","content":"Yes. Use Amplify, Converse, Sell and Grow together across your company, and assign each team member by the apps they need."},"4324":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-108","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#faq-cumulative","content":"Yes. Converse includes Amplify, Sell includes Converse, and Grow includes Sell."},"4325":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-109","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#faq-sales-engineer","content":"The pricing page puts pre-sales Sales Engineering under Sell, and post-sales Solution Engineering under Grow."},"4326":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-110","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#faq-forecasting","content":"Sell. It brings the Forecast app, with revenue forecast boards, forecast submissions, weekly pipeline snapshots and deal change history. Pipeline reviews with the Deal Driver agent build on the same data."},"4327":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-111","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#faq-health","content":"Grow. It brings the Retain app, with customer health scorecards, churn risks and retention forecast boards."},"4328":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-112","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#faq-engage","content":"One connected primary mailbox and LinkedIn automation. Dialer, WhatsApp, Telegram, Instagram and extra warm email mailboxes are added separately."},"4329":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-113","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#faq-agent-actions","content":"Separately from app subscriptions, based on agent usage. During a proof of concept, Oliv AI estimates the spend at your expected volume and assesses the return against time saved."},"4330":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-114","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#faq-crm","content":"No. Oliv AI works with your existing CRM. It brings the context together and keeps your systems updated."},"4331":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-115","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#faq-in-person","content":"Yes, through the mobile app from Converse up. Sell and Grow also support Plaud recordings, with the hardware purchased separately."},"4332":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-116","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles#related","content":"Oliv AI pricing: current prices for every plan and add-on."},"4333":{"id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles-117","page_id":"/product-docs/plans/plans-and-seat-roles","tags"