 what gets written?"},"4617":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-38","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#faq-deal-changes","content":"Can I see what Oliv AI changed on a deal?"},"4618":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-39","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#faq-slack-email","content":"Does Slack and email activity reach the CRM?"},"4619":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-40","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#faq-multiple-opportunities","content":"What if one account has several open opportunities?"},"4620":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-41","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#faq-acquisition","content":"What if a customer gets acquired and emails from a new domain?"},"4621":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-42","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#faq-messy-data","content":"Our CRM data is messy. Can we still connect?"},"4622":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-43","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#faq-warehouse","content":"Can Oliv AI send context to our data warehouse?"},"4623":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-44","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#faq-which-agents-write","content":"Does every agent write to the CRM?"},"4624":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-45","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#faq-pricing","content":"How is Oliv AI priced?"},"4625":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-46","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#related","content":"Related"},"4626":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-47","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","content":"Oliv AI works as a layer on top of your existing CRM, and the CRM stays your system of record. Oliv AI reads your accounts, contacts and opportunities, connects every meeting, call, email and Slack thread to the right record, and writes the updates back. Your reports, dashboards and forecasts keep running where they run today."},"4627":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-48","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#at-a-glance","content":"|                |                                                                         |\n| -------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **What it is** | A layer that reads your CRM and writes conversation insights back to it |","table":"table-0"},"4628":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-49","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#at-a-glance","content":"|                |                                                                |\n| -------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Which CRMs** | Salesforce, HubSpot and Zoho out of the box, others on request |","table":"table-0"},"4629":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-50","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#at-a-glance","content":"|                      |                                                                                         |\n| -------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **System of record** | Your CRM. Oliv AI works on its records and syncs changes back, rather than replacing it |","table":"table-0"},"4630":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-51","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#at-a-glance","content":"|                      |                                                                                  |\n| -------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Where you see it** | **Records › Deals**, a grid of your pipeline with a ten-tab drawer for each deal |","table":"table-0"},"4631":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-52","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#at-a-glance","content":"|                          |                                                                                      |\n| ------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **What reaches the CRM** | Activities, new accounts and contacts, field values, contact roles and meeting notes |","table":"table-0"},"4632":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-53","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#at-a-glance","content":"|                             |                                                                                                                        |\n| --------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **How writes are approved** | **Accept** or **Reject** on each AI suggestion, under **Ask First** by default, or **Auto-Pilot** once RevOps confirms |","table":"table-0"},"4633":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-54","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#at-a-glance","content":"|                   |                                            |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| **What it needs** | A CRM connection and a calendar connection |","table":"table-0"},"4634":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-55","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#what-it-is","content":"Oliv AI is a layer that sits on top of an existing CRM, rather than replacing it. The sync runs both ways: Oliv AI learns from your records and updates them with new insights. Pipeline, fields, owners, close dates, stages and forecast categories all stay in step."},"4635":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-56","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#what-it-is","content":"You don't move your pipeline anywhere. Inside Oliv AI, the deals your CRM syncs appear under **Records › Deals**, in five views: **Commit**, **Most Likely**, **Best Case**, **Pipeline** and **Closed**. Each row adds AI signals for **Forecast**, **Risks**, **Health**, **Momentum** and **Relationships**."},"4636":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-57","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#what-it-is","content":"Your CRM pipeline as Oliv AI shows it: the same deals, sorted into forecast views, with a signal column for each question a manager asks about a deal."},"4637":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-58","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#what-it-is","content":"Oliv AI keeps the CRM updated from what customers actually said, so the reports your leaders already trust run on current data. Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent does the writing."},"4638":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-59","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#one-product","content":"Oliv AI gives each role the apps it needs and puts the rest of the budget toward agents that work with your team. Plans build on each other: Converse includes Amplify, Sell includes Converse, and Grow includes Sell. Sell adds the Forecast app and Grow adds the Retain app, and every one of them reads the same CRM. The plans and seat roles page shows who gets what."},"4639":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-60","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#beyond-the-crm","content":"Account and opportunity context can also go back into Salesforce, Snowflake, Databricks or Redshift. So a team that reports from a warehouse gets the same context as the team working in the CRM."},"4640":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-61","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#what-its-for","content":"A CRM layer is for revenue leaders who want AI working on their pipeline without a second place to keep it. The CRM stays the record, and Oliv AI fills it from the conversations that never got logged."},"4641":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-62","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#how-it-helps","content":"**One system of record.** Updates flow into your existing workflows, reports and dashboards, so nobody reconciles two databases."},"4642":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-63","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#how-it-helps","content":"**Every channel counts.** Meeting, phone, email and Slack activity lands on the right account, contact and opportunity."},"4643":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-64","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#how-it-helps","content":"**The right deal on busy accounts.** Activity is matched even when one account has several open opportunities."},"4644":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-65","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#how-it-helps","content":"**You approve what gets written.** By default every suggested update surfaces for review before anything reaches the CRM."},"4645":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-66","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#without-it","content":"Your CRM reflects what got logged, not what happened. Reps type notes when they find time, and pipeline reports run on fields nobody has touched in weeks. Leaders then make calls on a record that is a few conversations behind."},"4646":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-67","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#why-buyers-care","content":"A CRO or VP of Sales usually raises this first, because the board pack and the forecast read from the CRM. Revenue operations owns the data quality and signs off on what may write to it. Account executives and account managers feel it as fewer fields to fill after each call."},"4647":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-68","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#approach","content":"Picture a CRO who spent two years folding three regional CRMs into one Salesforce org. Her board pack, the comp plan and every forecast now read from that org. When a vendor pitches an AI tool, her first question is where the data will live."},"4648":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-69","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#approach","content":"The usual compromise is a point tool with its own database and a nightly sync. Reps then check two screens, and someone in RevOps reconciles them when the numbers disagree. That probably costs a few hours a week, and trust in the pipeline report drops each time the two drift apart."},"4649":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-70","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#approach","content":"The CRO isn't short of a database. What her org lacks is the content of the calls, emails and Slack threads that never reach a record. Those conversations happen outside the CRM, so whatever reads them has to sit beside it and write into it."},"4650":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-71","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#approach","content":"Oliv AI does exactly that. It reads Salesforce and connects meeting, phone, email and Slack activity to the right accounts and opportunities. Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent then writes the updates back. Reports and the board pack keep running on the same org, and nothing asks her team to rip and replace on day one."},"4651":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-72","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#approach","content":"Even the match between a conversation and its record holds up on messy accounts. When one account carries several open opportunities, Oliv AI still files the conversation history against the right deal. That matching is one of the points covered in How Oliv AI compares as a CRM layer, below."},"4652":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-73","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#connect","content":"**Pick your CRM.** Salesforce, HubSpot and Zoho work out of the box. Additional CRMs are available on request."},"4653":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-74","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#connect","content":"**Install the connection.** A Salesforce admin follows the Salesforce install steps, and a HubSpot admin follows the HubSpot connection steps."},"4654":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-75","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#connect","content":"**Connect a calendar.** Calendar integration is required for Oliv AI to work, because it's how meetings get captured and notes get taken."},"4655":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-76","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#connect","content":"**Let the standard fields fill.** Close date, deal amount, stage, next steps and last activity date are mapped when you connect, and populate from day one."},"4656":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-77","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#connect","content":"**Hand over the custom fields.** Oliv AI's team maps your custom fields during onboarding as a service."},"4657":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-78","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#connect","content":"In the first week, Oliv AI's team maps your workflow, your CRM setup, where deals slip and where reps skip. You don't need a clean CRM to start."},"4658":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-79","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#write-rules","content":"By default, every suggested update surfaces for review before anything hits the CRM. You review it on the deal itself, in the **CRM Updates** tab, which has three lists with a count on each:"},"4659":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-80","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#write-rules","content":"**AI Suggestions.** One card per field, with the suggested value above its **Current Value**. You click **Accept** to apply it or **Reject** to drop it."},"4660":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-81","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#write-rules","content":"**AI Updates.** Changes Oliv AI has already applied to the deal."},"4661":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-82","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#write-rules","content":"**Updates History.** The record of changes on the deal."},"4662":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-83","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#write-rules","content":"This is where Ask First happens: each proposed field change sits beside the value your CRM holds now, and nothing is written until you accept it."},"4663":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-84","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#write-rules","content":"You choose between two modes:"},"4664":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-85","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#write-rules","content":"**Ask First.** You review each update before it's written."},"4665":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-86","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#write-rules","content":"**Auto-Pilot.** Unreviewed updates apply automatically, and the pipeline stays current without anyone acting."},"4666":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-87","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#write-rules","content":"Once accuracy thresholds are met, RevOps confirms the switch to auto mode. When Oliv AI can't resolve which record an activity belongs to, it asks the seller instead of guessing."},"4667":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-88","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#reads-and-writes","content":"| Direction | What it covers                                                          |\n| --------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Reads** | Accounts, contacts, opportunities and their fields, messy data included |","table":"table-1"},"4668":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-89","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#reads-and-writes","content":"| Direction            | What it covers                                                                     |\n| -------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Writes: activity** | Every meeting, call and email, logged against the account, contact and opportunity |","table":"table-1"},"4669":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-90","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#reads-and-writes","content":"| Direction           | What it covers                                                                        |\n| ------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Writes: records** | New accounts and contacts, the moment an activity involves someone not yet in the CRM |","table":"table-1"},"4670":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-91","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#reads-and-writes","content":"| Direction          | What it covers                                                          |\n| ------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Writes: fields** | Standard, methodology and custom fields, plus Opportunity Contact Roles |","table":"table-1"},"4671":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-92","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#reads-and-writes","content":"| Direction         | What it covers                                                         |\n| ----------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Writes: notes** | Meeting notes on the record, alongside the AI summary and action items |","table":"table-1"},"4672":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-93","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#reads-and-writes","content":"For data that's already there, real-time mode resolves issues as new activity arrives and batch mode goes back to clean history. RevOps can ask for jobs such as \"Find all duplicate accounts from last quarter\" or \"Backfill MEDDPICC fields across the pipeline.\""},"4673":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-94","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#deal-records","content":"On the grid, **Group**, **Fields**, **Sort** and **Filter** reshape the list, **Add Column** adds a column and **Export CSV** downloads it. Click any row to open the deal drawer. Its header shows the segment, stage, amount, close date and owner, plus a **Sync to Salesforce** button that pushes the deal to the CRM."},"4674":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-95","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#deal-records","content":"One deal, one drawer: the CRM fields sit in the header, the AI read of the deal sits below, and Sync to Salesforce sends your changes back to the system of record."},"4675":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-96","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#deal-tabs","content":"| Tab          | What you see                                                                         |\n| ------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Overview** | **Strengths** and **Risks & Gaps** cards, with icons for the activities they draw on |","table":"table-2"},"4676":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-97","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#deal-tabs","content":"| Tab        | What you see                                                                                     |\n| ---------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Agents** | **Pending Your Review**: work agents have queued on the deal, with **Send** or **View Progress** |","table":"table-2"},"4677":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-98","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#deal-tabs","content":"| Tab         | What you see                                                                            |\n| ----------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Details** | The deal's fields in sections, from **Overview** and **Next Steps** to **Success Plan** |","table":"table-2"},"4678":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-99","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#deal-tabs","content":"| Tab        | What you see                                                                         |\n| ---------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Stages** | Days spent in each stage, criteria completed per stage, and **Suggested Activities** |","table":"table-2"},"4679":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-100","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#deal-tabs","content":"| Tab        | What you see                                                                                                                      |\n| ---------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Health** | Sub-tabs for **Forecast**, **Risks**, **Qualification**, **Competition**, **Objections**, **Buying Committee** and **POC Health** |","table":"table-2"},"4680":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-101","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#deal-tabs","content":"| Tab          | What you see                                                                                                |\n| ------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Momentum** | An **Activity Map** of meetings, emails, internal and external Slack and agent actions, plus a **Timeline** |","table":"table-2"},"4681":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-102","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#deal-tabs","content":"| Tab             | What you see                                                                                       |\n| --------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Action Plan** | **Next Meeting**, **Next Action**, **Next follow-up**, your task list and a **Mutual Action Plan** |","table":"table-2"},"4682":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-103","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#deal-tabs","content":"| Tab          | What you see                                                        |\n| ------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Coaching** | A letter grade for the deal, with a score for each coaching section |","table":"table-2"},"4683":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-104","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#deal-tabs","content":"| Tab             | What you see                                               |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **CRM Updates** | **AI Suggestions**, **AI Updates** and **Updates History** |","table":"table-2"},"4684":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-105","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#deal-tabs","content":"| Tab        | What you see                                                                              |\n| ---------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Assets** | **Instant Assets**: ready-to-use templates such as an executive summary or ROI calculator |","table":"table-2"},"4685":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-106","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#deal-fields","content":"**Details** groups the record into **Overview**, **Next Steps**, **Opportunity and Risks**, **Adoption**, **Success Plan** and **Marketing Opportunity**. Jump to a section from the index on the left, change a field, then use **Sync to Salesforce** to send it back."},"4686":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-107","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#deal-fields","content":"The Details tab is the CRM record in editable sections, so a rep can correct a stage or close date on the deal without opening the CRM itself."},"4687":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-108","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#deal-comments","content":"The right rail holds **Ask**, **Comments** and **History**. **Comments** opens a dated team thread beside whichever tab you have open. Type a note or dictate it with the microphone, then send."},"4688":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-109","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#deal-comments","content":"The team's discussion stays on the deal, next to the fields and templates it is about, instead of in a separate chat that never reaches the record."},"4689":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-110","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#with-crm-manager","content":"Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent executes every write, so all changes reach your existing reports. Its page on oliv.ai covers how it keeps the CRM accurate."},"4690":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-111","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#with-meeting-assistant","content":"Oliv AI's Meeting Assistant agent proposes field updates from every call. The CRM Manager agent reviews the same call context and pushes the approved changes, as the record and follow-up workflow shows."},"4691":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-112","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#with-deal-and-forecast","content":"Oliv AI's Deal Driver agent reads the CRM but doesn't write to it directly. It surfaces signals for manager action in a pipeline review. Oliv AI's Forecaster agent can sync forecast category and adjusted values back to the CRM, if you configure it."},"4692":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-113","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#with-super-agents","content":"Oliv AI's Olivia agent needs a CRM connection for pipeline and deal history, and she reads what's already there. Oliv AI's Oliver agent connects to the CRM for schema alignment. It creates or modifies CRM field mappings when new tracking requirements emerge."},"4693":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-114","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#with-custom-agents","content":"Agents you set up can act in Salesforce and HubSpot through their tools. The approval choice for each action is covered in agent tools and run modes."},"4694":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-115","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#sales-leaders","content":"A CRO keeps one system of record and still gets AI on every deal. The forecast she presents reads from the same CRM her team updates, and the daily guide for sales managers shows how managers use it."},"4695":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-116","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#revenue-operations","content":"RevOps picks the write mode, signs off the move to Auto-Pilot and runs batch clean-up on history. The RevOps integration blueprint shows how calls, email and Slack feed the CRM together."},"4696":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-117","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#account-executives","content":"An AE opens the deal's **CRM Updates** tab after a call and accepts or rejects each suggestion. New stakeholders are already contacts with roles on the opportunity. The guide to running deals as an account executive shows where this fits in the day."},"4697":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-118","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#customer-success","content":"Renewals, QBRs and check-in calls are logged against the account like any sales call. An account manager opening the record sees this week's conversations, ready for the next meeting brief."},"4698":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-119","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#compare","content":"Most conversation tools log calls into the CRM. Oliv AI also links Slack activity to records, matches the right opportunity when an account has several, and fixes records already in the CRM in batch. Oliv AI is the only platform in this table that does all four."},"4699":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-120","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#compare","content":"CRM sync features, from each platform's public documentation:"},"4700":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-121","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#compare","content":"| Platform    | Slack activity linked to CRM records | Right opportunity when an account has several | Batch fixes to existing CRM records | Salesforce, HubSpot and Zoho |\n| ----------- | ------------------------------------ | --------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- | ---------------------------- |\n| **Oliv AI** | Yes                                  | Yes                                           | Yes                                 | Yes                          |","table":"table-3"},"4701":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-122","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#compare","content":"| Platform | Slack activity linked to CRM records | Right opportunity when an account has several | Batch fixes to existing CRM records    | Salesforce, HubSpot and Zoho |\n| -------- | ------------------------------------ | --------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------- | ---------------------------- |\n| **Gong** | Not in docs                          | Partly (falls back to the account)            | Partly (reassociates the last 30 days) | Yes (Zoho CRM integration)   |","table":"table-3"},"4702":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-123","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#compare","content":"| Platform  | Slack activity linked to CRM records                | Right opportunity when an account has several | Batch fixes to existing CRM records | Salesforce, HubSpot and Zoho       |\n| --------- | --------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| **Avoma** | Posts alerts only (cannot read Slack conversations) | Partly (you confirm the associated record)    | Partly (notes resynced by hand)     | Yes (single-click CRM connections) |","table":"table-3"},"4703":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-124","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#compare","content":"| Platform      | Slack activity linked to CRM records | Right opportunity when an account has several | Batch fixes to existing CRM records  | Salesforce, HubSpot and Zoho  |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------------ | --------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------ | ----------------------------- |\n| **Fireflies** | Not in docs                          | Not in docs                                   | Partly (On Demand for past meetings) | Yes (notes logged under Zoho) |","table":"table-3"},"4704":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-125","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#compare","content":"| Platform   | Slack activity linked to CRM records | Right opportunity when an account has several | Batch fixes to existing CRM records | Salesforce, HubSpot and Zoho   |\n| ---------- | ------------------------------------ | --------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| **Fathom** | Not in docs                          | Partly (deals added or removed by hand)       | Partly (manual, per call only)      | Partly (HubSpot or Salesforce) |","table":"table-3"},"4705":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-126","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#compare","content":"| Platform     | Slack activity linked to CRM records | Right opportunity when an account has several | Batch fixes to existing CRM records | Salesforce, HubSpot and Zoho     |\n| ------------ | ------------------------------------ | --------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- | -------------------------------- |\n| **Outreach** | Not in docs                          | Partly (most recent open opportunity)         | Partly (bulk push of past activity) | Partly (Salesforce and Dynamics) |","table":"table-3"},"4706":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-127","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#compare","content":"*Yes: documented and built in. Partly: documented with a limit, shown in brackets. Not in docs: not found in the vendor's public documentation.*"},"4707":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-128","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#compare-stronger","content":"**Slack threads count as activity.** Oliv AI connects Slack activity to the right accounts, contacts and opportunities, the same way it handles meetings, phone and email. Avoma's guide says it cannot read Slack conversations or monitor private chats. Compare Oliv AI vs Avoma."},"4708":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-129","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#compare-stronger","content":"**The right deal, not just the right account.** Oliv AI matches activity to the right opportunity when one account has several open. Gong documents that with multiple opportunities, the Related to field gets the account. Compare Oliv AI vs Gong."},"4709":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-130","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#compare-stronger","content":"**History gets fixed too.** Batch jobs find duplicate accounts, rebuild account hierarchies and backfill methodology fields across the pipeline. Gong's reassociation covers activities from the last 30 days. See Oliv AI as a Gong alternative."},"4710":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-131","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#compare-stronger","content":"*Competitor details checked against each vendor's public documentation on 22 October 2026. Features and plans change, so confirm with the vendor before you decide.*"},"4711":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-132","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#limits","content":"**A CRM comes first.** Oliv AI sits on top of an existing CRM and isn't one itself. The deals in **Records** come from the CRM you connect, and changes go back to it."},"4712":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-133","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#limits","content":"**Three CRMs out of the box.** Salesforce, HubSpot and Zoho connect directly. Any other CRM is a request to Oliv AI's team."},"4713":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-134","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#limits","content":"**A calendar is required.** Without a calendar connection, Oliv AI can't take notes in meetings."},"4714":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-135","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#limits","content":"**Custom fields go through onboarding.** Oliv AI's team maps them as a service, not from a settings screen."},"4715":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-136","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#limits","content":"**Review is the default.** Auto-Pilot starts only after RevOps confirms the switch."},"4716":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-137","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#limits","content":"**Some agents only read.** The Deal Driver agent surfaces signals and leaves the writing to people and the CRM Manager agent."},"4717":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-138","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#faq-replace","content":"No. Oliv AI works with your existing CRM. It brings the context together and keeps your systems updated, and the CRM stays the system of record."},"4718":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-139","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#faq-is-it-a-crm","content":"No. Oliv AI is a layer on top of your CRM. Its CRM Manager agent works on top of Salesforce, HubSpot or Zoho rather than holding records itself."},"4719":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-140","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#faq-which-crms","content":"Salesforce, HubSpot and Zoho out of the box. Additional CRMs are available on request."},"4720":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-141","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#faq-reports","content":"No. All updates flow into your existing CRM workflows, reports and dashboards, so they run on fresher data in the same place."},"4721":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-142","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#faq-who-approves","content":"You do. Every suggested update surfaces for review by default. RevOps confirms the move to **Auto-Pilot** once accuracy thresholds are met."},"4722":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-143","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#faq-deal-changes","content":"Yes. Open the deal in **Records › Deals** and go to **CRM Updates**. **AI Updates** lists the changes already applied, and **Updates History** keeps the record of changes on that deal."},"4723":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-144","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#faq-slack-email","content":"Yes. Oliv AI connects meeting, phone, email and Slack activity to the right accounts, contacts and opportunities. The Slack integration covers the Slack connection itself."},"4724":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-145","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#faq-multiple-opportunities","content":"Oliv AI still matches each activity to the right deal. It weighs every open account and opportunity, relationship history and conversation context to place the activity."},"4725":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-146","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#faq-acquisition","content":"A plain email-domain lookup finds no match and drops the activity. Oliv AI also weighs live M&A news, so it can still place the conversation on the right account."},"4726":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-147","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#faq-messy-data","content":"Yes. Real-time mode resolves issues as new activity comes in, and batch mode cleans what's already there. Duplicates get cleaned up as a byproduct of matching. The Context Graph post explains why Oliv AI enriches records and never replaces them."},"4727":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-148","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#faq-warehouse","content":"Yes. Account and opportunity context can go back into Salesforce, Snowflake, Databricks or Redshift."},"4728":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-149","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#faq-which-agents-write","content":"No. The CRM Manager agent executes writes. The Deal Driver agent doesn't write to the CRM directly, and the Forecaster agent syncs forecast values back only if you configure it."},"4729":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-150","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#faq-pricing","content":"By role, with apps per seat and agent actions billed through credits. See Oliv AI pricing for current plans."},"4730":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-151","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#related","content":"Salesforce: the install, review settings and objects for a Salesforce org."},"4731":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-152","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#related","content":"Keep the CRM updated: the day-to-day routine for reviewing and approving updates."},"4732":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-153","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#related","content":"CRM Manager agent: the agent that executes every write to your CRM."},"4733":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-154","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#related","content":"Why RAG fails on CRM data: why matching activity to the right object is harder than retrieval."},"4734":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-155","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#related","content":"Agentforce and specialized revenue AI: where a CRM's own AI fits next to a layer like Oliv AI."},"4735":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-156","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#related","content":"Oliv AI integrations: every tool Oliv AI connects to alongside your CRM."},"4736":{"id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm-157","page_id":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/platform/oliv-and-your-crm#related","content":"Oliv AI product documentation: every documented agent and feature."},"4737":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","type":"page","content":"Product summary","breadcrumbs":["Oliv AI docs"],"tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/product-summary"},"4738":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-0","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary","content":"A factual summary of Oliv AI, the AI agents it runs for revenue teams, the apps they work in, where you use them, who they're for and how Oliv AI is sold."},"4739":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-1","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/product-summary#at-a-glance","content":"At a glance"},"4740":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-2","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/product-summary#what-it-is","content":"What Oliv AI is"},"4741":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-3","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/product-summary#how-it-works","content":"How Oliv AI works"},"4742":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-4","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/product-summary#agents","content":"The agents"},"4743":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-5","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/product-s