_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#crm-current","content":"Keep the CRM current without typing"},"4866":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-12","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#deal-stalls","content":"When a deal goes quiet"},"4867":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-13","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#compare","content":"How Oliv AI compares for account executives"},"4868":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-14","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#compare-stronger","content":"Why Oliv AI is the stronger choice for account executives"},"4869":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-15","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#limits","content":"Limits and things to know"},"4870":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-16","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#common-questions","content":"Common questions"},"4871":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-17","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#faq-brief-timing","content":"When does the pre-meeting brief arrive?"},"4872":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-18","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#faq-brief-length","content":"How long is the brief?"},"4873":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-19","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#faq-methodologies","content":"Which sales methodologies does it support?"},"4874":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-20","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#faq-follow-up-template","content":"Is the follow-up email a template?"},"4875":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-21","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#faq-review-updates","content":"Do CRM updates go in without me seeing them?"},"4876":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-22","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#faq-incomplete-crm","content":"What if our CRM data is incomplete?"},"4877":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-23","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#faq-new-contacts","content":"Does it create contacts I haven't added?"},"4878":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-24","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#faq-unrecorded","content":"What happens if a meeting wasn't recorded?"},"4879":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-25","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#faq-reminders","content":"Will I get reminders about my deals?"},"4880":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-26","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#faq-setup","content":"How long does setup take?"},"4881":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-27","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#related","content":"Related"},"4882":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-28","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","content":"Oliv AI gives an account executive a set of agents that handle the work around each deal: the prep before a meeting, the follow-up after it and the CRM upkeep in between. You walk into calls prepared, review drafted emails and proposed field updates instead of writing them, and get a nudge when a deal starts to stall. This page shows how those pieces fit together across a deal."},"4883":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-29","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                                 |\n| ---------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| **Who it's for** | Account executives working active opportunities |","table":"table-0"},"4884":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-30","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#at-a-glance","content":"|                      |                                                                        |\n| -------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Before a meeting** | A brief about 30 minutes before every meeting on an active opportunity |","table":"table-0"},"4885":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-31","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                                                                   |\n| ---------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **After a call** | A drafted follow-up email, proposed CRM field updates and qualification gap flags |","table":"table-0"},"4886":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-32","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#at-a-glance","content":"|                |                                                                               |\n| -------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **In the CRM** | Accounts, contacts, activities and tasks kept current from your conversations |","table":"table-0"},"4887":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-33","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#at-a-glance","content":"|                        |                                                     |\n| ---------------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |\n| **When a deal stalls** | Nudges when next steps go overdue or activity drops |","table":"table-0"},"4888":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-34","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#at-a-glance","content":"|                          |                                                                                         |\n| ------------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Your day in one feed** | The Agent Feed on **Home**, with your morning brief, call prep and CRM update summaries |","table":"table-0"},"4889":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-35","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#at-a-glance","content":"|                     |                                                     |\n| ------------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Agents involved** | Meeting Assistant, CRM Manager, Deal Driver, Olivia |","table":"table-0"},"4890":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-36","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#at-a-glance","content":"An account executive's day as the agents report it, from the morning brief and call prep to the evening CRM summary, each update in one feed."},"4891":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-37","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#what-its-for","content":"Oliv AI takes the admin around each deal off the account executive. The time between calls goes to selling, not to rebuilding context or typing notes into the CRM."},"4892":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-38","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#how-it-helps","content":"**Briefed before you join.** A one-screen brief lands about 30 minutes before each deal meeting."},"4893":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-39","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#how-it-helps","content":"**Follow-up written from the call.** The email draft comes from the actual transcript, not a template."},"4894":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-40","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#how-it-helps","content":"**Fields proposed, not typed.** You accept or reject each suggested CRM update."},"4895":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-41","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#how-it-helps","content":"**Stalls flagged early.** You get a nudge when next steps go overdue or activity drops."},"4896":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-42","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#without-it","content":"Each call can cost 15 to 20 minutes of digging for context beforehand and about 15 minutes of email writing afterward. CRM updates depend on what the rep remembers. Qualification gaps then surface at the forecast review, when it's too late to act on them."},"4897":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-43","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#why-buyers-care","content":"The account executive is the champion, because the time savings show up before and after every call. VPs of Sales and sales managers usually make the purchase. It matters most for reps with a full calendar of meetings on open deals."},"4898":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-44","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#approach","content":"Imagine an account executive with four customer calls on a Tuesday, booked almost back to back. Two are with deals in late-stage evaluation. One is a first call with a new stakeholder, and one is a pricing follow-up."},"4899":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-45","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#approach","content":"The usual routine is to skim old notes in the few minutes between calls. Each follow-up then gets written from memory at the end of the day, and CRM fields wait until Friday. By then some details have probably faded, so the record shows less than the calls did. The next meeting on each deal may start from a thinner picture as a result."},"4900":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-46","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#approach","content":"Everything the rep needs is already on record: the recordings, the CRM history and the email thread. The real gap is timing. Prep is most useful in the half hour before a call. The follow-up is easiest to write while the conversation is still fresh in everyone's mind."},"4901":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-47","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#approach","content":"Oliv AI moves that work to the right moment. Oliv AI's Meeting Assistant agent sends a brief before each meeting on an active deal and drafts the follow-up after it. Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent turns what was said into field updates for the rep to approve."},"4902":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-48","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#approach","content":"The brief is built to fit on one screen and take about 60 seconds to read, as described under Before a meeting. How this setup lines up against other deal tools is covered in How Oliv AI compares for account executives, below."},"4903":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-49","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#before-a-meeting","content":"Oliv AI's Meeting Assistant agent sends a brief about 30 minutes before every meeting linked to an active opportunity. If the deal exists and the meeting is on your calendar, it runs automatically. The brief covers:"},"4904":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-50","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#before-a-meeting","content":"**Deal summary.** Stage, amount, close date, last activity and next steps."},"4905":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-51","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#before-a-meeting","content":"**Qualification status.** Where the deal stands against your active qualification framework, with gaps and open questions highlighted. **Settings › Qualification Framework** offers MEDDPICC, MEDDIC, SPICED, BANT and DRIVE."},"4906":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-52","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#before-a-meeting","content":"**Stakeholders.** Who is in the meeting, what roles they play and what they care about, based on prior conversations."},"4907":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-53","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#before-a-meeting","content":"**Recommended agenda.** Tailored to the deal stage and the qualification gaps."},"4908":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-54","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#before-a-meeting","content":"Shortly before the call, Meeting Assistant also posts a call prep note to your Agent Feed on **Home**. For a first meeting with a new contact, Oliv AI's Researcher agent builds the brief instead. Oliv AI's Olivia agent also surfaces the right context before every meeting, such as deal status, stakeholder intel, qualification gaps and what was agreed last time. Read more on getting the most from an AI meeting assistant."},"4909":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-55","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#after-a-call","content":"Once the meeting recording is processed, Meeting Assistant prepares three things:"},"4910":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-56","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#after-a-call","content":"**A follow-up email draft.** It covers what was discussed, what was agreed and the next steps, with dates where possible. You review, adjust and send. See how a strong sales follow-up converts."},"4911":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-57","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#after-a-call","content":"**Proposed deal field updates.** Stage, amount, close date, qualification fields and next steps, based on what was said."},"4912":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-58","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#after-a-call","content":"**Qualification gap flags.** New information, or notable absences, that change the deal's qualification status."},"4913":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-59","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#after-a-call","content":"Each meeting's record in **Activities › Meetings** holds the results in seven tabs: **Overview**, **Action Items**, **Meeting insights**, **Recording**, **Coaching**, **Attendees** and **CRM Updates**. **Meeting insights** files what was said under each criterion of your framework, with timestamps into the call. It also says plainly when a criterion wasn't discussed, which is where the gaps show."},"4914":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-60","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#after-a-call","content":"Qualification is filled in from what the buyer actually said, and the blanks are named, so you know what to ask on the next call."},"4915":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-61","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#review-updates","content":"After every activity, you get a Slack or preferred-channel message that says it found updates for a number of fields. The meeting's **CRM Updates** tab lists what changed after the call: completed updates, such as a refreshed account or a new contact, and pending ones with a button such as **Update Deal**."},"4916":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-62","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#review-updates","content":"After each call you can see what was already written to the CRM and which change still waits for you, without opening the CRM."},"4917":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-63","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#review-updates","content":"On the deal itself, the **CRM Updates** tab splits **AI Suggestions** from **AI Updates** and keeps an **Updates History**. Each suggestion shows the proposed value above the **Current Value**. Choose **Accept** or **Reject**."},"4918":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-64","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#review-updates","content":"A full history of how each field was updated stays visible. CRM Manager applies some updates and holds others for your review, and its post in the Agent Feed says how many of each. Once accuracy thresholds are met, RevOps can confirm the switch to auto mode."},"4919":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-65","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#crm-current","content":"Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent keeps accounts, contacts, opportunities, activities and tasks current from your conversations."},"4920":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-66","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#crm-current","content":"**New people and companies.** When a meeting, call or email involves a company or person not yet in the CRM, it creates the record and enriches it."},"4921":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-67","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#crm-current","content":"**The right deal.** It maps each activity to the right account and opportunity, including multi-threaded deals. If it can't resolve one, it asks you."},"4922":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-68","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#crm-current","content":"**Tasks from next steps.** It creates tasks from the next steps in meetings, calls and emails, and assigns them to the right owner."},"4923":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-69","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#crm-current","content":"**Buying committee roles.** It tracks each contact's role on the opportunity, such as economic buyer, champion or blocker."},"4924":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-70","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#crm-current","content":"**Meetings that weren't recorded.** It can prompt you for a quick voice summary and use that as a data source."},"4925":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-71","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#crm-current","content":"A meeting's **Action Items** tab shows the **Next meeting**, **Next action** and **Next follow-up**, then the tasks from the call with an assignee and a due date. Each task links to the moment in the recording it came from."},"4926":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-72","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#crm-current","content":"The next steps agreed on the call become owned, dated tasks, so nothing depends on the rep's notes."},"4927":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-73","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#crm-current","content":"It works with Salesforce, HubSpot and Zoho, as a layer on top of the CRM you already use. More on how Oliv AI handles CRM automation."},"4928":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-74","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#deal-stalls","content":"Oliv AI's Deal Driver agent nudges you directly when a deal stalls, a next step goes overdue or activity drops. That catches the gap before your manager needs to step in. CRM Manager also sends end-of-day reminders for open CRM tasks or unverified deal updates."},"4929":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-75","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#deal-stalls","content":"On the deal's **Action Plan** tab, the **Next follow-up** card shows how many days a follow-up is overdue, beside the next meeting, the next action and your task list."},"4930":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-76","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#deal-stalls","content":"A slipping follow-up shows on the deal itself, in days overdue, so you can catch the stall before the nudge or the pipeline review does."},"4931":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-77","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#deal-stalls","content":"To work a stuck deal, tell Oliv AI's Olivia agent something like \"This deal has been stuck for three weeks.\" She engages Oliv AI's Re-Activator agent and surfaces a re-engagement strategy, as covered in the things you can hand Olivia. For how deals slip in the first place, read why deal views miss half the picture."},"4932":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-78","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#compare","content":"Several deal tools now prepare reps for meetings. Oliv AI also proposes the CRM updates from each call for you to review, and nudges you directly when a next step goes overdue. Oliv AI is the only platform in this table that does all three."},"4933":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-79","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#compare","content":"Deal workflow features for account executives, from each platform's public documentation:"},"4934":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-80","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#compare","content":"| Platform    | Pre-meeting brief for deal meetings | CRM updates proposed for review after each call | Rep nudges when next steps go overdue |\n| ----------- | ----------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| **Oliv AI** | Yes                                 | Yes                                             | Yes                                   |","table":"table-1"},"4935":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-81","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#compare","content":"| Platform | Pre-meeting brief for deal meetings | CRM updates proposed for review after each call | Rep nudges when next steps go overdue |\n| -------- | ----------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| **Gong** | Yes (AI meeting prep)               | Partly (one text field on deal boards)          | Partly (overdue to-dos list)          |","table":"table-1"},"4936":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-82","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#compare","content":"| Platform     | Pre-meeting brief for deal meetings | CRM updates proposed for review after each call | Rep nudges when next steps go overdue |\n| ------------ | ----------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| **Outreach** | Yes (Meeting Prep Agent)            | Yes (Deal Agent)                                | Partly (overdue tasks in reports)     |","table":"table-1"},"4937":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-83","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#compare","content":"| Platform      | Pre-meeting brief for deal meetings | CRM updates proposed for review after each call | Rep nudges when next steps go overdue |\n| ------------- | ----------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| **Fireflies** | Yes (Meeting Prep briefs)           | Yes (Autofill CRM)                              | Not in docs                           |","table":"table-1"},"4938":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-84","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#compare","content":"| Platform  | Pre-meeting brief for deal meetings | CRM updates proposed for review after each call | Rep nudges when next steps go overdue |\n| --------- | ----------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| **Avoma** | Partly (meeting prep templates)     | Automated field updates                         | Not in docs                           |","table":"table-1"},"4939":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-85","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#compare","content":"| Platform   | Pre-meeting brief for deal meetings | CRM updates proposed for review after each call | Rep nudges when next steps go overdue |\n| ---------- | ----------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| **Fathom** | Not in docs                         | Writes summaries and tasks to CRM               | Not in docs                           |","table":"table-1"},"4940":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-86","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#compare","content":"*Yes: documented and built in. Partly: documented with a limit, shown in brackets. Not in docs: not found in the vendor's public documentation.*"},"4941":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-87","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#compare-stronger","content":"**Every core deal field, proposed after each call.** Oliv AI proposes stage, amount, close date, qualification fields and next steps from the conversation. Gong's deal boards fill one text-only CRM field with AI-suggested updates. Compare Oliv AI vs Gong."},"4942":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-88","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#compare-stronger","content":"**A brief built around the deal.** Oliv AI's brief shows qualification status against your methodology and a recommended agenda. Avoma documents templates that standardize meeting prep by meeting purpose. Compare Oliv AI vs Avoma."},"4943":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-89","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#compare-stronger","content":"**A nudge, not a list to check.** Oliv AI nudges the rep directly when next steps go overdue. Gong's to-do filter lets you show to-dos that are due or overdue. See Oliv AI as a Gong alternative."},"4944":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-90","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#compare-stronger","content":"*Competitor details checked against each vendor's public documentation on 21 October 2026. Features and plans change, so confirm with the vendor before you decide.*"},"4945":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-91","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#limits","content":"**Active opportunities only.** Meeting Assistant works on meetings linked to an active opportunity. Researcher covers first-time contacts."},"4946":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-92","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#limits","content":"**It needs a recording.** Meeting Assistant relies on Oliv Notetaker recordings and transcripts and a Deal Insights subscription."},"4947":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-93","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#limits","content":"**Not a CRM.** CRM Manager works on top of Salesforce, HubSpot or Zoho. It doesn't replace them."},"4948":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-94","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#limits","content":"**Pending updates have a deadline.** If a rep doesn't complete updates within a defined window, deals can be deferred or flagged as closed-lost. Each org configures this."},"4949":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-95","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#limits","content":"**One framework at a time.** Briefs and meeting insights follow the framework marked **Active** in Settings, so switching it changes what every deal is scored against."},"4950":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-96","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#faq-brief-timing","content":"About 30 minutes before every meeting linked to an active opportunity in your CRM."},"4951":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-97","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#faq-brief-length","content":"One screen, about 60 seconds to read. It covers the deal summary, qualification status, stakeholder context and a recommended agenda."},"4952":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-98","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#faq-methodologies","content":"**Settings › Qualification Framework** offers MEDDPICC, MEDDIC, SPICED, BANT and DRIVE. One is marked **Active**, and each shows its criteria and scoring before you switch with **Activate**."},"4953":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-99","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#faq-follow-up-template","content":"No. Meeting Assistant reads the transcript and drafts from the actual conversation. You review, adjust and send."},"4954":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-100","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#faq-review-updates","content":"Some do. CRM Manager applies some updates, listed under **AI Updates** on the deal, and holds the rest under **AI Suggestions** for you to accept or reject. RevOps can switch to auto mode once accuracy thresholds are met."},"4955":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-101","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#faq-incomplete-crm","content":"CRM Manager fills in missing or stale data from call history as it goes, so you don't need a clean CRM to start."},"4956":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-102","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#faq-new-contacts","content":"Yes. When an activity involves a person or company not yet in the CRM, CRM Manager creates and enriches the record."},"4957":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-103","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#faq-unrecorded","content":"CRM Manager can prompt you for a quick voice summary and use that as the data source."},"4958":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-104","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#faq-reminders","content":"Yes. Deal Driver nudges you when deals stall, next steps go overdue or activity drops. CRM Manager sends end-of-day reminders for open CRM tasks."},"4959":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-105","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#faq-setup","content":"Connect your calendar, your call recording tool or Oliv's native recorder, and your CRM. Most teams are connected within a week."},"4960":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-106","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#related","content":"The Olivia agent: the agent you ask for prep, follow-ups and next steps."},"4961":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-107","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#related","content":"The Deal Driver agent: what your manager sees from the same deals."},"4962":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-108","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#related","content":"AI agents for sales teams: how Oliv AI supports the whole sales org."},"4963":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-109","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#related","content":"Deal tracking software: use cases and what to weigh."},"4964":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-110","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#related","content":"AI for sales productivity: where reps save time with AI tools."},"4965":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-111","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#related","content":"Oliv AI integrations: the CRM, calendar and recording tools Oliv AI connects to."},"4966":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-112","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#related","content":"Oliv AI pricing: plans and what each includes."},"4967":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-113","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#related","content":"Oliv AI product documentation: every documented agent and feature."},"4968":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases","type":"page","content":"Use cases overview","breadcrumbs":["Oliv AI docs","Use cases"],"tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases"},"4969":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases-0","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases","content":"How Oliv AI's docs are organized by role, which agents and workflows each revenue role uses, and where the account executive use case fits."},"4970":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases-1","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases#how-docs-are-organized","content":"How the docs are organized"},"4971":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases-2","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases#account-executives","content":"Account executives"},"4972":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases-3","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases#sales-leaders","content":"Sales managers and sales leaders"},"4973":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases-4","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases#sales-development","content":"Sales development"},"4974":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases-5","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases#customer-success","content":"Customer success and account management"},"4975":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases-6","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases#revops","content":"Revenue operations"},"4976":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases-7","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases#enablement","content":"Enablement"},"4977":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases-8","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases#finding-your-role","content":"Finding your role"},"4978":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases-9","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases","content":"Use cases show Oliv AI from one role's point of view: which agents do the work, which workflows that role runs, and how it adds up across a week. The first one built is running deals as an account executive. For every other role, this page points you to the agent and workflow pages that role uses most."},"4979":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases-10","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases#how-docs-are-organized","content":"The docs answer three kinds of question, in three layers:"},"4980":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases-11","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases#how-docs-are-organized","content":"| Layer      | The question it answers                          | Start with                     |\n| ---------- | ------------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------ |\n| **Agents** | What does this agent do, and how do I set it up? | The agent pages, one per agent |","table":"table-0"},"4981":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases-12","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases#how-docs-are-organized","content":"| Layer         | The question it answers                         | Start with                                 |\n| ------------- | ----------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| **Workflows** | How do I get one job done from start to finish? | A guide that follows the job across agents |","table":"table-0"},"4982":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases-13","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases#how-docs-are-organized","content":"| Layer         | The question it answers           | Start with                        |\n| ------------- | --------------------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| **Use cases** | What does Oliv AI do for my role? | A role's week, with links to both |","table":"table-0"},"4983":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases-14","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases#how-docs-are-organized","content":"Integrations, apps and plans sit alongside these layers. They cover the tools Oliv AI connects to, the Converse app for captured conversations, and the seat each person needs. Oliv AI works as a layer on top of your CRM, so every role reads from the same record."},"4984":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases-15","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases#how-docs-are-organized","content":"The product follows the same split. On **Home**, the Agent Feed filters by **Team** (Sales, Sales Development, Customer Success or RevOps) and by **Role** (Contributor or Manager). Each choice shows the agents that work for that role and the updates they posted."},"4985":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases-16","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases#account-executives","content":"Account executives get the most built-out path. Oliv AI's Meeting Assistant agent sends a brief before each meeting on an active opportunity, then drafts the follow-up after the call. Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent turns what was said into field updates you approve. The account executive use case shows how those pieces fit across a deal."},"4986":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases-17","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases#account-executives","content":"The account executive's view: the agents that prep meetings, find accounts and keep the CRM current all report into one feed."},"4987":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases-18","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases#account-executives","content":"To go deeper, read the Meeting Assistant agent and CRM Manager agent pages. The recording and follow-up guide covers what happens after each call. Oliv AI's own page for account executives gives the wider picture."},"4988":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases-19","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases#sales-leaders","content":"Managers work from the same deals, seen at team level. Oliv AI's Deal Driver agent sends a morning brief, alerts when a deal needs attention, and a prep report for each rep before their 1:1. Oliv AI's Forecaster agent pre-drafts each rep's forecast, and managers add their own adjustments before the team number rolls up. Oliv AI's Coach agent scores every recorded call and recommends three goals per rep each month, and the manager sets one."},"4989":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases-20","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases#sales-leaders","content":"Switching the role to Manager adds the forecast and process agents to the feed, which is the team-level view this section describes."},"4990":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases-21","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases#sales-leaders","content":"The Deal Driver, Forecaster and Coach agent pages cover each one. The pipeline review guide puts them together in one weekly meeting. More for sales managers is on oliv.ai."},"4991":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases-22","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases#sales-development","content":"SDRs and BDRs book and run first calls, so preparation and capture matter most. Oliv AI's Olivia agent researches the company and the person before a first meeting, and the meeting preparation guide shows that brief. The Zoom integration records those calls, whoever hosts them. Deal Driver's briefs and reports work across BDR and AE pipelines, so BDR leads use it the same way sales managers do. See Oliv AI for sales development teams."},"4992":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases-23","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases#customer-success","content":"CSMs and account managers work with Oliv AI's Olivia agent too. Before every call she has the full account history ready, and the Olivia agent page shows how to ask her for it. Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent tracks renewals, QBRs and CS check-ins as well as sales cycles."},"4993":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases-24","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases#customer-success","content":"When you take over an account, the recorded handover call gives you its summary and next steps. The Slack integration suits teams that run their day from a shared channel. If a customer asks for no meeting bot, Oliv AI records botlessly when your company organizes the call. Oliv AI's Portfolio Manager agent is the customer success equivalent of Deal Driver, applied to the renewal book. In a CS manager's feed, it posts the 1:1 agenda with the accounts at renewal risk. Read more for customer success and account management teams."},"4994":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases-25","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases#customer-success","content":"For a customer success manager, the feed leads with renewal risk: the 1:1 agenda and the account patterns worth acting on."},"4995":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases-26","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases#revops","content":"RevOps sets the rules and keeps the data clean. Oliv AI's Oliver agent keeps the process handbook: your ICP, personas, approval workflows and sales methodology. The CRM upkeep guide and CRM field mapping cover how updates reach the right fields. The Salesforce integration page covers the install."},"4996":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases-27","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases#revops","content":"The RevOps feed brings these together: Oliver's review with changes ready to approve, CRM Manager's count of updates applied and held for review, and Forecaster's category shifts."},"4997":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases-28","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases#revops","content":"RevOps sees the process, data and forecast agents side by side, with each change that needs a decision flagged for review."},"4998":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases-29","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases#revops","content":"When you build or check agents, agent triggers set what starts them and run history shows what each run did. Planning a rollout starts with plans and seat roles. There's more on Oliv AI for revenue operations."},"4999":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases-30","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases#enablement","content":"Enablement managers use Oliv AI to ramp reps and keep training current. The Coach page shows how call scores turn into one goal per rep each month. The clip library collects the moments you describe, such as pricing objections, from real calls. Agent knowledge files hold the background reading an agent works against, such as a buying-committee profile or a solution deck."},"5000":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases-31","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases#finding-your-role","content":"Start with the section for your role above. If you own deals, begin with the account executive use case. If you manage people, begin with the pipeline review. If you run the systems, begin with Oliver and CRM upkeep. Each page links on to the agents and workflows it depends on."},"5001":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows","type":"page","content":"Workflows overview","breadcrumbs":["Oliv AI docs","Workflows"],"tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/workflows"},"5002":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows-0","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows","content":"How Oliv AI's agents carry a deal through the week, from the brief before a meeting and the follow-up after it to CRM upkeep and the weekly pipeline review."},"5003":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows-1","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/workflows#deal-week","content":"A deal's week in four workflows"},"5004":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows-2","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/workflows#before","content":"Before the meeting"},"5005":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows-3","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/workflows#during-and-after","content":"During and after the call"},"5006":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows-4","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/workflows#between-meetings","content":"Between meetings"},"5007":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows-5","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/workflows#weekly-review","content":"The weekly review"},"5008":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows-6","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/workflows#how-they-connect","content":"How the workflows connect"},"5009":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows-7","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/workflows#before-you-start","content":"Before you start"},"5010":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows-8","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows","content":"Workflows show Oliv AI's agents working together on one job, from start to finish. Each guide follows a deal through a normal week: preparing for a meeting, recording it and following up, keeping the CRM current, then reviewing the pipeline. The agent pages explain what each agent does on its own. These guides show who does what, and when."},"5011":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows-9","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows#deal-week","content":"| When             | Guide                 | What you end up with                          |\n| ---------------- | --------------------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| Before a meeting | Prepare for a meeting | A one-screen brief 30 minutes before the call |","table":"table-0"},"5012":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows-10","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows#deal-week","content":"| When                      | Guide                          | What you end up with                                          |\n| ------------------------- | ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| During and after the call | Record a meeting and follow up | A summary, a drafted follow-up email and proposed CRM updates |","table":"table-0"},"5013":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows-11","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows#deal-week","content":"| When             | Guide                | What you end up with                                                  |\n| ---------------- | -------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Between meetings | Keep the CRM updated | Accounts, contacts and opportunities kept current from every activity |","table":"table-0"},"5014":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows-12","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows#deal-week","content":"| When            | Guide                 | What you end up with                                          |\n| --------------- | --------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| End of the week | Run a pipeline review | A per-rep report before each 1:1, and a rollup for leadership |","table":"table-0"},"5015":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows-13","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows#deal-week","content":"The first three are written for the person running the deal. The pipeline review is written for their manager. All four read from the same meetings, calls and emails, so nothing has to be entered twice."},"5016":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows-14","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows#before","content":"Oliv AI's Meeting Assistant agent sends a brief 30 minutes before every meeting linked to an active opportunity. It covers the deal's status, where you stand on qualification against your methodology, who is in the meeting and a recommended agenda. The brief is designed to fit on one screen and take about 60 seconds to read."},"5017":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows-15","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows#before","content":"A first meeting with someone new works differently, because there's no deal history yet. You ask Oliv AI's Olivia agent to prepare you, and she researches the company and the person. You can also ask Olivia for prep at any time on the Home screen's **Ask** tab. Her answer opens with the deal at a glance, then covers who's joining, the risks and the talking points. The meeting preparation guide covers every kind of prep."},"5018":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows-16","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows#before","content":"Prep on demand: Oliv AI's Olivia agent starts with the four numbers that tell you how much is riding on the call, before the attendees, risks and talking points."},"5019":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows-17","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows#before","content":"For what the brief agent does on every deal, read the Meeting Assistant agent page."},"5020":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows-18","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows#during-and-after","content":"Oliv AI records the call, then turns it into everything you'd otherwise write by hand. When someone from your company organizes the meeting, Oliv AI records botlessly through the meeting platform. When an external organizer owns it, a note taker joins under your company's name. Bot and botless recording explains the choice, and the Zoom integration covers Zoom calls in detail."},"5021":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows-19","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows#during-and-after","content":"The meeting summary is ready as soon as the call ends. Oliv AI's Meeting Assistant agent then drafts the follow-up email from the transcript, with the recap, commitments, owners and next steps already written. It also proposes CRM updates and flags qualification gaps. In **Activities › Meetings**, each meeting opens in a drawer with tabs for the overview, action items, meeting insights, the recording, coaching, attendees and CRM updates. The follow-up guide walks through reviewing each one, and the meeting details page shows the recorded call itself."},"5022":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows-20","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows#during-and-after","content":"After the call, the meeting drawer holds everything the follow-up needs. Each tab covers one job, from the takeaways and tasks to the CRM changes."},"5023":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows-21","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows#during-and-after","content":"If your team works in Slack, the summary also arrives there through the Slack integration."},"5024":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows-22","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows#between-meetings","content":"Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent reads every meeting, call and email, then updates accounts, contacts, opportunities, activities and tasks in Salesforce, HubSpot or Zoho. Your CRM stays the system of record, and Oliv AI works on top of it."},"5025":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows-23","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows#between-meetings","content":"Each suggested update shows the field, the current value, the proposed value and the moment in the conversation behind it. On a deal's **CRM Updates** tab, you **Accept** or **Reject** each AI suggestion. A meeting's **CRM Updates** tab lists what was written after the call and holds a stage move as a **Pending Update** until you click **Update Deal**. Switch to auto mode once you trust it."},"5026":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows-24","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows#between-meetings","content":"Between meetings, the CRM Updates tab is where you see what Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent wrote and confirm the changes that are still pending."},"5027":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows-25","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows#between-meetings","content":"The CRM upkeep guide covers setup and a monthly hygiene check. CRM field mapping decides where each update lands, and the CRM Manager agent page covers the agent itself. Connection steps live on the Salesforce and HubSpot pages."},"5028":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows-26","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows#weekly-review","content":"Oliv AI's Deal Driver agent delivers its reports in **Reports › My Reports**. A **One-on-One Prep** report arrives for each rep on that rep's set day, such as every Thursday or every Friday. A **Morning Brief** covers the team's meetings every weekday. Through the week Deal Driver flags deals that need attention, each with a suggested action, and nudges reps directly when next steps go overdue. Every Monday, a **Pipeline Review** for leadership is ready before the first standup."},"5029":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows-27","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows#weekly-review","content":"The weekly review starts from the Pipeline Review, which groups every deal by status so a manager can jump straight to the deals at risk."},"5030":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows-28","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows#weekly-review","content":"Two more agents join the review. Oliv AI's Coach agent follows each rep's 1:1 report minutes later with that rep's coaching goal and weekly progress. Oliv AI's Forecaster agent rolls Deal Driver's signals into the forecast number. The pipeline review guide runs the meeting deal by deal. The Deal Driver, Forecaster and Coach agent pages explain each agent's part."},"5031":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows-29","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows#how-they-connect","content":"Each workflow feeds the next one. The brief draws on what earlier calls captured. The call produces the follow-up and the field updates. Each 1:1 report reads the deal fields CRM Manager keeps current, so the review is only as good as that upkeep."},"5032":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows-30","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows#how-they-connect","content":"Oliv AI's Olivia agent sits across all four. You can ask her to prepare you for a call or draft the follow-up from this afternoon's meeting, and she hands the work to the right specialist. Her rules come from the process handbook that Oliv AI's Oliver agent maintains. The Olivia agent page shows how to ask her. For a role-based view of the same week, read running deals as an account executive."},"5033":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows-31","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows#before-you-start","content":"Every workflow needs three connections: your calendar, a call recorder and your CRM. Calendar integration is required, because Oliv AI uses it to know which meetings to record. Teams and Google Meet need nothing more once the calendar is connected, and Zoom uses the Oliv AI Zoom app. Most teams are connected within a week."},"5034":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows-32","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows#before-you-start","content":"Seat roles decide which apps each person works in, so check plans and seat roles before you roll out. The full list of connected tools is on Oliv AI's integrations page. For the reasoning behind automating prep, read AI meeting preparation tools compared by CRM depth and the CRO's guide to CRM data."},"5035":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/keep-the-crm-updated","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/keep-the-crm-updated","type":"page","content":"Keep the CRM updated","breadcrumbs":["Oliv AI docs","Workflows"],"tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/workflows/keep-the-crm-updated"},"5036":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/keep-the-crm-updated-0","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/keep-the-crm-updated","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/keep-the-crm-updated","content":"How Oliv AI keeps Salesforce, HubSpot or Zoho current from every meeting, call and email, how to review proposed updates before they're written, and how to run a monthly CRM hygiene check."},"5037":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/keep-the-crm-updated-1","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/keep-the-crm-updated","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/workflows/keep-the-crm-updated#at-a-glance","content":"At a glance"},"5038":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/keep-the-crm-updated-2","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/keep-the-crm-updated","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/workflows/keep-the-crm-updated#before-you-begin","content":"Before you begin"},"5039":{"id":"/product-doc