eeting-34","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#faq-methodologies","content":"Which sales methodologies does the brief use?"},"5232":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-35","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#faq-agenda","content":"Does the brief include an agenda?"},"5233":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-36","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#faq-clean-crm","content":"Do I need a clean CRM before the brief works?"},"5234":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-37","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#faq-where","content":"Where do briefs and alerts show up?"},"5235":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-38","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#faq-follow-up-template","content":"Is the follow-up email a template?"},"5236":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-39","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#faq-one-on-ones","content":"Can managers get prep for their 1:1s?"},"5237":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-40","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#faq-team-size","content":"Is there a minimum team size?"},"5238":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-41","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#related","content":"Related"},"5239":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-42","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","content":"Oliv AI sends you a brief before your sales meetings, so you walk in knowing where things stand and what to cover. For a meeting on an active deal, Oliv AI's Meeting Assistant agent sends the deal summary, qualification status, stakeholders and a recommended agenda 30 minutes before the call. For a first meeting with someone new, Oliv AI's Olivia agent researches the company and the person. This guide covers setting it up, reading the brief and getting more when you need it."},"5240":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-43","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                      |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| **What arrives** | A pre-meeting brief, one screen long |","table":"table-0"},"5241":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-44","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#at-a-glance","content":"|          |                               |\n| -------- | ----------------------------- |\n| **When** | 30 minutes before the meeting |","table":"table-0"},"5242":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-45","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#at-a-glance","content":"|                       |                                                                      |\n| --------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Deal brief covers** | Deal summary, qualification status, stakeholders, recommended agenda |","table":"table-0"},"5243":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-46","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#at-a-glance","content":"|                                |                                                                 |\n| ------------------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **First-meeting brief covers** | Three bullets on the company and the person, plus an icebreaker |","table":"table-0"},"5244":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-47","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#at-a-glance","content":"|               |                                                                                                        |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **On demand** | Ask Oliv AI's Olivia agent on Home, and she lays out the deal, the attendees, risks and talking points |","table":"table-0"},"5245":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-48","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                  |\n| ---------------- | ---------------- |\n| **Reading time** | About 60 seconds |","table":"table-0"},"5246":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-49","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#at-a-glance","content":"|                   |                                                                             |\n| ----------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Methodologies** | MEDDPICC, MEDDIC, SPICED, BANT or DRIVE, whichever your team sets as Active |","table":"table-0"},"5247":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-50","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#at-a-glance","content":"|                 |                                                |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| **You connect** | Your calendar, your call recorder and your CRM |","table":"table-0"},"5248":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-51","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#before-you-begin","content":"**Connect three things.** The brief draws on your calendar, your call recording tool or Oliv AI's own recorder, and your CRM: Salesforce, HubSpot or Zoho."},"5249":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-52","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#before-you-begin","content":"**Have the deal in your CRM.** Deal briefs cover meetings linked to an active opportunity. First meetings with new contacts get a research brief instead."},"5250":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-53","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#before-you-begin","content":"**Know your methodology.** Qualification status is shown against the framework your company runs."},"5251":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-54","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#before-you-begin","content":"**Don't wait for a clean CRM.** Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent fills in missing or stale fields from call history as it goes, so the brief works from day one."},"5252":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-55","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#step-1-connect","content":"Connect your calendar so Oliv AI knows which meetings are coming up. Then connect your call recorder and CRM: your existing recording tool or Oliv AI's own recorder, plus Salesforce, HubSpot or Zoho. Past conversations and deal records are what the brief is built from. Most teams are connected within a week."},"5253":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-56","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#step-2-brief-arrives","content":"There's nothing to request. Oliv AI's Meeting Assistant agent sends the brief automatically before every meeting linked to an active opportunity, 30 minutes ahead of the start time. Oliv AI's Olivia agent works through Slack, Teams or the Oliv AI product, so prep shows up where you already work."},"5254":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-57","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#step-3-read-the-brief","content":"The deal brief is designed to fit one screen and take about 60 seconds to read. It has four parts:"},"5255":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-58","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#step-3-read-the-brief","content":"| Part             | What it tells you                                       |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Deal summary** | Stage, amount, close date, last activity and next steps |","table":"table-1"},"5256":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-59","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#step-3-read-the-brief","content":"| Part                     | What it tells you                                                                        |\n| ------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Qualification status** | Where the deal stands against your methodology, with gaps and open questions highlighted |","table":"table-1"},"5257":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-60","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#step-3-read-the-brief","content":"| Part             | What it tells you                                                                                   |\n| ---------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Stakeholders** | Who's in this meeting, the role each plays, and what they care about based on earlier conversations |","table":"table-1"},"5258":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-61","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#step-3-read-the-brief","content":"| Part                   | What it tells you                                                    |\n| ---------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Recommended agenda** | What to cover, tailored to the deal stage and the qualification gaps |","table":"table-1"},"5259":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-62","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#step-3-read-the-brief","content":"Start with the gaps. They're the questions worth asking while there's still time to act on the answers, which is the point of sales meeting preparation."},"5260":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-63","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#step-4-first-meeting","content":"You don't have to wait for the scheduled brief. Open **Home**, keep the **Ask** tab on Oliv AI's Olivia agent, and type the call you're preparing for, such as \"Get me ready for my renewal call at 4pm today.\" Olivia answers in the chat, and a collapsed **Reasoning Trace** row shows the steps she took."},"5261":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-64","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#step-4-first-meeting","content":"Oliv AI's Olivia agent opens her on-demand prep with the deal at a glance. Stage, value, the gap since the economic buyer was last touched and deal health tell you how much is at stake before you read on."},"5262":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-65","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#step-4-first-meeting","content":"Her answer runs in a fixed order:"},"5263":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-66","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#step-4-first-meeting","content":"| Section              | What it tells you                                                                            |\n| -------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Deal at a glance** | Four cards: deal stage, ARR, days since the economic buyer was last touched, and deal health |","table":"table-2"},"5264":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-67","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#step-4-first-meeting","content":"| Section            | What it tells you                                                             |\n| ------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Who's Joining?** | Each attendee with their role, such as champion or a new addition to the call |","table":"table-2"},"5265":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-68","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#step-4-first-meeting","content":"| Section            | What it tells you                                                                        |\n| ------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Risks to watch** | What could go wrong on this call, such as a silent champion or missing decision criteria |","table":"table-2"},"5266":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-69","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#step-4-first-meeting","content":"| Section            | What it tells you                                  |\n| ------------------ | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Talking points** | A numbered list of what to raise and in what order |","table":"table-2"},"5267":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-70","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#step-4-first-meeting","content":"| Section              | What it tells you                                                                                                  |\n| -------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Researcher brief** | A short profile of a new attendee from Oliv AI's Researcher agent: role, background and what they're likely to ask |","table":"table-2"},"5268":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-71","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#step-4-first-meeting","content":"The whole prep fits in one answer, from the deal cards down to a brief from Oliv AI's Researcher agent on the attendee you haven't met. The figures and names in it are sample data."},"5269":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-72","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#step-4-first-meeting","content":"A first meeting has no deal history to draw on, so the prep is research. Tell Olivia you're meeting someone for the first time and ask her to prepare you. Thirty minutes before the meeting, she sends three bullets and an icebreaker:"},"5270":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-73","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#step-4-first-meeting","content":"| Part            | What it covers                                                                                 |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **The company** | What it does, its size and industry, funding history and stage, recent news and market context |","table":"table-3"},"5271":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-74","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#step-4-first-meeting","content":"| Part           | What it covers                                                                                       |\n| -------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **The person** | LinkedIn career history, current role and tenure, interests, and shared connections or common ground |","table":"table-3"},"5272":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-75","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#step-4-first-meeting","content":"| Part               | What it covers                                      |\n| ------------------ | --------------------------------------------------- |\n| **The icebreaker** | One specific talking point to open the conversation |","table":"table-3"},"5273":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-76","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#step-4-first-meeting","content":"For a VP or C-suite contact, the brief also covers company tenure and publicly known priorities. If you want more than the three bullets, the full detail view is in the Oliv AI platform."},"5274":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-77","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#step-4-pre-meeting-email","content":"Oliv AI's Olivia agent ends her prep with a suggested next step, such as **Draft the pre-meeting Email**. Click it, and she writes the email two ways:"},"5275":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-78","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#step-4-pre-meeting-email","content":"**Compare the drafts.** One is marked **Recommended**, with a **Why this version?** box listing her reasons. The other is a softer alternative, tagged with when to use it."},"5276":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-79","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#step-4-pre-meeting-email","content":"**Choose how it goes out.** Pick **Send Draft 1 now**, schedule it with **Send Draft 1 at 3:30pm**, **Edit before sending**, or **Send Draft 2 instead**. Nothing goes out until you choose."},"5277":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-80","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#step-4-pre-meeting-email","content":"**Read what happens next.** Under **After this goes out, I'll**, Olivia lists her follow-through: log the touch on the deal through Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent, watch for a reply and ping you, and update your brief if none comes."},"5278":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-81","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#step-4-pre-meeting-email","content":"The pre-meeting email is the last step of prep. You pick the draft and the send option, and Oliv AI's Olivia agent says what she'll do once it's sent, including logging the touch on the deal."},"5279":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-82","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#step-5-use-the-agenda","content":"Open the recommended agenda and check it against what you planned to cover."},"5280":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-83","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#step-5-use-the-agenda","content":"Turn each highlighted qualification gap into a question for the call."},"5281":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-84","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#step-5-use-the-agenda","content":"Read the stakeholder notes, and decide who each point is aimed at."},"5282":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-85","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#step-5-use-the-agenda","content":"If a competitor is live in the deal, watch the clips pulled from past calls before you join."},"5283":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-86","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#step-5-use-the-agenda","content":"Join the call. After it, the follow-up draft and proposed CRM updates come back to you."},"5284":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-87","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#what-it-is","content":"Meeting preparation is the work Oliv AI does before your meetings so you don't rebuild context by hand. It comes in two forms, chosen by whether a deal exists yet."},"5285":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-88","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#what-it-is","content":"|         | Deal brief                        | First-meeting brief              |\n| ------- | --------------------------------- | -------------------------------- |\n| **For** | Meetings on an active opportunity | First meetings with new contacts |","table":"table-4"},"5286":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-89","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#what-it-is","content":"|             | Deal brief                        | First-meeting brief    |\n| ----------- | --------------------------------- | ---------------------- |\n| **Sent by** | Oliv AI's Meeting Assistant agent | Oliv AI's Olivia agent |","table":"table-4"},"5287":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-90","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#what-it-is","content":"|                | Deal brief                                     | First-meeting brief                         |\n| -------------- | ---------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| **Built from** | Your CRM and earlier conversations on the deal | Company research and the contact's LinkedIn |","table":"table-4"},"5288":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-91","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#what-it-is","content":"|              | Deal brief                                               | First-meeting brief             |\n| ------------ | -------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| **Contains** | Deal summary, qualification status, stakeholders, agenda | Three bullets and an icebreaker |","table":"table-4"},"5289":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-92","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#what-it-is","content":"|             | Deal brief                    | First-meeting brief           |\n| ----------- | ----------------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| **Arrives** | 30 minutes before the meeting | 30 minutes before the meeting |","table":"table-4"},"5290":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-93","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#what-it-is","content":"Oliv AI's Olivia agent sits across both. She surfaces the right context before every meeting, coordinating Meeting Assistant for active opportunities and doing the research for new contacts herself. You can also ask her for prep at any time, and she lays out the deal, the attendees, the risks and the talking points in one answer. That's the difference between an AI meeting assistant for sales and a recorder that only helps after the call."},"5291":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-94","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#what-its-for","content":"Meeting preparation puts what you need to know in front of you before the call starts. It covers where the deal stands, who's in the room and what to raise. The first minutes then go on the buyer, not on catching up."},"5292":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-95","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#how-it-helps","content":"**It arrives without asking.** The brief lands 30 minutes before the meeting, with nothing to request."},"5293":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-96","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#how-it-helps","content":"**It reads in a minute.** One screen, about 60 seconds, scannable on the way into the room."},"5294":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-97","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#how-it-helps","content":"**Gaps show up early.** Open qualification questions appear while you can still ask them."},"5295":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-98","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#how-it-helps","content":"**First calls get research too.** New contacts come with company and person context and an opening line."},"5296":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-99","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#without-it","content":"Without prep, reps rebuild each deal from notes and CRM records before the call, or walk in cold. Qualification gaps tend to surface at the forecast review, too late to fix. First calls open with questions the rep could have answered beforehand."},"5297":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-100","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#why-buyers-care","content":"This matters to sales leaders whose teams run dozens of calls a week. It matters just as much to SDR and BDR leads whose reps book first meetings back to back. It counts most when calendars fill up, because prep is usually the first thing to go."},"5298":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-101","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#approach","content":"Take an SDR who has booked a first discovery call with a finance VP at a target account. The call is at 2pm, with three other calls before it. The goal is to qualify the account and hand a live opportunity to an account executive."},"5299":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-102","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#approach","content":"The usual prep is a quick tour of LinkedIn, the company's website and a news search, plus any notes in the CRM. Reps who do this well tend to spend 15 to 20 minutes per contact. On a full day that time often isn't there, so the research gets skimmed or skipped."},"5300":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-103","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#approach","content":"A first call is mostly won or lost in its opening minutes. The SDR doesn't need everything about the account, just the few facts that make the opening specific. That's a short job if someone else has already done the reading."},"5301":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-104","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#approach","content":"Oliv AI does the reading before the SDR has to. Oliv AI's Olivia agent sends three bullets on the company and the person, plus one icebreaker to open with. Funding, market position and recent news cover the account. Career history, role and interests cover the person."},"5302":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-105","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#approach","content":"The research brief lands 30 minutes before the meeting, and the full detail view stays in the platform for anyone who wants more. How other platforms prepare reps for a first meeting is covered in How meeting preparation compares, below."},"5303":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-106","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#with-follow-up","content":"Once the recording is processed, Oliv AI's Meeting Assistant agent drafts the follow-up email from the actual transcript, not a template. It also proposes CRM updates for stage, amount, close date, qualification fields and next steps. Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent writes those updates, so the next brief starts from current data."},"5304":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-107","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#with-clips","content":"Oliv AI's Content Curator agent reviews every new recording and picks out clips that match a brief you set. When a competitor comes up in a live deal, Meeting Assistant pulls three recent clips from the competitive playlist before the next meeting, showing how other reps handled that comparison."},"5305":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-108","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#with-one-on-ones","content":"Managers get prep too. In **Reports › My Reports**, Oliv AI's Deal Driver agent delivers a **Morning Brief** every weekday. It covers the day's meetings, the ones marked important, and each rep's meetings with the deal behind them."},"5306":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-109","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#with-one-on-ones","content":"The Morning Brief from Oliv AI's Deal Driver agent is a manager's version of meeting prep. It shows which of the team's meetings need attention today, with buttons to join a call, leave the rep a note or review the deal."},"5307":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-110","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#with-one-on-ones","content":"Each meeting card in the brief has **Add me to this call**, **Leave a note** and **Review Deal**, and a line comparing the meeting with your own calendar. Deal Driver also prepares a **One-on-One Prep** report for each rep, on that rep's own day, such as every Thursday or every Friday. Oliv AI's Coach agent follows minutes later with that rep's coaching goal."},"5308":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-111","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#with-one-on-ones","content":"One-on-One Prep puts a rep's whole pipeline in front of the manager before their 1:1. Each rep has their own delivery day, set in the report list."},"5309":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-112","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#with-one-on-ones","content":"On customer success teams, Oliv AI's Portfolio Manager agent builds a briefing of each CSM's book before every scheduled 1:1."},"5310":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-113","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#with-methodology","content":"The qualification status in each brief follows the framework your team runs, whether that's MEDDPICC, MEDDIC, SPICED, BANT or DRIVE, set as **Active** in **Settings › Qualification Framework**. See how Oliv AI scores calls against your sales methodology."},"5311":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-114","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#with-tools","content":"The actions agents take in your calendar, mailbox and CRM are listed on each agent's **Tools** tab. Agent tools and run modes explains how to choose which of those actions wait for your approval."},"5312":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-115","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#who-uses-it","content":"These are typical patterns, shown to illustrate how the briefs are used."},"5313":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-116","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#sales-development","content":"A sales development team books first meetings every day. Each rep reads the research brief between calls and opens with the icebreaker, so no first call starts with \"tell me about your company.\" It's one way to keep AI-assisted prospecting personal."},"5314":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-117","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#account-executives","content":"An account executive with a full pipeline reads the deal brief before each call. The qualification gaps become the questions for that meeting, and the stakeholder notes show who needs which point."},"5315":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-118","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#account-managers","content":"An account manager walks into a renewal or expansion call with the full account history ready. Oliv AI's Olivia agent has it assembled before the call, including what was agreed last time."},"5316":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-119","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#sales-managers","content":"A sales manager starts the day with the Morning Brief, then opens each rep's 1:1 with their pipeline, activity and flagged deals already on the page. The conversation starts at strategy instead of status updates."},"5317":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-120","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#compare","content":"Oliv AI's brief arrives on its own 30 minutes before the meeting, with the deal's qualification status and a recommended agenda built in. First meetings get research on the company and the person, plus an icebreaker. Oliv AI is the only platform in this table that does all four."},"5318":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-121","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#compare","content":"Meeting preparation, from each platform's public documentation:"},"5319":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-122","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#compare","content":"| Platform    | Brief sent automatically before the meeting | Qualification status in the brief | Recommended agenda in the brief | Research on new contacts before a first call |\n| ----------- | ------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------- | ------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| **Oliv AI** | Yes                                         | Yes                               | Yes                             | Yes                                          |","table":"table-5"},"5320":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-123","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#compare","content":"| Platform | Brief sent automatically before the meeting | Qualification status in the brief | Recommended agenda in the brief | Research on new contacts before a first call |\n| -------- | ------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------- | ------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| **Gong** | Partly (CRM-triggered briefs)               | Partly (separate MEDDICC agent)   | Not in docs                     | Partly (web search sections)                 |","table":"table-5"},"5321":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-124","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#compare","content":"| Platform     | Brief sent automatically before the meeting | Qualification status in the brief | Recommended agenda in the brief | Research on new contacts before a first call |\n| ------------ | ------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------- | ------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| **Outreach** | Yes (Meeting Prep Agent briefs)             | Partly (separate Deal Agent)      | Partly (Talking Points section) | Partly (uses past account engagement)        |","table":"table-5"},"5322":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-125","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#compare","content":"| Platform         | Brief sent automatically before the meeting | Qualification status in the brief | Recommended agenda in the brief | Research on new contacts before a first call |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------- | ------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| **Fireflies.ai** | Yes (Meeting Prep created automatically)    | Not in docs                       | Not in docs                     | Partly (needs past meetings)                 |","table":"table-5"},"5323":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-126","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#compare","content":"| Platform  | Brief sent automatically before the meeting | Qualification status in the brief | Recommended agenda in the brief | Research on new contacts before a first call |\n| --------- | ------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------- | ------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| **Avoma** | Reminder email only                         | Not in docs                       | Partly (template you apply)     | Not in docs                                  |","table":"table-5"},"5324":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-127","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#compare","content":"*Yes: documented and built in. Partly: documented with a limit, shown in brackets. Not in docs: not found in the vendor's public documentation.*"},"5325":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-128","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#compare-stronger","content":"**Gaps inside the brief.** Oliv AI's brief shows qualification status against your methodology, next to the agenda. Gong documents a separate MEDDICC agent that shows where the gaps are. See Oliv AI as a Gong alternative."},"5326":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-129","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#compare-stronger","content":"**An agenda built from the deal.** Oliv AI's recommended agenda follows the deal stage and the open qualification gaps. Avoma documents sharing an agenda that you build from a notes template. See Oliv AI vs Avoma."},"5327":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-130","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#compare-stronger","content":"**Ready for people you've never met.** Oliv AI's first-meeting brief covers the company, the person and an icebreaker. Fireflies.ai builds its brief from your previous meetings with the same attendees."},"5328":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-131","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#compare-stronger","content":"**On the calendar, not on a trigger.** Oliv AI sends the brief 30 minutes before each meeting on an active opportunity. Gong's automated briefs go out when predefined CRM conditions are met. See Gong vs Oliv AI."},"5329":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-132","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#compare-stronger","content":"*Competitor details checked against each vendor's public documentation on 21 October 2026. Features and plans change, so confirm with the vendor before you decide.*"},"5330":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-133","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#limits","content":"**Deal briefs need a deal.** The deal brief covers meetings linked to an active opportunity in your CRM. Meetings with new contacts get the research brief instead."},"5331":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-134","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#limits","content":"**Connections come first.** No brief arrives until your calendar, recorder and CRM are connected. Most teams are connected within a week."},"5332":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-135","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#limits","content":"**The research brief is short by design.** It's three bullets and an icebreaker. The full detail view is in the platform."},"5333":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-136","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#limits","content":"**Emails wait for your choice.** A pre-meeting or follow-up email goes out only when you pick a send option or press send."},"5334":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-137","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#faq-when","content":"Thirty minutes before the meeting. You don't need to request it; it's sent automatically for meetings linked to an active opportunity."},"5335":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-138","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#faq-length","content":"One screen, about 60 seconds to read. It covers the deal summary, qualification status, stakeholder context and a recommended agenda."},"5336":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-139","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#faq-first-meeting","content":"Three bullets on the company and the person, plus an icebreaker. Oliv AI's Olivia agent sends it 30 minutes before the meeting."},"5337":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-140","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#faq-methodologies","content":"MEDDPICC, MEDDIC, SPICED, BANT or DRIVE. Your team marks one as **Active** in **Settings › Qualification Framework**, and the brief maps the deal against it."},"5338":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-141","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#faq-agenda","content":"Yes. The recommended agenda is tailored to the deal stage and its qualification gaps, so it points you at what still needs answering."},"5339":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-142","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#faq-clean-crm","content":"No. Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent fills in missing or stale fields from call history as it goes, so the brief can start straight away."},"5340":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-143","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#faq-where","content":"Oliv AI's Olivia agent works through Slack, Teams or the Oliv AI product. In the product, you ask her on the Home screen's Ask tab, and managers read Deal Driver's briefs in My Reports."},"5341":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-144","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#faq-follow-up-template","content":"No. Oliv AI's Meeting Assistant agent writes the draft from the call transcript: what was discussed, what was agreed and what happens next. You review, adjust and send."},"5342":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-145","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#faq-one-on-ones","content":"Yes. Oliv AI's Deal Driver agent prepares a One-on-One Prep report for each rep on that rep's set day, such as Thursday or Friday. Its Morning Brief covers the team's meetings every weekday."},"5343":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-146","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#faq-team-size","content":"No. A single rep gets value from the first brief. Gap tracking becomes more useful as deal volume grows, because there's more for it to catch."},"5344":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-147","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#related","content":"Agent tools and run modes: choose which agent actions wait for your approval."},"5345":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-148","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#related","content":"Oliv AI product documentation: every guide, by agent and feature."},"5346":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-149","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#related","content":"Meeting Assistant agent page: the agent that sends deal briefs and drafts follow-ups."},"5347":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-150","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#related","content":"Olivia agent page: the agent that prepares first meetings and routes work."},"5348":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting-151","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/prepare-for-a-meeting#related","content":"AI meeting preparation tools: how meeting prep tools differ on CRM depth."},"5349"