ocs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#account-managers","content":"Account managers"},"5380":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-27","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#sales-managers","content":"Sales managers"},"5381":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-28","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#compare","content":"How post-call follow-up compares"},"5382":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-29","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#compare-stronger","content":"Why Oliv AI is the stronger choice for post-call follow-up"},"5383":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-30","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#limits","content":"Limits and things to know"},"5384":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-31","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#common-questions","content":"Common questions"},"5385":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-32","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#faq-how-soon","content":"How soon is the follow-up ready?"},"5386":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-33","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#faq-template","content":"Is the follow-up email a template?"},"5387":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-34","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#faq-draft-contents","content":"What does the draft include?"},"5388":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-35","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#faq-review","content":"Is anything sent without me?"},"5389":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-36","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#faq-crm-fields","content":"Which CRM fields does it propose?"},"5390":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-37","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#faq-summary","content":"What's in the meeting summary?"},"5391":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-38","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#faq-ask-olivia","content":"Can I ask for a follow-up instead of waiting?"},"5392":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-39","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#faq-customer-hosted","content":"Does it work if the customer hosted the meeting?"},"5393":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-40","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#faq-which-meetings","content":"Which meetings get a follow-up draft?"},"5394":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-41","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#faq-share-part","content":"Can I share part of a call?"},"5395":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-42","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#related","content":"Related"},"5396":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-43","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","content":"Oliv AI records your sales calls and has the follow-up ready within minutes of the call ending. Oliv AI's Meeting Assistant agent drafts the email from the transcript, with the recap, commitments, owners and next steps already written. It also proposes CRM updates and flags qualification gaps for you to review. This guide covers getting the call recorded, then reviewing and sending everything that comes back."},"5397":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-44","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#at-a-glance","content":"|                               |                                                                                              |\n| ----------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **What you get after a call** | A meeting summary, a follow-up email draft, proposed CRM updates and qualification gap flags |","table":"table-0"},"5398":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-45","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#at-a-glance","content":"|          |                                                                       |\n| -------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **When** | The summary as soon as the meeting ends; the follow-up within minutes |","table":"table-0"},"5399":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-46","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#at-a-glance","content":"|                |                                                             |\n| -------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Drafted by** | Oliv AI's Meeting Assistant agent, from the call transcript |","table":"table-0"},"5400":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-47","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#at-a-glance","content":"|                      |                                               |\n| -------------------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| **The draft covers** | The recap, commitments, owners and next steps |","table":"table-0"},"5401":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-48","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#at-a-glance","content":"|                          |                                                                |\n| ------------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **CRM updates proposed** | Stage, amount, close date, qualification fields and next steps |","table":"table-0"},"5402":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-49","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#at-a-glance","content":"|                         |                                                                                                                                        |\n| ----------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Where you review it** | **Activities › Meetings** or **Activities › Calls**, in a drawer with tabs for the summary, tasks, insights, recording and CRM changes |","table":"table-0"},"5403":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-50","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#at-a-glance","content":"|                              |                             |\n| ---------------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| **Before anything goes out** | You review, adjust and send |","table":"table-0"},"5404":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-51","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#at-a-glance","content":"|              |                                          |\n| ------------ | ---------------------------------------- |\n| **Works on** | Meetings linked to an active opportunity |","table":"table-0"},"5405":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-52","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#before-you-begin","content":"**Connect your calendar.** Oliv AI needs calendar access to know which meetings to join and record."},"5406":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-53","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#before-you-begin","content":"**Connect your CRM.** Proposed updates are written against your deals in Salesforce, HubSpot or Zoho."},"5407":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-54","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#before-you-begin","content":"**Have the deal in your CRM.** Oliv AI's Meeting Assistant agent works on meetings linked to an active opportunity."},"5408":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-55","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#before-you-begin","content":"**Connect Slack if you use it.** The meeting summary arrives in Slack as soon as the meeting ends, and by email too."},"5409":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-56","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#step-1-record","content":"Oliv AI joins Zoom, Google Meet and Microsoft Teams meetings automatically once your calendar is connected, with the Oliv AI Zoom app installed for Zoom. If you or someone from your company organized the meeting, Oliv AI records botlessly through the meeting app, with no extra participant. If the customer organized it, a note taker joins with your company's name, and the host may need to admit it from the lobby. Either way, every speaker is transcribed and labeled."},"5410":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-57","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#step-2-summary","content":"The meeting summary is sent immediately after the meeting ends, to Slack and to your email by default. It holds the meeting details: title, date, time, participants and the account. It also covers key takeaways, next steps, talk time and a scorecard."},"5411":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-58","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#step-2-summary","content":"To open the full recording from Slack, click **Open Meeting** in the message. You can also find any meeting later in **Activities › Meetings**. The Meetings list has **My meetings** and **Team meetings** tabs, with **Search**, **Group**, **Fields**, **Sort** and **Filter**."},"5412":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-59","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#step-2-summary","content":"The Meetings list already shows each call's next step and AI summary, so you can see what needs following up before you open a single meeting."},"5413":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-60","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#step-2-summary","content":"Each row shows the meeting's **Next Step** and **AI Summary**, and a **Meeting with** dropdown that classes it as Prospect, Customer, Candidate or Colleague. Click a row to open the meeting. Its **Overview** tab holds:"},"5414":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-61","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#step-2-summary","content":"**Key takeaways**, each with timestamps that jump to that moment in the recording;"},"5415":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-62","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#step-2-summary","content":"an **AI Summary**, in headed sections with their own timestamps;"},"5416":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-63","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#step-2-summary","content":"an updates card for the account, with the deal's stage, amount and close date and a **Review Deal** button."},"5417":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-64","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#step-2-summary","content":"The Overview tab is the in-app version of the meeting summary. Every takeaway links back to the moment it came from, and the seven tabs split the rest of the follow-up work."},"5418":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-65","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#step-2-action-items","content":"The **Action Items** tab turns the call's commitments into tasks. Three cards at the top show the **Next meeting**, the **Next action** and the **Next follow-up**, each with a status such as **Accepted** or **Overdue**. Below them, a **Tasks** table lists each task with an **Assignee**, a **Due Date** and a timestamp back to the moment it was agreed."},"5419":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-66","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#step-2-action-items","content":"Action Items is where a call's commitments become tasks with owners and due dates. Each task links back to the moment in the call where it was agreed."},"5420":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-67","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#step-2-action-items","content":"Tick a task when it's done, switch the status filter from **Pending**, or **Add task** by hand. Phone calls in **Activities › Calls** get the same tab, split into **Our tasks** and **Their tasks**, so you can see what the buyer owes as well."},"5421":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-68","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#step-3-review-draft","content":"Within minutes of the call ending, Oliv AI's Meeting Assistant agent drafts your follow-up. It isn't a template. The agent reads the transcript and writes from the actual conversation:"},"5422":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-69","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#step-3-review-draft","content":"| Part      | What it covers                 |\n| --------- | ------------------------------ |\n| **Recap** | What was discussed on the call |","table":"table-1"},"5423":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-70","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#step-3-review-draft","content":"| Part            | What it covers               |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------- |\n| **Commitments** | What was agreed, and by whom |","table":"table-1"},"5424":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-71","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#step-3-review-draft","content":"| Part       | What it covers              |\n| ---------- | --------------------------- |\n| **Owners** | Who is doing each next step |","table":"table-1"},"5425":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-72","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#step-3-review-draft","content":"| Part           | What it covers                                        |\n| -------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Next steps** | What happens next, with specific dates where possible |","table":"table-1"},"5426":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-73","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#step-3-review-draft","content":"Read it through, change anything that needs changing, and send it. Nothing reaches your buyer until you've reviewed it. If you'd rather ask, tell Oliv AI's Olivia agent \"Draft the follow-up from my call this afternoon\" and she drafts it from the transcript."},"5427":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-74","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#step-4-crm","content":"From what was said on the call, Oliv AI proposes deal field updates and records them on the meeting's **CRM Updates** tab:"},"5428":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-75","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#step-4-crm","content":"Open **CRM Updates**. A timeline lists every change made after the call, such as a refreshed account summary, a scorecard update or a new contact. A green check marks the ones already done."},"5429":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-76","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#step-4-crm","content":"Find any **Pending Update**, such as a move to a new stage. Check it against what the buyer told you, then click **Update Deal** to confirm it."},"5430":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-77","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#step-4-crm","content":"Open the changed records with **View Account**, **View Deal** or **View Contact**. On the deal itself, the **CRM Updates** tab lists **AI Suggestions** to **Accept** or **Reject**, with the current CRM value beside each one."},"5431":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-78","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#step-4-crm","content":"CRM Updates shows what reached your CRM after the call and what is still waiting. A stage move stays pending until you confirm it with Update Deal."},"5432":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-79","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#step-4-crm","content":"Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent writes the updates, so your pipeline stays current without manual cleanup."},"5433":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-80","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#step-4-crm","content":"How freely agents act in your CRM is set per action. Agent tools and run modes explains which actions wait for your approval."},"5434":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-81","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#step-5-gaps","content":"After every call, Oliv AI flags new information, or notable absences, that affect the deal's qualification status. Gaps show up while there's still time to close them."},"5435":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-82","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#step-5-gaps","content":"Open the meeting's **Meeting insights** tab to see them. A row of chips, from **Metrics** and **Economic Buyer** to **Champion** and **Additional Fields**, follows your qualification framework. Click a chip to jump to its section, where each card holds what was said, with timestamps. Where nothing was said, the card says so instead of guessing."},"5436":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-83","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#step-5-gaps","content":"Meeting insights files what the buyer said under each qualification criterion. A card that says nothing was discussed is the gap to raise on the next call."},"5437":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-84","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#step-5-gaps","content":"Turn each gap into a question for the next meeting, and it will feed the brief that helps you prepare for the next meeting."},"5438":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-85","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#step-6-share","content":"Sometimes a colleague needs one part of the call, not all of it. Open the meeting's **Recording** tab, find the moment in **Chapters** or **Transcripts**, then use the buttons under the player:"},"5439":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-86","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#step-6-share","content":"**Clip** cuts the key moment, which then sits in your clip libraries."},"5440":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-87","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#step-6-share","content":"**Share** sends the meeting to a colleague."},"5441":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-88","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#step-6-share","content":"**Add Comment** pins a note to that point in the call, and **Comments** shows your team's notes."},"5442":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-89","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#step-6-share","content":"The Recording tab is where you cut and share the moment that matters. Chapters and the speaker timeline help you find it without replaying the whole call."},"5443":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-90","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#step-6-share","content":"A phone call's **Recording** tab plays the audio with a **Transcript** and **Comments** beside it, a **Timeline** of talk time and engagement, and **Add Comment**. The meeting details page covers every tab in depth."},"5444":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-91","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#step-6-share","content":"Phone calls get the same replay and transcript as meetings, with comments you can attach to a moment. Use it to check a commitment before you send the follow-up."},"5445":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-92","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#what-it-is","content":"Post-call follow-up is the work Oliv AI does once a recorded meeting ends, so you don't write the recap or update the CRM from memory. It has five outputs."},"5446":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-93","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#what-it-is","content":"| Output              | Sent by                     | When                               |\n| ------------------- | --------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| **Meeting summary** | Oliv AI, to Slack and email | Immediately after the meeting ends |","table":"table-2"},"5447":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-94","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#what-it-is","content":"| Output                           | Sent by                                                  | When                            |\n| -------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| **Takeaways, summary and tasks** | Oliv AI, on the meeting's Overview and Action Items tabs | Once the recording is processed |","table":"table-2"},"5448":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-95","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#what-it-is","content":"| Output                    | Sent by                           | When                              |\n| ------------------------- | --------------------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| **Follow-up email draft** | Oliv AI's Meeting Assistant agent | Within minutes of the call ending |","table":"table-2"},"5449":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-96","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#what-it-is","content":"| Output                   | Sent by                                                                   | When                             |\n| ------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------- |\n| **Proposed CRM updates** | Oliv AI's Meeting Assistant agent, written by Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent | After the recording is processed |","table":"table-2"},"5450":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-97","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#what-it-is","content":"| Output                      | Sent by                           | When             |\n| --------------------------- | --------------------------------- | ---------------- |\n| **Qualification gap flags** | Oliv AI's Meeting Assistant agent | After every call |","table":"table-2"},"5451":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-98","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#what-it-is","content":"Oliv AI's Olivia agent drives the whole post-meeting workflow: follow-up drafted, CRM updates flagged for review and next steps identified. You review and act; she handles the execution. It's the after-call half of an AI meeting assistant for sales."},"5452":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-99","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#what-its-for","content":"Post-call follow-up gets the recap to your buyer while the call is still fresh. It also keeps the CRM in step with what was actually said. You spend the minutes after a call reviewing, not writing."},"5453":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-100","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#how-it-helps","content":"**The draft is waiting.** The follow-up is written within minutes of the call ending."},"5454":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-101","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#how-it-helps","content":"**It comes from the call.** The transcript, not a template, supplies the recap and next steps."},"5455":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-102","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#how-it-helps","content":"**The CRM keeps up.** Field updates are proposed from what was said, ready to approve."},"5456":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-103","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#how-it-helps","content":"**Gaps surface early.** Missing qualification details show up after every call, not at the forecast review."},"5457":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-104","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#without-it","content":"Without it, the follow-up email takes about 15 minutes after every call. CRM updates depend on what the rep remembers. Qualification gaps come to light at the forecast review, when it's too late to act."},"5458":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-105","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#why-buyers-care","content":"This matters to account executives with calls booked back to back, because the follow-up is the first thing to slip. It matters to sales managers who need deal fields they can trust. It counts most late in a deal, when a slow recap costs momentum."},"5459":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-106","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#approach","content":"Imagine an account executive who has just finished a product demo with a buying committee of four. The next meeting starts in twenty minutes. Before then, the AE wants the recap in the champion's inbox, with the pricing question and the security review written down."},"5460":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-107","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#approach","content":"The usual fix is a quick email typed from memory, or a note to write it properly that evening. A rushed recap tends to miss who owns what. An evening recap arrives after the buyer has moved on to other things. Meanwhile the CRM still shows last week's stage and close date."},"5461":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-108","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#approach","content":"Everything the recap needs was said on the call. Who asked about pricing, what was agreed, and when the security review happens are all in the transcript. Writing the email is mostly a job of finding those lines and putting them in order."},"5462":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-109","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#approach","content":"Oliv AI does that job with its Meeting Assistant agent. Within minutes of the demo ending, the draft is written from the transcript, with the recap, commitments, owners and next steps. Proposed CRM updates and qualification gap flags come back alongside it for the AE to approve. The AE reads it on the way to the next call."},"5463":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-110","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#approach","content":"The draft is never a template, and nothing reaches the buyer until the AE has read it and pressed send. How other platforms handle the draft and the CRM after a call is covered in How post-call follow-up compares, below."},"5464":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-111","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#with-prep","content":"What you approve after one call feeds the brief before the next. Oliv AI's Meeting Assistant agent sends that brief before every meeting on an active opportunity, with the deal summary, qualification status and a recommended agenda."},"5465":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-112","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#with-recording-modes","content":"Who sends the invite decides how a call is recorded. When your company organizes, Oliv AI records through Zoom or Microsoft Teams with no bot. When the customer organizes, a note taker joins with your company's name. Converse also captures phone calls and in-person meetings."},"5466":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-113","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#with-one-on-ones","content":"Oliv AI's Deal Driver agent pairs the per-call summaries with pipeline context before each manager 1:1. Managers coach from the same picture their reps have."},"5467":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-114","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#with-clips","content":"Oliv AI's Content Curator agent reviews every new recording and clips the moments your team asked for, such as a well-handled pricing objection."},"5468":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-115","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#with-crm","content":"Proposed updates land in Salesforce, HubSpot or Zoho once approved. See every connection on Oliv AI integrations."},"5469":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-116","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#who-uses-it","content":"These are typical patterns, shown to illustrate how teams use the follow-up."},"5470":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-117","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#account-executives","content":"An account executive reviews the draft between back-to-back calls, fixes one date and sends it. The CRM updates get approved in the same sitting. It's a core part of how AEs run their deals in Oliv AI."},"5471":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-118","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#sales-development","content":"A sales development rep finishes a discovery call that turns into an opportunity. The follow-up and the first CRM fields come back ready, so the handoff to the account executive starts with a clean record."},"5472":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-119","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#account-managers","content":"An account manager closes a renewal call with three commitments from the customer. The recap lists each one with an owner, so nothing gets lost before the next check-in."},"5473":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-120","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#sales-managers","content":"A sales manager reads the qualification gap flags across the team's calls. Gaps on late-stage deals become the agenda for that week's 1:1s."},"5474":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-121","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#compare","content":"Oliv AI's follow-up is drafted from the transcript within minutes, without anyone clicking a button. The proposed CRM updates and qualification gaps come back in the same pass, ready to approve. Oliv AI is the only platform in this table that does all three."},"5475":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-122","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#compare","content":"Post-call follow-up, from each platform's public documentation:"},"5476":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-123","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#compare","content":"| Platform    | Follow-up drafted without a click | CRM updates proposed for approval | Qualification gaps flagged after the call |\n| ----------- | --------------------------------- | --------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| **Oliv AI** | Yes                               | Yes                               | Yes                                       |","table":"table-3"},"5477":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-124","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#compare","content":"| Platform | Follow-up drafted without a click | CRM updates proposed for approval      | Qualification gaps flagged after the call |\n| -------- | --------------------------------- | -------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| **Gong** | Partly (button on the call page)  | Partly (one text field on deal boards) | Partly (separate MEDDICC agent)           |","table":"table-3"},"5478":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-125","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#compare","content":"| Platform  | Follow-up drafted without a click       | CRM updates proposed for approval | Qualification gaps flagged after the call |\n| --------- | --------------------------------------- | --------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| **Avoma** | Partly (click Generate Follow-up Email) | Automated field updates           | Yes (gaps in the deal dashboard)          |","table":"table-3"},"5479":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-126","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#compare","content":"| Platform         | Follow-up drafted without a click    | CRM updates proposed for approval | Qualification gaps flagged after the call |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------------------ | --------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| **Fireflies.ai** | Yes (drafted after every sales call) | Yes (Autofill CRM review)         | BANT and MEDDIC scorecards (AI templates) |","table":"table-3"},"5480":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-127","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#compare","content":"| Platform   | Follow-up drafted without a click | CRM updates proposed for approval | Qualification gaps flagged after the call          |\n| ---------- | --------------------------------- | --------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Fathom** | Yes (AI follow-up email drafts)   | Writes summaries and tasks to CRM | Scorecard templates by methodology (AI Scorecards) |","table":"table-3"},"5481":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-128","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#compare","content":"| Platform     | Follow-up drafted without a click       | CRM updates proposed for approval      | Qualification gaps flagged after the call |\n| ------------ | --------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| **Outreach** | Partly (Compose email from the summary) | Yes (Deal Agent field recommendations) | Partly (separate Deal Agent)              |","table":"table-3"},"5482":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-129","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#compare","content":"*Yes: documented and built in. Partly: documented with a limit, shown in brackets. Not in docs: not found in the vendor's public documentation.*"},"5483":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-130","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#compare-stronger","content":"**Drafted before you ask.** Oliv AI's Meeting Assistant agent writes the follow-up once the recording is processed. Avoma documents a Generate Follow-up Email button you click in the meeting. See Oliv AI vs Avoma."},"5484":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-131","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#compare-stronger","content":"**Every deal field in one review.** Oliv AI proposes stage, amount, close date, qualification fields and next steps for approval. Gong fills one text-only CRM field with AI suggested updates on a deal board. See Gong vs Oliv AI."},"5485":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-132","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#compare-stronger","content":"**Gaps flagged with the draft.** Oliv AI flags qualification gaps after every call, next to the follow-up. Fathom offers scorecard templates you adapt to a methodology like SPICED."},"5486":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-133","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#compare-stronger","content":"*Competitor details checked against each vendor's public documentation on 21 October 2026. Features and plans change, so confirm with the vendor before you decide.*"},"5487":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-134","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#limits","content":"**Active opportunities only.** The follow-up draft, CRM updates and gap flags cover meetings linked to an active opportunity in your CRM."},"5488":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-135","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#limits","content":"**No recording, no draft.** The draft is built after the recording is processed, so the call has to be recorded first."},"5489":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-136","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#limits","content":"**Emails wait for you.** Nothing is sent to your buyer until you review the draft and send it."},"5490":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-137","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#limits","content":"**Stage moves wait for you.** A change of deal stage stays a **Pending Update** until you confirm it. Other updates, such as a refreshed account summary or a new contact, show on the **CRM Updates** tab once written."},"5491":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-138","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#limits","content":"**Lobbies can delay recording.** On a meeting the customer hosts, the note taker may need admitting before it can record."},"5492":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-139","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#limits","content":"**Summary messages can be turned off.** If you'd rather not get the Slack and email summaries, disable them on your **Profile Settings** page."},"5493":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-140","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#faq-how-soon","content":"Within minutes of the call ending. The meeting summary arrives sooner, immediately after the meeting ends."},"5494":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-141","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#faq-template","content":"No. Oliv AI's Meeting Assistant agent reads the transcript and writes the draft from the actual conversation: what was discussed, what was agreed and what happens next."},"5495":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-142","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#faq-draft-contents","content":"The recap, the commitments, the owners and the next steps, with specific dates where possible."},"5496":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-143","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#faq-review","content":"No email is. You review the draft, adjust anything that needs changing and send it yourself. The meeting's CRM Updates tab shows each CRM change, and holds stage moves until you confirm them."},"5497":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-144","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#faq-crm-fields","content":"Stage, amount, close date, qualification fields and next steps, based on what was said on the call. A stage move waits for you to click Update Deal, and deal suggestions wait for Accept or Reject."},"5498":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-145","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#faq-summary","content":"The title, date, time, participants and account, plus key takeaways, next steps, talk time and a scorecard. It goes to Slack and email."},"5499":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-146","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#faq-ask-olivia","content":"Yes. Tell Oliv AI's Olivia agent to draft the follow-up from your call, and she pulls from the meeting transcript to write it."},"5500":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-147","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#faq-customer-hosted","content":"Yes. A note taker joins with your company's name, so the call is recorded and the follow-up still comes back to you."},"5501":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-148","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up#faq-which-meetings","content":"Meetings linked to an active opportunity in your CRM. If the deal exists and the meeting is on your calendar, the agent runs automatically."},"5502":{"id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up-149","page_id":"/product-docs/workflows/record-and-follow-up","tags":[]