":1886,"5603":654,"5604":303,"5605":756,"5606":491,"5607":1731,"5608":1602,"5609":1603,"5610":1601,"5611":1599,"5612":1600,"5613":2668,"5614":1730,"5615":658,"5616":680,"5617":308,"5618":341,"5619":5516,"5620":4935,"5621":3976,"5622":3339,"5623":3343,"5624":3642,"5625":2741,"5626":3630,"5627":2113,"5628":3727,"5629":2496,"5630":1955,"5631":4897,"5632":1766,"5633":1673,"5634":1797,"5635":1755,"5636":3443,"5637":3994,"5638":1502,"5639":1589,"5640":1471,"5641":1557,"5642":1429,"5643":1529,"5644":948,"5645":287,"5646":588,"5647":45,"5648":43,"5649":911,"5650":247,"5651":251,"5652":418,"5653":413,"5654":245,"5655":704,"5656":838,"5657":3838,"5658":2813,"5659":5568,"5660":4616,"5661":5594,"5662":4752,"5663":3377,"5664":3109,"5665":5557,"5666":4180,"5667":5551,"5668":2514,"5669":3543,"5670":3804,"5671":1804,"5672":1913,"5673":4037,"5674":1933,"5675":2536,"5676":3990,"5677":5463},"orderedDocs":[[984,"\"Backfill MEDDPICC fields across the pipeline.\""],[3699,"\"Backfill MEDDPICC fields across the pipeline.\""],[1941,"\"Can you prep a mutual action plan for this deal?\" She engages Oliv AI's MAP Manager agent."],[983,"\"Clean unassigned contacts.\""],[3698,"\"Clean unassigned contacts.\""],[1939,"\"Draft the follow-up from my call this afternoon.\" Olivia pulls from the meeting transcript and drafts it."],[981,"\"Find all duplicate accounts from last quarter.\""],[3696,"\"Find all duplicate accounts from last quarter.\""],[1942,"\"I just met six people at an event, line up outreach for each of them.\" She engages Oliv AI's Prospector agent."],[982,"\"Rebuild broken account hierarchies.\""],[3697,"\"Rebuild broken account hierarchies.\""],[1940,"\"This deal has been stuck for three weeks.\" She engages Oliv AI's Re-Activator agent and surfaces a re-engagement strategy."],[809,"**1:1s open on coaching.** The brief lands before the meeting, so nobody starts with a pipeline recap."],[1261,"**1:1s start at strategy.** Rep reviews arrive prepped, so the meeting skips twenty minutes of status updates."],[4942,"**A brief built around the deal.** Oliv AI's brief shows qualification status against your methodology and a recommended agenda. Avoma documents templates that standardize meeting prep by meeting purpose. Compare Oliv AI vs Avoma."],[4713,"**A calendar is required.** Without a calendar connection, Oliv AI can't take notes in meetings."],[3549,"**A calendar is required.** Without a calendar integration, Oliv AI can't take notes during meetings."],[2075,"**A call record in four tabs.** A phone call opens with **Overview**, **Action Items**, **Recording** and **Contact**."],[3669,"**A clear before and after.** Each proposed update shows the suggested value beside the current Salesforce value."],[403,"**A clipped call.** The record shows the call's title and length, a video player with **Add Comment** and **Share**, a speaker **Timeline**, and a transcript you can search by speaker. **Ask AI** answers questions about the call, and **View Clip Library** and **View Slack Alert** open where the clip went."],[4711,"**A CRM comes first.** Oliv AI sits on top of an existing CRM and isn't one itself. The deals in **Records** come from the CRM you connect, and changes go back to it."],[1307,"**A daily rhythm, not a weekly check.** Deal Driver sends a Morning Brief and a Sunset Summary every weekday. Gong's pipeline generation dashboard recipe says it should be viewed weekly. See Oliv AI as a Gong alternative."],[2871,"**A dialer in the same workspace.** The Engage dialer gives each rep a US number inside the app, beside the ranked list. Avoma's dialer setup is built to work with your existing dialer. Compare Oliv AI vs Avoma."],[402,"**A drafted reply.** A **Draft · Gmail** label sits above the draft's **To**, **Subject** and body. A **Deal context used:** box lists the facts the draft relied on. **Review draft in Gmail** opens it, and **Copy** copies it."],[2076,"**A follow-up draft.** It's ready within minutes, written from the actual conversation."],[4910,"**A follow-up email draft.** It covers what was discussed, what was agreed and the next steps, with dates where possible. You review, adjust and send. See how a strong sales follow-up converts."],[1603,"**A follow-up email draft.** Written from the transcript: what was discussed, what was agreed, and next steps with dates where possible. It isn't a template."],[987,"**A governance summary.** Suggestions made, fields updated, reverts, time saved, acceptance rate by rep and flags that need review."],[2796,"**A list that keeps up.** The list re-ranks the moment a signal changes."],[2558,"**A lobby can stop a recording.** For meetings organized outside your company, the note taker may need admitting before recording can begin."],[2817,"**A manager view.** It flags whether reps are working the right accounts."],[2074,"**A meeting record in seven tabs.** Meeting details splits each meeting into **Overview**, **Action Items**, **Meeting insights**, **Recording**, **Coaching**, **Attendees** and **CRM Updates**."],[147,"**A method you can read in order.** Oliv AI shows each agent's **Process** as numbered steps, each with a title and a description. Gong's agent builder asks for a prompt describing what you want the agent to do. See Oliv AI as a Gong alternative."],[573,"**A middle setting between asking and acting.** With **Agent Decides**, the agent judges whether to ask before it uses a tool. Fireflies.ai documents choosing which permissions AskFred has in each connected app."],[2794,"**A next move, not only a task.** Each account comes with a recommended next step for the rep."],[4943,"**A nudge, not a list to check.** Oliv AI nudges the rep directly when next steps go overdue. Gong's to-do filter lets you show to-dos that are due or overdue. See Oliv AI as a Gong alternative."],[2878,"**A play works at one level.** Each play targets either a company or a single contact, and a contact-level play uses a single flow."],[2793,"**A ranked list with reasons.** Every account carries its rank and the reason for it."],[2869,"**A reason with every rank.** Engage shows why each account sits where it does, using CRM, calls and Slack. Gong's help center describes how to sort by CRM values such as fit score to decide where to focus. Compare Oliv AI vs Gong."],[2816,"**A recommended next move.** Reps get a next step that's ready to act on, not just an assignment."],[426,"**A record on every agent, not one agent type.** Oliv AI keeps run history on every agent with a detail page. Fireflies.ai saves the recording, transcript and summary after each voice agent call."],[3954,"**A record over time.** Past summaries and action items you can look back on, to track how next steps are moving."],[404,"**A release email.** An **Email** section shows the audience chip with its contact count, the subject and body with merge fields, and a **Copy** action."],[5648,"**A rollup built for the week, not a board subscription.** Oliv AI prepares the Monday summary for leadership automatically. Gong subscribers receive a weekly digest of deals through the deal board. See Oliv AI as a Gong alternative."],[3868,"**A summary nobody has to share.** Oliv sends the meeting summary as soon as the meeting ends, with next steps, talk time and a scorecard. Avoma's Slack integration lets you share entire meetings or select snippets to any Slack channel. Compare Oliv AI vs Avoma."],[5647,"**A summary prepared for leadership.** Oliv AI's Monday Pipeline Review is ready before the first standup. Avoma's forecast board is viewed by deal stage or forecast category. See Oliv AI vs Avoma."],[3952,"**A summary.** Key discussion points, action items and next steps, generated and shared once the meeting ends."],[3338,"**A tool for agents.** Gmail is one of seven systems in the agent builder, with nine named actions an agent can take."],[2072,"**A transcript.** Oliv AI transcribes the conversation and labels every speaker."],[989,"**A usage and ROI tab.** Visible in the product, alongside an estimate of time saved on manual CRM work."],[5164,"**A weekly account of what changed.** Oliv AI sends RevOps a weekly report of records created, fields updated and records cleaned. Avoma documents automating field updates to manage your pipeline. See Oliv AI vs Avoma."],[986,"**A weekly report.** Newly created deals, accounts and contacts, fields updated and enriched, and records cleaned or de-duplicated."],[1120,"**Accept or reject.** Reps press **Accept** or **Reject** on each field."],[4826,"**Account executives and sales leaders** use agents to prep meetings, follow up and move deals forward. Running deals as an account executive follows one AE's week."],[4414,"**Account risk.** Every flag from Oliv AI's Portfolio Manager agent comes with the evidence behind it: the signal, the account context and a recommended next action."],[942,"**Account structure.** It maps activity to the right account and opportunity, keeps parent and subsidiary links current, and removes duplicates."],[941,"**Accounts and contacts.** When an activity involves a company or person not yet in the CRM, it creates the record and enriches it straight away."],[3726,"**Accounts as well as contacts.** Oliv AI creates and enriches both accounts and contacts from any activity. Avoma documents that it creates Salesforce Contacts for external meeting participants. Compare Oliv AI vs Avoma."],[1406,"**Accuracy compounds.** Every closed deal makes the next forecast better."],[2809,"**Act on it.** Icon buttons flag, assign, forward or delete the conversation."],[1819,"**Act without asking carries a warning.** Only Oliver shows the **High Risk** banner, because it can change your settings."],[2340,"**Action Items.** The next meeting, next action and next follow-up, then a task table."],[4945,"**Active opportunities only.** Meeting Assistant works on meetings linked to an active opportunity. Researcher covers first-time contacts."],[5487,"**Active opportunities only.** The follow-up draft, CRM updates and gap flags cover meetings linked to an active opportunity in your CRM."],[2049,"**Activities › Calls** lists captured phone calls, with their direction, disposition, owner, company and deal."],[2048,"**Activities › Meetings** lists the meetings captured in your workspace in a grid, with **My meetings** and **Team meetings** tabs. Each row shows the next step and an AI summary."],[945,"**Activities and tasks.** It logs every meeting, call and email, and creates tasks from the next steps it hears."],[3659,"**Activities.** Every meeting, call and email is logged against the right account, contact and opportunity, including activity from meetings Oliv AI didn't join."],[1419,"**Add a cadence.** **Organisational Settings › Agents › Forecaster** lists your cadences by **Name**, **Board** and **Interval**. **Add** opens the **New Cadence** wizard, described below."],[5441,"**Add Comment** pins a note to that point in the call, and **Comments** shows your team's notes."],[1947,"**Add email, if you can.** Email is optional, but it adds a lot of context between meetings. LinkedIn or Sales Navigator is optional too, for contact enrichment."],[3357,"**Add the Chrome extension if you use Google Calendar.** It lets you stop the note taker joining a meeting from Google Calendar. The recording modes guide covers the other ways to manage it."],[3829,"**Add the Sales Companion app, if you want it.** The Help Center suggests installing the **Oliv Slack Sales Companion** app to make the most of Slack."],[4317,"**Add-ons aren't in the plans.** Enable, Engage, bot-based capture and the extra capture channels are priced separately."],[3190,"**Add** opens the **New Cadence** wizard in three steps: **Overview**, **Boards & Measurements** and **People**. On **Overview**, type a **Title** and **Description**, then pick a **Period**: **Weekly**, **Monthly** or **Quarterly**. With **Monthly**, you set a **Rep Submission Day** and a **Manager Submission Day**, each by week and day. Click **Next** to choose boards and measurements, then people."],[1274,"**Adjust the brief format if you want to.** Managers can customize alert sensitivity and brief format."],[3728,"**Admin install.** The package needs a Salesforce admin and the **Install for All Users** option."],[3205,"**Admins are booked early.** CRM, Zoom and Slack approvals don't stall the rollout in week three."],[1286,"**After the meeting.** Once the recording is processed, the follow-up email is drafted, CRM field updates are proposed and qualification gaps are flagged, all within five minutes of the call ending."],[4318,"**Agent usage is separate.** Agent actions are billed apart from seats, and the total depends on what your agents do."],[2825,"**Agentic Outreach** holds the written directives an agentic play follows, from **Overview** and **Week 1** through **Post-Call Protocol** and **Voice & Rules**."],[571,"**Agents that act beyond their own app.** Oliv AI's tools update CRM records, send email and post to Slack. Gong's help center says its agents generate outputs within Gong Assistant and do not perform actions in external systems. See Oliv AI as a Gong alternative."],[3275,"**Agents** in the sidebar opens the marketplace, where you filter agents by team or search by the job they do."],[1519,"**Agents** in the sidebar opens the marketplace. Filter pills narrow it to **All**, **Our Agents**, **Sales**, **Revenue Operations** or **Customer Success**, and **Search...** matches an agent's name or description. Each card carries **View Agent** or **Clone Agent**, and some carry a **Custom** or **Pre-built** badge. Oliver's chat sits on the right."],[5090,"**Agree who reviews.** In the review phase, reps accept or reject updates. RevOps decides when to switch to auto mode."],[4659,"**AI Suggestions.** One card per field, with the suggested value above its **Current Value**. You click **Accept** to apply it or **Reject** to drop it."],[2501,"**AI Summary.** The opening of the meeting's 