u."],[4535,"**Oliv AI's Coach agent** coaches every rep against the same up-to-date methodology. See the Coach agent."],[4538,"**Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent** tracks and updates the fields Oliver defines, including those in your CRM field mapping."],[4536,"**Oliv AI's Deal Driver agent** grounds its alerts in your qualification framework. See the Deal Driver agent."],[4537,"**Oliv AI's Forecaster agent** builds its signals on that framework, so the forecast rests on one qualification standard. See the Forecaster agent."],[4534,"**Oliv AI's Olivia agent** operates inside the stages, ownership and handoffs Oliver sets, from day one. See the Olivia agent."],[4090,"**Oliv.ai.** The richer in-meeting app. It has the bot join the call, cuts the steps needed for recording consent, and shows Oliv inside Zoom so you can edit CRM fields directly."],[4439,"**Oliver's warning is specific.** The **High Risk** warning appears for Oliver on **Act without asking**, because Oliver can change settings."],[5328,"**On the calendar, not on a trigger.** Oliv AI sends the brief 30 minutes before each meeting on an active opportunity. Gong's automated briefs go out when predefined CRM conditions are met. See Gong vs Oliv AI."],[1813,"**One change reaches every agent.** Oliver carries an update to scorecards, tracking fields and agent context together. Outreach's methodology page supports the MEDDPICC framework by default for its Deal Agent. Read how Gong and Outreach compare."],[1756,"**One change, everywhere.** A new rule reaches scorecards, tracking fields and agent context together."],[4949,"**One framework at a time.** Briefs and meeting insights follow the framework marked **Active** in Settings, so switching it changes what every deal is scored against."],[866,"**One goal at a time.** Each month the manager sets one goal per rep from the three recommended, or continues the last one."],[1973,"**One history per super agent.** Saved chats with Olivia and with Oliver sit in separate list