lay's detail page shows how far its contacts have moved, from identified to meetings booked. The Details tab mirrors the six steps of the Edit Play wizard."],[3851,"A post in a Slack channel can be the event that starts an agent. Here a release announcement becomes a customer update draft for the success team to review."],[2677,"A recorded meeting opens with a **Recording** tab: the player with **Add Comment**, **Clip** and **Share**, a speaker **Timeline** with talk time and engagement, and **Chapters**, **Transcripts** and **Comments**. The meeting details page covers each tab."],[2679,"A recorded phone call gets an audio player instead, with a **Timeline** of talk time per speaker, **Chapters**, **Add Comment** and a timestamped **Transcript**."],[2680,"A recorded phone call is replayed the same way as a meeting, with the transcript beside an audio player, so calls are as easy to review as video meetings."],[3948,"A recorded Webex call lands in the same Meetings list as calls from any other platform, with its duration, meeting type, next step and AI summary."],[4140,"A recorded Zoom call scored by Oliv AI's Coach agent: an overall grade, a score per skill and qualification coverage on one radar, ready for the next one-to-one."],[2632,"A recording mode is how Oliv AI captures a meeting. When native or botless recording is enabled for your organization, Oliv AI chooses the method based on who organized the meeting. You don't pick a mode per call."],[2510,"A recording nobody can find is close to a recording nobody made. Reps rebuild what a buyer said from memory, or walk into the next meeting without it. Small details, like who raised a concern, get lost between calls."],[1988,"A recording or transcript input such as Oliv Notetaker, a CRM connection and a calendar. Email and LinkedIn or Sales Navigator are optional."],[1278,"A rep hasn't updated the Core 4 Fields after a meeting."],[5581,"A rep hasn't updated the Core 4 Fields after a meeting."],[1281,"A rep shows a