ks."],[132,"On agents that have them, the **Knowledge** tab lists the files an agent works against, and the **Triggers** tab lists what starts it. Read them with the instructions to see the full picture of an agent."],[399,"On an agent that runs a sequence, the record is a numbered timeline instead of contacts and emails. The header names the contact and company. Each step carries a day label with its channel, a **Completed** or **Upcoming** badge, a title, a description and a preview of what was sent. A sent step also shows how it landed, such as \"Opened - No Reply\". It's the only place in the product where you can see what an agent still intends to do."],[5309,"On customer success teams, Oliv AI's Portfolio Manager agent builds a briefing of each CSM's book before every scheduled 1:1."],[3588,"On each deal, the **Momentum** tab plots what these connections bring in on one timeline. Its **Activity Map** has a row each for meetings, emails, internal Slack, external Slack and agent actions."],[5657,"On each rep's schedule, such as every Thursday, before the manager's 1:1 with that rep. It covers deal health, activity levels, stuck deals and what to focus on next week."],[5111,"On Home, CRM Manager's **Agent Feed** row reports each batch of work. It says how many fields changed, how many applied straight away and how many still need your review."],[673,"On some agents, the **Overview** tab also carries a plain-language sentence above the trigger pills. It explains what kind of event wakes the agent. It's collapsed to one line, and pressing it expands the rest."],[1430,"On the **Boards** tab, expand a manager's row to see each rep, or click the manager's name to drill into that team. Teams that run evidence-based forecast commits every Monday start from this rolled-up view. The full meeting routine is in Run a pipeline review."],[532,"On the **Instructions** tab, press a tool chip inside a process step. The **Tools** tab opens with that tool scrolled into view."],[53