e rather than the Knowledge tab."],[3245,"On the You Run It path, onboarding takes 2 to 4 sessions with your revenue operations team. On We Run It, there are no prompts to write and Oliv AI's operators maintain the playbooks."],[1116,"Once a custom field is mapped, CRM Manager updates it in the same way as standard and methodology fields. The RevOps implementation guide covers the rest of onboarding."],[802,"Once a month, Coach analyzes each rep's full performance data and produces a review report. It surfaces three focus areas, ranked by expected impact, each grounded in evidence from that rep's calls and deals."],[2682,"Once a recording is processed, Oliv AI's Content Curator agent can clip the moments your team cares about and post them to your team's channel."],[5110,"Once accuracy thresholds are met, RevOps confirms the switch to auto mode. In **Auto-Pilot**, unreviewed updates apply automatically, so the pipeline stays current without anyone acting."],[1125,"Once accuracy thresholds are met, RevOps confirms the switch to auto mode. On **Auto-Pilot**, unreviewed updates apply automatically and the pipeline stays current without anyone acting."],[3692,"Once accuracy thresholds are met, RevOps confirms the switch to auto mode. Until then, reps get end-of-day reminders for unverified deal updates, and managers can see what is waiting from the **AI Suggestions** count on each deal."],[4666,"Once accuracy thresholds are met, RevOps confirms the switch to auto mode. When Oliv AI can't resolve which record an activity belongs to, it asks the seller instead of guessing."],[3658,"Once connected, the sync covers pipeline, fields, owners, close dates, stages and forecast categories. Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent does the writing."],[2528,"Once Oliv AI is connected to Slack, three messages start arriving with no setup:"],[3598,"Once Slack is connected, three meeting messages start on their own: a summary of tomorrow's meetings, a prep summary before each call and a meeting s