 need done. A word that appears only in a card's description still finds that agent."],[16,"Search matches the description as well as the name. Typing renewal keeps Renewal Radar by its name and QBR Builder by its description."],[2563,"Search the Meetings list for the date. Oliv AI's help article uses a meeting held on June 12th as the example."],[3104,"Seat roles"],[4190,"Seat roles and the apps they bring"],[3607,"Seat roles decide which apps each person uses, so check plans and seat roles before you connect a whole team. For a wider plan, the RevOps integration blueprint covers calls, email, Slack and the CRM together."],[5034,"Seat roles decide which apps each person works in, so check plans and seat roles before you roll out. The full list of connected tools is on Oliv AI's integrations page. For the reasoning behind automating prep, read AI meeting preparation tools compared by CRM depth and the CRO's guide to CRM data."],[4222,"Sell"],[4270,"Sell adds opportunity management through the Forecast app. It's built for account executives, sales engineering and partnerships. On top of everything in Converse, it includes:"],[3073,"Sell. It brings the Forecast app, with opportunity grids, methodology tracking, forecast boards and forecast submissions."],[4326,"Sell. It brings the Forecast app, with revenue forecast boards, forecast submissions, weekly pipeline snapshots and deal change history. Pipeline reviews with the Deal Driver agent build on the same data."],[5204,"Send a pre-meeting email"],[4022,"Send Oliv a message through Intercom in the Oliv app, and the team removes it for you."],[4174,"Send Oliv a message through Intercom in the Oliv app, and the team removes it for you."],[3422,"Send Oliv a message through Intercom in the Oliv UI."],[3745,"Send Oliv AI a message through Intercom in the Oliv AI app, and the team removes the integration."],[2710,"Send the meeting invite from your own calendar. With your company as the organizer, Oliv AI records botlessly and no note taker joins."],[3844,"Send to Slack is the final step of Oliv AI's Content Curator agent, after it analyses recordings, tags moments, summarises them and files the clip."],[2297,"Sentiment"],[2387,"Sentiment shows per person on the **Attendees** tab, as **Ally** or **Neutral** for example. When Content Curator maps a conversation, it also reads the meeting's sentiment and how it flowed. Converse reads sentiment and intent instead of matching words."],[4329,"Separately from app subscriptions, based on agent usage. During a proof of concept, Oliv AI estimates the spend at your expected volume and assesses the return against time saved."],[609,"Set a schedule"],[467,"Set a tool's run mode"],[37,"Set run modes on each tool: decide which actions wait for a person."],[2148,"Set up a moment"],[2742,"Set up a play with Edit Play"],[754,"Set up Coach"],[1037,"Set up CRM field mapping"],[897,"Set up CRM Manager"],[1204,"Set up Deal Driver"],[1344,"Set up Forecaster"],[1554,"Set up Meeting Assistant"],[3093,"Set up the forecast"],[1696,"Set up the Oliver agent"],[3766,"Set up the Slack integration"],[3909,"Set up the Webex integration"],[4045,"Set up the Zoom integration"],[1860,"Set up what Olivia reads"],[2593,"Set up Zoom recording"],[3090,"Set your stages and qualification framework"],[1832,"Setting Oliver to **Act without asking** lets it change your settings without confirming first. The banner sits above the message box while that setting is on."],[3225,"Setup and onboarding, from each platform's public documentation:"],[2425,"Seven: **Overview**, **Action Items**, **Meeting insights**, **Recording**, **Coaching**, **Attendees** and **CRM Updates**."],[584,"Seven: Salesforce and HubSpot, plus Gmail, Google Calendar, Outlook, LinkedIn and Slack. Salesforce offers 34 tools and HubSpot 32; Slack offers 5 and the others 9 each."],[1349,"Several cadences at once"],[4932,"Several deal tools now prepare reps for meetings. Oliv AI also proposes the CRM updates from each call for you to review, and nudges you directly when a next step goes overdue. Oliv AI is the only platform in this table that does all three."],[3536,"Several meeting tools can push notes or properties into HubSpot. Oliv AI also holds each update for approval, tracks each contact's role on the deal, and reminds reps about updates they haven't reviewed. Oliv AI is the only platform in this table that does all four."],[1000,"Several tools in this table write fields from calls. CRM Manager also resolves duplicate accounts as activity touches them and sends RevOps a weekly digest with each rep's acceptance rate. Oliv AI is the only platform in this table that does all three."],[2300,"Share part of a meeting"],[3501,"Share your HubSpot URL with the Oliv AI admin through Intercom in the Oliv AI app."],[3680,"Share your Salesforce URL with Oliv AI's team."],[1953,"She also alerts reps when Oliv AI's Deal Driver agent flags a manager-level concern on one of their deals."],[1901,"She is the same agent for the whole revenue org, not a separate instance per person. She adapts to each rep's accounts and deals, while Oliver keeps her inside consistent company process. In the agent picker she describes herself in one line: \"I see everything across your team and dispatch the right sub-agent for each task.\""],[4908,"Shortly before the call, Meeting Assistant also posts a call prep note to your Agent Feed on **Home**. For a first meeting with a new contact, Oliv AI's Researcher agent builds the brief instead. Oliv AI's Olivia agent also surfaces the right context before every meeting, such as deal status, stakeholder intel, qualification gaps and what was agreed last time. Read more on getting the most from an AI meeting assistant."],[3443,"Show Oliv AI fields on HubSpot deals"],[4353,"Show the reasoning behind an answer"],[3500,"Sign in to the Oliv AI web app and visit the HubSpot integration, at `web.oliv.ai/hubspot/connect`."],[4474,"Signal graph"],[4553,"Signals read out 