nected systems an agent reads and which fields it can see, so you can check what an agent knows before it runs."],[5254,"The deal brief is designed to fit one screen and take about 60 seconds to read. It has four parts:"],[2439,"The Deal Driver agent docs: how meeting signals feed deal risk for managers."],[1678,"The Deal Driver agent docs: the manager bundle that includes Meeting Assistant."],[1995,"The Deal Driver agent docs: the manager's view of the same pipeline."],[4961,"The Deal Driver agent: what your manager sees from the same deals."],[1284,"The Deal Driver bundle includes meeting-level support for individual reps."],[4990,"The Deal Driver, Forecaster and Coach agent pages cover each one. The pipeline review guide puts them together in one weekly meeting. More for sales managers is on oliv.ai."],[5660,"The deal, the signal, the relevant context and a suggested action for the manager."],[2356,"The details already exist on the recording. What the CSM needs is the champion's priorities and open concerns, in their own words, before Tuesday. Reading a whole transcript to find two or three moments is the slow part."],[4686,"The Details tab is the CRM record in editable sections, so a rep can correct a stage or close date on the deal without opening the CRM itself."],[2745,"The dialer"],[2888,"The dialer is an add-on to Engage. It comes with one US phone number and calling minutes to the US and Canada, and runs Power and Parallel sessions."],[2841,"The dialer is an add-on to Engage. It gives a rep one US phone number, with calling minutes to the US and Canada. The **Dialer** tab lists every session with its type, status, creator, contact list, numbers dialed and connects."],[2842,"The Dialer tab is the home for every calling session. Sessions run as Power or Parallel, and Oliv AI's Prospector agent can create them alongside your reps."],[4979,"The docs answer three kinds of question, in three layers:"],[5463,"The draft is never a template, and nothing reaches the