liv AI Outlook add-in."],[3978,"The Oliv AI Chrome extension or the Oliv AI Outlook add-in."],[4123,"The Oliv AI Chrome extension or the Oliv AI Outlook add-in."],[1484,"The Oliv Forecast app: forecast boards, deal inspection and scenario modelling."],[1991,"The Oliver agent: the super agent that sets the rules Olivia works within."],[1188,"The Olivia agent docs: asking about deals the mapped fields describe."],[1325,"The Olivia agent docs: the front-facing agent reps work with."],[1033,"The Olivia agent docs: the front-line agent reps ask about deals."],[1834,"The Olivia agent docs: the front-line super agent that works inside Oliver's rules."],[4960,"The Olivia agent: the agent you ask for prep, follow-ups and next steps."],[2925,"The other three apps open from **Apps** in the main navigation."],[57,"The Overview tab"],[193,"The Overview tab"],[471,"The Overview tab"],[613,"The Overview tab"],[5417,"The Overview tab is the in-app version of the meeting summary. Every takeaway links back to the moment it came from, and the seven tabs split the rest of the follow-up work."],[21,"The Overview tab is the summary of an agent. Each card on it, from triggers to knowledge, has a tab of its own that goes into detail."],[2338,"The Overview tab is where a meeting opens: takeaways, the AI summary and the linked deal sit together, and every tab across the top splits the same meeting another way."],[2,"The parts every Oliv AI agent is built from, from the marketplace where agents live to the detail page, instructions, tools and run modes, triggers, knowledge and run history."],[5,"The parts of an agent"],[679,"The picker is the same whichever agent you opened it from."],[680,"The picker lists the systems a trigger can come from. Search narrows both groups, and the most common sources sit at the top."],[5662,"The Pipeline Review every Monday: a full view of every deal in the pipeline, sorted by status, prepared before the first standup."],[4199,"The plans and seat roles page covers all three in detail. It also has a worked example that sorts a whole revenue org into seat roles."],[2820,"The Plays tab is the team's list of outbound plays. Priority changes inline, and Outreach Type shows whether a play runs agentic outreach or a step-based flow."],[5278,"The pre-meeting email is the last step of prep. You pick the draft and the send option, and Oliv AI's Olivia agent says what she'll do once it's sent, including logging the touch on the deal."],[1600,"The prep also reaches you on Home. When something about an upcoming meeting changes, Meeting Assistant posts a row in the **Agent Feed**. Olivia's daily brief carries a Meeting Assistant section with **Detours**, plans for objections that might come up, and a **Review meeting plan** button."],[3836,"The prep summary gives you the meeting's title, date, time, participants and the account it belongs to. It adds research on the account and the contact you're meeting. For the full brief an agent builds before a deal meeting, see how to prepare for a meeting."],[4209,"The pricing page gives example actions for several agents. Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent creates records, updates fields and syncs next steps. Oliv AI's Deal Driver agent reviews pipeline, drafts follow-ups and flags risks. Oliv AI's Forecaster agent prepares the forecast and updates forecast categories. To see what an agent did on each run, open its run history. Each tool's run mode decides whether an action needs a person's approval first, as agent tools and run modes explains."],[4313,"The pricing page includes a calculator for your own team. Enter the number of people in each group, Converse, Sell, Grow and Amplify. It compares the Oliv AI apps in their plan with named tools, using the same seat counts."],[2065,"The pricing page lists each capture channel by name: botless meeting capture, phone call capture, email capture and Slack capture. Those four channels are the columns covered in How the Converse app compares, below."],[4325,"