ack, Teams, or within the Oliv product."],[1979,"Yes. She's one agent for the whole revenue org. She adapts to each rep's accounts and deals, and Oliver keeps her within company process."],[872,"Yes. Start from the pre-built scorecards or build your own from a library of more than 100 criteria. No engineering is required."],[2565,"Yes. Switch from **My meetings** to **Team meetings** to see meetings beyond your own calls."],[5499,"Yes. Tell Oliv AI's Olivia agent to draft the follow-up from your call, and she pulls from the meeting transcript to write it."],[1826,"Yes. The **History** tab lists every change with its author, status and files. Filter it by Oliver, by your company or by Oliv GTM Engineer."],[2124,"Yes. The AI summary and full call transcript are attached to the opportunity record in your CRM."],[2434,"Yes. The AI-generated summary and the full call transcript are attached to the opportunity record. The **CRM Updates** tab lists every change made."],[5183,"Yes. The count beside **AI Suggestions** on each deal's **CRM Updates** tab shows what's waiting."],[1983,"Yes. The dropdown beneath the message box offers **Ask before acting** and **Act without asking**. It opens on **Ask before acting** in each conversation."],[1986,"Yes. The history panel lists your saved chats with Olivia, with search and **New Chat**. Oliver keeps a separate list of his own."],[4846,"Yes. The iPhone app records and transcribes in-person conversations. Oliv AI also captures in-person meetings through its Plaud integration."],[2885,"Yes. The list re-ranks the moment a signal changes."],[3886,"Yes. The meeting preparation summary in Slack includes a link that removes the note taker from that meeting."],[5338,"Yes. The recommended agenda is tailored to the deal stage and its qualification gaps, so it points you at what still needs answering."],[1482,"Yes. The Weekly Forecast report arrives in My Reports every Monday. Managers also get a weekly summary of the team forecast with flagged deals, in Slack or email."],[2125,"Yes. Turn off the automated meeting messages on your **Profile Settings** page."],[2571,"Yes. Turn them off on your **Profile Settings** page."],[2435,"Yes. Use **Ask** in the drawer, or ask Olivia, for example to draft the follow-up from a call, and she works from the transcript."],[4323,"Yes. Use Amplify, Converse, Sell and Grow together across your company, and assign each team member by the apps they need."],[1027,"Yes. When a new person joins a meeting, call or email thread, CRM Manager creates the contact and enriches it with title, LinkedIn and email. The meeting's **CRM Updates** tab shows it as **Contact Created**, with **View Contact**."],[3560,"Yes. When a person or company in a meeting, call or email isn't in HubSpot, Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent creates the record and enriches it."],[4956,"Yes. When an activity involves a person or company not yet in the CRM, CRM Manager creates and enriches the record."],[4446,"Yes. When one agent produces work for another, the email carries a **Drafted by** line naming the agent that wrote it."],[4019,"Yes. You can discuss meeting outcomes, assign action items and work on them with your team. Past summaries stay available to track progress."],[3075,"Yes. You can pick a pre-built agent from the marketplace or create your own, from instructions, tools, triggers and knowledge."],[4844,"Yes. You can pick a pre-built agent from the marketplace or create your own. Building custom agents is part of every plan."],[2121,"Yes. You capture in-person meetings with the mobile app. Sell and Grow also support Plaud recordings, with the hardware bought separately."],[4849,"Yes. You connect only what you need today and migrate when you're ready. A proof of concept scopes one agent use case first."],[4021,"Yes. Zoom has its own Zoom integration. For Teams and Google Meet, no separate integration is needed once your calendar is connected."],[1411,"Yet most of what the commit needs already sits in the pipeline and the calls. Close dates slip, stages stall and deals go quiet, and each of those leaves a trail. The hard part is reading that trail across every deal, every week, without waiting on people."],[1621,"Yet nothing in that recap is new information. Every ask, owner and date was said out loud on a recorded call. The real job is turning the transcript into an email and a few field changes while the meeting is still fresh."],[3351,"Yet the thread already holds the facts. Who asked what, who agreed to what, and when, are all written down with names and times. What's missing is something that reads the thread next to the calls and files each point against the right deal."],[3268,"You ask for work in plain language. Oliv AI's Olivia agent runs the day-to-day work and hands tasks to specialist agents. Oliv AI's Oliver agent keeps the rules: your stages, ownership and handoffs."],[5568,"You can also adjust alert sensitivity and the brief format. Every scheduled report appears in **Reports › My Reports**, and briefs, alerts and summaries can also reach the manager through Slack or email."],[243,"You can also press a knowledge pill on the **Overview** tab. Unlike the tools and trigger pills beside it, a knowledge pill doesn't switch tabs. It opens that file in a new browser tab instead."],[2538,"You can ask Oliv AI's Olivia agent to draft the follow-up from a call, and she pulls from the meeting transcript. It saves opening the meeting yourself when you only need the email."],[1938,"You can describe the work in your own words. For example:"],[528,"You can see the setting on the tab itself. The three modes always appear in the same order, and each keeps one icon and color on the button and in the menu. How other platforms handle an agent's freedom to act is covered in How agent tools and run modes compare, below."],[4105,"You can see what each Zoom app is allowed to do. Every permission it asks Zoom for is listed in plain words in Permissions Zoom asks for. The features they enable are covered in How the Zoom integration compares, below."],[4259,"You can use all four plans together in one company. Assign each team member by the apps they need, rather than buying one plan for everyone."],[288,"You can't tell from the tab. No file shows a processed state, and no run record cites a knowledge file as its source."],[4663,"You choose between two modes:"],[2851,"You choose WhatsApp, Telegram or Instagram one at a time, and each is added per person. Teams pay only for the channels they use. The Oliv AI pricing page lists each channel."],[4013,"You connect one during setup. Visit web.oliv.ai and follow the on-screen steps. If you don't have an account, you can create one through onboarding."],[3003,"You decide how much freedom an agent has, and you can check every action it took."],[4806,"You decide how much freedom each agent has. Every tool an agent holds is set to **Auto Run**, **Requires Approval** or **Agent Decides**, as tools and run modes explains. A conversation with Olivia or Oliver is set to **Ask before acting** or **Act without asking**."],[2256,"You describe the moment in plain language. The agent matches segments against that description, using context and intent rather than keyword lists."],[1471,"You dismiss it with **X**. Forecaster learns from that, and every decision you make helps it recognize your company's patterns."],[4721,"You do. Every suggested update surfaces for review by default. RevOps confirms the move to **Auto-Pilot** once accuracy thresholds are met."],[2527,"You don't have to start in the list. When you get a Slack message about a meeting, press **Open Meeting** in the message. It takes you to Oliv AI, where you open the green tab the help center points to."],[2221,"You don't have to wait for the agent. In Converse, search for the exact objection, competitor mention or pricing concern. Then open the meeting's **Recording** tab and press **Clip** to cut that moment yourself."],[5260,"You don't have to 