 you track properties unique to your process, Oliv AI's team maps them for you during onboarding."],[3577,"Your CRM"],[5375,"Your CRM"],[4636,"Your CRM pipeline as Oliv AI shows it: the same deals, sorted into forecast views, with a signal column for each question a manager asks about a deal."],[4645,"Your CRM reflects what got logged, not what happened. Reps type notes when they find time, and pipeline reports run on fields nobody has touched in weeks. Leaders then make calls on a record that is a few conversations behind."],[170,"Your playbook, written for agents: how Oliv AI captures your revenue process."],[2601,"Your revenue team's agents"],[4426,"Your reviews do more than gate one change. Oliv AI's Forecaster agent learns from every signal you accept, edit or reject. Oliv AI's Portfolio Manager agent learns when you dismiss a flag that doesn't match your read. Oliv AI's Oliver agent watches what is winning in the field and drafts the next process update for your review."],[3172,"Your stages, imported from the CRM and mapped to a probability and forecast category, are what deal alerts and the forecast read from week one."],[3167,"Your stakeholder checks each section for accuracy. Once it's in place, every agent works inside those rules from day one. Oliver's proposed changes wait as **Pending Review** until your company approves them, and minor ones that apply on their own are still logged in the Playbook's **History**."],[1637,"Your team's framework decides what counts as a gap, so it helps to agree on your sales methodology first."],[4033,"Zoom"],[4062,"Zoom admins and revenue operations"],[2709,"Zoom and Microsoft Teams are both supported. Recording happens inside the meeting app itself, with no separate Oliv participant on the call."],[4147,"Zoom recording features, from each platform's public documentation:"],[3078,"Zoom, Google Meet and Microsoft Teams, which it joins automatically, and Webex through the Webex App Hub."]],"type":"string"},"page_id":{"docs